oṃ śrīśrīrādhākṛṣṇābhyāṃ namaḥ

śrīmadbhāgavatamahāpurāṇam |

  (3)

atha bhāgavatatṛtīyaskandhaprārambhaḥ ||


 oṃ namo bhagavate vāsudevāya |

 (3.1)

  atha prathamo'dhyāyaḥ

  viduroddhavasaṃvādaḥ

 || 3.1.1 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

  evam etat purā pṛṣṭo maitreyo bhagavān kila |

 kṣattrā vanaṃ praviṣṭena tyaktvā svagṛham ṛddhimat ||

madhvaḥ : yuddhakāle tu viduras tīrthayātrāṃ gato'pi san |

prāya āste gajapure pāṇḍavānāṃ vyapekṣayā || iti skānde ||1||

śrīdharaḥ :  śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ | śrīgopālakṛṣṇāya namaḥ |

tṛtīye tu trayastriṃśadadhyāyaiḥ sargavarṇanam |

  īśekṣayā guṇakṣobhāt sargo brahmāṇād asambhavaḥ ||

tatra tu prathame'dhyāye bandhūn hitvā gatāyuṣaḥ |

 nirgatasyoddhavenādau samvādaḥ kṣattur ucyate ||

  bhagavad brahmasaṃproktaṃ saṃkṣepta varṇitaṃ purā |

prāha bhāgavataṃ śeṣaproktaṃ vistarataḥ punaḥ ||

dvedhā hi śrīmadbhāgavatasampradāyapravṛttiḥ | ekataḥ saṃkṣepataḥ
śrīnārāyaṇabrahmanāradādidvāreṇa, anyatas tu vistarataḥ
śeṣasanatkumārasāṃkhyāyanādidvāreṇa | tatra dvitīye
śrīnārāyaṇabrahmasaṃvādena saṃkṣepato'ham evāsam ityādi catuḥślokyā
śrībhāgavataṃ nirūpitam | tad eva brahmanāradasaṃvādena
daśalakṣaṇatayā kiñcid vistareṇoktam | tad eva śeṣoktam ativistarato
vaktuṃ tṛtīyādyārambhaḥ |

tatra tṛtīye prathamaṃ kṣattur maitreyasaṃgamaś caturbhir adhyāyaiḥ,
tato'ṣṭabhiḥ savisargaḥ sargaprapañcaḥ | tato visargaprastāvena
saptabhir varāhāvatāraḥ | tata ekena visargasamāhāraḥ | tatprasaṅgena
caturbhiḥ kapilāvatāraḥ | tato navabhiḥ kapilākhyānam | iti
trayastriṃśatādhyāyais tṛtīyaskandhapravṛttiḥ | tatra
dvitīyaskandhānte—

parimāṇaṃ ca kālasya kalpalakṣaṇavigraham | 

yathā purastād vyākhyāsye pādmaṃ kalpam atho śṛṇu ||  [bhā.pu. 2.10.47]

iti pratijñātam arthaṃ vistareṇa nirūpayitum itihāsaṃ prastauti bhagavān
śukaḥ, evam iti dvābhyām | ṛddhimat sarvasampadbhiḥ sampūrṇam ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  śrīśrīkṛṣṇacaitanyacandrāya namaḥ |

 tṛtīyakramasandarbhe sandarbhāṇāṃ samāhṛtiḥ |

 kriyate yannideśena sa me'nanyagater gatiḥ ||

viśvanāthaḥ :

praṇamya śrīguruṃ bhūyaḥ .śrīkṛtaṃ karuṇārṇavam |

lokanāthaṃ jagaccakṣuḥ śrīśukaṃ taṃ ūpāśraye ||

goparāmājanaprāṇapreyase'tiprabhuṣṇave |

  tadīyapriyadāsyāya māṃ madīyam ahaṃ dade ||

 tryadhikatriṃśadadhyāyyā tṛtīye sarga ucyate |

 tattvaḥaḥ samaṣṭisṛṣṭir yaḥ pradhānāt puruṣekṣitāt ||

  pradarśya bhagavadbrahmanāradādyaḥaḥ pravartitam |

saraṇbhāvaṃ śeṣakumārādyaiś ca darśyate ||

 viduroddhavasaṃvādaś caturbhiḥ punar aṣṭabhiḥ |

  savisargaḥ sargavidhiḥ saptabhiḥ kroḍakīrtanam ||

 tato visargasaṃkṣepa ekena kapilodayaḥ |

  caturbhir navabhiś ceti tṛtīyaskandhasaṃgrahaḥ ||

 tatra tu pratham'dṛśayatie kṣattā hitvāgrajaṃ gataḥ |

  tīrthaṃ tatra śrutāniṣṭo'pṛcchan militaṃ ūddhavam ||

pūrvaskandhe'ṣṭame'dhyāye rājñāṃ kṛteṣu bahuṣu praśneṣu dvitrapraśnānāṃ
ūttaraṃ dattvā mahāmunir manasi parāmamarśa—yathānena rājñāṃ sampraty
ahaṃ pṛṣṭas tathaiva pūrvaṃ vidureṇāpi maitreyaḥ pṛṣṭa iti | tataś ca
tatprastāvenaivotthāpitena rājñaḥ sarvapraśnottaraṃ dāsyāmīti
niścityāha—evam iti | ṛddhimat sarvasampadbhiḥ pūrṇam ||1||


 || 3.1.2 ||

yad vā ayaṃ mantrakṛd vo bhagavān akhileśvaraḥ |

 pauravendragṛhaṃ hitvā praviveśātmasāt kṛtam ||

śrīdharaḥ :  kiṃ cātiślāghyaṃ tyāgānarham ity āha—yad vai prasiddhaṃ gṛhaṃ
vaḥ pāṇḍavānāṃ mantrakṛd dautyakartā sann ayaṃ śrīkṛṣṇaḥ |
buddhisannidhānād ayam iti nirdeśaḥ | pauravendro duryodhanas tasya gṛhaṃ
hitvānāhūta eva praviveśa | tatra hetuḥ—ātmasātkṛtam ātmīyatvena gṛhītam
||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  “yad vā ayam” ity atra “yadāśrayam” iti citsukhaḥ
||2||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, tasya tadgṛhaṃ tajjigamiṣitebhyas tīrthebhyaḥ
sarvebhyo'py atiśreṣṭhaṃ tyāgānarham | tad api bhrātṛdattena santāpenaiva
tatyājety āha—yad iti | vai niścitam | yad gṛhaṃ vaḥ pāṇḍavānāṃ mantrakṛt
dūtyakartā san ayaṃ .śrīkṛtaḥ buddhisannidhānād ayam iti nirdeśaḥ |
pauravendras tadā duryodhano'nāhūta eva praviveśa | tatra
hetuḥ—ātmasātkṛtam ātmīyatvena svīkṛtam ||2||


 || 3.1.3 ||

  rājovāca—

 kutra kṣattur bhagavatā maitreyeṇāsa saṃgamaḥ |

 kadā vā saha  saṃvāda etad varṇaya naḥ prabho ||

śrīdharaḥ :  kutra saṃgama āsa babhūva ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  tatra śaunakavad rājāpi tatkathāyā utkaṇṭhayā tāṃ
viśeṣataḥ pṛcchati—kutreti | kutra kadā saṃgama āsa āsīt, saṃvādo vā |
tatra kutreti kasmin sthāne viṣaye veti gamyam | etad iti tad etat trayam
ity arthaḥ ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ :  āsa babhūva ||3||


 || 3.1.4 ||

 na hy alpārthodayas tasya vidurasyāmalātmanaḥ |

 tasmin varīyasi praśnaḥ sādhuvādopabṛṃhitaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  varīyasi śreṣṭhe | alpasyārthasyodayo yasmāt tathābhūto na
bhavati | sādhuvādena satām anumodanenopabṛṃhitaḥ saṃvardhitaḥ | yad vā,
sādhor maitreyasya vādenottareṇa ślāghita ity arthaḥ ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  varīyasi śreṣṭhe | alpasyārthasyodayo yasmāt tathābhūto na
bhavati | sādhuvādena bhavatām anumodanenopabṛṃhitaḥ saṃvardhitaḥ | yad
vā, sādhor maitreyasya vādenottareṇa ślāghita ity arthaḥ ||4||


 || 3.1.5 ||

 sūta uvāca—

  sa evam ṛṣivaryo'yaṃ pṛṣṭo rājñā parīkṣitā |

 pratyāha taṃ subahuvit prītātmā śrūyatām iti ||

na katamenāpi vyākhyātam.


 || 3.1.6 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

 yadā tu rājā svasutān asādhūn

 puṣṇan na dharmeṇa vinaṣṭadṛṣṭiḥ |

 bhrātur yaviṣṭhasya sutān vibandhūn

praveśya lākṣābhavane dadāha ||

madhvaḥ : yadā yadāha tadā keśābhimarśaḥ prāpta iti yadāśabdo hetvarthaḥ
| yadā tadā iti hetvarthe kālārthe ca bhaṇyate ity abhidhāne ||6||

śrīdharaḥ :  tyāgānarhasyāpi gṛhasya tyāge hetutvena kauravāparādhān
āha—yadety ekādaśabhiḥ | eteṣāṃ ca tadā sa kṣattā ayād ity ekādaśe
kriyāsambandhaḥ | yaviṣṭhasya kaniṣṭhasya pāṇḍoḥ | vibandhūn pitṛhīnān
||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yadety ādīnāṃ tadā sa kṣattā ayād ity ekādaśasthayā kriyayā
sambandhaḥ | vinaṣṭe dṛṣṭī netre dṛṣṭir jñāṃnaṃ ca yasya | yaviṣṭhasya
kaniṣṭhasya pāṇḍoḥ | vibandhūn pitṛhīnān ||6||


 || 3.1.7 ||

 yadā sabhāyāṃ kurudevadevyāḥ

  keśābhimarśaṃ sutakarma garhyam |

  na vārayāmāsa nṛpaḥ snuṣāyāḥ

 svāsrair harantyāḥ kucakuṅkumāni ||

śrīdharaḥ :  kurudevasya yudhiṣṭhirasya devyā draupadyā ātmanaḥ snuṣāyāḥ
svīyair asrair aśrubhiḥ svakucakuṅkumāni ripustrīṇāṃ vā
tadbhartṛvadhena harantyāḥ ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  kurudevadevyā draupadyāḥ kucakuṅkumāni svasya
ripustrīṇāṃ vā tadbhartṛvadhena harantyā iti caturthātiśayoktir
utprekṣā ca vyañjitā ||7||


 || 3.1.8 ||

  dyūte tv adharmeṇa jitasya sādhoḥ

satyāvalambasya vanaṃ gatasya |

  na yācato'dāt samayena dāyaṃ

tamojuṣāṇo yad ajātaśatroḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  satyāvalambasya satyāśrayasya vanāt pratyāgatasya samayena
pūrvakṛtena dāyam aṃśaṃ yācamānasya yad yadā nādān na dadau | tamo mohaṃ
juṣāṇaḥ [putraṃ sevamānaḥ, avivekaṃ vā] ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  vanāt pratyāgatasya samayena pūrvakṛtena dāyaṃ bhāgaṃ
yācamānasya yad yadā ||8||


 || 3.1.9 ||

yadā ca pārthaprahitaḥ sabhāyāṃ

jagadgurur yāni jagāda kṛṣṇaḥ |

na tāni puṃsām amṛtāyanāni

rājoru mene kṣatapuṇyaleśaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  yāni vacanāni puṃsāṃ bhīṣmādīnām amṛtāyanāny amṛtasrāvīṇi
rājā dhṛtarāṣṭro duryodhano vā uru bahu na mene | kṣato naṣṭaḥ puṇyaleśo
yasya saḥ | na sukhakīrtidharmādihetuḥ, kintu rājyaprāptimātrahetuḥ
puṇyaleśa evāsīt | tasyāpi naṣṭatvād anādṛtavān ity arthaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  yadeti | “amṛtāyanāni” ity atra “amṛtāvahāni” iti |
“kṣata” ity atra “hṛta” iti citsukhaḥ ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ :  puṃsāṃ tadbhāvkaraṇ bhīṣmādīnām, rājā dhṛtarāṣṭro
duryodhano vā uru bahu na mene | tatra hetuḥ—kṣateti | na
sukhakīrtidharmādikaraḥ, kintu rājyaprāpako yaḥ puṇyaleśa evāsīt,
tasyāpi naṣṭatvād ity arthaḥ ||9||


 || 3.1.10 ||

  yadopahūto bhavanaṃ praviṣṭo

mantrāya pṛṣṭaḥ kila pūrvajena |

athāha tan mantradṛśāṃ varīyān

  yan mantriṇo vaidurikaṃ vadanti ||

śrīdharaḥ :  idānīṃ vidurasyaiva kṛtaṃ parābhavaṃ
darśayati—yadetyādiṣaḍbhiḥ | yadā pūrvajena dhṛtarāṣṭreṇa mantrāya
copahūto'ntargṛhaṃ praviṣṭo mantraṃ pṛṣṭaḥ sann, athānantaraṃ tad āha |
kiṃ mantriṇo'dyāpi yad vaidurikaṃ viduravākyam iti prasiddhaṃ vadanti
||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  idānīṃ vidurasyaiva parābhavaṃ tatkṛtaṃ darśayati ṣaḍbhiḥ
| athānantaraṃ vidūras tad āha—kiṃ mantriṇo'dyāpi yad vaidurikaṃ
viduravākyam iti prasiddhaṃ vadanti ||10||


 || 3.1.11 ||

 ajātaśatroḥ pratiyaccha dāyaṃ

 titikṣato durviṣahaṃ tavāgaḥ |

sahānujo yatra vṛkodarāhiḥ

 śvasan ruṣā yat tvam alaṃ bibheṣi ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tad evāha—ajātaśatror iti tribhiḥ | tava āgo'parādhaṃ
sahamānasya dāyaṃ pratiyaccha dehi | yatrāparādhe'nujaiḥ saha vartamāno
vṛkodararūpo'hiḥ krodhena śvasan vartate | yad yasmāt tvam alam atyarthaṃ
bibheṣi ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  tad evāha—ajāteti yat yatra āgasi vṛkodararūpo'hiḥ
krodhena śvasan vartate | yad yasmāt tvam alam atyarthaṃ bibheṣi ||11||


 || 3.1.12 ||

  pārthāṃs tu devo bhagavān mukundo

gṛhītavān sakṣitidevadevaḥ |

 āste svapuryāṃ yadudevadevo

 vinirjitāśeṣanṛdevadevaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu mama tādṛśāḥ putrā bahavaḥ santīti garvaṃ mā kṛthā ity
āha—pārthāṃs tu mukunda ātmīyatvena gṛhītavān | sa ca devas tatrāpi
bhagavān na tu prākṛtaḥ | kiṃ ca, saha kṣitidevair viprair devaiś
cendrādibhir vartamānaḥ | yato'sau tatraiva viprā devāś cety arthaḥ | sa
ca svapuryām eva sukham āste, na tv anyatra gataḥ | kiṃ ca, yadudevānāṃ
devaḥ pūjyaḥ | yato'sau tatraiva sarve rājānaḥ | ataḥ pārthānāṃ dāyaṃ
dehīti ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  samprati tv anyad apy adbhutaṃ teṣāṃ mahābalādhikyaṃ śṛṇv
ity āha pārthāṃs tv iti | ātmīyatvena gṛhītavān | sa ca devaḥ, tatrāpi
bhagavān kṣitidevair viprair devaiś ca sahitaḥ | tatpakṣa eva viprā
devāś ceti bhāvaḥ | tatrāpi svapūryām evāste, na tv anyatra gataḥ |
yadudevā yadupravarā devā baliṣṭhā yasmāt saḥ | yatrāsau tatraiva
yadupravīrā ity arthaḥ | kiṃ ca, tasyaiva balaṃ śṛṇv ity āha vinirjitā
aśeṣā nṛdevāḥ kaṃsajarāsandhādayo devāś ca bālyam ārabhyaiva
brahmendravaruṇarudrādayo yena saḥ | ataḥ pārthānāṃ dāyaṃ dehi yady
ātmano bhadram icchasīti bhāvaḥ ||12||


 || 3.1.13 ||

 sa eṣa doṣaḥ puruṣadviḍ āste

  gṛhān praviṣṭo yam apatyamatyā |

puṣṇāsi kṛṣṇād vimukho gataśrīs

  tyajāśv aśaivaṃ kulakauśalāya ||

śrīdharaḥ :  duryodhanas tan na manyata iti ced ata āha—sa eṣa mūrto doṣa
eva gṛhān praviṣṭa āste | doṣatve hetuḥ, puruṣadviṭ śrīkṛṣṇadveṣṭā |
ko'sau ? yaṃ tvam apatyamatyā puṣṇāsi na tv apatyam asau | na pataty
asmād iti hy apatyaṃ prāhuḥ | gatā śrīr yasmāt sa tvam ity ākrośati | ata
enam aśaivam amaṅgalam āśu tyaja | kathaṃ putras tyājyas tatrāha—kulasya
kauśalāya | tyajed ekaṃ kulasyārthe iti hi nyāyaḥ ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  matputro duryodhano'tra vipratipatsyate iti cet,
tatrāha—sa eṣa iti | tvatkoṭijanmakṛtaduṣkṛtaphalabhūta ity arthaḥ |
doṣo mūrta eva yataḥ puruṣaṃ parameśvaraṃ dveṣṭi, tatrāpi tava gṛhān
bāhyān abhyantarān manobuddhyādirūpān api praviṣṭa evāste, tatrāpi tvaṃ
taṃ puṣṇāsi, tatrāpy apatyamatyā na hy asāv apatyaṃ na pataty asmād ity
apatyam iti nirukteḥ | ata eva na tvam anumīyase kṛṣṇād vimukhaḥ gataśrīr
iti lakṣmīs tava gṛhebhyo niḥsṛtya gateti jānīhi | nanu tarhi ko'tra
pratīkāras tatrāha āśu śīghram aśaivyam amaṅgalam enaṃ tyaja | mayā pitrā
putrasya tyāge matkule kalaṅkaḥ syāt tatrāha—kulasyaiva kauśalāya
kuśalāya tyajed ekaṃ kulasyārthe iti nyāyāt | anyathā kulam eva sarvaṃ te
naṅkṣyatīti bhāvaḥ ||13||


 || 3.1.14 ||

 ity ūcivāṃs tatra suyodhanena

pravṛddhakopasphuritādhareṇa |

 asatkṛtaḥ satspṛhaṇīyaśīlaḥ

kṣattā sakarṇānujasaubalena ||

śrīdharaḥ :  ity ūcivān evaṃ ūktavān | asau kṣattā viduraḥ satāṃ
spṛhaṇīyaṃ śīlaṃ yasya sa karṇaduḥśāsanaśakunisahitena
duryodhanenāsatkṛtas tiraskṛtaḥ ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  ity ūcivān evaṃ ūktavān | viduraḥ suyodhanena asatkṛtaḥ
tiraskṛtaḥ karṇaduḥśāsanaśakunisahitena ||14||


 || 3.1.15 ||

  ka enam atropajuhāva jihmaṃ

 dāsyāḥ sutaṃ yadbalinaiva puṣṭaḥ |

 tasmin pratīpaḥ parakṛtya āste

  nirvāsyatām āśu purāc chvasānaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tiraskāram āha—ka iti | dāsīsuto hy atrāhvānānarhaḥ | jihmaś
ca kuṭilaḥ | jihmatāha—yasya balinānnena puṣṭas tasminn eva pratīpaḥ
pratikūlaḥ pareṣāṃ kārye vartate | ataḥ purān nirvāsyatām | śvasānaḥ
śvasan jīvamātraśeṣa ity arthaḥ | pāṭhāntare śmaśānavad amaṅgalaḥ
||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  tiraskāram evāha—ka enam atra mahārājasadasi ajuhāveti
āhvānānarham iti bhāvaḥ | tatra hetuḥ—dāsyāḥ sutam iti janmanaiva duṣṭam |
jihmaṃ kuṭilam iti | karmaṇāpi kauṭilyam āha—yad balinā yad dattenānnena
puṣṭas tasminn eva svasvāmini pratīpaḥ pratikūlaḥ pareṣāṃ śatrūṇāṃ kṛtye
kārye vartate | ato'yam atra sthitaḥ sarvam evāsmatkulaṃ nāśayituṃ
yatiṣyata iti bhāvaḥ | nirvāsyatām ayam ito niṣkālyatāṃ yaḥ ko'tra madīyo
vartate teneti bhāvaḥ | tatrāpy āśu mā vilambena tatrāpi śvasānaḥ
śvāsamātrāvaśiṣṭa iti sabahuvetraprahāram iti bhāvaḥ | śmaśāna iti
pāṭhe śmaśānavad amaṅgalo'yaṃ kenāsmadgṛhamadhye ānīto yo mām
evāmaṅgalaṃ vakti | ata āśu niṣkāśyatām anyathā rājapuram idaṃ śmaśānam
eva kariṣyatīti bhāvaḥ ||15||


 || 3.1.16 ||

  svayaṃ dhanur dvāri nidhāya māyāṃ

bhrātuḥ puro marmasu tāḍito'pi |

sa ittham atyulbaṇakarṇabāṇair

gatavyatho'yād uru mānayānaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  atyulbaṇaiḥ karṇayor bāṇavat praviśadbhiḥ paruṣavākyair
marmasu tāḍito'pi gatavyathaḥ | tatra hetuḥ—māyāṃ ūru bahu mānayann aho
māyāyā māhātmyam iti tām eva tatra hetuṃ manyamānas tan niḥsāraṇāt pūrvaṃ
svayam eva ayān nirjagāma | kiṃ kṛtvā ? ete nūnaṃ mariṣyanti kiṃ dhanuṣeti
tasya dvāri dhanur nidhāya | yad vā, bhīmādibhiḥ saṃgatyāsmābhir
yotsyatīti mā śaṅkīr iti dhanur nidhānam ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  “svayam” ity atra “smayan” iti citsukhaḥ ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ :  sa ittham atyulbaṇakarṇabāṇaḥaḥ atyulbaṇaiḥ
paruṣavākyair karṇayor bāṇair iva praviśya marmasthāneṣu tāḍitaḥ |
tatrāpi bhrātuḥ puraḥ are kim evaṃ brūṣe ity apy anuktavataḥ | kiṃ ca,
tāḍito'pi gatavyathaḥ | dhanyo'si are duryodhana, dhanyo'si tvayā mama
sarvā api vyathā nirvāpitā yad ito niḥsāryamāṇasya dūre kvacana tīrthādiṣu
nirviṇṇatayā sthāsyatas tvajjanake mamatāṃ tyaktavato mama kā vyatheti
manasy anulapyeti bhāvaḥ | ayāt nirjagāma svayam iti duṣṭair niḥsāraṇāt
svayam eva niḥsaraṇaṃ bhadram iti bhāvaḥ | dhanurdvāri nidhāyeti samprati
sarvaṃ svagṛhādikam api tyaktavato vivikte kvacid upaviśya kṛṣṇaṃ
bhajiṣyatoo mama kim anena duścihnena dhanuṣeti bhāvaḥ | yad vā,
bhīmādibhiḥ saṃgatyāsmābhiḥ saha yotsyata iti pāpo'yaṃ mā śaṅketeti dhanur
nidhānam | māyāṃ ūrum ānayānaḥ mānayann iti māyayaivāndhīkṛtaḥ puraḥ
santam api kṛṣṇaṃ na paśyati | yad vā, aho māyāmāhātmyaṃ bhagavataḥ
kṛṣṇasya yad evaṃ prakāreṇa māṃ svabhaktam ito niṣkāśya bhīmādibhir
niḥsaṃśayam ete ghātayiṣyanta iti ||16||


 || 3.1.17 ||

sa nirgataḥ kauravapuṇyalabdho

gajāhvayāt tīrthapadaḥ padāni |

anvākramat puṇyacikīrṣayorvyām

  adhiṣṭhito yāni sahasramūrtiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tato nirgatasya tīrthāṭanaprakāram āha—sa ity aṣṭabhiḥ | sa
gajāhvayān nirgataḥ saṃs tīrthaṃ pādau yasya tasya hareḥ padāni kṣetrāṇi
puṇyacikīrṣayā'nvākramat pratyapadyata | kauravāṇāṃ puṇyena labdha iti
teṣāṃ bhāgyam eva tena rūpeṇa gatam iti sūcitam | urvyāṃ sahasramūrtir
brahmarudrādyanekamūrtiḥ saṃs tīrthapādyāni yāny adhiṣṭhāya sthitaḥ
tāni tāni jagāmety arthaḥ ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  anvākramat anukrameṇa prāpa | puṇyacikīrṣayā
tadduḥsaṅgaprāyaścittecchayā | ataḥ sadoṣaṃmanyaḥ sahasā śrīkṛṣṇam
api draṣṭuṃ na jagāmeti bhāvaḥ ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ :  kuros tadvaṃśyānāṃ ca puṇyena labdha iti teṣāṃ bhāgyam eva
tena rūpeṇa gatam iti sūcitam | tīrthaṃ pādau yasya tasya harer iti
taccaraṇabuddhyaiva tādṛśānāṃ tīrthadidṛkṣeti sūcitam | padāni kṣetrāṇi
sahasramūrtir matsyakūrmādyanekamūrtiḥ san yāni yāny adhiṣṭhāya
sthitaḥ ||17||


 || 3.1.18 ||

 pureṣu puṇyopavanādrikuñjeṣv

 apaṅkatoyeṣu saritsaraḥsu |

  anantaliṅgaiḥ samalaṃkṛteṣu

cacāra tīrthāyataneṣv ananyaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  puṇyāni yāny upavanādīni teṣu kuñjaṃ latādigūḍhasthānam |
apaṅkāni toyāni yeṣāṃ teṣu saritsaraḥsu ca tīrtheṣv āyataneṣu kṣetreṣu ca
| kīdṛśeṣu ? anantasya liṅgair mūrtibhiḥ samyag alaṃkṛteṣu | ananya ekākī
||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : pureṣu prasiddheṣu na vidyate paṅkaṃ pāpaṃ yebhyas teṣu
pāpahantṛṣu toyeṣu ananyaḥ sarvatra śrīkṛṣṇaikadṛṣṭiḥ ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ :  ananya ekākī ||18||


 || 3.1.19 ||

  gāṃ paryaṭan medhyaviviktavṛttiḥ

sadāpluto'dhaḥ śayano'vadhūtaḥ |

 alakṣitaḥ svair avadhūtaveṣo

 vratāni cere haritoṣaṇāni ||

śrīdharaḥ :  kiṃ ca, gāṃ paryaṭan vratāni cere ācarat | medhyā pavitrā
viviktāsaṃkīrṇā vṛttir jīvikā yasya | sadāplutaḥ pratitīrthaṃ snātaḥ |
adhaḥ śayanaṃ yasya | avadhūto'saṃskṛtadehaḥ, avadhūtaveṣo
valkalādidhārī | ata eva svair alakṣitaḥ ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : viviktatvaṃ paravṛttibhir amiśratvam ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ :  gāṃ pṛthivīṃ medhyā pavitrā viviktā vṛttāntareṇāmiśritā
vṛttijīvikā yasya saḥ | sadāplutaḥ pratitīrthaṃ snāta iti snānena
pāvitryaṃ lakṣyate | snānānantaraṃ kadācid aspṛśyasparśe punar api
snātīti sadā bhagavanmantrādismaraṇārthaṃ pavitra eva tiṣṭhatīty arthaḥ
| avadhūto'saṃskṛtadehaḥ, avadhūtaveṣo valkalādidhārī, ata eva svair
alakṣitaḥ ||19||


 || 3.1.20 ||

  itthaṃ vrajan bhāratam eva varṣaṃ

kālena yāvad gatavān prabhāsam |

tāvac chaśāsa kṣitim eka cakrām

 ekātapatrām ajitena pārthaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  ekasyaiva cakraṃ sainyaṃ yasyām | ekam eva rājacihnaṃ
śvetātapatraṃ yasyāṃ tām | ajitena śrīkṛṣṇena sahāyena ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  bhāratam eva varṣam iti tanmadhyavarti
kumārikākhaṇḍam eva jñeyaṃ viṣṇupurāṇānusāreṇānyatrāgamyatvāt ||20||

viśvanāthaḥ :  ekasyaiva cakraṃ sainyaṃ yasyām | ekam eva rājacihnaṃ
śvetātapatraṃ yasyāṃ tām | ajitena śrīkṛṣṇena sahāyena hetunā pārtho
yudhiṣṭhiraḥ ||20||


 || 3.1.21 ||

tatrātha śuśrāva suhṛdvinaṣṭiṃ

 vanaṃ yathā veṇujavahnisaṃśrayam |

saṃspardhayā dagdham athānuśocan

  sarasvatīṃ pratyag iyāya tūṣṇīm ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tatra prabhāse parasparaspardhayā nimittabhūtayā suhṛdāṃ
kauravāṇāṃ vinaṣṭiṃ vināśam aśṛṇot | parasparanāśe dṛṣṭāntaḥ—veṇujaṃ
vahniṃ saṃśrayate yad vanaṃ, tad yathā dagdhaṃ bhavati, tathā | pratyag
udgamābhimukham ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : suhṛdvinaṣṭim iti | yādavānāṃ vinaṣṭim ity eva jñeyam
| nātivilambād evoddhavena milanāt ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ :  tatra prabhāse suhṛdāṃ kauravāṇāṃ vinaṣṭiṃ vināśam,
duryodhanādiṣu sauhārdābhāvād anativilambe evoddhavamilanāc ca suhṛdāṃ
yādavānām iti kecid vyācakṣate | vanaṃ yathā dagdhaṃ bhavatīty anvayaḥ |
pratyak pratīcīṃ paścimavāhinīm ity arthaḥ ||21||


 || 3.1.22 ||

 tasyāṃ tritasyośanaso manoś ca

pṛthor athāgner asitasya vāyoḥ |

tīrthaṃ sudāsasya gavāṃ guhasya

  yac chrāddhadevasya sa āsiṣeve ||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ :  tritādīnām ekādaśatīrthāni tattannāmnā
prasiddhāny āsevitavān ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.


 || 3.1.23 ||

 anyāni ceha dvijadevadevaiḥ

  kṛtāni nānāyatanāni viṣṇoḥ |

pratyaṅgamukhyāṅkitamandirāṇi

  yaddarśanāt kṛṣṇam anusmaranti ||

madhvaḥ : pratyaṅkamukhyo viṣṇuḥ | brahmā pratyaṅkavān viṣṇuḥ
samyaglakṣaṇavattamaḥ iti tantramālāyām ||23||

śrīdharaḥ :  dvijadevair ṛṣibhir devaiś ca kṛtāni | aṅgam aṅgaṃ prati
vartante iti pratyaṅgāny āyudhāni teṣu mukhyaṃ cakraṃ tenāṅkitāni
mūrdhanyahemakumbheṣu cihnitāni mandirāṇi, yeṣu tāni nānāvidhāni viṣṇor
āyatanāni kṣetrāṇi tīrthāni cāsiṣeve | yeṣāṃ cakrāṅkitamandiravatāṃ
darśanāc chrīkṛṣṇasmaraṇaṃ bhavati ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : dvijadevair ṛṣibhir devaiś aṅgam aṅgaṃ prati vartante iti
pratyaṅgāny āyudhāni | teṣu mukhyaṃ cakraṃ tenāṅkitāni mandirāṇi, yeṣu
tāni ||23||


 || 3.1.24 ||

 tatas tv ativrajya surāṣṭram ṛddhaṃ

  sauvīramatsyān kurujāṅgalāṃś ca |

  kālena tāvad yamunāṃ ūpetya

  tatroddhavaṃ bhāgavataṃ dadarśa ||

śrīdharaḥ :  ativrajyātikramya | yāvad uddhavaḥ prāptas tāvat svayam api
yamunāṃ ūpetya ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tāvad iti vākyālaṃkāre sambhrame vā ||24||


 || 3.1.25 ||

  sa vāsudevānucaraṃ praśāntaṃ

  bṛhaspateḥ prāktanayaṃ pratītam |

āliṅgya gāḍhaṃ praṇayena bhadraṃ

 svānām apṛcchad bhagavatprajānām ||

śrīdharaḥ :  sa viduraḥ | prāktanayaṃ pūrvaśiṣyaṃ nītiśāstre |
pāṭhāntare prāpto nayo nītiśāstraṃ yena tam | pratītaṃ prakhyātam |
svānāṃ jñātīnāṃ bhadram apṛcchat | praśne hetuḥ, bhagavataḥ prajānāṃ
poṣyāṇām ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : suhṛdvinaṣṭeḥ śrutatve'pi svānāṃ bhadram apṛcchad iti
| śokāveśasvabhāvo'yam | sveṣāṃ paramātmīyānām ||25||

viśvanāthaḥ :  prāktanayaṃ pūrvaśiṣyaṃ nītiśāstre | prāptanayam iti vā
pāṭhaḥ | pratītaṃ khyātam, tatra vidurakartṛkāliṅgane'pi uddhavasya
namaskārābhāvaḥ premamūrcchayaiva jñeyaḥ ||25||


 || 3.1.26 ||

  kaccit purāṇau puruṣau svanābhya

 pādmānuvṛttyeha kilāvatīrṇau |

  āsāta urvyāḥ kuśalaṃ vidhāya

kṛtakṣaṇau kuśalaṃ śūragehe ||

madhvaḥ : padmo brahmā samuddiṣṭaḥ padmā śrīr api cocyate iti brāhme |

lokānāṃ sukhakartṛtvam apekṣya kuśalaṃ vibhoḥ |

pṛcchyate satatānandāt kathaṃ tasyaiva pṛcchyate || iti pādme ||26||

śrīdharaḥ :  prathamaṃ tāvad rāmakṛṣṇayoḥ kuśalaṃ pṛcchati | kaccid iti
praśne | svanābhau bhavaḥ svanābhyaḥ pādmo brahmā, tasyānuvṛttyā
prārthanayehāvatīrṇau kuśalam āsāte vartate | kṛtakṣaṇau dattāvasarau
sarveṣāṃ kṛtotsavāv iti vā | tayor nityakuśalatve'py
uktaviśeṣaṇaviśiṣṭau śūrasenasya gṛhe kaccid āsāte ? iti praśnaḥ ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svanābhyeti | svīyasya garbhodaśāyino nābhau bhavaḥ
svanābhyaḥ nijaśāsanārhaṇam itivat vyākhyātam | kuśalaṃ lokānāṃ maṅgalaṃ
yasmāt tad yathā syāt ||26||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavatprakaṭasthityaiva tatprajānāṃ bhadram iti
bhagavatsukhasthitiṃ pṛcchati—kaccid iti | praśne svanābhau bhavaḥ
svanābhyaḥ pādmo brahmā kṛtakṣaṇau kṛtotsavau tayor nityakuśalinor api
kuśalapraśnaḥ premṇaiva jñeyaḥ ||26||


 || 3.1.27 ||

kaccit kurūṇāṃ paramaḥ suhṛn no

 bhāmaḥ sa āste sukham aṅga śauriḥ |

 yo vai svasèṇāṃ pitṛvad dadāti

varān vadānyo varatarpaṇena ||

madhvaḥ : varatarpaṇena bhartṛtarpaṇena ||27||

śrīdharaḥ :  yadūnāṃ kuśalaṃ pṛcchati navabhiḥ | bhāmaḥ pūjyaḥ | śaurir
vasudevaḥ | yad vā, bhāmo bhaginībhartā | kuntī vasudevasya bhaginī | ato
devakī pāṇḍor bhaginīti lokavyavahāraḥ | varān arthān | vadānyo'tyudāraḥ
| varāṇāṃ tatpatīnāṃ tarpaṇena santarpaṇena saha ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhāmo bhaginībhartā, pauravī rohiṇyoḥ patitvāt |
svasèṇām iti kuntīsnehatātparyād uktam ||27||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhāmo bhaginībhartā | vasudevabhāryāyāḥ pauravyā
vidurādīnāṃ bhaginītvāt śaurir vasudevaḥ | svasèṇām iti kuntyāḥ
snehātiśayo dhvanyate | anyāsu svasṛṣu tathābhāvādṛṣṭeḥ | varān abhīpsitān
arthān varāṇāṃ tatpatīnāṃ tarpaṇena santoṣaṇena saha ||27||


 || 3.1.28 ||

 kaccid varūthādhipatir yadūnāṃ

  pradyumna āste sukham aṅga vīraḥ |

 yaṃ rukmiṇī bhagavato'bhilebhe

  ārādhya viprān smaram ādisarge ||

madhvaḥ : ādhir mano varūthaṃ ca ātmā svam iti cocyate ity abhidhāne
||28||

śrīdharaḥ :  varūthādhipatiḥ senānīḥ | ādisarge pūrvajanmani smaraṃ
kāmaṃ santam abhilebhe putraṃ labdhavatī ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : smaraṃ śrībhagavadvyūharūpam | śrīkṛṣṇasandarbhe
tathā nirṇīya vyākhyātatvāt ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : atra praśne tenātivaiklavyāt kramo nānusṛtaḥ |
varūthādhipatiḥ senānīḥ | ādisarge pūrvajanmani smaraṃ kandarpam iti
kandarpasya devatvāt pradyumnasya naratvāt tathābhūtatve utkarṣadyotanā
| vastutaḥ siddhānte tu kandarpas tadvibhūtiviśeṣa eva | evam agre'pi
tadaṃśavibhūtayo'pi sarvatra tallīlākathāsu tādātmyenaivocyante |
yathā devakīvasudevāv api pṛśnisutapasāv uktau svayaṃ bhagavataiva—tvam
eva pūrvasarge'bhūḥ pṛśniḥ svāyambhuve sati [bhā.pu. 10.3.32] ity ādinā
sarvatra naralīlatāpuṣṭyā camatkāra eva kāraṇaṃ jñeyam, yathātraiva
“ārādhya viprān” iti, jāmbavatī vratāḍhya [bhā.pu. 3.1.30] iti rukmiṇī
jāmbavatyādīnāṃ bhagavatsvarūpaśaktīnām api tattadarthe
tattatsādhanam api ||28||


 || 3.1.29 ||

  kaccit sukhaṃ sātvatavṛṣṇibhoja

 dāśārhakāṇām adhipaḥ sa āste |

yam abhyaṣiñcac chatapatranetro

 nṛpāsanāśāṃ parihṛtya dūrāt ||

śrīdharaḥ :  sātvatādīnām adhipa ugrasenaḥ | śatapatranetraḥ śrīkṛṣṇaḥ |
nṛpāsanāśāṃ rājyābhilāṣaṃ parihṛtya prāṇabhayena dūrāt sthitam ity arthaḥ
||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nṛpāsanāśāṃ taddiśam api parihṛtyety asya |
śatapatranetra eva vā kartā ||29||

viśvanāthaḥ :  adhipa ugrasenaḥ | yaṃ ūgrasenaṃ nṛpāsanāśāṃ rājyābhilāṣaṃ
parihṛtya prāṇabhayena dūrāt sthitam ity arthaḥ | śatapatranetraḥ
śrīkṛṣṇaḥ ||29||


 || 3.1.30 ||

  kaccid dhareḥ saumya sutaḥ sadṛkṣa

  āste'graṇī rathināṃ sādhu sāmbaḥ |

 asūta yaṃ jāmbavatī vratāḍhyā

 devaṃ guhaṃ yo'mbikayā dhṛto'gre ||

śrīdharaḥ :  he sāumya | hareḥ sutas tena sadṛkṣaḥ sadṛśaḥ sādhu sukham
āste | guhaṃ svāmikārtikeyam | agre pūrvajanmani yo bhavānyā garbhe
dhṛtas tam ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sāmbasya guhatvaṃ pradyumnavad eva ||30||

viśvanāthaḥ :  sadṛkṣaḥ sadṛśaḥ | guhaṃ kārtikeyam | aṃśāṃśinor aikyāt
rudrasya bhagavadaṃśatvāt tatputrasya kārttikeyasyāpi
bhagavatputrāṃśatvaṃ yuktyā jñeyam | yad vā, parāvareśo mahadaṃśayukta
ity ādi vakṣyamāṇayuktyā avatārakāle śrīkṛṣṇe nārāyaṇapraveśe sati
nārāyaṇa eva vasudevagṛhe'vatīrṇa iti pratītir iva sāmbe guhapraveśāt
pradyumne kāmapraveśāt uddhavādiṣv api vasvādeḥ praveśāt tathā tathoktir
nānupapannā ||30||


 || 3.1.31 ||

kṣemaṃ sa kaccid yuyudhāna āste

yaḥ phālgunāl labdhadhanūrahasyaḥ |

 lebhe'ñjasādhokṣajasevayaiva

  gatiṃ tadīyāṃ yatibhir durāpām ||

śrīdharaḥ :  yuyudhānaḥ sātyakiḥ | kṣemaṃ kuśalam āste | phālgunād arjunāl
labdhaṃ dhanuṣo rahasyaṃ yena | tadīyām adhokṣajasambandhinīm ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tadīyāṃ gatiṃ paramāntaraṅgām ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ :  yuyudhānaḥ sātyakiḥ | phālgunād arjunāt ||31||


 || 3.1.32 ||

  kaccid budhaḥ svasty anamīva āste

 śvaphalkaputro bhagavatprapannaḥ |

  yaḥ kṛṣṇapādāṅkitamārgapāṃsuṣv

 aceṣṭata premavibhinnadhairyaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  śvaphalkaputro'krūraḥ | budho vidvān | ato bhagavantaṃ
prapanno'nusṛtaḥ | ata evānamīvo niṣpāpaḥ | bhaktau liṅgam | yo'ceṣṭata
vyaluṭhat | premṇā vibhinnaṃ vidīrṇaṃ dhairyaṃ yasya saḥ | svasti kṣemam
āste ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  akrūrasya sarvadā paramabhaktimattve'pi yaḥ kṛṣṇeti
kāladeśādivaiśiṣṭyena camatkāritvād yuktam ||32||

viśvanāthaḥ :  anamīvo niṣpāpaḥ śvaphalkaputro'krūro'ceṣṭata
nandagrāmapraveśe vyaluṭhat ||32||


 || 3.1.33 ||

  kaccic chivaṃ devakabhojaputryā

 viṣṇuprajāyā iva devamātuḥ |

  yā vai svagarbheṇa dadhāra devaṃ

 trayī yathā yajñavitānam artham ||

śrīdharaḥ :  devakanāmā yo bhojas tasya putryā devakyāḥ | viṣṇuḥ prajā
putro yasyās tasyāḥ devamātur aditer iva | kaccic chivam |
yajñavitānarūpam arthaṃ trayī yathā prakāśakatayā bibharti tathā dadhāra
||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : devamātur iveti dṛṣṭāntatvaṃ taditarābhāvena ||33||

viśvanāthaḥ :  devakanāmā yo bhojas tasya putryā devakyāḥ | viṣṇuḥ prajā
apatyaṃ yasyās tasyāḥ devamātur aditer iva ||33||


 || 3.1.34 ||

  api  svid āste bhagavān sukhaṃ vo

 yaḥ sātvatāṃ kāmadugho'niruddhaḥ |

yam āmananti sma hi śabdayoniṃ

 manomayaṃ sattvaturīyatattvam ||

śrīdharaḥ :  sātvatānāṃ ūpāsakānāṃ kāmān dogdhi pūrayatīti kāmadughaḥ |
bhagavattve hetuḥ—yaṃ śabdasya śāstrasya yoniṃ kāraṇam āmananti vedāḥ |
kutaḥ ? manomayaṃ manasaḥ pravartakam | tat kutaḥ ?
sattvasyāntaḥkaraṇasya caturvidhasya turīyaṃ tattvaṃ caturtham
adhidaivam | cittāhaṅkārabuddhimanasām antaḥkaraṇabhedānāṃ krameṇa
vāsudevasaṃkarṣaṇapradyumnāniruddhā hy adhiṣṭhātāraḥ | manasaś ca
śabdayonitvaṃ prasiddham—manaḥ pūrvarūpam | vāg uttararūpam iti | tathā
anyo'ntara ātmā manomayaḥ iti prastutya tasya yajur eva śiraḥ | ṛg
dakṣiṇaḥ pakṣaḥ | sāmottaraḥ pakṣaḥ [tai.u. 2.1] ityādiśruteḥ | tathā ca
śikṣāyāṃ—

ātmā buddhyā sametyārthān mano yuṅktevi vakṣayā |

manaḥ kāyāgnim āhanti sa prerayati mārutam | 

mārutas tūrasi caran mandraṃ janayati svaram ||  ity  ādi ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  evam aniruddhasyāpi sākṣāccaturvyūhatve liṅgam
āha—api svid iti | śabdayoniṃ niśvāsavyañjitavedavṛndam | evaṃ vā are
asya mahato bhūtasya niśvasitam etad yad ṛgvedaḥ [bṛ.ā.u. 2.4.10] ity
ādiśruteḥ | manomayaṃ citte vāsudevavan manasy upāsyam | sattvaṃ
śuddhasattvātmakaḥ śrīvāsudevādirūpo bhagavān tatra turīyaṃ rūpam | ato
bāṇayuddhādau bandhanānukaraṇādikam ātmecchāmayī līlaiva,
śrīrāmacandrādivat | asya pādmabṛhatsahasranāmni māhātmyanāmāni
caitāni—

aniruddho bṛhadbrahma prādyumnir viśvamohanaḥ |

caturātmā caturvarṇaś caturyugavidhāyakaḥ ||

caturbhedaikaviśvātmā sarvotkṛṣṭāṃśakoṭisūḥ |

āśrayātmā... || iti |

ataḥ śrīkṛṣṇavyūhatvena mahāniruddhatvād asyaivāvirbhāvaviśeṣaḥ
pralayārṇavādidhāmā puruṣa iti jñeyam | ata evābhedena jagṛhe pauruṣaṃ
rūpaṃ bhagavān [bhā.pu. 1.3.1] ityādyuktaṃ mūlasaṃkarṣaṇādyaṃśair eva
hītarasaṃkarṣaṇādyavasthātrayaṃ puruṣaṃ prakāśayatīti | tathaivābhedena
viṣṇudharmottare'pīdaṃ ūktam | tatra śrīvajrapraśnaḥ—

kas tv asau bālarūpeṇa kalpānteṣu punaḥ punaḥ |

dṛṣṭo yo na tvayā jñātas tatra kautūhalaṃ mama ||

śrīmārkaṇḍeyottaraṃ ca—

bhūyo bhūyas tv asau dṛṣṭo mayā devo jagatpatiḥ |

kalpakṣayeṇa vijñātaḥ sa māyāmohitena vai ||

kalpakṣaye vyatīte tu taṃ devaṃ prapitāmahāt |

aniruddhaṃ vijānāmi pitaraṃ te jagatpatim || iti | [1.79.13]

bhīṣmaparvaṇi duryodhanaṃ prati bhīṣmaśikṣāyāṃ śrīkṛṣṇasyāvatārārambhe
gandhamādanam āgatasya brahmaṇas tadāvirbhāvaṃ manasi paśyatas tu
bālasya tad idaṃ vacanam—

sṛṣṭvā saṃkarṣaṇaṃ devaṃ svayam ātmānam ātmanā |

kṛṣṇa tvam ātmanāsrākṣīḥ pradyumnaṃ cātmasambhavam ||

pradyumnāc cāniruddhaṃ tvaṃ yaṃ vidur viṣṇum avyayam |

aniruddho'sṛjan māṃ vai brahmāṇaṃ lokadhāriṇam ||

vāsudevamayaḥ so'haṃ tvayaivāsmi vinirmitaḥ || [ma.bhā. 6.61.6567]

ata eva ca pūrvam api ca jagṛhe pauruṣaṃ rūpaṃ [bhā.pu. 1.3.1] ity atra
śrīkṛṣṇasya aniruddhāvatārāntaḥpātitvaṃ na vyākhyātam | ata eva viśeṣaḥ
kṛṣṇasandarbhe'sti ||34|| [śrīkṛṣṇasandarbha 89]

viśvanāthaḥ :  sātvatānāṃ yādavaviśeṣāṇāṃ bhāvkaraṇ vā | śabdayoniṃ
niśvāsavyañjitavedavṛndaṃ—evaṃ vā are asya mahato bhūtasya niśvasitam
etad yad ṛgvedaḥ [bṛ.ā.u. 2.4.10] ity ādiśruteḥ | mano mayate iti
manomayaṃ manasaḥ pravartakam | tathā sattvasya śuddhasattvarūpasya
caturvyūhasya turīyaṃ caturthaṃ tattvaṃ tad apy asya bāṇayuddhādau
bandhanādikam acintyātmecchāmayī līlaiva, śrīrāmacandrādivat | atrāsya
caturvyūhatve pramāṇaṃ viṣṇudharmottare vajrapraśne mārkaṇḍeyottaraṃ,
yathā—

bhūyo bhūyas tv asau dṛṣṭo mayā devo jagatpatiḥ |

kalpakṣayeṇa vijñātaḥ sa māyāmohitena vai ||

kalpakṣaye vyatīte tu taṃ devaṃ prapitāmahāt |

aniruddhaṃ vijānāmi pitaraṃ te jagatpatim || [1.79.13] iti |

bhīṣmaparvaṇi duryodhanaṃ prati bhīṣmaśikṣāyāṃ śrīkṛṣṇasyāvatārārambhe
gandhamādanam āgatasya brahmaṇas tadāvirbhāvaṃ manasi paśyataḥ
stuvānasya tad idaṃ brahmavacanam—

sṛṣṭvā saṃkarṣaṇaṃ devaṃ svayam ātmānam ātmanā |

kṛṣṇa tvam ātmanāsrākṣīḥ pradyumnaṃ cātmasambhavam ||

pradyumnāc cāniruddhaṃ tvaṃ yaṃ vidur viṣṇum avyayam |

aniruddho'sṛjan māṃ vai brahmāṇaṃ lokadhāriṇam ||

vāsudevamayaḥ so'haṃ tvayaivāsmi vinirmitaḥ || [ma.bhā. 6.61.6567] iti
||34|| 


 || 3.1.35 ||

api  svid anye ca nijātmadaivam

 ananyavṛttyā samanuvratā ye |

  hṛdīkasatyātmajacārudeṣṇa

  gadādayaḥ svasti caranti saumya ||

śrīdharaḥ :  api svit kiṃ svit | anye ca svasti caranti | nijasya
dehādivyatiriktasyātmano daivaṃ śrīkṛṣṇam
ananyavṛttyaikāntabhaktibhavena ye samyag anuvratāḥ anusṛtāḥ | hṛdīkaś
ca satyabhāmāyā ātmajaś ca cārudeṣṇaś ca gadaś cādir yeṣāṃ te'pi ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  nijasya ātmīyasya ātmanaś ca daivaṃ śrīkṛṣṇam ||35||

viśvanāthaḥ :  nijasyātmano daivaṃ mūrtaṃ bhāgyam iva śrīkṛṣṇaṃ samyag
anuvratāḥ anusṛtāḥ ||35||


 || 3.1.36 ||

  api svadorbhyāṃ vijayācyutābhyāṃ

  dharmeṇa dharmaḥ paripāti setum |

duryodhano'tapyata yatsabhāyāṃ

  sāmrājyalakṣmyā vijayānuvṛttyā ||

śrīdharaḥ :  idānīṃ kurūn pṛcchati ṣaḍbhiḥ | api kim | svadorbhyāṃ
svabāhuvad vartamānābhyāṃ vijayācyutābhyām arjunakṛṣṇābhyāṃ
dharmamārgeṇa dharmo yudhiṣṭhiraḥ setuṃ dharmamaryādāṃ paripāti | yasya
sabhāyāṃ vijayānuvṛttyā jayaparamparayā, arjunasya sevayeti vā |
evaṃbhūtaṃ yasyaiśvaryam ity arthaḥ ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : api svadorbhyām ity ādikaṃ śrībhagavadantardhānena
teṣāṃ prākaṭyāsambhavāt ||36||

viśvanāthaḥ :  idānīṃ kurūn pṛcchati ṣaḍbhiḥ | api kim | dostulyābhyām
arjunakṛṣṇābhyāṃ dharmo yudhiṣṭhiraḥ setuṃ dharmamaryādāṃ samrājyaṃ
sampattyā kīdṛśyā vijayasya sarvotkarṣasya anuvṛttir yasyāṃ tayā ||36||


 || 3.1.37 ||

kiṃ vā kṛtāgheṣv agham atyamarṣī

 bhīmo'hivad dīrghatamaṃ vyamuñcat |

  yasyāṅghripātaṃ raṇabhūr na sehe

  mārgaṃ gadāyāś carato vicitram ||

madhvaḥ : aghaṃ vyamuñcat punar aparādhabuddhiṃ hitvā āste ||37||

śrīdharaḥ :  kṛtāgheṣu kṛtāparādheṣu kuruṣu svakartṛkam aghaṃ dīrghatamaṃ
bahukālānucintitam ahivad atyamarṣī bhīmaḥ kiṃ vyamuñcan no vā ? gadāyā
vicitraṃ vividhaṃ mārgaṃ carataḥ ||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : aghaṃ krodhajaṃ vyasanam | aṃho duḥkhavyasaneṣv agham
ity amaraḥ yasyāṅghrīty anumānenaivoktam ||37||

viśvanāthaḥ :  kṛtāgheṣu kuruṣu svakartṛkam aghaṃ viṣam iva vadhahetuṃ
bahukālānucintitaṃ kiṃ vyamuñcan no vā ? ||37||


 || 3.1.38 ||

kaccid yaśodhā rathayūthapānāṃ

 gāṇḍīvadhanvoparatārir āste |

 alakṣito yaccharakūṭagūḍho

 māyākirāto giriśas tutoṣa ||

śrīdharaḥ :  rathayūthapānāṃ madhye yaśodhāḥ kīrtidhārī | yad vā,
svīyānāṃ teṣāṃ kīrtipradaḥ uparatā arayo yasmāt | yasya śarakūṭena
bāṇasamūhena gūḍha ācchannaḥ ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  rathayūthapānāṃ madhye yaśodhāḥ kīrtidhārī uparatir
vinaṣṭaśatruḥ sann āste yac charasamūhena gūḍha ācchannaḥ ||38||


 || 3.1.39 ||

yamāv uta  svit tanayau pṛthāyāḥ

 pārthair vṛtau pakṣmabhir akṣiṇīva |

remāta uddāya mṛdhe svarikthaṃ

 parāt suparṇāv iva vajrivaktrāt ||

śrīdharaḥ :  uta svit kiṃ svit | yamau nakulasahadevau | remāte krīḍāte
ity arthaḥ | mādryāḥ sutāv api pṛthāyās tanayau pṛthāyāḥ putrair vṛtau
suparṇāv iva remāte | kiṃ kṛtvā ? parāt duryodhanāt svarikthaṃ svīyaṃ
rājyaṃ ūddāyācchidya | vajrivaktrād indrasya mukhāt svariktham amṛtaṃ
garuḍa iveti | yad vā, suparṇāv iveti | yadi dvau garuḍāv amṛtam ānayetāṃ
tarhi tadvat | akṣiṇīveti maṇīvādigaṇatvāt sandhiḥ ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : uddāyetyasya kartāraḥ pārthā eva vā | tathā hi yau
pārthair vṛttau pālyamānau santau svacchandavihāritvena suparṇāv iva
remāte | kiṃ kṛtvā ? vṛttau parāt svarikthaṃ ūddāya | kasmād iva ?
vajriṇo vrajrahastasya mukhād ivety abhūtopamā | “uddāya” ity atra
“uddhṛtya” iti puṇyāraṇyapāṭhāntaram ||39||

viśvanāthaḥ : yamau nakulasahadevau mādryāḥ sutāv api pṛthāyā eva
pakṣmabhī rakṣite akṣiṇī iva pārthair vṛtau | akṣiṇīveti maṇīvādiḥ | parāt
śatror duryodhanāt sakāśāt mṛdhe yuddhe svarikthaṃ rājyaṃ ūddāyācchidya
remāte | kasmāt ? kim ācchidya ? kāv iva ? vajrivaktrād indrasya mukhāt
riktham amṛtam ācchidya dvau suparṇāv iva | uddāyety asya kartāra eva
pārtho eva vā | tathā hi—pārthair vṛtau pālyamānau remāte | kiṃ kṛtvā ?
vṛtau parāt svariktham ādāya kasmād iva vajriṇo vajrahastasya mukhād iva
| suparṇāv ivety abhūtopameyam ||39||


 || 3.1.40 ||

aho pṛthāpi dhriyate'rbhakārthe

 rājarṣivaryeṇa vināpi tena |

yas tv ekavīro'dhiratho vijigye

 dhanur dvitīyaḥ kakubhaś catasraḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  pṛthāyāḥ kiṃ nu kuśalaṃ pṛccheyam, yatas tasyāḥ pāṇḍunā vinā
prāṇadhāraṇam evāścaryam ity āha—aho iti | dhriyate jīvati | na
cātyāścaryam | yato'rbhakārthe dhriyate na bhogārtham | tathāpi tv
āścaryam evety āha—tena tathābhūtena vinā | tad evāha—yas tv iti | dhanur
eva dvitīyaṃ sahāyo yasya ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sarvān eva tān yugapat pṛcchan kuntīm api śocati—aho
iti | teṣām api paramasadguṇānām arbhakāṇām arthe ity arthaḥ | tataś ca
teṣām eva kuśalena, tasyāś ca kuśalaṃ syād iti tad eva vadeti bhāvaḥ
||40||

viśvanāthaḥ :  aho āścaryam atra kuśalapraśne mayā pṛthāpi dhriyate iti
tasyā api kuśalaṃ brūhīti bhāvaḥ | nanu kim evaṃ brūṣe ?
tatrāha—rājarṣivaryeṇa pāṇḍunā svapatinā vināpi arbhakārthe
yudhiṣṭhirādibālakapālanārtham eva sthitā yadi yudhiṣṭhirādayo'rbhakā
nābhaviṣyaṃs tadā sā amariṣyad eveti bhāvaḥ | yaḥ pāṇḍur eko niḥsahāya eva
vīro dhanur eva dvitīyaṃ yasya saḥ ||40||


 || 3.1.41 ||

saumyānuśoce tam adhaḥpatantaṃ

bhrātre paretāya vidudruhe yaḥ |

 niryāpito yena suhṛt svapuryā

ahaṃ svaputrān samanuvratena ||

śrīdharaḥ :  pṛthā arbhakārthe jīvatīti yuktam evety āha—he saumya, taṃ
dhṛtarāṣṭraṃ jīvan tam anuśocāmi | tat kiṃ ? adhaḥpatantam | tatra hetuḥ,
paretāya mṛtāya bhrātre pāṇḍave tatputradroheṇa yo vidudruhe drohaṃ
kṛtavān | kiṃ ca, jīvato'pi bhrātur mamāpakṛtavān ity āha—yena suhṛd
bhrātāhaṃ svapuryāḥ sakāśān niryāpito vivāsitaḥ ||41||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evam ajīvantaṃ pāṇḍuṃ na śocāmi sadgatyarhatvāt,
dhṛtarāṣṭraṃ tu jīvantam api tadvaiparītyāc chocāmy evety āha—somyeti
||41||

viśvanāthaḥ : dhṛtarāṣṭrasyāndhasya tu kuśalaṃ naiva pṛcchāmi, kintu tam
adhaḥpatantam anuśoce—he saumya uddhava ! yaḥ paretāya mṛtāyāpi bhrātre
tatputradroheṇa vidudruhe drohaṃ kṛtavān mahyam aparasmai bhrātre
jīvate'pi vidudruhe ity āha—niryāpita iti suhṛt tasya hitakāry api ||41||


 || 3.1.42 ||

so'haṃ harer martyaviḍambanena

 dṛśo nṛṇāṃ cālayato vidhātuḥ |

nānyopalakṣyaḥ padavīṃ prasādāc

  carāmi paśyan gatavismayo'tra ||

śrīdharaḥ :  aho svalu vismayo jānato'pi tasyaivaṃ duśceṣṭitaṃ, yatas tvaṃ
sādhur api duḥkhaṃ prāpito'sīty ata āha—so'haṃ hareḥ prasādāt tasya
padavīṃ māhātmyaṃ paśyan gatavismayo'tra bhūtale nānyopalakṣyo gūḍhaḥ san
sukhaṃ vicarāmi | kathaṃbhūtasya ? martyaviḍambanenaiśvaryāc chādakena
mānuṣyānukaraṇena nṛṇāṃ dṛśaś cittavṛttīś cālayato bhrāmayataḥ ||42||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ahaṃ tu tatsaṅgy api bhagavatprasādānna
tādṛśājñānavān | atas tatsaṅgaṃ tyaktvā tadvārtāśravaṇe'pi nirviṇṇaḥ
san lokeṣv ātmānaṃ gopayaṃś carāmīty āha so'ham iti | gatavismayaḥ
gatasandehaḥ | atha vidurasya śrīkṛṣṇe paramaparāyaṇasyāpi
vyavahāramātradṛṣṭyā śrīkṛṣṇaparityāgena yāvajjīvaṃ dūragamanam idaṃ
śrīkṛṣṇenaiva kāritam iti lakṣyate tac ca
dhṛtarāṣṭrādivyavahārāveśaparityājanāya svaikamātraveśāya ca
paścāttāpaṃ sampādayitum iti | ataḥ pūrvaṃ yo vidurābhiprāyo vyākhyātaḥ
so'pi tadicchayaiva jāta iti jñeyam ||42||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, mayi tasya droho na mamāpakārako'bhūt, pratyuta
paramopakāraka evābhūd ity āha—so'ham iti | martyānāṃ dhṛtarāṣṭrādīnāṃ
svaprasādālambhanād viḍambanena vañcanena nṛṇāṃ tatsadṛśānām anyeṣām api
prākṛtānāṃ  dṛśor buddhivṛttīś cālayato bhramayato hareḥ prasādāt
tatpadavīṃ, tasya caraṇavinyāsavartma caraṇau ca paśyan, 
bhaktavatsalasya  bhagavataḥ kiyad etad āścaryaṃ ? iti gatavismayaḥ
kvāpy etadrahasyānudghāṭanād anenopalakṣyaḥ san atra tīrtheṣv eva carāmi
| atra duryodhananiḥsāritasya khedasamudre nimajjito vidurasya
pratyakṣībhūya bhagavatā tasminn eva kāle evaṃ ūktaṃ—bho matparamabhakta
vidura ! madviraham anusmṛtya kim ity evaṃ khidyase ? yatra yatra tvaṃ
yiyāsasi, tatra tatraiva tīrthe tadagre calantaṃ tvayā saha kṛtasaṃvādam
eva māṃ paśyann eva yāsyasīti bhagavadvaro'numīyate, ata eva
duryodhanavadhānantaram api yudhiṣṭhirarājyaprāptāv api
bhagavaddarśanānandanirvṛtenaiva vidureṇa nāyātam, anyathā avaśyam
āyāsyataiva | kiṃ ca, mauṣalalīlānte'ntardadhatā bhagavatā viduranetrād
apy antarhitam | ata eva tadavadhi uddhavadarśanaparyantaṃ vidurasya
vaikalyam ||42||


 || 3.1.43 ||

nūnaṃ nṛpāṇāṃ trimadotpathānāṃ

mahīṃ muhuś cālayatāṃ camūbhiḥ |

  vadhāt prapannārtijihīrṣayeśo'py

  upaikṣatāghaṃ bhagavān kurūṇām ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu hareḥ kim evaṃ līlayā, yena svabhaktānāṃ
vanavāsādikleśā bhavanti, svasya ca dautye bandhanodyamādiparābhavaḥ,
tad varaṃ teṣām aparādhānantaram eva hananaṃ nāparādhopekṣety ata
āha—nūnaṃ niścitaṃ tribhir madair utpathānāṃ ūdvṛttānāṃ vadhād dhetoḥ
prapannānām ārtijihīrṣayeśo'ghasamaya eva hantuṃ samartho'pi kurūṇām
aghaṃ ūpaikṣata | tadānīm eva teṣāṃ vadhe sarvaduṣṭarājavadho na syād
ity āśayenety arthaḥ |

vidyāmado dhanamadas tathaivābhijano madaḥ |

ete madā madāndhānāṃ ta eva hi satāṃ damāḥ || iti trayo madāḥ ||43||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu bhagavataḥ kim evaṃ līlāyā yena svabhaktānāṃ
vanavāsādikleśo bhavanti | svasya ca dautye bandhanodyamādiparābhavaḥ
taduttaraṃ teṣām aparādhānantaram eva hananaṃ nāparādhopekṣety ata
āha—nūnam iti | tribhir madair utpathānām asadvṛttānāṃ vadhād eva
prapannānām ārtijihīrṣayā īśaḥ aghasamaye hantuṃ samartho'pi kurūṇām
aghaṃ ūpaikṣata | tadānīm eva teṣāṃ vadhe sarvaduṣṭarājanyavadho na
syād ity āśayenety arthaḥ |

vidyāmado dhanamadas tathaivābhijano madaḥ |

ete madā madāndhānāṃ ta eva hi satāṃ damāḥ || iti trayo madāḥ ||43||


 || 3.1.44 ||

  ajasya janmotpathanāśanāya

  karmāṇy akartur grahaṇāya puṃsām |

nanv anyathā ko'rhati dehayogaṃ

  paro guṇānāṃ ūta karmatantram ||

madhvaḥ : na dehoyogo hi janir viṣṇor vyaktir janiḥ smṛtā  ity āgneye |
hari kartāpy akarteti phalābhāvena bhaṇyate iti ||44||

śrīdharaḥ :  sarvadurvṛttavadhādyartham eva bhagavato janmakarmāṇi
nānyatheti kaimutyanyāyenāha—ajasyāpi janma, akartur api karmāṇi puṃsāṃ
grahaṇāya kamasu pravṛttaye | anyathā na ced eva tarhi bhagavato
janmādikathā tāvad āstām | ko vānyo'pi guṇānāṃ paro guṇātīto dehayogaṃ
karmavistāraṃ vā'rhatīti ||44||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  ajasya janmety āvirbhāvamātraṃ tad ity arthaḥ |
akartuḥ karmāṇīti svairalīlā ity arthaḥ | puṃsāṃ sarveṣāṃ grahaṇāya
svasmin manasa ākarṣaṇāya | yathoktaṃ pañcame—yallīlāṃ mṛgapatir 
ādade'navadyām ādātuṃ svajanamanāṃsy  udāravīrya [bhā.pu. 5.25.10] iti
| ato dehayogam iti pitṛtvena svīyakriyamāṇānāṃ deheṣv āvirbhāvamātram
ity arthaḥ | guṇānāṃ paraḥ kaḥ pārṣadādir api ||44||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu cidghanānandarūpasya  bhagavataḥ kim evaṃ 
prākṛtalokabhadrābhadramadhyavittatvena ? satyam | svabhakteṣu
vātsalyam anyatra  sarvatrāpi hitaiṣitvam iti dvāv eva tatra  hetuḥ ity
āha—ajasya  jīvavan māyādhīnatayā janmādivikārarahitasyāpi janma
yogamāyayā bhaktapremādhīnatayā janmādivilāsavattvaṃ ūtpathānāṃ
sanmārgacchidyam asurāṇāṃ  nāśanāya svakartṛkanāśanena teṣāṃ
mokṣadānāya akartuḥ nāsya karmaṇi janmādāv ityuktadiśā
sattvādiguṇanibandhanakartṛtvarahitasyāpi karmāṇi cidānandamayāni
govardhanoddharaṇādīni | puṃsāṃ svabhaktānāṃ  sarvatra
svargamokṣādisukheṣv api viraktānāṃ grahaṇāya āsvādanīyatgvena svīkārāya
|

yad vā, puṃsāṃ muktamumukṣusāṃsārikāṇāṃ  jīvānāṃ grahaṇāya svasminn
ākarṣaṇāya nivṛttatarṣair upagīyamānād  ity ādeḥ | na tv anyathā  jīvānāṃ
svakarmādhīnam eva yathā janma karma na tathā  ity arthaḥ |
karmādhīnajanmakarmavattve dehenāpi tasya sambandhaḥ karmādhīna eva syāt
| sa ca dehayogo guṇātītabhaktisiddhajīvasyāpi nāsti kiṃ punaḥ sākṣāt
parameśvarasya tasyety āha—guṇānāṃ paraḥ guṇebhyaḥ pṛthagbhūtaḥ sann api
kaḥ khalu jīvo'pi karmatantraṃ karmādhīnaṃ dehayogam arhati, api tu na
ko'pi | atra karmatantraṃ dehayogaṃ nārhatīty ukte akarmatantraṃ
dehayogam arhatīty artho labhyate | tasya  parameśvarasya tu māyayā
sahayogāsambhavāt taddehasya cidānandaghanatvaṃ svata evāyātam ||44||


 || 3.1.45 ||

 tasya prapannākhilalokapānām

  avasthitānām anuśāsane sve |

 arthāya jātasya yaduṣv ajasya

vārtāṃ sakhe kīrtaya tīrthakīrteḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tasmād evaṃbhūtācintyamāyāvinodasya kathāṃ kathayety
āha—tasya prapannā ye'svilalokapālās teṣām anyeṣāṃ ca svīye'nuśāsane
sthitānām arthāya yaduṣu jātasya | tīrthaṃ saṃsāratāriṇī kīrtir yasyeti
||45||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  hanta hanta sā durvārtā mayā prabhāse śrutaiva tadāpy
uttaram adadāne'pi tvayi pratyavayavaṃ yat spṛṣṭaṃ tat khalu vilapitam eva
| tasmāj janmādilīlām eva tadvismaraṇāya śrotum icchāmīty āha—tasyeti
||45||

viśvanāthaḥ : atas tasya cidghanānandarūpāṇi janmakarmāṇy eva kathayety
āśayenāha—tasya prapannā ye'khilalokapālās teṣām anyeṣāṃ ca svīye
anuśāsane sthitānām arthāya prayojanāya | tīrthaṃ paramapāvanī
saṃsāratāriṇī ca kīrtir yasya tasya | sarveṣu tīrtheṣu prāyaḥ
kṛtamajjana evāsmi | samprati tvaṃ teṣāṃ sāphalyaṃ ūpādāya kṛṣṇasya
kīrtitīrthāmṛte māṃ nimajjayeti bhāvaḥ ||45||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

 tṛtīye prathamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


  iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye

 pāramahaṃsyaṃ saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ

 tṛtīyaskandhe viduroddhavasaṃvāde

 prathamo'dhyāyaḥ |

||3.1||


 (3.2)

atha dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ

viduroddhavasaṃvāde

 || 3.2.1 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

iti bhāgavataḥ pṛṣṭaḥ kṣattrā vārtāṃ priyāśrayām |

  prativaktuṃ na cotseha autkaṇṭhyāt smāriteśvaraḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

  dvitīye kṛṣṇaviśleṣād anuśocan nathoddhanaḥ |

kṣattre bālacaritrāṇi kṛṣṇasyāvarṇayacchvasan ||

tad evaṃ priyavārtāṃ pṛṣṭasyoddhavasya śrīkṛṣṇavirahautkaṇṭhyāveśena
prativacanāsāmarthyam āha ṣaḍbhiḥ—itīti | smārita īśvaro yasya ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : smāriteti smaraṇaviśeṣaṃ gamayati ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

  dvitīye premavaiklavyarodanasnapitānanaḥ |

  vrajalīlāṃ samāsena rāsāntāṃ ūddhavo'vadat ||

śrīkṛṣṇaviśleṣavivṛddhapremamūrcchitasyoddhavasya
prativacanāsāmarthyaṃ vadan kām api daśāṃ darśayati—vidūrasyoccaiḥ
praśnebhyo mūrcchābhaṅgena smārita īśvaro yasya saḥ ||1||


 || 3.2.2 ||

  yaḥ pañcahāyano mātrā prātarāśāya yācitaḥ |

tan naicchad racayan yasya saparyāṃ bālalīlayā ||

śrīdharaḥ : etad eva kaimutyanyāyena prapañcayati—ya iti dvābhyām | yaḥ
pañcavarṣo'pi bālalīlayeti kṛṣṇaṃ kañcit parikalpya kalpitair eva
sādhanaiḥ paricaryāṃ kurvan prātarbhojanārthaṃ mātrā prarthito'pi tad
bhojanaṃ naicchat ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ya iti yugmakam ||2||

viśvanāthaḥ : tasya prāktanīṃ bhaktiṃ darśayati—bālalīlayeti
pañcālikābhiḥ khelann eva kām api pañcālikāṃ kṛṣṇaṃ parikalpya kalpitair
evopacāraiḥ paricaryāṃ kurvan mātrā prātarbhojanārthaṃ prārthito'pi
sampraty api me bhagavatparicaryā na nirvyūḍheti tadbhojanaṃ naicchat
||2||


 || 3.2.3 ||

  sa kathaṃ sevayā tasya kālena jarasaṃ gataḥ |

  pṛṣṭo vārtāṃ pratibrūyād bhartuḥ pādāv anusmaran ||

śrīdharaḥ : jarasaṃ vṛddhatvaṃ gataḥ prāptaḥ ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yasya pañcālikārūpasya jarasaṃ jarāṃ
kṛtacirasevitvam ity arthaḥ | pravayaso'py āsan yuvāno'tibalaujasa ity
anena virodhāt ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : tasya sevayā hetunā sevāprabhāveṇety arthaḥ | kāle
samaye'pi jarasaṃ vṛddhatvaṃ na gataḥ | yad vā, kāle yā sevā yasmin kāle
yā samucitā sevā tayā | kāleneti tṛtīyāntatayā vyākhyānaṃ tv asaṅgataṃ,
tatra pravayaso'py āsan yuvāno'tibalaujasa ity anena virodhāt ||3||


 || 3.2.4 ||

  sa muhūrtam abhūt tūṣṇīṃ kṛṣṇāṅghrisudhayā bhṛśam |

 tīvreṇa bhaktiyogena nimagnaḥ sādhu nirvṛtaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : śrīkṛṣṇāṅghrisudhayā sādhu nirvṛtaḥ | tasyām eva tīvreṇa
vivaśatvāpādakena bhaktiyogena bhṛśaṃ nimagnaś ca ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tarhi kathaṃ pratyuktavān ucyate śrībhagavataiva
svanityalīlāyā manasi darśanena sāntvanād ity āha—sa iti tribhiḥ ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : pādayor anusmaraṇaṃ vivṛṇoti—sa iti | vidurapraśnair
uddhavasya mūrcchābhaṅge sati hanta hanta tena prabhuṇāhaṃ virahito'smīti
śrīkṛṣṇāṅghryāḥ smaraṇena sākṣātkāre sati prāptā yā saundaryasudhā tayā
āsvādyamānayā muhūrtaṃ ghaṭikādvayaparyantaṃ tūṣṇīṃ sthito'bhūt, tataś
ca tīvreṇa kṛṣṇaviśleṣavivṛddhena bhaktiyogena premṇā āsvādanabhūmnā
tasyām eva sudhāyāṃ nimagnaḥ vismṛtakṛṣṇaviśleṣaduḥkhaḥ san sādhu yathā
syāt tathā nirvṛto'bhūt ||4||


 || 3.2.5 ||

 pulakodbhinnasarvāṅgo muñcan mīladdṛśā śucaḥ |

pūrṇārtho lakṣitas tena snehaprasarasamplutaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : pulakair udbhinnāny ujjṛmbhitāni sarvāṇy aṅgāni yasya |
mīlantyā dṛśā śuco'śrūṇi muñcan | tena vidureṇa pūrṇārthaḥ kṛtārtho
lakṣitaḥ | yato bhagavati yaḥ snehas tasya prasaraḥ pūras tasmin saṃpluto
nimagnaḥ ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : nirvṛtyānubhāvaṃ darśayati—pulakair udbhinnāni aṅkuritāni
sarvāṇy aṅgānīti udbhidas tarugulmādyā iti stambhaś ca vyañjitaḥ |
mīlantyā dṛśā śucaḥ aśrūṇi muñcan tena vidureṇa pūrṇārthaḥ kṛtārtho
lakṣitaḥ anubhāvair anumitena premṇety arthaḥ | yataḥ premṇa eva bhagavati
snehaś cittadravas tasya prasaraḥ puras tasmin samplutaḥ nimagnaḥ
prathamaṃ premṇi nimagnas tatas taddvitīyakakṣāyāṃ snehe nimagna ity
arthaḥ ||5||


 || 3.2.6 ||

 śanakair bhagavallokān nṛlokaṃ punar āgataḥ |

 vimṛjya netre viduraṃ prītyāhoddhava utsmayan ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavān eva lokas tasmāt | nṛlokaṃ dehānusandhānam |
utsmayan yadukulasaṃhārādibhagavaccāturyasmaraṇena vismayaṃ prāpnuvan
||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhavagallokāt nityalīlāmayadvārakākhyāt | nṛlokaṃ
bahirdṛśyamānaṃ vidurādimayaṃ manuṣyalokam āgataḥ anusandadhānaḥ |
utsmayan tadanubhavenoccair ānandita ity arthāh ||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : tataś ca bhagavallokāt svapremodrekeṇa prāpitān
nityalīlāmayadvārakākhyāt nṛlokaṃ vidurapremṇā ākṛṣyamāṇaḥ sann
āgataḥ punar iti dvitīyamūrcchābhaṅge satīty arthaḥ | utsmayan
bhūbhāraharaṇādicāturyasmaraṇena vismayaṃ prāpnuvan | yad vā, bho
uddhava ! viduraṃ pratyuttareṇa samādhāya punar atrāgaccheti
bhagavadāśvāsanenotkṛṣṭaṃ smitaṃ kurvan ||6||


 || 3.2.7 ||

uddhava uvāca—

kṛṣṇadyumaṇi nimloce gīrṇeṣv ajagareṇa ha |

  kiṃ nu naḥ kuśalaṃ brūyāṃ gataśrīṣu gṛheṣv aham ||

śrīdharaḥ : śrīkṛṣṇaviraheṇa santapyamānaḥ pratyāha—śrīkṛṣṇa eva
dyumaṇiḥ sūryas tasya nimloce'stamaye satyajagareṇa kālamahāsarpeṇa
gīrṇeṣu nigiliteṣu tvatpṛṣṭānāṃ bandhūnāṃ kiṃ nu kuśalaṃ brūyām ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : śokavyākulaṃ viduram āśvāsayituṃ prathamam eva siddhāntaṃ
bruvan svabahirvṛttyā tadvirahasantāpaṃ lokānāṃ duravasthānaṃ
cāvedayati | kṛṣṇa eva dyumaṇiḥ sūryas tasya nimloce astamaye sati
ajagareṇa mahāsarparūpaśokāndhakāreṇa gīrṇeṣu nirgiliteṣu gṛheṣu
no'smākaṃ tvatpṛṣṭānāṃ bandhūnāṃ kiṃ kuśalaṃ brūyāṃ ? atra jyotiścakre
sthitasyaiva dyumaṇer aśvarathasārathyādiparikaraviśiṣṭasya yasmin
varṣe astamayo dṛśyate tad anyeṣu varṣeṣu
tadaivodayapūrvāhnamadhyāhnādayo dṛśyante yathā, tathaiva
gokulamathurādvārakāsthasya saparikarasya
tattallīlāmṛtamajjitajagajjanasyaiva kṛṣṇasya yasmin
brahmāṇḍe'ntardhānaṃ dṛśyate, tadaivānyeṣu brahmāṇḍeṣu
janmotsavarāsotsavakaṃsavadharukmiṇyādipariṇayotsavādyā līlā
dṛśyante | jyotiścakre sūryasyodayapūrvāhnādyāḥ pratīyamānatvād avāstavāḥ
| kṛṣṇasya tu janmādyās tatra tatra nityatvād vāstavā eveti viśeṣaḥ |
sarvāsāṃ līlānāṃ nityatvaṃ prathamaskandhe darśitam | daśame ca punaḥ
sapramāṇakaṃ darśayiṣyate ca | yathā sūryāstamayasambandhini varṣe
andhakāreṇa grasyamāne kamalāni mlāyanti cakravākā vilapanti,
cauradasyurākṣasapretādyā hṛṣyanti, tathaiva
śrīkṛṣṇāntardhānasambandhini brahmāṇḍe duḥkhājagaragraste sādhavo
mlāyanti, kṛṣṇānurāgiṇo vilapanti, dharmasetavo bhidyante, adhārmikā
bhagavadbahirmukhā hṛṣyantīty uddhavena gīrṇeṣv ity ādinā sūcitam ||7||


 || 3.2.8 ||

durbhago bata loko'yaṃ yadavo nitarām api |

  ye saṃvasanto na vidur hariṃ mīnā ivoḍupam ||

śrīdharaḥ : anuśocann āha—durbhago bhāgyahīnaḥ | ye saha saṃvasanto'pi
śrīharir ayam iti na viduḥ | yathā kṣīrasamudre jātam uḍupaṃ candraṃ
tadā tatratyā mīnāḥ kevalaṃ kamanīyaḥ kaścij jalacara ity evaṃ viduḥ, na
tv amṛtamaya iti tadvat | yad vā, jale pratibimbitaṃ candraṃ yatheti
||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : durbhaga iti | ayaṃ mama hṛdaye sphuran dvārakāvāsī
lokaḥ | durbhago bhāgyahīnaḥ | ye saṃvasantaḥ saha vasanto'pi na vidur na
jānanti, ahaṃ tu saṃvāsabhāgyahīno na jānāmīti nāścaryam iti bhāvaḥ |
atra tadānīṃ yadi saṃvāso nābhaviṣyat, tadā nāvediṣur ity evāvakṣyad iti
jñeyam | kiṃ ca, hariḥ sarvamanoharatvena jñāta api, taṃ nāviduḥ, svayaṃ
bhagavattvena na jānanti | tatra dṛṣṭāntaḥ—mīnā ivoḍupam iti |
svakalāvardhanārthaṃ prabhāse samudramagnaṃ taṃ mīnā yathā kevalaṃ
madhurojjvalatvenaiva viduḥ, na tu devottamatvena tadvad ity arthaḥ ||8||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ tadvinābhūtānām uttamalokānāṃ duravasthāṃ darśayitvā
tadvirahodrekeṇākasmāt sphuritaṃ tadīyamahaiśvaryajñānaṃ svasmin
nālakṣya tadvinābhūtānāṃ tallīlāparikarāṇāṃ
tādṛśamahaiśvaryasphūrtim ālakṣya premavibhramasya kenāpi
vaicitryeṇaiva tān nindati—durbhaga iti | ayaṃ mama hṛdaye sphuran
dvārakāvāsī lokaḥ | durbhago bhāgyahīnaḥ | tatrāpi yadavas
tadatisamīpasambandhino nitarāṃ durbhagāḥ | ye saṃvasantaḥ saha
vasanto'pi hariṃ svamādhuryeṇa tattanmano harantaṃ na vidur na jānanti
| ahaṃ tu saṃvāsabhāgyahīnatvāt jñātvāpy atidurbhaga iti bhāvaḥ | yathā
kṣīrasamudre jātam uḍupaṃ tatrasthaṃ candraṃ tatratyā mīnāḥ kevalam
atikamanīya āsmākīnaḥ kaścij jalacara ity eva viduḥ, na tu devatārūpaḥ
sudhāṃśuniśāpatir iti tadvat yadavaḥ kṛṣṇasya mādhuryam eva jānanti, na
tv aiśvaryam iti duḥkhena tān durbhagān eva bravīmīti bhāvaḥ | vastutas tu
durjñeyo bhago māhātmyaṃ yasya saḥ | aiśvaryajñānaniṣṭhebhyo'pi
mādhuryajñānaniṣṭhānām utkarṣasya daśame vyākhyāsyamānatvāt atra na
vidur iti vartamānanirdeśena dvārakāvāsināṃ yadūnāṃ ca
bhagavannityasaṅgitvajñāpanāya, bho vidura ! tvatpṛṣṭakuśalā
yādavādayaḥ samprati śrībhagavatā sahaiva sukhenaiva khelanti | kevalaṃ
praṣṭā tvaṃ pṛṣṭaś cāham ity āvām evāvāṃ śocāva iti bhāvaḥ | atra yadi
tadānīṃ kṛṣṇena saha teṣāṃ saṃvāso nābhaviṣyat, tadā nāvediṣur ye vasanta
ity evāvakṣyad iti jñeyam ||8||


 || 3.2.9 ||

 iṅgitajñāḥ puruprauḍhā ekārāmāś ca sātvatāḥ |

  sātvatām ṛṣabhaṃ sarve bhūtāvāsam amaṃsata ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhāgyahīnatvād eva na viduḥ, na tu jñānasāmagryabhāvād ity
āha—iṅgitaṃ cittasthaṃ jānantīti | tathā puru atiśayena prauḍhā nipuṇāḥ |
ekasminn eva sthāne āramantīti tathā | evaṃbhūtā api bhūtānām āvāsam
īśvaraṃ santaṃ sātvatām ṛṣabhaṃ sātvataśreṣṭham amanyanta ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanv adhunāpi na jānantīti kathaṃ jānāsi ? ity āśaṅkya
tatra hetuṃ prācīnanijānubhavam āha—iṅgitajñā iti | sātvatāṃ sveṣām eva
ṛṣabhaṃ nityakulapatitve vartamānaṃ svayaṃ bhagavantam atibhūtāvāsaṃ
tadaṃśarūpaṃ bhūtāntaryāmiṇam evāmaṃsateti eko deva ity ādau
sarvabhūtādhivāsa [śve.u. 6.11] ity antaryāmīti śruteḥ | uktaṃ ca
vṛṣṇīnāṃ paradevateti [bhā.pu. 10.43.17] iti ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu śuddhapremaikamādhuryabhujo gokulavāsina iva
dvārakāvāsino na khalv aiśvaryajñānaśūnyā bhavanti | tat kathaṃ na
vidur iti bravīṣi ? tatrāha—iṅgitajñā iti tadīyacittastham api vastu
jānanti kiṃ punaḥ śarīrasthaṃ saundaryalāvaṇyādikam | tatra hetuḥ—puru
prauḍhā atisūkṣmabuddhayaḥ | tad apy aiśvaryajñānābhāvam āha—ekasminn
evāsanaśayanādau āramante | sātvatāṃ sveṣām eva ṛṣabhaṃ
nityakulapatitvena vartamānaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ bhūtāvāsaṃ sarvabhūteṣv āvasantam
antaryāmiṇam evāmaṃsata eko deva ity ādau sarvabhūtādhivāsa [śve.u. 6.11]
ity antaryāmiśruteḥ | na tu svayaṃ bhagavattvena sākṣānnārāyaṇasyāpy
aṃśinamk ity atas te hariṃ na vidur ity aham evocam iha jagati samucitaṃ
jānanto'jānantaś ca na nindyante | nindyante tu tanmadhyavartino'rdham
ardhaṃ jānantu iti bhāvaḥ ||9||


 || 3.2.10 ||

  devasya māyayā spṛṣṭā ye cānyad asadāśritāḥ |

bhrāmyate dhīr na tadvākyair ātmany uptātmano harau ||

śrīdharaḥ : ye yādavā devasya māyayā spṛṣṭā vyāptā yādavo'yam
asmadbandhur iti vadanti, ye ca śiśupālādayo'sad evānyad vairam āśritā
nindanti, teṣāṃ vākyair ātmani harāv uptātmano nikṣiptacittasya mādṛśasya
buddhir na bhrāmyate mohaṃ na prāpyate | anye tu mūḍhā evety arthaḥ ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : devasyeti | ye ca yādavebhyo'nyo virāḍ aviduṣāṃ
[bhā.pu. 10.43.17] ityādyuktaprakāreṇa paramavidvāṃṣas te tv anyad
asat paramotkṛṣṭabhautikadeho'sāv iti manyanta ity arthaḥ ||10||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ ca martyalokavartinaḥ sādhavas tadvirahaduḥkhinaḥ,
ye ca yādavādyās tannityasaṅginaḥ saṃyogasukhinaḥ, te dvaya eva
bhaktimattvāt dhanyā eva | anye tv abhaktā nārakina evety āha—devasya
māyayā ye spṛṣṭā vidvanmāninas tatrāpi ye ca anyatpiṣṭasāṅkhyhetuād
aparam atiduṣṭamatam āsuram āśritās teṣāṃ vākyaiḥ kṛṣṇaḥ śarīrraṃ
parityajya vaikuṇṭhaṃ gata iti tathā kṛṣṇo
dhṛtarāṣṭrajarāsandhādimahāmahārājadrohadharmajanitvena
brahmaśāpena sakula evaṃ nāśaṃ prāpta iti nindābhāṣitair harau ātmani
paramātmani uptātmano nikṣiptacittasya bhaktajanasya dhīr na bhrāmyati,
kintu tanmādhurya eva nimajjati, yeṣāṃ bhrāmyati tair apy alaṃ nārakibhir
iti bhāvaḥ ||10||


 || 3.2.11 ||

  pradarśyātaptatapasām avitṛptadṛśāṃ nṛṇām |

ādāyāntar adhād yas tu svabimbaṃ lokalocanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : ko'sau hariḥ ? ity apekṣāyām āha—pradarśyeti | na taptaṃ tapo
yair ato'vitṛptā dṛśo yeṣāṃ teṣāṃ svabimbaṃ śrī mūrtim etāvantaṃ kālaṃ
darśayitvā yo'ntarhitavān lokasya locanam ādāyācchidya, tādṛśasyānyasya
vilokanīyasyābhāvāt ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yathā tathāpi sarvākarṣaṇam eva tadrūpam ity āha
pradarśyeti | cakṣuṣaś cakṣur [kena.u. 1.2] iti śrutyuktadiśā |
lokalocanarūpaṃ svabimbaṃ svamūrtim ādāya gṛhītvā | tathoktaṃ mausale
parvaṇi—

kṛtvā bhārāvataraṇaṃ pṛthivyāḥ pṛthulocanaḥ |

mocayitvā tanuṃ kṛṣṇaḥ prāptaḥ svasthānam uttamam ||  [ma. 16.9.29] iti
| 

atra “mocayitvā” bhārāvataraṇāt tyājayitvā, na tu muktvety arthaḥ ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : tasmād bhaktānāṃ matam eva vāstavaṃ bhavet | tad eva kiṃ ?
ity apekṣāyām āha—pradarśyeti | avitṛptadṛśāṃ nṛṇām ity anādare ṣaṣṭhī |
yas tu svabimbaṃ svīyaṃ śrīvigrahaṃ nèn pradarśya tanmādhuryam
āsvādayitum ārabdhavata eva tān avitṛptadṛśo'nādṛtya svabimbaṃ punar
ādāya taddṛgbhya ācchidya nītvā antaradhāt śīghraṃ tirobabhūva | atra
yatpadasyottaravākyārthagatatvena na tatpadāpekṣā | “sādhu candramasi
puṣkaraiḥ kṛtaṃ mīlitaṃ yad abhirāmatādhika” itivat | tirodhānākaraṇe
atilobhinas te punar api nirbharam āsvādayiṣyantīti buddhyaivety utprekṣā
dhvanitā |

nanu tarhi dattāpahārī so'bhūt, tatrāha—lokānāṃ locanāni sthitāni yatreti
locanāny apahartum eva nṛbhyaḥ svabimbaṃ dattaṃ, na tu tat tasya
paramārthadānaṃ, kintu caurasyeveti punar apy utprekṣā | tataś ca kṛṣṇena
pṛthivyām avatīrya sarvacakṣur haraṇāl lokā andhīkṛtā eva, na tu pālitā
iti vyājastutiḥ |

nanu svabimbamādhuryasyānantyāt cirāyāpi pāyane tasya kā hānir
abhaviṣyat ? tatra tasya kṛpāsindhoḥ ko doṣaḥ ? kintu lokānām eva
bhāgyābhāva ity āha—ataptatapasām iti lokarītyaivoktiḥ | vastutas tu
ataptatapasāṃ kintu prāptatatkṛpābharāṇām ity arthaḥ | na hy etādṛśam
anurāgitvāpādanam eva mukhyaprayojanaṃ ca dhvanitaṃ, asminn abhyudite
jātu na tṛpitr darśanādiṣv ity ujjvalanīlamaṇyukter [uṇī. 14.79]
atṛptanetratvaṃ snehalakṣaṇaṃ tṛṣṇādhikyād anurāgalakṣaṇaṃ vā jñeyam |
tathā svabimbam ādāyaiva antaradhāt |

nanu parityajya iti śarīraparityāgavādinaḥ parāhatāḥ | tathā yan
martyalīlaupāyikaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.2.12] iti, yad dharmasūnor [bhā.pu.
3.2.13] ity uttaraślokeṣu svabimbasyaiva viśeṣaṇadānān mānuṣaṃ bimbaṃ
parihāya divyaṃ svabimbam ādāyāgād iti viruddhaṃ vyācakṣāṇapi parāhatāḥ |
tathā pradarśyeti antaradhād iti, na tu paśyati smeti pradarśane
antardhāne ca tasyecchaiva kāraṇam iti karmādhīnatvavivādino'pi parāhatāḥ
| tasmād devasya māyayā spṛṣṭā  [bhā.pu. 3.2.10] iti pūrvaślokoktānām
asatāṃ mataṃ dūṣayituṃ pravṛttasyoddhavasyaiveyaṃ vāṇī pramāṇīkartavyā, na
tv etatpratikūlānāṃ vākyānāṃ koṭīr apīty etadvākyaṃ kṛṣṇas tu bhagavān
svayaṃ [bhā.pu. 1.3.28] iti vākyavad eva mantavyam iti śāstrasyāsya
svaraso rasanīyaḥ ||11||


 || 3.2.12 ||

  yan martyalīlaupayikaṃ svayoga

 māyābalaṃ darśayatā gṛhītam |

 vismāpanaṃ svasya ca saubhagarddheḥ

  paraṃ padaṃ bhūṣaṇabhūṣaṇāṅgam ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad eva bimbaṃ varṇayati tribhiḥ | yan martyalīlāsv aupayikaṃ
yogyam | svasyāpi vismayajanakam | yataḥ saubhagarddheḥ
saubhāgyātiśayasya paraṃ padaṃ parā kāṣṭhā | bhūṣaṇānāṃ bhūṣaṇāny aṅgāni
yasmin ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atra harāv uptātmanāṃ niścayam āha—yan martyeti |
svayogamāyābalaṃ svacicchakter vīryam | etādṛśasaubhāgyasyāpi
prakāśikeyaṃ bhagavatīty evaṃvidhaṃ darśayatāviṣkṛtam |
sakalasvavaibhavavidvadgaṇavismāpanāyeti bhāvaḥ | na kevalam etāvat
tasyaiva rūpāntare tādṛśatvānanubhavāt | tatrāpi pratikṣaṇam apy
apūrvaprakāśāt svasyāpi vismāpanam | yataḥ saubhagarddheḥ paraṃ padaṃ
parā pratiṣṭhā |

nanu tasya bhūṣaṇaṃ tv asti saubhagahetuḥ ? ity āha—bhūṣaṇeti | kīdṛśaṃ ?
martyalīlaupāyikaṃ narākṛtīty arthaḥ | tasmāt sutarāṃ yuktaṃ ūktaṃ
śrīmahākālapurādhipenāpi—dvijātmajā me yuvayor didṛkṣuṇā mayopanītāḥ
[bhā.pu. 10.89.58] ity ādi | śrīharivaṃśe śrīkṛṣṇavacanena
ca—maddarśanārthaṃ te bālā hṛtās tena mahātmanā [ha.vaṃ. 2.114.8] iti
||12|| [prītisandarbhaḥ, 80]

viśvanāthaḥ: nanv antardhāya svabimbaṃ vaikuṇṭham eva kiṃ nītavāṃs
tatrāha yad bimbaṃ martyalīlāsu aupayikaṃ ūpayuktaṃ kathaṃ vaikuṇṭhaṃ
yātv iti bhāvaḥ | tena dvārakāyām eva sampraty api yathāpūrvam eva tad
vartata eva tadicchābhāvād atratyā lokās tan na paśyantīti mātraṃ viśeṣa
iti bhāvaḥ | na ca martyalīlaupayikatvena tasyāpakarṣo mantavyaḥ,
pratyuta vaikuṇṭhalīlāsvarūpebhyo'pi paramotkarṣa evety āha
svayogamāyā svarūpabhūtā cicchaktis tasyā balaṃ sampūrṇam eva
sāmarthyaṃ darśayatā darśayitum iti na ca kim apy aiśvaryaṃ mādhuryaṃ vā
nihnutya sthāpitam, api tu svasarvasvam evātra bimbe nikṣiptam | nāpi
vaikuṇṭhe'py evaṃ balaṃ darśitam iti bhāvaḥ | gṛhītam iti
sthitisarganirodheṣu gṛhītā māyayā vibhor ity atra māyayā guṇā gṛhītā
itivad abhede'pi bhedoktiḥ | buddhir hi bhagavatī abhede'pi bhedaṃ
janayatīti nyāyāt | gṛhītam āviṣkṛtam iti sandarbhaḥ |

yad vā, yad bimbaṃ darśayatā darśayituṃ svayogamāyābalaṃ gṛhītaṃ
rājamahiṣīvivāhādiṣu tathā prasiddher balam eva dyotayati svasya ca
vaikuṇṭhasthasya śrīnārāyaṇasvarūpasyāpi vismāpanam | aho rūpam aho
sādguṇyam iti camatkāraprāpakam anyāvatārarūpaguṇādidarśināṃ
vaikuṇṭhīyapārṣadādīnāṃ kā vārteti bhāvaḥ | ata eva saubhagarddheḥ
saubhāgyasampatteḥ paraṃ padaṃ parāvadhisthānam | ato
vaikuṇṭhanāthasyāpi taddarśanecchodbhavati dvijātmajā me yuvayor
didṛkṣuṇā [bhā.pu. 10.89.58] ity ādeḥ | bhūṣaṇānām api bhūṣaṇāny aṅgāni
yasyeti paramasaundaryaṃ ūktam ||12||


 || 3.2.13 ||

 yad dharmasūnor bata rājasūye

nirīkṣya dṛksvastyayanaṃ trilokaḥ |

  kārtsnyena cādyeha gataṃ vidhātur

 arvāksṛtau kauśalam ity amanyata ||

madhvaḥ: trilokasyājñānaṃ vrata |

ānandarūpaṃ dṛṣṭvāpi lokamauktikam eva tu |

manyate viṣṇurūpaṃ ca aho bhrāntir bahusthitā || iti skānde ||13||

śrīdharaḥ : dṛśāṃ svasty ayanaṃ paramānandakaram | tribhuvanastho lokaḥ
prāṇimātram | adyedānīm iha bimbe | arvāksṛtāv arvācīnasaṃsāranirmāṇe
manuṣyanirmāṇe vā yat kauśalaṃ naipuṇaṃ tat kārtsnyena gataṃ ūpakṣīṇaṃ
nātaḥ paraṃ tasya kauśalam astīty evaṃ mene | tan mūrter vidhātuḥ
sṛjyatvābhāve'pi lokadṛṣṭir iyaṃ ūktā |

kramasandarbhaḥ : devamāyāspṛṣṭān āha—yad dharmeti ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ: tasya saubhagarddhimattvaṃ tvayāpi sākṣātkṛtam iti smārayati
yaddharmeti | trilokaḥ tribhuvanastho loko brahmendrādir api iti
amanyata | kiṃ ? adya iha jagati vidhātur arvāksṛtau
arvācīnavicitrasaṃsāranirmāṇe yat kauśalaṃ tat sarvaṃ gataṃ ūpakṣīṇam
etad aṅgakāntau dṛṣṭāyāṃ vidhātṛsṛṣṭānāṃ
nīlotpaladalitāñjanendranīlamaṇinīradānāṃ jugupsā, etanmukhe dṛṣṭe
candrapadmayor api dhikkāra ity evam ||13||


 || 3.2.14 ||

  yasyānurāgaplutahāsarāsa

 līlāvalokapratilabdhamānāḥ |

  vrajastriyo dṛgbhir anupravṛtta

 dhiyo'vatasthuḥ kila kṛtyaśeṣāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : anurāgeṇa pluto vyāpto hāso rāso vinodaś ca līlāvalokaś ca
taiḥ svakṛtahāsādyanantaraṃ pratilabdho māno yābhis tāḥ | dṛgbhiḥ saha
anupravṛttā gacchantaṃ tam evānugatā dhiyo yāsāṃ tāḥ | kṛtye śeṣo yāsāṃ
tāḥ asamāpitakṛtyā eva tasthuḥ ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha premavilāsayoḥ paramotkarṣam āha—yasyeti | eṣu
vākyeṣu yacchabdānāṃ pūrvavākyasyānte paṭhitvān na pūrvānvayāpekṣā
||14||

viśvanāthaḥ: kiṃ caivam anuraktebhyas trilokasthebhyo
brahmarudrādibhyo'pi vrajastrīṇām anurāgādhikyam, yatas tais tathā
sammānitena kṛṣṇenāpi tā eva yathā sammānitā na tu tathā te'pīty āha
anurāgeṇa plutair vyāptair hāsaiḥ | rāso rasasamūho yatra tathābhūto yo
līlāyā avalokas tena svakṛtena tanmānadānānantaraṃ pratilabdho māna
ādaro yābhis tās tadaiva dṛgbhiḥ saha anupravṛttyā gacchantaṃ tam
evānugatā dhiyo'pi yāsāṃ tāḥ | avatasthus tatkṣaṇa eva jāḍyodayāt kim api
ceṣṭituṃ na prababhūvur ity arthaḥ | tataś ca kṛtyeṣu
mārjanalepanadadhimathanapariveṣaṇādiṣu śeṣo yāsāṃ tāḥ |
tattatkṛtyamadhya evākasmikataddarśanaprāpter asamāpitakṛtyā eva
babhūvur ity arthaḥ | tena tasya svaparyantasarvajagatsu vismāpanatā
vrajastrīṣu punarmohanatā ca premādhikyenaivābhūd iti bhāvaḥ | tad evaṃ
tadbimbasya martyalīlaupayikatvaprapañcanena
martyalokasthagokulamathurādvārakāsv eva nityasthitatvaṃ
dyumaṇidṛṣṭāntena darśanādarśanamātraviśeṣataṃ ca dhvanitvam ||14||


 || 3.2.15 ||

 svaśāntarūpeṣv itaraiḥ svarūpair

abhyardyamāneṣv anukampitātmā |

  parāvareśo mahadaṃśayukto

 hy ajo'pi jāto bhagavān yathāgniḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃbhūtabimbadarśane kāraṇam āha—svīyāny eva śāntāny
aśāntāni ca rūpāṇi | tatra śāntarūpeṣu itaraiḥ pīḍyamāneṣv anukampitaḥ
kṛtānukampa ātmā yasya | ajo'pi jāta āvirbhūtaḥ | mahābhūtarūpeṇa
nityasiddha evāgnir yathā kāṣṭheṣv āvirbhavati tadvat | ajasya janmani
hetuḥ, mahān mahattattvam aṃśaḥ kāryaleśo yasyāvyaktasya tanmahadaṃśaṃ
tad yukta iti ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : anukampām āha—svaśānteti | itarair aśāntaiḥ svarūpaiḥ
tatsvabhāvajarūpair ity arthāh | tac ca janmani tattadaṃśān ādāyaivety
āha mahadaṃśayuktaḥ mahataḥ svasyaivāṃśair yuktaḥ mahāntaṃ vibhum
ātmānaṃ [ka.u. 2.1.4] ityādiśruteḥ | mahadvac ca [veṣū. 1.4.8] eti
nyāyaprasiddheś ca | mahānto ye puruṣādayo'ṃśās tair yukta iti vā
lokanāthaṃ mahadbhūtam itivad ātmavyabhicāraḥ | mahadbhir vaṃśaiś ca
yukta iti vā ||15||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu vaikuṇṭhān nārāyaṇa evāgatya vasudevagṛhe avatatāreti
kvacit purāṇapuruṣaḥ sitakṛṣṇakeśa eveti, kvacit kṣīrodanātha iti,
kvacin naranārāyaṇāv iti, kvacid upendra iti tvanmukhāt tu
dvārakādidhāmastho martyalīlaupāyikaḥ sarvotkṛṣṭa iti śrūyate | atra ko
niścayaḥ ? ity ata āha—svaśānteti svīyā ye śāntarūpā bhaktās teṣu
itaraiḥ svarūpair ghorair mūḍhaiś ca pīḍyamāneṣu satsu anukampito
jātānukampa ātmā mano yasya saḥ | prakṛteḥ pare ye nārāyaṇādisvarūpāḥ,
avare brahmādayaś ca teṣām īśaḥ svayaṃ bhagavān śrīkṛṣṇaḥ
mahadaṃśayuktaḥ mahān mahatsraṣṭā puruṣaḥ, mahāntaṃ vibhum ātmānaṃ
[ka.u. 2.1.4] ityādiśruteḥ | aṃśā
matsyakūrmanṛharinaranārāyaṇavāmanādayas tair yuktaḥ san, ajo'pi
ātyantikakāraṇatvād ajanyo'pi prākṛtajanmarahito'pi vā jāta āvirbhūtaḥ
| mahābhūtarūpeṇa nityasiddha evāgnir yathā maṇiśilāsu gharṣaṇavaśād
āvirbhavati, tadvat | tena mathurādisvīyanityadhāmastha eva bhagavān
mathurāsthavasudevograsenādiṣu svabhakteṣu labdhātikaṣṭeṣu
kṛpāśaktigharṣaṇavaśenāvirbhūto dṛśyo babhūvety agnidṛṣṭāntaḥ | tathā
mathurodayaśaile devakyāṃ prācyāṃ diśi uditaḥ san duṣṭatamāṃsi saṃhṛtya
śiṣṭakamalāny anurāgicakravākāṃś ca tair abhyarditāni santoṣya
dharmamaryādāḥ pravartya prabhāsāstaśaile astaṃ gataḥ iti
dyumaṇidṛṣṭāntaś ca parasparānukūlaḥ svadhāmasthaṃ santam evāvirbhūtaḥ,
taṃ spaṣṭam evābhidadhāti, na tu kutaścid vaikuṇṭhanātho vaikuṇṭhāt
kṣīrodanātha kṣīrodāt naranārāyaṇāv upendrādayaś ca svasvadhāmata
āgatyāvatatāreti yathāsthānaṃ prasiddhir api mahadaṃśayukta iti
viśeṣaṇād āvirbhāvasamaye tair vaikuṇṭhanāthādibhir āgatya parāvareśe
kṛṣṇe saṃmilanāt susaṅgatair eveti sarvaṃ munivākyaṃ ca pramāṇam ||15||


 || 3.2.16 ||

māṃ khedayaty etad ajasya janma

 viḍambanaṃ yad vasudevagehe |

  vraje ca vāso'ribhayād iva svayaṃ

 purād vyavātsīd yadanantavīryaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu kuto'sau parāvarāṇām īśaḥ pāratantryapratīteḥ ? tatrāha
dvābhyām | mām apy etad durvitarkyaṃ durghaṭaṃ ca khedayati, tad
evāha—vasudevagehe bandhanāgāre yaj janmano viḍambanam anukaraṇam, na tu
nṛsiṃhavad akasmād āvirbhāvaḥ | kaṃsabhayād iva nilīya vraje vāsaś ca |
kālayavanādiripubhayād iva purān mathurāyā vyavātsīd apalāyata ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : aho tādṛśamahimno'pi tasya paramasauśīlyena
svajanasukhadātrī lokavallīleyam īkṣyatāṃ yata evāsmākaṃ
tadviyogakhedo'tiśete ity āha mām iti dvayena ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ sarva eva sāṅkhyhetuas tubhyaṃ yathātmabodham
āviṣkṛtaḥ kintu yanmādṛśair api durjñeyaṃ vidvadbhyaḥ pṛṣṭvāpy
aprāptatattvaṃ tatra kheda eva mama pūrvam āsīd ity āha—ajasyeti |
ekasyaivājatvaṃ janmavattvaṃ ca kathaṃ sambhaved iti | kiṃ cātra
janmavattvasyānkaraṇamātratvenāvāstavattve khedo na syād ity ubhayor eva
vāstavatvam uddhavasya vivakṣitaṃ jñeyam | tathā vasudevagehe
kaṃsakārāgāre yaj janma etan māṃ khedayati pūrvam akhedayat,
vartamānasāmīpye vartamānavad veti laṭ | yato viḍambanam apakarṣa eva
tasya janmalīlā hi mātāpitror bandhūnām anyeṣāṃ ca bhaktānāṃ
paramotsavamayī bhavitum arhati paramasvatantreṇa tena tathā kathaṃ na
kṛteti, tathā vraje ca vāsas tasya svābhāvikaḥ paramasukhamaya eva, tatra
aribhayasya kāraṇatvaṃ kathaṃ khyāpitaṃ ? ivakāreṇa yadyapi kaṃsād vraje
sthito na bibheti, tad api tathā purān mathurāto vyavātsīt |
aparimitabalo'pi kālayavanādiripubhayāt apalāyata, na hy asya karhicid
rājan pumān veda vidhitsitam iti śrībhīṣmeṇāpy uktam, kintu rahasi
matpṛṣṭena śrībhagavataiva prabodhitasya mama sampraty eva khedo'pagata
iti bhāvaḥ ||16||


 || 3.2.17 ||

 dunoti cetaḥ smarato mamaitad

  yad āha pādāv abhivandya pitroḥ |

 tātāmba kaṃsād uruśaṅkitānāṃ

prasīdataṃ no'kṛtaniṣkṛtīnām ||

śrīdharaḥ : etac ca hareś caritaṃ smarato mama cetaḥ karmabhūtaṃ dunoti
vyathayati | tad eva darśayati, yadāheti | he tāta, he amba, yuvāṃ
prasīdataṃ prasādaṃ kurutam | na kṛtā niṣkṛtiḥ śuśrūṣaṇaṃ yais teṣām |
no'smākam iti bahuvacanaṃ tu rāmādyabhiprāyam ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : evam evaitac caritaṃ smarato mama cetaḥ karmabhūtaṃ dunoti
smety arthaḥ | yad āheti mātāpitarau svāparādhaṃ kṣamāpayati sma—he tāta,
he amba, yuvāṃ no'smān prasīdataṃ dvitīyārthe ṣaṣṭhyaḥ | atra kaṃsād
uruśaṅkitānām ity asya vākyasya satyatve īśvaratvavyābhicāraḥ mithyātve
īśvaravāk kathaṃ mithyeti pūrvavat khedaḥ | atisarveśvarasyāpy evaṃ
lokarītyā vinayo'timādhuryapoṣakaḥ kathaṃ mayā vismartavya iti
maccetasi tattaccaritaṃ śalyām ivābhūd ity uddhavavilāpaḥ ||17||


 || 3.2.18 ||

 ko vā amuṣyāṅghrisarojareṇuṃ

  vismartum īśīta pumān vijighran |

  yo visphuradbhrūviṭapena bhūmer

bhāraṃ kṛtāntena tiraścakāra ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu tarhy anīśvara eva kiṃ na syāt, tava tu śraddhāmātram
etat tatrāha tribhiḥ—ko vā aṅghrisarojayor yo reṇus tam api vijighran
sevamānaḥ pumān vismartum īśīta śaknuyāt | visphuran bhrūviṭapo bhrūlatā
sa eva kṛtāntas tena ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tataś ca mādhuryaṃ tasya paramaprabhāvatve'pi sarveṣām
apy ākarṣakam ity āha—ko veti | mādhurye kaimutyam aṅghrīti | tadreṇum
apīty arthaḥ | kīdṛśasyāpi tatrāha—ya iti | viṭapaḥ pallave śiṅge vistāre
stambaśākhayor iti viśvaprakāśaḥ ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu tarhy anīśvara eva kiṃ na syāt ? tava tu śraddhāmātram
eva tatrāha tribhiḥ | visphuran bhrūviṭapo bhrūpallavaḥ sa eva kṛtāntas
tena | viṭapaḥ pallave śiṅge vistāre stambaśākhayor iti viśvaḥ ||18||


 || 3.2.19 ||

 dṛṣṭā bhavadbhir nanu rājasūye

caidyasya kṛṣṇaṃ dviṣato'pi siddhiḥ |

yāṃ yoginaḥ saṃspṛhayanti samyag

yogena kas tadvirahaṃ saheta ||

śrīdharaḥ : na ca tasyeśvaratvaṃ sādhanīyam, bhavadbhir api dṛṣṭatvād ity
āha—dṛṣṭeti | yāṃ siddhiṃ samyag yogena prāptum icchanti ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kṛpāyā atyamaryādatvam āha—dṛṣṭeti ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ :  tasya parameśvaratvānubhāvaḥ kair vā na sākṣāt kṛta ity
āha—dṛṣṭā iti | dviṣata iti kṛpāyā apy apāratvaṃ yāṃ yasyai ||19||


 || 3.2.20 ||

 tathaiva cānye naralokavīrā

 ya āhave kṛṣṇamukhāravindam |

 netraiḥ pibanto nayanābhirāmaṃ

 pārthāstrapūtaḥ padam āpur asya ||

śrīdharaḥ : āhave yuddhe pārthasyāstraiḥ pūtāḥ niṣpāpāḥ santaḥ ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tathaiveti pārthāstrapūtatvam atra
tanmukhāravindadarśanayāthārthyahetuḥ | tad etat tu sthāpitaṃ yathā
rahad bhruvor bhāram ity ādau ||20||

viśvanāthaḥ : dveṣavatsu mokṣadāyinīṃ kṛpām uktvā tad anyeṣu taṭastheṣv
api premapradāyinīṃ kṛpām āha—tathaiveti netraiḥ pibanta iti ta eva
dhanyā vayam adhanyāḥ tanmādhuryapānatatpadaprāptibhyāṃ vañcitā iti
vilāpadhvaniḥ ||20||


 || 3.2.21 ||

  svayaṃ tv asāmyātiśayas tryadhīśaḥ

 svārājyalakṣmyāptasamastakāmaḥ |

baliṃ haradbhiś ciralokapālaiḥ

kirīṭakoṭyeḍitapādapīṭhaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evaṃ param aiśvarye saty api yad ugrasenānuvartitvaṃ tat
punar asmān atyantaṃ vyathayatīty āha—svayaṃ tu ya evaṃbhūtas tasya tat
kaiṃkaryaṃ no'smān viglāpayatīty uttareṇānvayaḥ | na sāmyātiśayau yasya |
yam apekṣyān yasya sāmyamatiśayaś ca nāstīty arthaḥ | tatra hetavaḥ,
tryadhīśas trayāṇāṃ puruṣāṇāṃ lokānāṃ guṇānāṃ vā īśaḥ | svārājyalakṣmyā
paramānandasvarūpasaṃpattyaiva prāptasamastabhogaḥ | baliṃ karam
arhaṇaṃ vā haradbhiḥ samarpayadbhiś cirakālīnair lokapālaiḥ
kirīṭāgreṇeḍitaṃ stutaṃ pādapīṭhaṃ yasya | praṇamatāṃ
kirīṭasaṅghaṭṭanadhvanir eva stutitvenotprekṣyate ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : punar alaukikalīlāyāṃ paramavinayaguṇatvam
āha—svayaṃ tv ity ādi yugmakena | adhīśaḥ trayāṇāṃ mahatsraṣṭèṇāṃ
brahmāṇḍasthitasarvahūtasthānām īśaḥ | viṣṇos tu trīṇi rūpāṇi ity ādi
| ciralokapālaiḥ aprākṛtalokapālaiḥ | manurūpaiś ca daśabhir
dikpālaiḥ parito vṛtam iti brahmasaṃhitātaḥ ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, brahmādiṣv ādipuruṣādiṣv api tasya prabhutvaṃ vā
kva ugrasene kaiṃkaryaṃ vā kveti bhaktavaśyatvamādhuryaṃ mayā kathaṃ
vismartuṃ śakyam iti vilapati dvābhyām | na vidyate sāmyaṃ kiṃ ūtātiśayo
yasya saḥ | yam apekṣyānyasya sāmyam eva nāsti kiṃ ūtātiśaya ity arthaḥ |
tatra hetavaḥ  trayāṇāṃ mahatsraṣṭādipuruṣāṇāṃ tisṛṇāṃ
cicchaktijīvaśaktimāyāśaktīnāṃ ceśaḥ | svairaṃśair bhaktaiḥ śaktibhir
līlābhir aiśvaryair mādhuryaiś ca rājata iti tasya bhāvaḥ svārājyaṃ tad
eva lakṣmīs tayā hetunā āptāḥ samastāḥ kāmā yaṃ saḥ | cirakālīnair
lokapālair anantakoṭibrahmāṇḍeṣu sṛjadbhir brahmabhiḥ pālayadbhir
viṣṇubhiḥ saṃharadbhiḥ rudrair dhārayadbhiḥ śeṣaiḥ | kirīṭāgreṇa īḍitaṃ
stutaṃ pādapīṭhaṃ yasya saḥ | praṇamatāṃ kirīṭasaṅghaṭṭadhvanir eva
stutitvenotprekṣyate ||21||


 || 3.2.22 ||

 tat tasya kaiṃkaryam alaṃ bhṛtān no

viglāpayaty aṅga yad ugrasenam |

 tiṣṭhan niṣaṇṇaṃ parameṣṭhidhiṣṇye

nyabodhayad deva nidhārayeti ||

śrīdharaḥ : aṅga vidura ! bhṛtān bhṛtyān | ugrasene yat kiṃkaratvaṃ tad
evāha—parameṣṭhidhiṣṇye rājāsane niṣaṇṇam āsīnaṃ svayaṃ tiṣṭhan he deva,
nidhārayāvadhārayeti nyabodhayad vijñāpitavān ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ :  aṅga he vidura ! bhṛtān bhṛtyān | ugrasene yat kiṃkaratvaṃ
tad evāha—parameṣṭhidhiṣṇye mahārājasiṃhāsane niṣaṇṇam āsīnaṃ svayaṃ
tattale tiṣṭhan kasyāpi sahāyaṃ kurvan—he deva mahārājādhirāja ! asya
tvadīyamaṇḍaleśvarasya kṛtyaṃ nirdhārayeti nyabodhayad avadhāpayāmāsa
||22||


 || 3.2.23 ||

 aho bakī yaṃ stanakālakūṭaṃ

jighāṃsayāpāyayad apy asādhvī |

 lebhe gatiṃ dhātryucitāṃ tato'nyaṃ

  kaṃ vā dayāluṃ śaraṇaṃ vrajema ||

śrīdharaḥ : evam anuvṛttiḥ kṛpayaiveti sūcayann apakāriṣv api tasya
kṛpālutāṃ darśayann āha—aho āścaryaṃ kṛpālutāyāḥ | hantum icchayāpi
stanayoḥ saṃbhṛtaṃ kālakūṭaṃ viṣaṃ yam apāyayat | bakī pūtanā asādhvī
duṣṭāpi dhātryā yaśodāyā ucitāṃ gatiṃ lebhe | bhaktaveṣamātreṇa yaḥ
sadgatiṃ dattavān ity arthaḥ | tato'nyaṃ kaṃ vā bhajema ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : aho bakīty ādau punar laukikalīlāyāṃ kṛpāyā
atyamaryādatvam anyatrāvatārādāv adarśanāt | tatra dhātrīṇāṃ kiṃ ū gavo 
nu  mātara [bhā.pu. 10.6.38] ity anusāreṇa tasmai stanyāmṛtadāyinīnāṃ
kāsāñcit tāṃ gatim ||23||

viśvanāthaḥ : avatārāramhata eva parāpakāriṣv api kṛpāmādhuryaṃ smaraṇ
vilapati—aho āścaryam | bakī pūtaneti mātṛbhāvasya kṛtrimatve'pi tatrāpi
jighāṃsayāpi kālakūṭam api yam apāyayat | tataḥ sakāśāt
dhātryucitāṃ—ambikā ca kilimbā ca dhātrike stanyadātṛke iti dve kṛṣṇasya
dhātryau taducitāṃ goloke gatiṃ lebhe | bhaktaveśamātreṇāpi bhaktocitāṃ
ratiṃ prāpnotīty atra bhagavatā dviṣaty api pūtanā dṛṣṭāntīkṛtā | evaṃ
dviṣatām api muktir bhaktiś ca syād iti kṛṣṇāvatārasyāsādhāraṇo dharma
uktaḥ ||23||


 || 3.2.24 ||

  manye'surān bhāgavatāṃs tryadhīśe

  saṃrambhamārgābhiniviṣṭacittān |

  ye saṃyuge'cakṣata tārkṣyaputram

aṃse sunābhāyudham āpatantam ||

madhvaḥ : asurā api ye viṣṇuṃ śaṅkhacakragadādharam |

bhaktipūrvam avekṣante jñeyā bhāgavatā iti ||

vidviṣanti tu ye viṣṇum ṛṣiputrā api sphuṭam |

asurās te'pi vijñeyā gacchanti ca sadā tamaḥ ||

jīvadvayasamāyogād dhiraṇyakamukhāḥ pare |

bhaktidveṣayutāś ca syur gatis teṣāṃ yathā nijam ||

kaṃsapūtanikādyāś ca bāndhavādiyutā yataḥ |

jīvadvayasamāyogād gatidvayajigīṣavaḥ ||

sarvathā bhaktito muktir dvaiṣāttama udīritam |

niyamas tv anayor nityāṃ mohāyānyavaco bhavet || iti brāhme ||24||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu bhāgavatān eva bhagavān anugṛhṇātīti prasiddham, satyam,
asurān apy akaṃ bhāgavatān eva manye, yato bhāgavatā iva te'pi
bhagavaddhyānābhiniveśena bhagavantam aparokṣaṃ paśyantīty āha—saṃrambhaḥ
krodhāveśas tena mārgeṇābhiniviṣṭaṃ cittaṃ yeṣāṃ tān | ata eva ye saṅgrāme
tārkṣyaḥ kaśyapas tasya putraṃ garuḍam aṃse skandhe sunābhāyudhaś
cakrāyudho'rir yasya tam acakṣatāpaśyan | tasmāt teṣv apy anugraho yukta
evety arthaḥ | vakṣyati ca—tasmāt kenāpy upāyena manaḥ kṛṣṇe niveśayet
[bhā.pu. 7.1.30] iti ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : manye iti yadyapi teṣu vastuto bhagavatattvaṃ nāsti
tathāpy utaprekṣata evety arthaḥ | tataś ca
nijabahirmukhatvenaivāntimasamaye taddarśanaṃ na prāpsyāmīti
svanindārthaṃ ūktam ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : manya iti vilāpa eva, na tu sāṅkhyhetuaḥ | asurān bhāgavatān
manya iti antimasamaye bhagavatsākṣātkārabhagavatpadaprāptibhyāṃ
liṅgābhyāṃ tenāsmadādīn bahirmukhān manye, antimasamaye
taddarśanābhāvatatprāptyabhāvābhyām iti dhvanitam | saṃrambhaḥ
krodhāveśaḥ tārkṣaḥ kaśyapas tatputraṃ garuḍam acakṣata apaśyan | kīdṛśaḥ
? aṃse skandhe sunābhāyudhaś cakrāyudho yasya tam āpatantaṃ sammukham
āyāntam ||24||


 || 3.2.25 ||

  vasudevasya devakyāṃ jāto bhojendrabandhane |

  cikīrṣur bhagavān asyāḥ śam ajenābhiyācitaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : idānīṃ tasyāntardhānaprakāraṃ vaktum ādita ārabhya tac
caritaṃ saṅkṣepataḥ kathayati | vasudevasya bhāryāyāṃ jātaḥ | bhojendraḥ
kaṃsas tasya bandhanāgāre | asyāḥ pṛthivyāḥ śaṃ sukhaṃ svayaṃ cikīrṣuḥ
ajena brahmaṇā ca yācitaḥ san ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : vidurapraśnasamādhānārthaṃ mauṣalalīlā avaśyaṃ vaktavyeti
tāṃ duḥkhamayīṃ līlāṃ sukhamayyā līlayā sahitīkṛtyaiva vivakṣur
āha—vasudevasyeti | bhojendrasya bandhanāgāre | asyāḥ pṛthivyāḥ śaṃ sukham
ajena brahmaṇā ||25||


 || 3.2.26 ||

 tato nandavrajam itaḥ pitrā kaṃsād vibibhyatā |

  ekādaśa samās tatra gūḍhārciḥ sabalo'vasat ||

śrīdharaḥ : pitrā hetubhūtena nandavrajam ito gataḥ | samāḥ saṃvatsarān
gūḍhārcir guptatejāḥ ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ekādaśeti | tāvataiva pūrṇakaiśoratvāt
tathoktaṃ—kālenālpena rājarṣe [bhā.pu. 10.8.26] ity ādi |
kvacātisukumārāṅgau kiśorau nāptayauvanāv ity ādibālyapaugaṇḍakaiśorāḥ
putrābhyām abhavan kvacid ity ādibhyaḥ | gūḍhārcir iti yathā gūḍhārciḥ
kutrāpy agniḥ prāptaṃ prāptam indhanaṃ dahati | tathā gopalīlāyā
gūḍhaprabhāva eva san prāptaṃ prāptam asuravṛndaṃ dahann ity arthaḥ |
ekādaśaparyantaṃ gūḍhārciḥ tataḥ paraṃ pañcadaśaparyantaṃ prakaṭārcir
iti sādhyāhāraṃ vyākhyānaṃ tv aghaṭamānaṃ ca ekādaśābhyantare
tattatprabhāvasya madhye madhye prasūtatvāt | tāvataiva
pūrṇakaiśoratvāt tathoktam ||26||

viśvanāthaḥ : pitrā hetunā ito gataḥ | ekādaśasamāḥ saṃvatsarān
vyāpyāvasat | tāvataiva kālena bālyapaugaṇḍakaiśoralīlāsampūrteḥ
gūḍhārciḥ prākṛtaiḥ kaṃsādibhir alakṣitatattvaḥ | mādhuryodrekeṇa
gūḍhaiśvarya iti vā ||26||


 || 3.2.27 ||

parīto vatsapair vatsāṃś cārayan vyaharad vibhuḥ |

  yamunopavane kūjad dvijasaṅkulitāṅghripe ||

śrīdharaḥ : vyaharad akrīḍat | kūjadbhir dvijaiḥ pakṣibhiḥ saṅkulitā
vyāptā aṅghripā yasmin ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  kūjadbhir dvijaiḥ saṅkulitā vyāptā aṅghripā yatra tasmin
||27||


 || 3.2.28 ||

  kaumārīṃ darśayaṃś ceṣṭāṃ prekṣaṇīyāṃ vrajaukasām |

 rudann iva hasan mugdha bālasiṃhāvalokanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : rudann ivetīvaśabdasya yathāyogaṃ sarvatrāpy anvayaḥ |
mugdho bālaś ca yaḥ siṃhas tadvad avalokanaṃ yasya saḥ ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kaumārīm iti | atyantabālyatvad vatsacāraṇasya
prāktanīyaṃ līlā śokāveśena vyatyasya paṭhitāya evambhūtaḥ sa parīta ity
ādi yojyaṃ tatra rudann iva hasann iva bālyasvabhāvo darśitaḥ ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : rudann iveti | bālānāṃ rodanaṃ cāstram iti yathā bālā vināpi
rodanacihnaṃ rodanaṃ darśayanti tathaiva mātèṇām agre
adeyalobhyavastuprārthanāhaṭhādau rudann iva bhavati tadaiva
tatprāptau hasan | kiṃ ca, bhīṣaṇadaityādyāgame mugdho'pi bālo'pi siṃho
yathā ghorasattvāya bibheti, kintu svaparākramam eva dṛṣṭyā dyotayati
tathābhūtasya siṃhasyaivāvalokanaṃ yasya saḥ | paramavatsalān pitrādīn
vyākulayati ||28||


 || 3.2.29 ||

 sa eva godhanaṃ lakṣmyā niketaṃ sitagovṛṣam |

  cārayann anugān gopān raṇadveṇur arīramat ||

śrīdharaḥ :  sa evādhikaṃ vayaḥ prāptaḥ san godhanaṃ cārayan | kathāṃ
bhūtaṃ godhanaṃ ? lakṣmyāḥ śobhādisaṃpado niketanam | sitā govṛṣā yasmin
nānāvarṇe gosaṅghe | raṇan śabdaṃ kurvan veṇur yasya | arīramad ramayām
āsa ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ :  sa eva kiñcid adhikaṃ vayā bhavan vatsacāraṇaṃ samāpya
lakṣmyāḥ śuklanīlaharitapītadhūmalavarṇaśobhāyā niketaṃ godhanaṃ
cārayan | sitā govṛṣā yatra tat gopān ramayām āsa ||29||


 || 3.2.30 ||

  prayuktān bhojarājena māyinaḥ kāmarūpiṇaḥ |

 līlayā vyanudat tāṃs tān bālaḥ krīḍanakān iva ||

śrīdharaḥ : vyanudaj jaghāna | krīḍanakāṃs tṛṇādinirmitān siṃhādīn yathā
||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : vyanudaj jaghāna | krīḍanakān patrādinirmitān siṃhādīn iva
||30||


 || 3.2.31 ||

vipannān viṣapānena nigṛhya bhujagādhipam |

utthāpyāpāyayad gāvas tat toyaṃ prakṛtisthitam ||

śrīdharaḥ :  vipannān mṛtān gopān gāva iti gāś cotthāpya tad eva toyam |
prakṛtisthitaṃ nirviṣam ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : viṣodakapānena mūrcchitān gopālān gāś cotthāpya
prakṛtisthitaṃ nirviṣam ||31||


 || 3.2.32 ||

ayājayad gosavena goparājaṃ dvijottamaiḥ |

  vittasya corubhārasya cikīrṣan sadvyayaṃ vibhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : indrapūjābhaṅgena kṛtā gavāṃ pūjaiva gosavas tena |
goparājaṃ nandam | vittasya ceti cakārād indrasya mānabhaṅgaṃ kurvan
urubhārasyātisamṛddhasya ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ :  gosevenendramakhabhaṅgataḥ pravartitena gavāṃ pūjanena |
cakārād indrasya ca mānabhaṅgaṃ ūrubhārasya atisamṛddhasya ||32||


 || 3.2.33 ||

 varṣatīndre vrajaḥ kopād bhagnamāne'tivihvalaḥ |

gotralīlātapatreṇa trāto bhadrānugṛhṇatā ||

śrīdharaḥ : kopād varṣati | gotraḥ parvata eva līlātapatraṃ tena | he
bhadra ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : kopād varṣati sati | gotraḥ parvata eva līlātapatraṃ tena |
he bhadra ||33||


 || 3.2.34 ||

śaracchaśikarair mṛṣṭaṃ mānayan rajanīmukham |

gāyan kalapadaṃ reme strīṇāṃ maṇḍalamaṇḍanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : mṛṣṭaṃ ūjjvalam | strīṇāṃ maṇḍalaṃ maṇḍayatīti tathā ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : rajanīmukhaṃ pradoṣaṃ pakṣe śaracchaśino nāyakasya
karatalagharṣaṇair mṛṣṭaṃ prasvedādyapasāraṇenojjvalīkṛtaṃ rajanyā
nāyikāyāḥ svādhīnabhartṛkāyā mukhaṃ mānayan ābhinandayann aham apy evam
eva karomīti strīṇāṃ maṇḍalaṃ rāsasambhogalīlānantaraṃ maṇḍayati saḥ
||34||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

tṛtīye dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||


  iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye

 pāramahaṃsyāṃ saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ

 tṛtīyaskandhe vidūroddhavasaṃvāde

  dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ

  || 3.2 ||

 (3.3)

atha tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ

viduroddhavasaṃvāde

 || 3.3.1 ||

uddhava uvāca—

tataḥ sa āgatya puraṃ svapitroś

  cikīrṣayā śaṃ baladevasaṃyutaḥ |

nipātya tuṅgād ripuyūthanāthaṃ

 hataṃ vyakarṣad vyasum ojasorvyām ||

śrīdharaḥ :

  tṛtīye mathurām etya vrajāt kaṃsavadhādikam |

 yat kṛtaṃ dvārakāyāṃ ca kṛṣṇena tad avarṇayat ||

śam ity avyayam | pitroḥ sukhasya cikīrṣayety arthaḥ | tuṅgād rājamañcāt
| ripuyūthānāṃ nāthaṃ kaṃsam | vyasor api vikarṣaṇaṃ pitroḥ sukhārtham
||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : uddhava uvāceti | rāsalīlāvarṇanārambhe
premavaivaśyād adhyāyasamāptiḥ | paścāt katham api bahir anusandhāne
satīti jñeyam | tata iti priyādi priyajanapīḍakatvād devādīnāṃ
prītiviṣayakatvāc ca vikarṣaṇam ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

  tṛtīye mathurādvāravatyoḥ kaṃsavadhādikāḥ |

 līlāḥ kurūṇāṃ nidhanam api saṅkṣipya varṇitam ||

śam ity avyayaṃ sukhavācakaṃ pitroḥ sukhasya cikīrṣayety arthaḥ | tuṅgān
mañcāt | hataṃ prāptāghātaṃ tato vyasuṃ prāptamṛtyum api vyakarṣad iti
tanmaraṇasambhāvayatāṃ bibhyatāṃ pitrādīnāṃ
mūrcchitatvabhānanirāsārtham ||1||


 || 3.3.2 ||

  sāndīpaneḥ sakṛt proktaṃ brahmādhītya savistaram |

tasmai prādād varaṃ putraṃ mṛtaṃ pañcajanodarāt ||

śrīdharaḥ : brahma vedam | savistaraṃ ṣaḍaṅgādisahitam |
pañcajanodaravidāraṇadvārā putram ānīyety arthaḥ ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : pañcajanodaraṃ prāpya mṛtaṃ yamalokād ānīya prādād iti
boddhavyam ||2||

viśvanāthaḥ : brahma vedaṃ savistaraṃ ṣaḍaṅgādisahitam |
pañcajanodaraṃ vidāryeti lyablopena pañcamī, yamalokād ānīyeti śeṣaḥ
||2||


 || 3.3.3 ||

  samāhutā bhīṣmakakanyayā ye

śriyaḥ savarṇena bubhūṣayaiṣām |

 gāndharvavṛttyā miṣatāṃ svabhāgaṃ

jahre padaṃ mūrdhni dadhat suparṇaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : bhīṣmakakanyāyā arthe svavarṇamātratayāhūtāḥ |

eṣāṃ śriyo jihīrṣayāhvānabuddhir bhagavatā kṛtā |

suparṇaḥ suparānandāt kākutstho vāci saṃsthiteḥ || iti pādme ||3||

śrīdharaḥ : bhīṣmakakanyayā rukmiṇyā ye rājānaḥ samāhūtāḥ | hrasvatvam
ārṣam | “samāhṛtā” iti pāṭhe ākṛṣṭā ity arthaḥ | kena sādhanena ? śriyo
lakṣmyāḥ savarṇena samānena rūpeṇa | yadyapi tayā kevalaṃ śrīkṛṣṇa
evāhūto na sarve, tathāpi tasyā lāvaṇyaṃ teṣām āgamane hetur iti
tayaivāhūtā ity ucyate | eṣāṃ miṣatāṃ paśyatāṃ mūrdhni padaṃ dadhat | tayā
saha gāndharvavṛttyā parasparasamayarūpayā bubhūṣayā bhavitum icchayā
jahāra | kathaṃbhūtāṃ ? svabhāgaṃ lakṣmyaṃ śatvāt | tayā
svātmano'rpitatvāc ca | suparṇaḥ supatanaḥ | yad vā, suparṇa iva
svabhāgaṃ sudhām ity arthaḥ | yad vā, śriyo rukmiṇyāḥ samānaṃ
varṇadvayaṃ vācakaṃ yasya sa śriyaḥ savarṇo rukmī, tena samāhūtāḥ
śiśupālādayaḥ | kimarthaṃ ? bhīṣmakakanyayā saha teṣāṃ bubhūṣayā bhūtir
bhavatv ity etad artham | tatra śiśupālasyāhvānaṃ varatvena bubhūṣayā,
jarāsandhādīnāṃ tad vivāhotsavena | śeṣaṃ pūrvavat ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhīṣmakakanyāyā yā bubhūṣā tayeti vyadhikaraṇa eva
tṛtīyādvayaṃ svabhāgaṃ śrīrukmiṇīrūpaṃ jahāra ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhīṣmakakanyayeti ṣaṣṭhyarthe tṛtīyā | bhīṣmakakanyāyā
rukmiṇyāḥ śriyaḥ sākṣāllakṣmyāḥ samānau varṇau dvau rukmīti akṣaradvayaṃ
vācakaṃ yasya tena rukmiṇā ye rājānaḥ samāhṛtā hrasvatvam ārṣam |
“samāhṛtā” iti pāṭhe samānītā ity arthaḥ | eṣāṃ rājñāṃ mūrdhni padaṃ
dadhat suparṇo garuḍaḥ sudhām iva svabhāgaṃ rukmiṇīṃ jahre | eṣāṃ
kīdṛśānāṃ gāndharve vivāhe yā vṛttis tayā śiśupālasya varatvena anyeṣāṃ
varayātratvena yad varaṇaṃ tenety arthaḥ | bubhūṣayā ahaṃ vara iti vayaṃ
varayātrā iti bhavitum icchayā miṣatāṃ kadācit kṛṣṇa āgatya kanyām
apahared ity ata itas tataḥ sacakitaṃ paśyatām ||3||


 || 3.3.4 ||

 kakudmino'viddhanaso damitvā

 svayaṃvare nāgnajitīm uvāha |

  tadbhagnamānān api gṛdhyato'jñān

jaghne'kṣataḥ śastrabhṛtaḥ svaśastraiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kakudmato vṛṣabhān aviddhanāsikān | viddhanāsikān kṛtveti vā
| tair vṛṣabhais tad damanena ca bhagno māno yeṣāṃ tathāpi tān gṛdhyataḥ
kāmayamānān, ata evājñān śastrabhṛto rājñas tac chastrair akṣata eva
jaghāna ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sveṣām arjunādīnāṃ śastrair jaghne | teṣu
svaprabhāvāveśāt svayam eva jaghānety arthāh | gāṇḍīvī kālayāmāseti
śrīdaśamasaṃvādāyetthaṃ vyākhyāyate ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : kakudmino vṛṣabhān aviddhanāsikān eva damitvā tair vṛṣaiḥ
parābhūtatvena bhagno māno yeṣāṃ tān | tad api gṛdhyataḥ kanyām
abhikāṅkṣataḥ, ata eva ajñān rājñaḥ svaśastrair jaghne, teṣāṃ śastrair
bhṛtaḥ pūrṇa ācchanno'py akṣataḥ ||4||


 || 3.3.5 ||

  priyaṃ prabhur grāmya iva priyāyā

vidhitsur ārcchad dyutaruṃ yadarthe |

 vajry ādravat taṃ sagaṇo ruṣāndhaḥ

  krīḍāmṛgo nūnam ayaṃ vadhūnām ||

śrīdharaḥ : yadādityāḥ kuṇḍale dātuṃ svargaṃ gataḥ, tadā prabhuḥ
svatantro'pi grāmyaḥ strīparatantra iva priyāyāḥ satyabhāmāyāḥ priyaṃ
vidhātum icchur dyutaruṃ pārijātam ānītavān | yadarthe yannimittaṃ taṃ
kṛṣṇaṃ vajrī strīprerito yoddhum anvadhāvat | svakāryasādhakena tena
yuddhodyamas tasyāyukta evety āha—krīḍāmṛga iti | ayaṃ vajrī ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : grāmyaḥ kāmīvad dṛśyamāno'pi vastutaḥ priyāyāḥ
premavatyāḥ priyaṃ premṇepsitaṃ yat tad vidhitsur yadarthe dyutarum
ārcchat vajrī tv ātmānusāreṇa tam anyathā matvaivādravat anyathā mananam
evāha ayaṃ kṛṣṇo vadhūnāṃ saundaryamātralobhena svīkṛtānāṃ kāminīnāṃ
nūnaṃ krīḍāmṛgaḥ kāmavaśa iti ||5||

viśvanāthaḥ : grāmyaḥ kāmīva dṛśyamāno'pi vastutas tu priyāyāḥ premavatyāḥ
priyaṃ premavaśatvena prītiṃ vidhitsuḥ dyutaruṃ pārijātam ārcchat
āhṛtavān yadarthe vajrī vajrasahita eva tam ādravat ā īṣat yoddhum
āgatavān | tatra hetuḥ—andha iti | tatrāpi hetuḥ—vadhūnāṃ śacyādīnāṃ
krīḍāmṛga iti | yathā ātmavan manyate jagad  iti nyāyena vadhūnāṃ
satyabhāmādīnām ayaṃ krīḍāmṛga iti nindann evādravad ity arthaḥ ||5||


 || 3.3.6 ||

  sutaṃ mṛdhe khaṃ vapuṣā grasantaṃ

 dṛṣṭvā sunābhonmathitaṃ dharitryā |

 āmantritas tattanayāya śeṣaṃ

  dattvā tadantaḥpuram āviveśa ||

śrīdharaḥ : sunābhena cakreṇonmathitaḥ sutaṃ bhaumaṃ dṛṣṭvā tasya mātrā
dharitryā bhūmyā āmantritaḥ prārthitaḥ saṃs tasya tanayāya bhagadattāya
dṛtaśeṣaṃ rājyaṃ dattvā ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : sutaṃ narakāsuraṃ sunābhenonmathitaṃ hataṃ dṛṣṭvā dharitryāḥ
tanmātrā āmantritaḥ niveditaḥ tattanayāya bhagadattāya | atra
śuddhamātāpitṛkasyāpi tasya bāṇāsurasaṅgād eva kubuddhir iti
asādhusaṅgamahimaprastāve purāṇāntarakathā jñeyā ||6||


 || 3.3.7 ||

 tatrāhṛtās tā naradevakanyāḥ

  kujena dṛṣṭvā harim ārtabandhum |

utthāya sadyo jagṛhuḥ praharṣa

 vrīḍānurāgaprahitāvalokaiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tatrāntaḥpure kujena bhaumena yā āhṛtās tāḥ, praharṣaś ca
vrīḍā cānurāgaś ca taiḥ prahitāḥ preritā ye'valokās tair jagṛhuḥ
svīkṛtavatyaḥ ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  tatrāntaḥpure kujena narakāsureṇa | praharṣaś ca vrīḍā
cānurāgaś ca taiḥ prahitāḥ preritā ye'valokās tair jagṛhuḥ, mamāyam eva
vara iti pratyekaṃ svīcakruḥ ||7||


 || 3.3.8 ||

 āsāṃ muhūrta ekasmin nānāgāreṣu yoṣitām |

  savidhaṃ jagṛhe pāṇīn anurūpaḥ svamāyayā ||

śrīdharaḥ : āsāṃ yoṣitāṃ pāṇīṃs tattadanurūpaḥ san savidhaṃ
vivāhocitaprakārasahitaṃ yathā bhavati ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svamāyayā acintyacicchaktyā savidhim iti
puṇyāraṇyaḥ ||8||

viśvanāthaḥ : savidhaṃ vivāhocitaprakārasahitaṃ svamāyayā yogamāyayā
suṣṭhu amāyayeti ||8||


 || 3.3.9 ||

  tāsv apatyāny ajanayad ātmatulyāni sarvataḥ |

ekaikasyāṃ daśa daśa prakṛter vibubhūṣayā ||

madhvaḥ :  uttamaiḥ sarvataḥ sāmyaṃ kiñcit sāmyam udīryate  ity āgneye
||9||

śrīdharaḥ : sarvataḥ sarvair guṇaiḥ svatulyāni | prakṛter māyāyā vividhaṃ
bhavanaṃ vistāras tadicchayā | yad vā, prakṛter hitor vividhaṃ bhavitum
icchayā ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : prakṛte svarūpasyaiva vaibhavecchayā, prakṛtiś ca
svarūpaṃ ca svabhāvaś ca  ity amaraḥ | vyākhyātaṃ ca ṭīkākṛdbhiḥ pañcame
prakṛtiṃ bhajasva [bhā.pu. 5.1.19] ity atra prakṛtiṃ svarūpam iti ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : prakṛteḥ svasvabhāvasya vibubhūṣayā vibhavecchayā
ātmatulyānīty ukteḥ | prakṛtiṃ ca svarūpaṃ ca svabhāvaś ca  ity amaraḥ
||9||


 || 3.3.10 ||

  kālamāgadhaśālvādīn anīkai rundhataḥ puram |

ajīghanat svayaṃ divyaṃ svapuṃsāṃ teja ādiśat ||

śrīdharaḥ : kālaḥ kālayavanaḥ | rundhata āvṛṇvataḥ | mucukundabhīmādibhir
nimittamātraiḥ svayam evājīghanad ghātitavān | tena ca svapuṃsāṃ tejaḥ
prabhāvaṃ kīrtiṃ vā dattavān ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svayam iti sākṣād eva kutracit tu tatra tatrāveśenety
arthaḥ ||10||

viśvanāthaḥ : kālaḥ kālayavanaḥ | anīkaiḥ sainyaiḥ rundhata āvṛṇvataḥ |
mucukundabhīmādibhir nimittamātraiḥ svayam evājīghanad ghātitavān | tena
ca teṣāṃ svapuṃsāṃ tejaḥ prabhāvaṃ kīrtiṃ vā dattavān ||10||


 || 3.3.11 ||

 śambaraṃ dvividaṃ bāṇaṃ muraṃ balvalam eva ca |

  anyāṃś ca dantavakrādīn avadhīt kāṃś ca ghātayat ||

śrīdharaḥ : śambaradvividabalvalān anyān api kāṃścit
pradyumnarāmādibhir ghātayad aghātayat | “ghātayan” iti vā pāṭhaḥ |
dantavaktrādīn svayam avadhīt ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : śambaram iti yugmakam | śambarādīn aghātayat bāṇādīn
avadhīd iti yathāyathaṃ yojyam ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : atha tadanantaraṃ kāṃś ca nṛpān ghātayad ity aḍāgam ābhāva
ārṣaḥ | “ghātayan” iti pāṭhe babhūveti śeṣaḥ ||11||


 || 3.3.12 ||

 atha te bhrātṛputrāṇāṃ pakṣayoḥ patitān nṛpān |

 cacāla bhūḥ kurukṣetraṃ yeṣām āpatatāṃ balaiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nṛpān ghātayad ity anuṣaṅgaḥ | kathaṃbhūtān ? kurukṣetram
āpatatāṃ gacchatāṃ yeṣāṃ balaiḥ sainyair bhūḥ sarvāpi cacāla cakampe
||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : patitān iti svayaṃ pṛthvībhārabhūtatvena kāṃścit
tatpakṣagāmitvena ca kāṃścid rakṣaṇīyebhyaś cyutān ity arthaḥ ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : kāṃś ca kīdṛśān te tava bhrātṛputrāṇāṃ yudhiṣṭhirādīnāṃ
duryodhanādīnāṃ ca pakṣayoḥ patitān prāptān kurukṣetram āpatatām
āgacchatāṃ yeṣāṃ balaiḥ sainyaiḥ bhūḥ sarvāpi cacāla cakampe ||12||


 || 3.3.13 ||

 sa karṇaduḥśāsanasaubalānāṃ

  kumantrapākena hataśriyāyuṣam |

  suyodhanaṃ sānucaraṃ śayānaṃ

bhagnoruṃ ūrvyāṃ na nananda paśyan ||

śrīdharaḥ : sa kṛṣṇaḥ | hatā śrīr āyuś ca yasya | bhagnāv ūrū yasya tam
urvyāṃ śayānaṃ paśyann api na nananda santoṣaṃ na prāpa ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : sa kṛṣṇaḥ paśyann api na nananda ||13||


 || 3.3.14 ||

kiyān bhuvo'yaṃ kṣapitorubhāro

 yad droṇabhīṣmārjunabhīmamūlaiḥ |

 aṣṭādaśākṣauhiṇiko madaṃśair

āste balaṃ durviṣahaṃ yadūnām ||

śrīdharaḥ : anabhinandanaprakāram evāha—kiyān iti | droṇadibhir mūlaiḥ
kāraṇabhūtaiḥ | yad iti yaḥ aṣṭādaśākṣauhiṇīyuktaḥ | hrasvatvamārṣam |
kṣapito ya harur bhāro bhuvaḥ ayaṃ kiyān | atyalpa ity arthaḥ | yasmān
madaṃśaiḥ pradyumnādibhir hetubhūtair durviṣahaṃ balam āste ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : āste balam ity asyāyaṃ bhāvaḥ | bhūbhāras tāvad
vyaktibāhulyena na syāt, parvatasamudrādīnāṃ tatra prācuryāt | kintv
adhārmikaprācuryeṇaiva tatra bhāraḥ syāt | tatrāstāṃ tāvat
pradyumnādimadaṃśānāṃ yadumātrāṇāṃ paramadhārmikatvam evoktam |
brahmaṇyānāṃ vadānyānāṃ vadānyānāṃ nityaṃ vṛddhopasevinām | vipraśāpaḥ
katham abhūd vṛṣṇīnāṃ kṛṣṇacetasām ity ādau |
śayyāsanāṭanālāpakrīḍāsnānāśanādiṣu | na viduḥ santam ātmānaṃ vṛṣṇayaḥ
kṛṣṇacetasa ity ādau tasmaḍ yad atra durviṣahatvena bhāratvam ucyate tat
khalu tāṃs tyaktvā kevalasya mamāntardhāne teṣāṃ madviyogena pīḍārtānāṃ
parārdhasaṅkhyānāṃ saṅgāt pṛthivīyaṃ pīḍitā syād itīty eva gamyate ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : tatra hetuḥ—kiyān iti | yato droṇādibhirmūlaiḥ
kāraṇabhūtair aṣṭādaśākṣauhiṇībharaḥ bhuvo bhāraḥ urur yathā syāt tathā
kṣapitaḥ ayaṃ kiyān atyalpa ity arthaḥ | sandhir ārṣaḥ | samāsavyākhyāyāṃ
vidheyāṃśāvimarśaḥ soḍhavyaḥ | yasmān madaṃśaiḥ pradyumnādibhir
hetubhūtair durviṣahaṃ balam āste |

nanu bhūbhāras tāvad vyaktibāhulyena na syāt parvatasamudrādīnāṃ, tatra
prācuryāt kintv dhārmikaprācuryeṇaiva te cādhārmikā bhagavatā saṃhṛtā
eva, na ca yadukulasyādhārmikatvaṃ vācyaṃ bhagavatparikararūpatvāt |
brahmaṇyānāṃ vadānyānāṃ nityaṃ vṛddhopasevinām | vipraśāpaḥ katham abhūd
vṛṣṇīnāṃ kṛṣṇacetasām | śayyāsanāṭanālāpakrīḍāsnānāśanādiṣu | na viduḥ
santam ātmānaṃ vṛṣṇayaḥ kṛṣṇacetasa ityādyuktibhyaś ca |
atrocyate—bhāro hi dvividho bhavati—duḥkharūpaḥ sukharūpaś ca | prathamo
duḥsahaḥ, dvitīyas tu susaha eva, yathā yuvatyā svaramaṇasya bhāraḥ |
yathā ca vatsalayā mātrā svapotasya kroḍe kṛtasya bhāraḥ | yathā ca
vaṇijā śirasi dhṛtasya svadhanasya bhāraḥ | kiṃ cālpabalena janena
svasmād atibahulaḥ sukharūpo'pi bhāro voḍhuṃ na śakyate | yathā
paramadhārmikasya mahābhāgavatasya tapobalādhikyam āviṣkurvato
dhruvasyāpi bhāraḥ pṛthivyāḥ | yad uktaṃ—

yadaikapādena sa pārthivārbhakas

tasthau tadaṅguṣṭhanipīḍitā mahī |

nanāma tatrārdham ibhendradhiṣṭhitā

tarīva savyetarataḥ pade pade || [bhā.pu. 4.8.79] iti |

yadā ca bhagavatāpi svabalam āviṣkriyate tadā tasya paramānandarūpasyāpi
bhāro na voḍhuṃ śakyate | yathā bhīṣmastutau dhṛtarathacaraṇo'bhyayāc
caladgur [bhā.pu. 1.9.37] iti | nṛsiṃhāvirbhāve ca—protsarpata kṣmā ca
padābhipīḍitā  [bhā.pu. 7.8.34] iti | ato'tra yadyapi yadukulasya bhāraḥ
pṛthivā bhāratvena nābhimanyate yathā sukumāryāpi striyā
bahusvarṇaratnatvādyābharaṇabhāras tad api premavatā tatkāntena
tadaṅgebhyaḥ kaścana kaścanotsevādāv āgantuka evābharaṇabhāro niṣkāśyate
sthāpyate ca sarvadopayogī tathaiva aṃśāvataraṇasamaye
nityaparikararūpeṣu yādavādiṣu ye devādayo'ṃśāḥ paraviṣṭās ta eva
dvārakāto niṣkramayya prabhāse upasaṃhṛtāḥ ||14||


 || 3.3.15 ||

 mitho yadaiṣāṃ bhavitā vivādo

 madhvāmadātāmravilocanānām |

 naiṣāṃ vadhopāya iyān ato'nyo

mayy udyate'ntardadhate svayaṃ sma ||

śrīdharaḥ : na cātrānya upāyaḥ prabhavati, kintu madhunā ya āmadaḥ sarvato
madas tenātāmravilocanānām eṣāṃ vivādo yadā bhaviṣyati tadeyān evaiṣāṃ
vadhopāyaḥ ato'nyo nāsti | ekātmāno'pi mayy udyate sati svayam eva
vivādenāntardadhīrann ity arthaḥ ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tatrānyeṣām iva naiṣāṃ saṃhāraḥ sambhavati, kintu
prakārāntareṇaiveti svagatamāha—mitha iti | madhunā ya ā samyak madas
tenātāmranetrāṇāṃ vivādas tadāpi eṣāṃ vadharūpa upāyo na bhavati kintu
ato vadhāt anya eva iyān vadasadṛśo na tu vadha ity arthaḥ | tena lokā
vastutas tv avadham eva parasparavadhaṃ drakṣyantīty arthaḥ | vāstavaṃ
vastutas tu spaṣṭam āha—mayi udyate imān upasaṃjihīrṣyau sati svayam eva
ime antardadhate antardhāsyante smeti niścaye ||15||


 || 3.3.16 ||

 evaṃ sañcintya bhagavān svarājye sthāpya dharmajam |

 nandayām āsa suhṛdaḥ sādhūnāṃ vartma darśayan ||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃ ślokadvayenoktaṃ krameṇa sañcintya svarājye sthāpayitvā
||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : pūrvaṃ dhṛtaḥ sthāpitaḥ punar dhṛto rakṣitaḥ ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : sthāpya sthāpayitvā ||16||


 || 3.3.17 ||

uttarāyāṃ dhṛtaḥ pūror vaṃśaḥ sādhvabhimanyunā |

sa vai drauṇyastrasampluṣṭaḥ punar bhagavatā dhṛtaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : dhṛto rakṣitaḥ ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : dhṛta āhitaḥ | dhṛto rakṣitaḥ ||17||


 || 3.3.18 ||

ayājayad dharmasutam aśvamedhais tribhir vibhuḥ |

so'pi kṣmām anujai rakṣan reme kṛṣṇam anuvrataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : anujaiḥ saha ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : reme virarāja ||18||


 || 3.3.19 ||

bhagavān api viśvātmā lokavedapathānugaḥ |

  kāmān siṣeve dvārvatyām asaktaḥ sāṅkhyam āsthitaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  kevalaṃ bhagavajjñānaṃ sāṅkhyam ity abhidhīyate  ity adhyātme
||19||

śrīdharaḥ : sāṅkhyaṃ prakṛtipuruṣavivekam ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhagavān apīti kṛtakṛtyatāyāṃ jātāyāṃ vairāgyalīlā
prakāśitety arthāh ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : pañcamaṣaṣṭhe aiśvarye dyotayati bhagavān api |
viśvasyāntaryāmīva asaktaḥ lokavedeti lokavedayor aniṣiddhān eva kāmān
sukharūpān indrādibhir upāyanatvena preṣitān siṣeve bubhuje | atra asakta
iti vairāgyaṃ, sāṅkhyam iti jñeyam ||19||


 || 3.3.20 ||

snigdhasmitāvalokena vācā pīyūṣakalpayā |

 caritreṇānavadyena śrīniketena cātmanā ||

  imaṃ lokam amuṃ caiva ramayan sutarāṃ yadūn |

reme kṣaṇadayā datta kṣaṇastrīkṣaṇasauhṛdaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : snigdho yaḥ smitasahito'valokas tena | pīyūṣakalpayā
sudhātulyayā | pāṭhāntare sudhāpravāharūpayā | ātmanā dehena ||20||

kṣaṇadayā rātryā, dattaḥ kṣaṇo'vasara utsavo vā, yāsāṃ strīṇāṃ tāsu kṣaṇaṃ
sauhṛdaṃ yasya saḥ ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra kramam āha tribhiḥ | snigdheti yugmakam ||20||
rajanyā dattāvasarastrīṇāṃ kṣaṇam utsavarūpaṃ sauhṛdaṃ yasya ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : māyāśaktivilāsa eva tasyānāsaktiś cicchaktivilāse tv
āsaktir evety āha—siddheti | krameṇāvalokavacanalīlārūpaiś caturbhir
mādhuryaiḥ imaṃlokaṃ martyalokasthaṃ svabhaktam amuṃ devalokasthaṃ
teṣv api madhye yadūn nitarāṃ yaduṣv api madhye strīṣu reme ity
āsaktyādhikyaṃ kṣaṇadayā rajanyā dattaḥ kṣaṇo'vasaro yāsāṃ tathābhūtāsu
strīṣu kṣaṇena ratyotsavena sauhṛdaṃ yasya saḥ | paṭṭamahiṣīṇāṃ
svarūpabhūtatvāc cicchaktitvam | skāndaprabhāsakhaṇḍe
śivagaurīsaṃvāde gopyādimāhātmye dṛṣṭam |

ṣoḍaśaiva sahasrāṇi gopyas tatra samāgatāḥ |

lakṣam ekaṃ tathā ṣaṣṭhir ete kṛṣṇasutāḥ priye || ity upakramya,

haṃsa eva mataḥ kṛṣṇaḥ paramātma janārdanaḥ |

tasyaitāḥ śaktayo devi ṣoḍaśaiva prakīrtitāḥ ||

candrarūpī mataḥ kṛṣṇaḥ kalārūpās tu tāḥ smṛtāḥ ||  iti |

atra viśeṣo daśame prapañcayiṣyate ||2021||


 || 3.3.22 ||

  tasyaivaṃ ramamāṇasya saṃvatsaragaṇān bahūn |

  gṛhamedheṣu yogeṣu virāgaḥ samajāyata ||

madhvaḥ :  sarvadāpi viraktaḥ san bhāsayīta virāgivat |

kādācitkaḥ kutas tasya lokaśikṣārtham iṣyate || iti pādme |

tenāpi virāgaḥ pradarśitam ||22||

śrīdharaḥ : gṛhamedheṣu gṛhadharmeṣu | yogeṣu kāmabhogopāyeṣu | virāga
audāsīnyaṃ jātam ity arthaḥ ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : gṛhamedheṣu gārhasthyocitadharmānuṣṭhāneṣu vairāgyam
audāsīnyam ||22||

viśvanāthaḥ : gṛhamedheṣu yogeṣu rajoguṇamayakarmamārgeṣu
tadupalakṣitakarmijanopanītabhogyavastuṣu ca virāga audāsīnyaṃ
samyagjāyateti sarvakālam eva sa āsīd eva, tadānīṃ tv
atispaṣṭībabhūvety arthaḥ | guṇeṣv asaṅgo vairāgyam iti vairāgyasya
lakṣaṇād guṇātīteṣu śuddhasattvamayeṣu rukmiṇyādivilāseṣu vairāgyaṃ na
vyākhyeyam ||22||


 || 3.3.23 ||

  daivādhīneṣu kāmeṣu daivādhīnaḥ svayaṃ pumān |

  ko viśrambheta yogena yogeśvaram anuvrataḥ ||

madhvaḥ : ataḥ ko'nyo viśrambhaṃ kuryāt ||23||

śrīdharaḥ : yadā svādhīneṣv api bhagavato virāgaḥ, tadā daivādhīneṣu ko
visrambheta viśvāsaṃ prītiṃ vā kuryāt ? yogena ced yogeśvaraṃ śrīkṛṣṇam
anuvrataḥ ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sā ca vairāgyalīlaitad bodhayitum ity āha—daiveti
||23||

viśvanāthaḥ : sā ca vairāgyalīlā etad bodhayitum ity āha—yadā svādhīneṣv
api bhagavato virāgas tadā daivādhīneṣu ko viśrambheta viśvāsaṃ prītiṃ
kurvīta yogena cet yogeśvaraṃ bhagavantam anuvrataḥ syāt ||23||


 || 3.3.24 ||

puryāṃ kadācit krīḍadbhir yadubhojakumārakaiḥ |

  kopitā munayaḥ śepur bhagavanmatakovidāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : śepuḥ śāpaṃ daduḥ | bhagavato mate'bhiprāye kovidāḥ abhijñāḥ
||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhagavanmataṃ tu vipraśāpavyājena mitho yadaiṣām ity
ādinā pūrvam uktam | devaḥ śrīkṛṣṇaḥ ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavato mate abhiprāye kovidā iti munīnāṃ doṣaḥ parihṛtaḥ
| bhagavato'pi tādṛśābhiprāyakāraṇam ekādaśāste vyākhyāsyate ||24||


 || 3.3.25 ||

 tataḥ katipayair māsair vṛṣṇibhojāndhakādayaḥ |

yayuḥ prabhāsaṃ saṃhṛṣṭā rathair devavimohitāḥ ||

madhvaḥ : eṣyac ca niścitaṃ yat tad atītatvena bhaṇyate |

cakravatparivṛtter vā duṣṭānāṃ mohanāya vā || iti skānde ||25||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : devamohitā eva vṛṣṇyādayo yayur nityabhūtās tu dvārakāyām
eva prāpañcikalokālakṣyatayā tasthuḥ | devāś ca te mohitāś ceti vā ||25||


 || 3.3.26 ||

tatra snātvā pitèn devān ṛṣīṃś caiva tadambhasā |

 tarpayitvātha viprebhyo gāvo bahuguṇā daduḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : vayaḥ śīlādibahuguṇopetā yā gāvas tāḥ ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatreti yugmakam ||26||

viśvanāthaḥ : gāvo gāḥ bahuguṇāḥ payaśīlādimatīḥ ||26||


 || 3.3.27 ||

 hiraṇyaṃ rajataṃ śayyāṃ vāsāṃsy ajinakambalān |

yānaṃ rathān ibhān kanyā dharāṃ vṛttikarīm api ||

śrīdharaḥ :  kanyāś ca | vṛttikarīṃ jīvikāparyāptām ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : goviprārthāsava iti paramadhārmikatvam eva
dṛḍhīkṛtaṃ, tena bhagavadicchayaiva tādṛśabuddhitvam āgantukam iti
vyañjitam | tataś ca tatra tatra daṇḍaś ca lokabhīṣaṇārtham eva, na tu
vāstavam iti ca darśitam ||27||

viśvanāthaḥ : vṛttakarīṃ jīvikāparyāptām ||27||


 || 3.3.28 ||

annaṃ corurasaṃ tebhyo dattvā bhagavadarpaṇam |

  goviprārthāsavaḥ śūrāḥ praṇemur bhuvi mūrdhabhiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavadarpaṇaṃ yathā bhavati | goviprārthā asavo yeṣām
||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavate'rpaṇaṃ yatra tat yathā syāt tathā goviprārtho
asavo yeṣāṃ te iti teṣāṃ dhārmikatvaṃ dṛḍhīkṛtya
bhagavadicchādhīnasaṃhāratvaṃ vyañjitam | bhagavadicchā ca brāhmaṇā na
kopanīyā iti lokapravartanā nityabhūtebhyo yādavebhyo
devādyaṃśavibhājanā teṣāṃ tanmiṣeṇa svasvapadaprāpaṇā
svīyaṣaṣṭhaiśvaryadyotanā |
svabhaktibhaktadhāmalīlāparikarādimāhātmyagopanena
bahirmukhalokapratāraṇā svabhaktajanānurāgavistāraṇādyā iti ||28||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīyo'yaṃ tṛtīye'tra saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe

viduroddhavasaṃvāde

  tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ |

 ||3||

 (3.4)

  caturtho'dhyāyaḥ

  viduroddhavasaṃvādaḥ

 || 3.4.1 ||

uddhava uvāca—

 atha te tadanujñātā bhuktvā pītvā ca vāruṇīm |

tayā vibhraṃśitajñānā duruktair marma paspṛśuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

  caturthe bandhunidhanaṃ śrutvātmajñānalabdhaye |

uddhavasyopadeśena kṣatā maitreyam āgamat ||

tair brāhmaṇair anujñātāḥ | vāruṇīṃ paiṣṭhīṃ madirām ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tayopalakṣaṇabhūtayā bhagavataiva vibhraṃśitaṃ jñānaṃ
yeṣāṃ te ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

  aprākaṭyaṃ hareḥ śrutvā svakulasyoddhavāc chvasan |

caturthe svopadeśārthaṃ maitreyaṃ viduro'nvagāt ||

tair brāhmaṇais tena kṛṣṇena vā anujñātā marma parasparam iti śeṣaḥ ||1||


 || 3.4.2 ||

 teṣāṃ maireyadoṣeṇa viṣamīkṛtacetasām |

nimlocati ravāv āsīd veṇūnām iva mardanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : vāruṇy eva maireyaṃ tasya doṣeṇa nimlocati astaṃ gacchati sati
| mardanaṃ kadanam ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : vāruṇy eva maireyaṃ tasya doṣeṇa nimlocati astaṃ gacchati
sati | mardanaṃ nāśaḥ ||2||


 || 3.4.3 ||

 bhagavān svātmamāyāyā gatiṃ tām avalokya saḥ |

sarasvatīm upaspṛśya vṛkṣamūlam upāviśat ||

madhvaḥ : ātmamāyāyāḥ ātmasāmarthyasya gatiṃ pūrvam evāvalokya |

jñātvā katipayair varṣaiḥ pūrvam eva janārdanaḥ |

mauṣalaṃ jñānasampattyā uddhavaṃ badarīṃ naya ||

sa jñānaṃ tatra vistīrya punar dvāravatīṃ yayau |

pūrvam evopadiṣṭo'pi hariṇā jñānam uddhavaḥ ||

svargārohaṇakāle tu punaḥ papraccha keśavam |

punaḥ śrutvā badaryāṃ tu varṣatrayam uvāsa ha ||

jñānaṃ saṃsthāpya paścāc ca svecchayā svargataḥ prabhuḥ || iti gāruḍe
||34||

śrīdharaḥ : upasṛtya sarasvatyām ācamya ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svātmamāyayetīndrajālavad eva mauṣalalīlā vyañjitā
||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu vātsalyapārāvāro bhagavān
kṛtacaraputrapautrādiparamapālanaḥ pradyumnādivadhaṃ kathaṃ sākṣāt
dṛṣṭavān ity āha—bhagavān iti | māyāyā gatiṃ ceṣṭāṃ pradyumnādyā yādavāḥ
parasparavadhena sadya eva nāśaṃ prāpur iti sarvalokapratyāyanarūpāṃ
svātmeti—nahi madīyā māyā tam api sā mohayed ity arthaḥ | 
māyāyāḥ svāśrayāvyāmohanasvabhāvatvāt | tataś ca bhagavatā tv evaṃ vilokitaṃ
nityabhūtā līlāparikarāḥ pradyumnādayo yādavā dvārakāyām eva sthitās
tattatpraviṣṭacarā devās tu tattadaṅgebhyaḥ pṛthak kṛtās
tattadrūpeṇa prabhāsamānītā bhuktvā pītvā svalabdhānijñāḥ sukhena
divaṃ yayur iti | ata eva pūrvapadye tadanujñātā iti divaṃ gantum ity
eva tattvam | atra rāmapradyumnāniruddhānāṃ bhagavadvyūhatvāt ete hi
yādavāḥ sarve madgaṇā eva bhāmini sarvadā matpriyā devi
mattulyaguṇaśālina iti yathā saumitribharato yathā saṃkarṣaṇādayaḥ,
tathā tenaiva jāyante nijalokād yadṛcchayā ity ādi pādmokteḥ | devānāṃ ca
hitārthāya vayaṃ prāptā manuṣyatām iti harivaṃśe akrūrokteś ca | yādavānāṃ
nityalīlāparikaratvāt teṣu śāstrādiṣu praviṣṭānāṃ guhādīnāṃ devānām apy
adhikāramadhya eva nāśānarhāt mauṣalalīleyaṃ māyiky eva | māyiky api
sarvamāyikasṛṣṭyabhāve'pi śrīkṛṣṇalīlāntarvartitvād
acintyayogamāyānumoditā nityaiva jñeyā ||3||


 || 3.4.4 ||

ahaṃ cokto bhagavatā prapannārtihareṇa ha |

 badarīṃ tvaṃ prayāhīti svakulaṃ sañjihīrṣuṇā ||

śrīdharaḥ : ahaṃ coktaḥ pūrvam eva dvārakāyām ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : badarīṃ tvaṃ prayāhīti | atra kāraṇam asmāl lokād
uparate [bhā.pu. 3.4.30] ity ādi vakṣyati ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : ahaṃ coktaḥ pūrvam eva dvārakāyām, ahaṃ ceti prakāśabhedena
svasaṅge ahaṃ rakṣita idam uktaś ceti sarasvatyā cakāraṃ prayojita
uddhavaḥ | tatra hetuḥ—prathame pakṣe prapannasya mama ārtiṃ
svavirahapīḍāṃ haratīti tena, dvitīye asmāl lokād uparata iti
vakṣyamāṇayuktyā prapannānāṃ badaryāśramavāsināṃ
svāṃśanaranārāyaṇādīnām ārtiṃ svacaritaṃ
bhaktijñānavairāgyādiśravaṇotkaṇṭhārūpāṃ haratīti tena ||4||


 || 3.4.5 ||

  tathāpi tadabhipretaṃ jānann aham arindama |

pṛṣṭhato'nvagamaṃ bhartuḥ pādaviśleṣaṇākṣamaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad abhipretaṃ kulasaṃhārādikam ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tadabhipretaḥ yāhīti bruvann api prabhur māṃ prāyo na
tyakṣyatīti vā kulasaṃhārādikaṃ vā ||5||


 || 3.4.6 ||

  adrākṣam ekam āsīnaṃ vicinvan dayitaṃ patim |

  śrīniketaṃ sarasvatyāṃ kṛtaketam aketanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : kṛtaketaṃ kṛtāvāsam | aketanam anāśrayam ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : adrākṣam iti trikam ||68||

viśvanāthaḥ : ketanam āśrayo na vidyate yasya tam |
prākṛtāprākṛtavastūnāṃ vastutas tadāśritatvād iti bhāvaḥ ||6||


 || 3.4.7 ||

śyāmāvadātaṃ virajaṃ praśāntāruṇalocanam |

dorbhiś caturbhir viditaṃ pītakauśāmbareṇa ca ||

śrīdharaḥ : virajaṃ virajasaṃ śuddhasattvamayam | viditaṃ lakṣitam |
kauśaṃ kauśeyam ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ : na vyākhyātam |


 || 3.4.8 ||

  vāma ūrāv adhiśritya dakṣiṇāṅghrisaroruham |

 apāśritārbhakāśvattham akṛśaṃ tyaktapippalam ||

śrīdharaḥ : adhiśrityopari sthāpayitvā | apāśritaḥ
pṛṣṭhato'vaṣṭabdho'rbhako bālaḥ komalo'śvattho yena tam | tyaktaṃ pippalaṃ
viṣayasukhaṃ yena tam | tathāpy akṛśam ānandapūrṇam ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : adhiśrityopari sthāpayitvā | apāśritaḥ
pṛṣṭhato'vaṣṭabdho'śvatthpāto yena tam | na śvas tiṣṭhatīty aśvatthaḥ
bhūrādipaṃ ca pādavibhūtir asthirā māyikā sā pṛṣṭhīkṛtety ataḥ paraṃ
prapañcikā lokā māṃ na paśyantv ity āśayena arbhakapadena
sarvabrahmāṇḍeṣu madhye asya brahmāṇḍāsyātikṣudratvaṃ vyañjitam | tyaktaṃ
pippalaṃ samāptīkṛtaitadbrahmāṇḍavilāsaṃ pippalaśabdena śrutyā
viṣayasukhokteḥ ||8||


 || 3.4.9 ||

  tasmin mahābhāgavato dvaipāyanasuhṛtsakhā |

lokān anucaran siddha āsasāda yadṛcchayā ||

śrīdharaḥ : dvaipāyanaḥ suhṛt sakhā ca yasya sa svaguruputratvāt,
parāśaraśiṣyo maitreya ity arthaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yadṛcchayā—kenāpi bhāgyodayena |
dvaipāyanasuhṛtsakheti ṭajabhāva ārṣaḥ ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : dvaipāyano vyāsaḥ svaguruputratvāt suhṛt sakhā ca yasya
saḥ | maitreyaḥ parāśarasya śiṣya ity arthaḥ | yadṛcchayā akasmād eva
||9||


 || 3.4.10 ||

 tasyānuraktasya muner mukundaḥ

pramodabhāvānatakandharasya |

āśṛṇvato mām anurāgahāsa

 samīkṣayā viśramayann uvāca ||

śrīdharaḥ : pramodena bhāvena cānatā kandharā yasya | paṭhāntare
pramodasya bhāreṇa | anurāgeṇa saha hāso yasyāṃ tayā samīkṣayā viśramayan
vigataśramaṃ kurvan ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tasya tathābhūtasyāśṛṇvato'pi mām evovāceti | tato'pi
svasyānugrāhyatvaṃ vyañjitam | tathā ca vakṣyate svayaṃ bhagavatā asmāl
lokād uparate [bhā.pu. 3.4.30] ity ādi dvābhyām | ata eva ṣaṣṭhī | ata eva
tasyāśṛṇvata iti tadvacane kiñcid gopanamudrā ca darśitā ||10||

viśvanāthaḥ : tasyānuraktety ādiviśeṣaṇaviśiṣṭasyāpi mām evovāceti
tasmād api svasya premāspadatvādhikyaṃ vyañjitam, ata eva śaṣṭhī |
anurāgasya hāsaḥ prakāśo yasyāṃ tayā samīkṣayā anurāgahāsābhyāṃ yuktayā
vā viśramayan māṃ vigatavirahaśramaṃ kurvan ||10||


 || 3.4.11 ||

śrībhagavān uvāca—

 vedāham antar manasīpsitaṃ te

  dadāmi yat tad duravāpam anyaiḥ |

 satre purā viśvasṛjāṃ vasūnāṃ

 matsiddhikāmena vaso tvayeṣṭaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : he uddhava, te manasīpsitam aham antaḥsthito veda vedmi |
dāne hetuḥ—viśvasṛjāṃ vasūnāṃ camilitānāṃ satre | he vaso iti purā
pūrvajanmani tvaṃ vasur abhūḥ, tadā matprāptikāmena tvayāham iṣṭaḥ |
atas tatsādhanaṃ dadāmi dāsyāmi | anyair matparāṅmukhair duṣprāpam
||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ata eva nityapārṣadatve'py ekāṃśena vasutvam
udbhāvyādiṣṭam ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : veda vedmi | yad anyair durāpaṃ tad dadāmi | dāne
hetuḥ—viśvasṛjāṃ vasūnāṃ ca militānāṃ satre, he vaso iti pūrvajanmani
tvaṃ vasur abhūḥ, tadā matprāptikāmena tvayāham iṣṭaḥ iti
nityalīlāparikare uddhave vasoḥ praveśāt nityasiddhasyāpy uddhavasya
sādhanasiddhatvam eva maitreyam uddhavaṃ ca jñāpayāmāsa | nityalīlāyā
rahasyatvarakṣaṇārthaṃ, kecit tu līlāparikara uddhavo dvārakāyām eva
sthitaḥ vasurūpa uddhavo'yam ity āhuḥ ||11||


 || 3.4.12 ||

  sa eṣa sādho caramo bhavānām

 āsāditas te madanugraho yat |

yan māṃ nṛlokān raha utsṛjantaṃ

  diṣṭyā dadṛśvān viśadānuvṛttyā ||

śrīdharaḥ : tasya bhāgyam abhinandati | sa eṣa bhavo janma te bhavānāṃ
madhye caramaḥ | yady asmin madanugraha āsādito labdhaḥ | yat punar māṃ
raha ekānte viśadānuvṛttyā ekāntabhaktyā dadṛśvān dṛṣṭavān asi etad
diṣṭyā bhadraṃ jātam ity arthaḥ | nṛlokān nṛśabdena jīvās teṣāṃ lokān
utsṛjantaṃ vaikuṇṭhaṃ gacchantam ity arthaḥ ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhavānāṃ vasvādirūpeṇāpi lokasaṅgrahārthaṃ bahūnām
avatārāṇāṃ caramaḥ paramakāṣṭhām āpannas tadaṃśirūpa ity arthaḥ |
viśadānuvṛttyā śuddhabhāvatayānugamanena yad dṛṣṭavāṃs tad diṣṭyā bhadram
eva kṛtam ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : tam āśvāsayati—sa iti | bhavānāṃ janmanāṃ madhye eṣa bhavaś
caramaḥ śeṣaḥ | yad yasminn āsāditaḥ prāptaḥ | yat punar māṃ raha ekānte
viśadānuvṛttyā ekāntabhaktyā dadṛśvān dṛṣṭavān asi etaddiṣṭyā bhadraṃ
jātam ity arthaḥ | nṛlokān nṛśabdena jīvās teṣāṃ lokān utsṛjya taṃ
vaikuṇṭhaṃ gacchantam ity arthaḥ ||12||


 || 3.4.13 ||

 purā mayā proktam ajāya nābhye

 padme niṣaṇṇāya mamādisarge |

jñānaṃ paraṃ manmahimāvabhāsaṃ

yat sūrayo bhāgavataṃ vadanti ||

śrīdharaḥ : dadāmīti yad uktaṃ tad eva nirdiśati | purā pūrvasmin pādme
kalpe | ādisarge sargopakrame | mama mahimā līlāvabhāsyate yena tat
||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : purā mayeti | purā brāhme kalpe, dvitīyaskandhe
brahmakalpakathanāt | jñānaṃ paraṃ catuḥślokīrūpam |
manmahimāvabhāsam iti tasya nirviśeṣapratipādakatvaṃ nāṅgīkṛtam ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ : dadāmīti yat pratiśrutaṃ tan nirdiśati—pureti | ādisarge
brāhmakalpe | mama mahimā līlāvabhāsyate yena tad iti svāmicaraṇāḥ,
mahimā māhātmyam ity anye | bhāgavataṃ catuḥślokīrūpam ||13||


 || 3.4.14 ||

 ity ādṛtoktaḥ paramasya puṃsaḥ

pratikṣaṇānugrahabhājano'ham |

  snehottharomā skhalitākṣaras taṃ

 muñcañ chucaḥ prāñjalir ābabhāṣe ||

śrīdharaḥ : ity evam ādṛtaś cāsāv uktaś cāham | pratīkṣaṇaṃ kṛpāvaloka
evānugrahas tasya bhājanaḥ pātrabhūtaḥ | pāṭhāntare pratikṣaṇam
anugrahasya pātram iti | śuco'śrūṇi muñcann āvabhāṣe uktavān asi ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ata evāha—itīty ādi | [śrīmaduddhavavacanam itīty ādi
lokabhāvanāv ity antam |] ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : ity aham ādṛta uktaś ca | pratīkṣaṇaṃ mantraṇādiṣu uddhavaṃ
vinā etat ko'pi na jānāti, sa āgacchatu, tata idaṃ
bhaviṣyatītyādipratīkṣā | hrasvamadhyapāṭhe pratikṣaṇaṃ kṣaṇe kṣaṇe
yo'nugrahas tasya pātraṃ śucaḥ aśrūṇi ||14||


 || 3.4.15 ||

ko nv īśa te pādasarojabhājāṃ

  sudurlabho'rtheṣu caturṣv apīha |

 tathāpi nāhaṃ pravṛṇomi bhūman

 bhavatpadāmbhojaniṣevaṇotsukaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : na hi svājñānanivṛttimātrakāmo'haṃ, kintu
tvanniṣevaṇotsukas tvayi cāghaṭamānācaraṇaṃ dṛṣṭvā me moho bhavati, atas
tvaṃ tattvajñānaṃ dehīti prārthayitum āha—ko nv iti | caturṣu dharmādiṣu
tathāpi, he bhūman ! bhavatpadāmbhojaniṣevaṇotsuko'ham, tān na pravṛṇomi
||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tadaiva nivedayati—ko nv iti ||15||

viśvanāthaḥ: nanu bhagavan prabho kiṃkaraṃ māṃ saṃsārān mocayituṃ
sārūpyādikaṃ vā grāhayituṃ svajñānaṃ vyājihīrṣasi ced alaṃ tenety āha—ko
nv iti | caturṣu dharmādiṣu madhye pādasarojaṃ bhajatāṃ ko nu durlabha
iti sakāmānām api vināpi jñānaṃ pādabhajanenaiva mokṣādiphalasiddhiḥ
syād iti bhāvaḥ | ahaṃ tu tathāpi svata eva prāptān api tān arthān na
vṛṇomi | tatra hetur bhavad iti | ato jñānena mama kiṃ kāryam iti bhāvaḥ
||15||


 || 3.4.16 ||

  karmāṇy anīhasya bhavo'bhavasya te

 durgāśrayo'thāribhayāt palāyanam |

kālātmano yat pramadāyutāśramaḥ

  svātmanrateḥ khidyati dhīr vidām iha ||

śrīdharaḥ : aghaṭamānācaraṇaṃ darśayati | karmāṇy anīhasya niḥspṛhasya
niṣkriyasya vā | abhavasyājanmanaḥ bhavo janma | kālātmanas tavāribhayād
durgāśrayaḥ palāyanaṃ ca svātmani ratir yasya tasya bahvībhiḥ strībhir
gṛhasthāśrama iti yad ihāsmin viṣaye viduṣām api dhīḥ saṃśayena khidyati
||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanv evaṃ cet tarhi kathaṃ kim api jñātum iṣṭaṃ vartate
? yad eva mayā vyañjitaṃ vedāham antarmanasīpsitaṃ te [bhā.pu. 3.4.11]
ity anena ? satyam | kintu nātmārtham—yasyāṃ līlāyāṃ pṛcchā, tasyās tava
bhaktakṛpāvaibhavamayatvena jñātatvāt | tathāpi maitreyasākṣikeṇa
tadvacanenānyāṃs tathā suṣṭhu pratyāpayitum eva mama tathepsati
vijñāpayann āha—karmāṇīti tribhiḥ | vidām etādṛśānāṃ sarvajñānām api
||16||

viśvanāthaḥ: asmākaṃ dāsānāṃ punas tadrūpaguṇalīlā eva
darśanasmaraṇādyaiḥ paramānandahetus tāsām api jñānenātīvāgrahaḥ | yat
kiṃcij jñānasya sattvāt sāmastyena jñānāsambhavāc ca | kintu tatra līlāḥ
kāścana kāścana yuktyā viruddhyante, tatraiva me jijñāsitaṃ vartata ity
āha dvābhyām | anīhasya niṣkriyasya karmāṇi govardhanoddharaṇādīni, na tu
viśvasṛṣṭyādīni | teṣāṃ hi māyāguṇakṛtānāṃ tvayy āropitatvena,
svarūpatas tāvakatvābhāvāt niṣkalaṃ niṣkriyaṃ śāntaṃ niravadyaṃ nirañjanam
iti śrutyuktena niṣkriyatvena na virodhaḥ | govardhanoddharaṇādīnāṃ
karmaṇāṃ tu tvayā svarūpeṇaiva kṛtatvāt, teṣāṃ niṣkriyatvena virodha eveti
mama saṃśayaḥ | yad vā, narākṛteḥ parabrahmaṇas tava narākṛtitve
aprākṛtānantakarmavattvam | brahmatve prākṛtāprākṛtakarmarāhityaṃ,
tatraiva brahmapadasya rūḍheḥ | na ca nirviśeṣasvarūpam eva brahma
saviśeṣasvarūpo bhagavān iti svarūpabhedād vyavastheyam iti vācyam |
svarūpadvayābhāvād iti ṣaṣṭhokteḥ saṃśaya eva yatas tathā |
abhavasyājanmano janma | kālātmanas tava jarāsandhādyaribhayāt palāyanaṃ
samudradurgāśrayaś ca | svātmany eva ratir yasya tasyāpi pramadānām
ayutena sahāśramo gṛhāśramaḥ gṛhāśramaprayuktadevapitrādiyoge
svātmārāmasya tava ratiḥ | rukmiṇyādipramadābhiḥ ramaṇe tu tavātmārāmatā
nāpagacchet tāsām ātmabhūtatvād ity ahaṃ jānāmy eva | ata eva mayā
āśramaśabdaḥ prayuktaḥ | iha asmin virodhe vidāṃ viduṣām api dhīḥ
samādhānādarśanāt khidyati |

na ca niṣkriyatvājaḍatvakālātmatvātmārāmatvādīnām eva satyatvaṃ
sakriyatvajanmavattvabhītatvagṛhāśramavattvānām anukaraṇamātratvam
iti vācyam | tathātve viduṣāṃ dhīr atra khidyatīti noktaṃ syāt,
sakriyatvādīnānukaraṇāny eva na tu vāstavānīti jñāne kutaḥ khedaḥ ?
tathaivākriyatvādibhiḥ prākṛtakriyādaya eva niṣidhyante na tv
aprākṛtakriyādaya iti jñāne kutaḥ khedaḥ | tathaiva
brahmatvabhagavattvābhyām evākriyatvasakriyatvādīny anukaraṇamātrāṇīti
bruvāṇā akriyatvam aprākṛtakriyatvam abhavatvam aprākṛtajanmavattvam iti
ca bruvāṇā brahmatvabhagavattvābhyām evākriyatvasakriyatvādivyavastheti
bruvāṇā akhidyadbuddhaya evāvidvāṃsa iti dhvaniḥ | yad uktaṃ svayaṃ
bhagavatā—na me viduḥ suragaṇāḥ prabhavaṃ na maharṣayaḥ [gītā 10.2] iti
suragaṇā brahmādyā api maharṣayo vyāsādyā api me prakṛṣṭaṃ bhavaṃ janma
na vidur iti tatrārthaḥ | bhīṣmeṇāpy uktam—

na hy asya karhicid rājan pumān veda vidhitsitam |

yad vijijñāsayā yuktā muhyanti kavayo'pi hi || [bhā.pu. 1.9.16] iti ||16
||


 || 3.4.17 ||

mantreṣu māṃ vā upahūya yat tvam

akuṇṭhitākhaṇḍasadātmabodhaḥ |

  pṛccheḥ prabho mugdha ivāpramattas

 tan no mano mohayatīva deva ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, mantreṣu ca prastuteṣu ca satsy mām āhūya vai aho
pṛccher apṛcchaḥ | akuṇṭhitaḥ kālādinākhaṇḍaḥ santataḥ sadātmā
saṃśayādirahito bodho vidyāśaktir yasya | mugdhavad ajñavat |
apramatto'vahitaḥ san ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : mohayatītveti vastutaḥ svasya mohābhāvāt ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ: mantreṣu jarāsandhavadharājasūyādyarthagamanavicārādiṣu
prastuteṣu māṃ vai niścitam upahūya yat pṛccheḥ—uddhava tvam atra kiṃ
kartavyaṃ, tad brūhi ity apṛcchaḥ | akuṇṭhitaḥ kalādinā akhaṇḍaḥ
paripūrṇaḥ sadā sārvadika eva ātmano bodhaḥ saṃvicchaktir yasya saḥ |
mugdha iva yathānyo mugdho janaḥ pṛcchati tathety arthaḥ | kiṃ ca,
apramattaḥ kāryāntaravyāvṛttyāpi rahitatvād iti bhāvaḥ | tat tava yugapad
eva maugdhyaṃ sārvajñyaṃ ca mohayatīva mohayaty eva | atra mugdha iva tvaṃ
na tu mugdha iti tathā mohayatīva na tu mohayatīti vyākhyāyāṃ
saṅgatyabhāvāt iti saṅgateṣu vākyeṣu madhye'syotthāpanaṃ vyarthaṃ syād
ity atas tathā na vyākhyeyam ||17||


 || 3.4.18 ||

  jñānaṃ paraṃ svātmarahaḥprakāśaṃ

  provāca kasmai bhagavān samagram |

api kṣamaṃ no grahaṇāya bhartar

vadāñjasā yad vṛjinaṃ tarema ||

śrīdharaḥ : svātmanas tava raho rahasyaṃ tattvaṃ tasya prakāśakam | kasmai
brahmaṇe | sarvanāmatvam ārṣam | no'smākaṃ grahaṇāyāpi kṣamaṃ yadi yogyaṃ,
tarhi vada | bhartaḥ svāmin, yad yato vṛjinaṃ samṣāraduḥkham
añjasānāyāsena tariṣyāmaḥ ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tasmāj jñānaṃ param iti | vṛjinaṃ vidām api tathā tvayi
sandehena jātaṃ nijaduḥkham | bhavatpadāmbhojaniṣevanotsukānām asmākam
anyaduḥkhāspṛṣṭatvād iti bhāvaḥ | [svātmarahaḥprakāśām ity atra
yathāpadam agre 25padyaṃ, 12.8.49tamapadyaṃ ca draṣṭavyam |] ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ : ata etadādisaṃśayāpanodanam eva jñānam icchāmīty
āha—jñānam iti svātmanas tava rahaḥ sarvāgamyaṃ rahasyaṃ yan mama
jijñāsyaṃ tasya prakāśo yatra tajjñānaṃ, na tu tvayā dātuṃ pratiśrutaṃ
tanmahimāvabhāsam ity arthaḥ | kasmai bhavān provāca ced vada | yad vā,
kasmai bhagavān provāca api tu na kasmā apīty arthaḥ | tad api yady evaṃ
mām anukampase tadā he bhartar vada | tac ca no grahaṇāya kṣamam asmākaṃ
śuddhadāsyavatāṃ grahītuṃ yadi yogyaṃ syāt, kiṃ vā, yogyatve'pi yadi
śakyaṃ syāt tadā vada, na cen mā vadeti bhāvaḥ | yato jñānād vṛjinam
uktalakṣaṇaṃ majjijñāsyaṃ sampraty upasthitaṃ
yadukulasaṃhāratvaddehāntardhānādikaṃ ca duḥkhasindhum ||18||


 || 3.4.19 ||

  ity āveditahārdāya mahyaṃ sa bhagavān paraḥ |

ādideśāravindākṣa ātmanaḥ paramāṃ sthitim ||

śrīdharaḥ : āvedito hārdo hṛdisthito'bhiprāyo yena tasmai ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : paramāṃ sthitiṃ catuḥślokīproktām | tādṛśarūpatve'pi
rahasyākhyapremavaśatāmayalīlāmayīm ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : mahyaṃ na tu maitreyāyāpīty arthaḥ | ātmanaḥ svasya sthitiṃ
vyavasthitiṃ līlāyā maryādāṃ ca dvārakādidhāmasu nityanivāsaṃ ca, kintu
yā sthitiḥ śukadevena na nirvṛtā nāpy uddhavena vidurāyānyasmai kasmaicid
apīty ataḥ sāṅkhyhetuaviśeṣālābhāt niṣkriyatvasakriyatvādīnām
acintyaśaktisiddhatvam evāhur eke | yathoktaṃ bhāgavatāmṛte karmāṇy
anīhasya [bhā.pu. 3.4.16] iti padyam adhikṛtya,

tat tan na vāstavaṃ cet syād vidyāṃ buddhibhramas tadā |

na syād evety acintyaiva śaktilīlāsu kāraṇam || [la.bhā. 1.5.119] iti
||19||


 || 3.4.20 ||

 sa evam ārādhitapādatīrthād

  adhītatattvātmavibodhamārgaḥ |

 praṇamya pādau parivṛtya devam

  ihāgato'haṃ virahāturātmā ||

śrīdharaḥ : ārādhitapādo bhagavān sa eva tīrthaṃ gurus tasmād
adhīto'dhigatas tattvātmavibodhasya paramārthātmajñānasya mārgo yena
so'ham | devaṃ parivṛtya pradakṣiṇīkṛtya ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : adhīto jñātas tattvena yāthārthyenātmābhīṣṭavijñānasya
mārgaś catuḥślokīrūpo yena saḥ | tasya ca
bhagavatpremavaśatvapratipādakatvād virahātur ātmeva sann ihāgato'ham
ity anena ca tasya rukṣajñānatātparyatvaṃ svata eva khaṇḍitam ||20||

viśvanāthaḥ : sa uddhavo'ham ārādhitapādo bhagavān sa eva tīrthaḥ gurus
tasmād adhītatattvarūpasya ātmavibodhasya jñānamārgo yena saḥ |
parivṛtya parikramya tataḥ paraṃ bhagavatā kiṃ kṛtaṃ tan mayā na dṛṣṭam
iti bhāvaḥ ||20||


 || 3.4.21 ||

so'haṃ taddarśanāhlāda viyogārtiyutaḥ prabho |

 gamiṣye dayitaṃ tasya badaryāśramamaṇḍalam ||

śrīdharaḥ : tasta darśanenāhlādo viyogenārtiś ca tābhyāṃ yuto
badaryāśramasthānaṃ gamiṣyāmi ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : virahāturātmā cet tarhi kathaṃ calituṃ gadituṃ vā
śaknoṣi ? tatrāha—so'ham iti | darśanāhlādaḥ śanakair bhagavallokāt ity
anusāreṇa | viyogārtiyutas tu, nṛlokaṃ punar āgataḥ ity anusāreṇa | tato
viyoge'pi madhye madhye svasākṣātkārāsamarthaḥ san | tasya dayitaṃ māṃ
prasthāpayituṃ vāñchitaṃ badaryāśramam api gamiṣyāmīty arthaḥ ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu tvaṃ tadvirahavyathayāpi kathaṃ jīvasīti ?
tatrāha—kṣaṇe kṣaṇe taddarśanenāhlādas tadviyogenārtiś ca tābhyāṃ yutaḥ
| badaryāśramam iti tatraiva gantuṃ bhagavadādeśāt ||21||


 || 3.4.22 ||

yatra nārāyaṇo devo naraś ca bhagavān ṛṣiḥ |

 mṛdu tīvraṃ tapo dīrghaṃ tepāte lokabhāvanau ||

śrīdharaḥ : mṛdu paropadravaśūnyam | tīvraṃ duścaram | dīrgham ākalpāntam
| tepāte tapaś carata ity arthaḥ | lokabhāvanau lokānugrahakārakau
||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tatraiva tadaṃśaḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇa āsta ity āha—yetreti |
mṛdu sarvalokasukhadaṃ tīvraṃ sarvalokair duścaraṃ dīrghaṃ
bahukālavyāpi, lokānāṃ bhāvanau utpādakau pālakau vā ||22||


 || 3.4.23 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

 ity uddhavād upākarṇya suhṛdāṃ duḥsahaṃ vadham |

 jñānenāśamayat kṣattā śokam utpatitaṃ budhaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : jñānena vivekena ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : suhṛdāṃ vadhaṃ duḥsaham api uddhavāt sakāśāt ity evaṃ
prakārakam upākarṇety anvayaḥ | jñānena kṛṣṇadyumaṇi nimloce ity ādy
uddhavoktitātparyaparyālocanajanitena ||23||


 || 3.4.24 ||

sa taṃ mahābhāgavataṃ vrajantaṃ kauravarṣabhaḥ |

  viśrambhād abhyadhattedaṃ mukhyaṃ kṛṣṇaparigrahe ||

śrīdharaḥ : viśrambhād viśvāsāt ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : visrambhāt praṇayāt | visrambhaḥ praṇaye'pi ca ity
amaraḥ ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : viśrambhād viśvāsāt svato'tikaniṣṭham api kṛṣṇaparigrahe
kṛṣṇaṃ parigrahītuṃ vaśīkartuṃ mukhyaṃ svato'tiśreṣṭham | ataḥ kaniṣṭhā
api bhaktyudrekavanto jyeṣṭhair api guruḥ kartavya ity atra |
viduravākyam eva pramāṇam iti bodhitam ||24||


 || 3.4.25 ||

vidura uvāca—

  jñānaṃ paraṃ svātmarahaḥprakāśaṃ

 yad āha yogeśvara īśvaras te |

vaktuṃ bhavān no'rhati yad dhi viṣṇor

  bhṛtyāḥ svabhṛtyārthakṛtaś caranti ||

śrīdharaḥ : yad yasmād viṣṇor bhṛtyāḥ svabhṛtyaprayojanasādhakāḥ santaś
caranti | na hi kṛtārthānām anyat kṛtyam astīty arthaḥ ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yad eva jñānam | so'sādhāraṇo yo bhṛtyārthaḥ |
bhavatpadāmbhojaniṣevaṇosukaḥ [bhā.pu. 3.4.15] ity uktānusāreṇa
sevārūpas tatkāriṇo viṣṇor bhṛtyāś caranty anutiṣṭhantīti tasya jñānasya
bhaktimayatvaṃ vyaktam | ata evāsmin vākye pūrvoktaśrīmaduddhavavākye
ca rahaḥśabdaś catuḥślokīpaṭhitarahasyaśabdena samānārthatayā
nirdiṣṭaḥ | ataḥ śrībhagavadvākye, manmahimāvabhāsaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.4.13]
iti mahimaśabdasyāpi tatparyantatāyām eva tātparyam | atas tathābhūto'pi
premavaśa evāhaṃ tathā tathā naralīlādāv āviṣṭo bhavāmīti śrībhagavatā
siddhāntitam api, paramasthitiśabdasyāpy atraiva tātparyāt ||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : no'smabhyam ity asmador dvayoś cety ekatve'pi dvitve'pi
bahutvam | yad yasmād viṣṇor bhṛtyā vaiṣṇavāḥ svabhṛtyānām arthaṃ
bhaktyupadeśarūpaṃ kurvāṇāḥ kṛpayā ajñalokānāṃ guravo bhavanta eva
bhramanti | atas tatsevakābhimānine mahyaṃ bhagavajjñānam upadiśety
arthaḥ ||25||


 || 3.4.26 ||

uddhava uvāca—

 nanu te tattvasaṃrādhya ṛṣiḥ kauṣāravo'ntike |

  sākṣād bhagavatādiṣṭo martyalokaṃ jihāsatā ||

śrīdharaḥ : tattvāya saṃrādhya iti | ayaṃ bhāvaḥ—bhagavataiva
smaraṇamātreṇa tavāpi tattvam upadiṣṭaprāyam | atha kevalam
asambhāvanādinivṛttaye jñānī kaścid ārādhyaḥ | sa ca tavārādhyo maitreyo
na tv aham | mamāntika eva tvadupadeśe tasyādiṣṭatvād iti ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : idam abhyarhaṇīyaṃ katham ahaṃ śiṣyīkuryām iti svagataṃ
bruvan, ayemahābhāga, yad bhagavanmukhād avagataṃ tasya
tadīyayādavādīnāṃ ca dehatyāgaṃ vinaiva svasvadhāmasthitatvaṃ tat tan
mayoktam eva | kintu, tadīya janmakarmādyaśeṣaviśeṣatattvāni jijñāsase
cet, tarhi ṛṣir maitreya eva guruḥ kartavya ity āha—nanv iti | nanu
niścitam eva | tasya bhāvas tattvaṃ tena svabhṛtyārthakṛtatvena
gurutveneti yāvat, saṃrādhya ārādhya maitreya eva, na tv ahaṃ, yatas
tvadupadeśārthaṃ, mamāntike bhagavatā sākṣāt sa ādiṣṭa eva ||26||


 || 3.4.27 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

 iti saha vidureṇa viśvamūrter

guṇakathayā sudhayā plāvitorutāpaḥ |

kṣaṇam iva puline yamasvasus tāṃ

 samuṣita aupagavir niśāṃ tato'gāt ||

śrīdharaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

kramasandarbhaḥ : viśvamūrteḥ sarvataḥ sākṣād iva sphurato'ta eva
virahe'pi guṇakathayety ādi ||27||

viśvanāthaḥ : tāṃ niśāṃ kṣaṇam iva samuṣitaḥ aupagaviḥ aupagavasyāpatyam
uddhavaḥ tataḥ prātar agāt ||27||


 || 3.4.28 ||

  rājovāca—

nidhanam upagateṣu vṛṣṇibhojeṣv

adhirathayūthapayūthapeṣu mukhyaḥ |

  sa tu katham avaśiṣṭa uddhavo yad

  dharir api tatyaja ākṛtiṃ tryadhīśaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : ākṛtiṃ pṛthivīm |  śarīram ākṛtir dehaḥ kuḥ pṛthivī mahī tathā
ity abhidhānam ||28||

śrīdharaḥ : brahmaśāpenanidhanaṃ prāpteṣu yady asmāt trayāṇāṃ brahmādīnām
īśo harir apy ākṛtiṃmanuṣyākāraṃ tyaktavān ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nidhanaṃ nitarāṃ dhanasvarūpaṃ
śrīkṛṣṇanityalīlādhāma | upa samīpato vyavadhānaṃ vinaiva gateṣu | sa
tu katham avaśiṣṭaḥ | eka eva prapañce sthitaḥ | yat yasmāt trayāṇāṃ
brahmādīnāṃ mahatsraṣṭrādīnāṃ vādhīśo harir ākṛtiṃ vīrāḍ ākāraṃ
tyaktavān | martyalokaṃ jihāsatā [bhā.pu. 3.4.26] iti, asmāl lokād
uparate [bhā.pu. 3.4.28] iti pūrvāparānurodhāt ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : nidhanaṃ nāśaṃ yad yasmāt tryadhīśo harir api, ā
samyakprakāreṇa kṛtiṃ ceṣṭāṃ līlāṃ tatyāja samāptīcakāreti prakaṭo'rthaḥ
| vastutas tu nitarāṃ dhanaṃ sarvasvaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ prapañcāgocarībhūtam api
upagateṣu nikaṭaprāpteṣu vṛṣṇyādiṣu, sa tu uddhavaḥ katham avaśiṣṭaḥ,
tadīyavirahasantāpam upalabdhum ekāṃśenāpi prakaṭatayā sthityanaucityād
iti bhāvaḥ | na ca sa vṛṣṇyādiṣv aprasiddho mantavyaḥ, yataḥ adhirathety
ādi |

nanu badarīṃ tvaṃ prayāhīti bhagavadājñāṃ katham anyathā kuryāt ?
tatrāha—yasya hariḥ sarvaduḥkhahartāpi prabhuḥ ākṛtim iṅgitam api
tatyāja—ākāras tv iṅga iṅgitam ity amaraḥ | vrajadevīṣu tad yāta mā ciraṃ
goṣṭhaṃ śuśrūṣadhvaṃ patīn satīr  [bhā.pu. 10.29.22] itivad
ājñādānasamaye yadi kim apīṅgitam akariṣyat tadā mahāsubuddhir asāv
uddhavo badarikāśramaṃ nāgamiṣyat tatsamīpa evāsthāsyad ity arthaḥ ||28||


 || 3.4.29 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

brahmaśāpāpadeśena kālenāmoghavāñchitaḥ |

 saṃhṛtya svakulaṃ sphītaṃ tyakṣyan deham acintayat ||

madhvaḥ :  pṛthivīlokasantyāgo dehatyāgo hareḥ smṛtaḥ | 

nityānandasvarūpatvād anyan naivāpalabhyate ||

darśayej janamohāya sadṛśīṃ mṛtakākṛtim |

maṭavad bhagavān viṣṇuḥ parajñānākṛtiḥ svayam || iti skānde |

rājan parasya tanubhṛj jananāpyayehā

māyā viḍambanam avaihi yathā naṭasya || iti ca ||29||

śrīdharaḥ : brahmaśāpaḥ apadeśo miṣaṃ yasya tena kālena svaśaktirūpeṇa
| amoghaṃ vāñchitaṃ yasya | na hy atra śāpaḥ prabhuḥ, kintu
bhagavadicchaivety arthaḥ ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : evaṃ tyakṣyan deham iti ca jñeyam | dehaṃ virāḍākāram
| pūrvoktahetutvāt | etac ca śrīkṛṣṇasandarbhasya
trinavatitamavākyapraghaṭṭadṛṣṭyā vicāryam | tathā hi—tad evaṃ yadyapi
bhagavataḥ śrīkṛṣṇasya svayaṃbhagavattve suṣṭhu nirdhārite nityam eva
tadrūpatvenāvasthitir api svayam eva siddhā | tathāpi mandadhiyāṃ
bhrāntihānārtham idaṃ vivriyate | tatra tāvad ārādhanāvākyenaiva sā
sidhyati | ārādhyasyābhāve ārādhanānodanāyā vipralipsājanyatvāpatteḥ |
tac ca paramāpte śāstre na sambhavati | sambhave ca puruṣārthābhāvāt
śāstrānarthakyam |

āropaś ca paricchinnaguṇarūpa eva vastuni, kalpyate nānantaguṇarūpe |
śrīsvāmicaraṇair apīdam eva puṣṭam ekādaśānte dhāraṇādhyānamaṅgalaṃ
[bhā.pu. 11.31.6] ity atra dhāraṇāyā dhyānasya ca maṅgalaṃ śobhanaṃ,
viṣayam itarathā tayor nirviṣayatvaṃ syāt | dṛśyate cādyāpi tadupāsakānāṃ
sākṣātkāras tatphalasprāptiś ceti bhāvaḥ ity eṣā | śrūyate caivaṃ
pañcame navasu varṣeṣu tattadavatāropāsanādi | yathoktaṃ—navasv api
varṣeṣu bhagavān nārāyaṇo mahāpuruṣaḥ puruṣāṇāṃ
tadanugrahāyātmatattvavyūhenātmanādyāpi sannidhīyate [bhā.pu. 5.17.14]
iti |

sannidhānaṃ cedaṃ sākṣādrūpeṇa śrīpradyumnādau gativilāsāder
varṇitatvāt | tatra cātmanā svayam evety uktam | tathā nityatva eva
śālagrāmaśilādiṣu narasiṃhatvādibhedaś ca saṃgacchate |
tattadavatārasānnidhyād eva hi tattadbhedaḥ | tathā śrīkṛṣṇam
adhikṛtyāpi gītaṃ śrīkṛṣṇasahasranāmaprārambhe śrīviṣṇudharmottare—

tasya hṛṣṭāśayaḥ stutyā viṣṇur gopāṅganāvṛtaḥ |

tāpiñchaśyāmalaṃ rūpaṃ piñchottaṃsam adarśayat || iti |

agre ca tadvākyam—

mām avehi mahābhāga kṛṣṇaṃ kṛtyavidāṃ vara |

puraskṛto'smi tvadbhaktyā pūrṇāḥ santu manorathāḥ || iti |

tathā pādme nirmāṇakhaṇḍe—paśya tvaṃ darśayiṣyāmi svarūpaṃ vedagopitam
iti śrībhagavadvākyānantaraṃ brahmavākyam—

tato'paśyam ahaṃ bhūpa bālaṃ kālāmbudaprabham |

gopakanyāvṛtaṃ gopaṃ hasantaṃ gopabālakaiḥ ||

kadambamūla āsīnaṃ pītavāsasam adbhutam |

vanaṃ vṛndāvanaṃ nāma navapallavamaṇḍitam || ity ādi |

trailokyasaṃmohanatantre śrīmadaṣṭādaśākṣarajapaprasaṅge—

aharniśaṃ japed yas tu mantrī niyatamānasaḥ |

sa paśyati na sandeho gopaveśadharaṃ harim || iti |

gautamīye ca sadācāraprasaṅge—

aharniśaṃ japen mantraṃ mantrī niyatamānasaḥ |

sa paśyati na sandeho gopaveśadharaṃ harim || iti |

śrīgopālatāpanīśrutiś caivam—tad u hovāca brahmaṇo'sāv anvarataṃ me
dhyātaḥ stutaḥ parameśvaraḥ parārdhānte so'budhyata | gopaveśo me puruṣaḥ
purastād āvirbabhūva [goṭā.u. 1.29] iti siddhanirdeśo'pi śrūyate yathā
vande vṛndāvanāsīnam indirānandamandiraṃ [nā.pu. 1.1.1] iti
bṛhannāradīyārambhe maṅgalācaraṇam |

gṛhaṃ santiṣṭhate yasya māhātmyaṃ daityanāyaka |

dvārakāyāḥ samudbhūtaṃ sānnidhyaṃ keśavasya ca |

rukmiṇīsahitaḥ kṛṣṇo nityaṃ nivasate gṛhe ||

iti skānde dvārakāmāhātmye baliṃ prati śrīprahlādavākyam |

vratinaḥ kārttike māsi snātasya vidhivan mama |

gṛhāṇārghyaṃ mayā dattaṃ danujendraniṣūdana || [pa.pu. 6.93.24]

iti pādmakārttikamāhātmye tatprātaḥsnānārghyamantraś ca |

evaṃ ca śrīmadaṣṭādaśākṣarādayo mantrās
tattatparikarādiviśiṣṭatayivārādhyatvena siddhanirdeśam eva kurvanti |
tadāvaraṇādipūjāmantrāś ca | kiṃ bahunā ?
karmavipākaprāyaścittaśāstre'pi tathā śrūyate | yad āha
bodhāyanaḥ—homas tu pūrvavat kāryo govindaprītaye tataḥ ity ādy
anantaraṃ——

govinda gopījanavallabheśa

kaṃsāsuraghna tridaśendravandya |

godānatṛptaḥ kuru me dayālo

aṃśovināśaṃ kṣapitārivarga || iti |

anyatra ca yathā—

govinda gopījanavallabheśa

vidhvastakaṃsa tridaśendravandya |

govardhanādipravaraikahasta

saṃrakṣitāśeṣagavapravīṇa |

gonetraveṇukṣapaṇa prabhūtaṃ

āndhyaṃ tathograṃ timiraṃ kṣipāṃśu || iti |

spaṣṭaṃ ca tathātvaṃ śrīgopālatāpanyāṃ—govindaṃ saccidānandavigrahaṃ
vṛndāvanasurabhūruhatalāsīnaṃ satataṃ samarudgaṇo'haṃ toṣayāmi
[goṭā.u. 1.37] iti |

ata eva puraskṛto'smi tvadbhaktyā ity evoktam iti | alaṃ
caivāṃvidhapramāṇasaṅgrahaprapañcena | yataś
cicchaktyekavyañjitānāṃ tatparicchadādīnām api tathā
nityāvasthititvenāvirbhāvatirobhāvāv eva dvitīyasandarbhe sādhitau staḥ
| sarvathotpattināśau tu niṣiddhau | tatas tadavatārāṇāṃ kim uta, svayaṃ
bhagavato vā tasya kim utatarām iti | tathā ca vyākhyātaṃ jagṛhe pauruṣaṃ
rūpaṃ [bhā.pu. 1.3.1] ity atra tattvavādagurubhiḥ—vyaktyapekṣayā jagṛhe
| tathā ca tantrabhāgavate—

aheyam anupādeyaṃ yad rūpaṃ nityam avyayam |

sa evāpekṣyarūpāṇāṃ vyaktim eva janārdanaḥ ||

agṛhṇād vyasṛjac ceti rāmakṛṣṇādikāṃ tanum |

paṭhyate bhagavān īśo mūḍhabuddhivyapekṣayā ||

tamasā hy upagūḍhasya yat tamaḥpānam īśituḥ |

etat puruṣarūpasya grahaṇaṃ samudīryate ||

kṛṣṇarāmādirūpāṇāṃ loke vyaktivyapekṣayā || iti |

evam eva prathame dvādaśādhyāye vidhūya [bhā.pu. 1.12.11] ityādipadye
svāmibhir api vyākhyātam—yatra dṛṣṭas tatraivāntarhitaḥ na tv anyatra
gataḥ | yato vibhuḥ sarvagata ity eṣā |

tathā mādhvabhāṣyapramāṇitā śrutiś ca—vāsudevaḥ saṃkarṣaṇaḥ
pradyumno'niruddho'haṃ matsyaḥ kūrmo varāho narasiṃho vāmano rāmo rāmo
rāmaḥ kṛṣṇo buddhaḥ kalkir ahaṃ śatadhāhaṃ sahasradhāham ito'ham
ananto'haṃ naivaite jāyante naite mriyante | naiṣām ajñānabandho na
muktiḥ sarva eva hy ete pūrṇā ajarā amṛtāḥ paramā paramānandā iti
caturvedaśikhāyām |

tathā ca śrīnṛsiṃhapurāṇe—yuge yuge viṣṇur anādimūrtim āsthāya viśvaṃ
paripāti duṣṭahā iti |

tathā ca nṛsiṃhatāpanyāṃ tadbhāṣyakṛdbhir vyākhyātam—etan
nṛsiṃhavigrahaṃ nityam iti | śrutiś ca seyam ṛtaṃ satyaṃ paraṃ brahma
puruṣaṃ nṛkeśarivigrahaṃ [nṛṭā.u. 1.6] iti |

evaṃ ca brāhmapādmottarakhaṇḍādāv api śrīmatsyadevādīnāṃ ca pṛthak
pṛthag vaikuṇṭhādilokāḥ śrūyante | evam eva jaleṣu māṃ rakṣatu
matsyamūrtir iti nārāyaṇavarmādyuktam api saṅgacchate |

tasmāt svayaṃ bhagavati śrīkṛṣṇe'py anyathāsambhāvanam anādipāpavikṣepa
eva hetuḥ | tad evam abhipretya tān durbuddhīn api bodhayituṃ tasya
svopāsyatvaṃ pratipādayann āha patir gatiś cāndhakavṛṣṇisātvatāṃ
prasīdatāṃ me bhagavān satāṃ patiḥ [bhā.pu. 2.4.20] iti | atra
viśeṣajijñāsā cet śrīkṛṣṇasandarbho (93) dṛśyaḥ ||29||

viśvanāthaḥ : pratyuttaram āha—brahmaśāpāpadeśaḥ prapañcāgocarīkaraṇe
miṣaṃ tena svakulaṃ saṃhṛtya acintayat | kālenāpi amoghaṃ vyarthīkartum
aśakyaṃ vāñchitam icchā yasya saḥ | sphītaṃ svamaryādāto'py ativistṛtaṃ
dehaṃ tyakṣyan acintayat | taddehasya saccidānandarūpatvena
vibhutve'pi svarūpānibandhanaṃ prāpañcikalokacakṣurgocarībhūtatvam eva
sphītatvam | tatra saviśeṣaṇe hi vidhiniṣedhau viśeṣaṇam upasaṅkrāmataḥ,
sati viśeṣyabādhe iti nyāyena tyāgakriyā viśeṣaṇa evānveti, na tu
viśeṣye, yathā caitro rājā bhavati, dehaṃ puṣṭam asau cakāra, iyaṃ sādhvī
strī naṣṭābhavad iti | atra tyāgakriyāyā dehe'nvayabādho
bhagavaddehasya saccidānandarūpatvena nityatvāt | tathā hi,
mahāvārāhe—

sarve nityāḥ śāśvatāś ca dehāntasya parātmanaḥ |

hānopādānarahitā naiva prakṛtijāḥ kvacit ||

paramānandasandohā jñānamātrāś ca sarvataḥ || iti |

tathā mādhvabhāṣyapramāṇitā śrutiś ca—vāsudevaḥ saṃkarṣaṇaḥ
pradyumno'niruddho'haṃ matsyaḥ kūrmo varāho narasiṃho vāmano rāmo rāmo
rāmaḥ kṛṣṇo buddhaḥ kalkir ahaṃ śatadhāhaṃ sahasradhāham ito'ham
ananto'haṃ naivaite jāyante naite mriyante | naiṣām ajñānabandho na
muktiḥ sarva eva hy ete pūrṇā ajarā amṛtāḥ paramā paramānandā iti |

govindaṃ saccidānandavigrahaṃ vṛndāvanasurabhūruhatalāsīnaṃ satataṃ
samarudgaṇo'haṃ toṣayāmi [goṭā.u. 1.37] iti gopālatāpanī | ṛtaṃ satyaṃ
paraṃ brahma puruṣaṃ nṛkeśarivigrahaṃ [nṛṭā.u. 1.6] iti nṛsiṃhatāpanī
ca | tathātraiva kṛṣṇadyumaninimloce [bhā.pu. 3.2.7] iti |
ādāyāntaradhād yas tu svabimbaṃ lokalocanaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.2.11] iti |
vrajapuravanitānāṃ vardhayan kāmadevaṃ [bhā.pu. 10.90.48]
ityādiśrutismṛtivākyāni bahūny eva draṣṭavyāni |

atra prakaṭārthena dehatyāgam avagamayya pūrvāparavākyavirodham
anavadhāpya ca āsuraprakṛtaya eva premabhaktyamṛtād vañcitāḥ
śrībhāgavatasya mohanītve vyākhyātatvāt vyākhyāsyamānatvāc ca | nūnam iti
pāṭhe—svāṃśarūpaṃ nārāyaṇābhidham avatārakāle svasmin vaikuṇṭhād āgatya
militaṃ, samprati punar vaikuṇṭhe prasthāpayituṃ svadehād vibhajya
tyakṣyan āgatebhyo brahmādibhyaḥ pālanārthaṃ dāsyan tjajer dānārthatvāt |
dehaṃ virāḍākāraṃ pṛthvīm iti sandarbhaḥ ||29||


 || 3.4.30 ||

  asmāl lokād uparate mayi jñānaṃ madāśrayam |

arhaty uddhava evāddhā sampraty ātmavatāṃ varaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : mayy uparate sati jñānam arhati jñānayogyo bhavati ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ahaṃ śrīkṛṣṇarūpa āśrayo yasyeti jñānasyāpi
vaiśiṣṭyam uktam | ātmā aham eva paramapuruṣārthatvena vidyate yeṣāṃ
teṣām ātmavatāṃ śreṣṭhaḥ ||30||

viśvanāthaḥ : asmāt prāpañcikikāl lokād uparate
svīyarūpaguṇalīlāmādhuryavṛṣṭibhyo virate sati aham evāśrayo yasya
tat ahaṃ yaj jānāmi tad uddhavo'pi jñātum arhatīty arthaḥ | māṃ didṛkṣūn
yan mukhāj jñānaṃ jijñāsūn vadarikāśramavāsino munīn matpratimūrtitvena
jñānaṃ grāhayitum iti bhāvaḥ | ātmā aham eva svāmitvena varte yeṣāṃ teṣām
ātmavatāṃ varaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ ||30||


 || 3.4.31 ||

noddhavo'ṇv api mannyūno yad guṇair nārditaḥ prabhuḥ |

 ato madvayunaṃ lokaṃ grāhayann iha tiṣṭhatu ||

śrīdharaḥ : mattaḥ sakāśād īṣad api nyūno na bhavati | yady asmād guṇair
viṣayair na kṣobhitaḥ | madvayunaṃ madviṣayaṃ jñānaṃ lokasyopadiśan
||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yad yasmād atiśayena madanyūnatvād dhetor guṇaiḥ
sattvādibhir nārdito na pīḍitaḥ, guṇātīta ity arthaḥ | yataḥ prabhuḥ
sarvārthasamarthaś ca | madvayunaṃ madviṣayaṃ jñānaṃ grāhayann iti
badarikāśramagatāṃs taṃs tān mahāmunīn praty apīty arthaḥ | tad idaṃ
grāhaṇaṃ vyaktam akathayiṣyamāṇam api jñeyam eva |
bhagavatsaṅkalpasyānyathātvādyasambhavāt | yathoktaṃ—amoghavāñchitaḥ
[bhā.pu. 3.4.29] iti ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ : svapratimūrtitve uddhavasya yogyatām āha—aṇv api | mattaḥ
sakāśād īṣad api na nyūnaḥ yad yasmāt guṇaiḥ sattvādibhiḥ | nanu jagaty
asmin guṇātītāḥ paraḥ sahasrā jīvanmuktā guṇair anarditā eva santi | tena
kiṃ teṣāṃ bhagavatsāmyaṃ ? satyaṃ tarhy evaṃ vyākhyeyaṃ—guṇair aprākṛtair
balabuddhijñānavairāgyādibhir nārditaḥ, teṣāṃ vegadhāraṇasāmarthyam
eva tair anarditatvam atra jñeyam, yathā kāmādivegadhāraṇasāmarthyam
eva kāmādyanarditatvam ucyate | uddhavo hi adhirathayūthapeṣu mukhya ity
ucyate | tad api na kvāpi tādṛśasyāprākṛtasya balasyāviṣkāraḥ kṛta iti
balavegadhāraṇam evaṃ buddhyādīnām api vegadhāraṇaṃ jñeyam etad
evāsādhāraṇyam | prabhuḥ aham iva vaśīkṛtamāyaḥ ity arthaḥ | madvayunaṃ
majjñānam ||31||


 || 3.4.32 ||

  evaṃ trilokaguruṇā sandiṣṭaḥ śabdayoninā |

badaryāśramam āsādya harim īje samādhinā ||

madhvaḥ :  uttamair adhikatvaṃ vā sāmyaṃ vā vijayo'pi vā |

ucyate'pi tu nīcānāṃ mohārthaṃ vāpy upekṣayā |

dṛṣṭānusārād vā mūḍhaḥ kiñcitsāmyena vā kvacit || iti brahmatarke ||32||

śrīdharaḥ : evam anenābhiprāyeṇa śabdayoninā vedakartrā īje pūjayāmāsa
||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : badaryāśramaṃ prati gamanāya bhagavadādeśo'yaṃ
śrībhagavadvihāramaye'smin deśe tena sthātum aśakyatvād ity abhiprāyaḥ
| samādhinānanyamanovṛttyā | īje sākṣād iva siṣeve | tad idaṃ tu
maitreyasahitatayā sāṅkṣepeṇa tadgrahaṇānantaram eva jñeyam iti tasya
dhairyakāraṇaṃ darśitam ||32||

viśvanāthaḥ : evam anena prakāreṇa trilokasthānāṃ guruṇā keṣāṃcid
avaśiṣṭānāṃ vadarikāśramavāsinām uddhavadvārāpi guruṇety arthaḥ |
śrutadevādimilanārthaṃ bāṇādyasurajayārthaṃ pārijātādinayanārthaṃ
devakīputrādyānayanārthaṃ ca prāyo
mithilādisamastabhūtalasvargavaikuṇṭhasutalādīn gacchatā
svadarśanena svaśrīmukhajñānopadeśena ca tatratyān kṛtārthayaty api
bhagavatā badarikāśramānāgamanāt tatratyaṛṣijanānām apy utkaṇṭhām
anusmṛtya tatroddhavaḥ prasthāpitaḥ kvacit kalpe vadarikāśramo'pi preṣitaḥ
| imaṃ sandeśaṃ naranārāyaṇābhyāṃ dehīti sandeśaviṣayīkṛta ity arthaḥ |
sa ca noddhavo'ṇv apīti padyam eva śabdayonināṃ śabdānāṃ vedalakṣaṇānām
api yonir utpattir yata iti vedeṣv apy anupalabhyajñānaṃ bhagavān
jānatīti dhvaniḥ | tac coddhave nyastam ity anudhvaniḥ | uddhavamukhān
naranārāyaṇau tad eva prāpsyata iti pratyanudhvaniḥ | sandeśapatrī ca
svasti śrīmannaranārāyaṇau prati vijñāpanaṃ cedam |
sapādaśatavarṣaparyantaiva matprakaṭaprakāśagatā līlā bhavet
tanmaryādā ca | samprati vṛtteti dvārakāyāṃ saparikareṇa mayā
antardhīyate prabhāsaṃ ca gatvā avatāritān devādīn ādhikārikabhaktān
prati svāspadeṣu prasthāpya brahmaprārthitenaikenāṃśena vaikuṇṭhe
sārjunenāṃśenālakṣitaṃ yuṣmatpade ca gamyate | kiṃ ca,
matpūrṇasvarūpadarśanasyotkaṇṭhānāṃ yuṣmākaṃ kṛte
matpriyapārṣadamukhye'sminn uddhave svasārūpyasādguṇye arpite yataḥ
noddhavo'ṇv api mannyūno yad guṇair nārditaḥ prabhuḥ | ato madvayunaṃ
lokaṃ grāhayann iha tiṣṭhatu ity eṣā | iha vadarikāśrame ||32||


  || 3.4.3335 ||

viduro'py uddhavāc chrutvā kṛṣṇasya paramātmanaḥ |

  krīḍayopāttadehasya karmāṇi ślāghitāni ca ||

 dehanyāsaṃ ca tasyaivaṃ dhīrāṇāṃ dhairyavardhanam |

  anyeṣāṃ duṣkarataraṃ paśūnāṃ viklavātmanām ||

  ātmānaṃ ca kuruśreṣṭha kṛṣṇena manasekṣitam |

 dhyāyan gate bhāgavate ruroda premavihvalaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : anyeṣāṃ paśutulyānām | viklavātmanām adhīracittānām ||
manasekṣitaṃ cintitam ||3335||

kramasandarbhaḥ : vidura iti trikam | upādānam atra prakaṭanaṃ
prāpañcikabhaktasamīpānayanārthatvāt ||33|| dehanyāsam |
aprakaṭalīlāvakāśe dhāmni svavigrahasya vinyāsaṃ praveśanam ity arthaḥ |
dhīrāṇāṃ tasmin luptacittānām | tadrūpatveṇaiva tadavasthānanirṇayād
dhairyavardhanam | anyeṣāṃ tadviparītabuddhīnāṃ tattvājñānād
durvibhāvyam ity arthaḥ ||3435||

viśvanāthaḥ : krīḍayaiva kartryā upa ādhikyena ātto gṛhīto deho yasya
tasya līlāśakter adhīna eva sa tasya dehas tayaiva śaktyāvirbhāvyate
cāntardhāpyate ceti bhāvaḥ | tathā evam anena prakāreṇa tasya dhīrāṇāṃ
yādavādīnām api dehānāṃ nyāsaṃ dvāradāyām aprakaṭaprakāśe'rpaṇam |
prabhāse ca punas tyāgaṃ śrutvā kīdṛśaṃ dhairyavardhanaṃ tathā śrutvaiva
viduro hṛdi dhairyam abadhnād ity arthaḥ | yad vā, tad api
dhairyacchedanaṃ vardhacchedane | punaḥ kīdṛśaṃ ? anyeṣām abhaktānāṃ
yoginām api atiśayena duṣkaram | ekatra deśe dehasyāntardhānam anyatra
deśe tyāgatvena loke jñāpanam iti yogibhir duṣkaram ity arthaḥ | paśūnām
iti bhaktābhāvād iti bhāvaḥ | viklavātmanām evaṃ kartuṃ vyākulamanasām
ātmānaṃ svam ||3335||


 || 3.4.36 ||

kālindyāḥ katibhiḥ siddha ahobhir bharatarṣabha |

prāpadyata svaḥsaritaṃ yatra mitrāsuto muniḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kālindyāḥ sakāśāt siddha eva viduraḥ katipayair dinaiḥ
svaḥsaritaṃ gaṅgāṃ prāpadyata prāptaḥ ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : kālindyāḥ sakāśāt katibhir ahobhiḥ siddhe niṣpaṇṇe sati
bhāve ktaḥ | katiṣu ahaḥsu vṛtteṣu satsv ity arthaḥ | svaḥsaritaṃ gaṅgāṃ
prāpadyata prāptaḥ ||36||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīye'tra caturtho'pi saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe

viduroddhavasaṃvāde

 caturtho'dhyāyaḥ |

||3.4||

 (3.5)

 (3.5)

  pañcamo'dhyāyaḥ

 || 3.5.1 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

dvāri dyunadyā ṛṣabhaḥ kurūṇāṃ

maitreyam āsīnam agādhabodham |

kṣattopasṛtyācyutabhāvasiddhaḥ

 papraccha sauśīlyaguṇābhitṛptaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

 uktaś caturbhir adhyāyaiḥ kṣattur maitreyasaṅgamaḥ |

saṃvādas tu tayoḥ skandha dvayenātha nigadyate ||

dyunadyā gaṅgāyā dvāri haridvāre āsīnaṃ na tu karmavyagram | tatra
hetuḥ—agādho'paricchinno bodho yasyeti | maitreyasya sauśīlyam ārjavādi,
guṇāś ca karuṇādayas tair abhitṛptaḥ | pāṭhāntare kṣattuḥ sauśīlyādibhir
abhitṛptaṃ santuṣṭaṃ maitreyam ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sauśīlyaṃ susvabhāvaḥ tatpradhānā guṇās tais tṛpto
mānādīcchārahitaḥ pāṭhāntare kṣattuḥ sauśīlyādibhir abhitṛptaṃ santuṣṭaṃ
maitreyam ||2||

viśvanāthaḥ :

  pañcame jagataḥ sṛṣṭyādy apṛcchat sukhaduḥkhinaḥ |

  kṣattrā pratyāha maitreyaḥ sargaṃ tattvaiḥ stavaṃ hareḥ ||

 bhaṅgyā caturbhir adhyāyair āśrayasyāṅginaḥ sthitim |

uktvā tadaṅgeṣūkto'pi sargaḥ sa vyāsam ucyate ||

dyunadyā gaṅgāyāḥ dvāri haridvāre āsīnaṃ, na tu kāryavyagryam |
prathamāntapāṭhe—maitreyasya sauśīlyaguṇaḥaḥ santuṣṭaḥ,
dvitīyāntapāṭhe—vidurasya ||1||


 || 3.5.2 ||

vidura uvāca—

  sukhāya karmāṇi karoti loko

 na taiḥ sukhaṃ vānyadupāramaṃ vā |

vindeta bhūyas tata eva duḥkhaṃ

yad atra yuktaṃ bhagavān vaden naḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : praśnān evāha—sukhāyeti pañcadaśabhiḥ | taiḥ karmabhiḥ |
sukhaṃ vānyasya suḥkhasyopaśamaṃ vety arthaḥ | athavānyad vā na vindeta |
kiṃ tat ? ity apekṣāyāṃ tasyaiva nirdeśaḥ | upāramaṃ veti | tatas taiḥ
karmabhir bhūyaḥ punaḥ punar duḥkham eva vindeta | atraivaṃ vidhe saṃsāre
no'smākaṃ yad yuktaṃ kartuṃ yogyaṃ tatsarvajño bhagavān vaden nirūpayatu
||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra yadyapi viduraḥ śrībhagavadiṣṭajñānaṃ śrotum
abhīṣṭavān pṛṣṭavāṃś ca śrīmaduddhavaṃ prati pūrvaṃ śrīmaduddhavena ca
śrīmaitreyaṃ prati praṣṭuṃ śrībhagavadājñānusāreṇopadiṣṭaḥ | tathāpi
taṃ prati tam anupṛṣṭavāṃs tat khalu
śrīmaduddhavaviṣayakapraśnānantaraṃ jātena dainyasvabhāvenaiva |
dainyaṃ ca śrībhagavatā svapratinidhirūpoddhavadvārānupadeśenātmani
nātiyogyatāmananāt śrībhagavāṃs tu tasya śrīmaduddhavāc
catuḥślokīmaṭreṇa manaḥprakāśābhāvaṃ tathā bahūṃś ca praṣṭavyān arthān
vijñāya tāvat saṃvādanirviṇṇena tena tan nopadideśa, kintu tatra yogyena
maitreyeṇaiveti | tasmād ātmani tajjñānayogyatvāpādanasādhanāyaiva sa
nivedayati sukhāyeti tribhiḥ | tatrātmanaḥ sādhāraṇyāya | lokamātrasya
dausthyaṃ prathamena tādṛśaṃ vinānyāśrayarāhityaṃ dvitīyena |
abhīṣṭaprārthanaṃ tṛtīyena jñeyam ||2||

viśvanāthaḥ : atra bhagavadupadiṣṭaṃ rahasyaṃ jñānam uddhavāt prāpya
svasya tatrāyogyatāṃ matvā atinirviṇṇa eva viduro manasi parāmamarśa |
tasyānuraktasya muner mukundaḥ parmodabhārānatakandharasya | āśṛṇvato mām
anurāgahāsasamīkṣayā viśramayann uvācety uddhavokteḥ |
paramāntaraṅgasvabhaktacūḍāmaṇim uddhavam eva bhagavān rahasyaṃ
svajñānam upadideśa, na tu śṛṇvantam api | maivam | tad ahaṃ
tajjñānārtham imam ajānantaṃ mahānubhāvaṃ prathamaṃ na prārthayiṣyan
kintu svajijñāssitam eva yat kiñcit pṛcchāmi | yadi ca tad ayaṃ jānāti
tadā bho vidura tvadarthaṃ bhagavatāham ādiṣṭo bhagavatproktaṃ
tasyājatvajanmavattvādivirodhaparihārakam atirahasyajñānaṃ tvaṃ
gṛhāṇeti svayam eva vakṣyatīty ata āha sukhāyety ādi | taiḥ karmabhiḥ
sukhaṃ vā anyat duḥkhopaśamanaṃ vā uparamaṃ vairāgyaṃ vā na vindeta |
kintu bhūyo bhūyaḥ kṛtebhyas tebhyaḥ karmabhyo duḥkham eva | atra praśne
yad yuktaṃ tad uttaraṃ no asmān vadatu bhavān ||2||


 || 3.5.3 ||

janasya kṛṣṇād vimukhasya daivād

adharmaśīlasya suduḥkhitasya |

anugrahāyeha caranti nūnaṃ

bhūtāni bhavyāni janārdanasya ||

śrīdharaḥ : daivāt prācīnakarmaṇo nimittabhūtāt kṛṣṇād
vimukhasyāto'dharmaśīlasyātaḥ suduḥkhitasya janasyānugrahāya bhavyāni
maṅgalāni bhūtāni caranti | bhavantaḥ paropakārasvabhāvā evety arthaḥ
||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : janasyeti | daivāt prācīnakarmaṇo hetos tadāveśād
adharmaśīlasya bhagavaddharmarahitasyety arthaḥ ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : sarvabhūtānugrāhakā bhavadvidhā mahābhāgavatā eva tattvaṃ
jānantīty āha—bhavyāni bhūtāni maṅgalarūpā bhaktāḥ ||3||


 || 3.5.4 ||

  tat sādhuvaryādiśa vartma śaṃ naḥ

  saṃrādhito bhagavān yena puṃsām |

hṛdi sthito yacchati bhaktipūte

 jñānaṃ satattvādhigamaṃ purāṇam ||

śrīdharaḥ : tat tasmāt he sādhuvarya, śaṃ sukharūpaṃ vartma na ādiśa
kathaya | yena vartmanā saṃrādhito hṛdisthitaḥ san | satattvādhigama
ātmāpārokṣyaṃ tatsahitam | purāṇam anādivedapramāṇakam ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tat sādhv iti bhaktipūte premavimale | sattvaṃ jñānaṃ
tac ca brahmabhagavatparamātmety āvirbhāvam ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : śaṃ sukharūpaṃ vartma bhajanamārgaṃ no'smān ādiśa | sa
prasiddho bhagavān | tattvasya—vadanti tat tattvavidaḥ [bhā.pu. 1.2.11]
ity anenoktasya brahmaparamātmabhagavatsvarūpasyādhigamo yasmāt
tajjñānaṃ yacchati | yad uktaṃ—

tac chraddadhānā munayo jñānavairāgyayuktayā |

paśyanty ātmani cātmānaṃ bhaktyā śrutagṛhītayā || [bhā.pu. 1.2.12] iti |

purāṇaṃ purātanaṃ na mīmāṃsādikam ivārvācīnam ||4||


 || 3.5.5 ||

karoti karmāṇi kṛtāvatāro

  yāny ātmatantro bhagavāṃs tryadhīśaḥ |

 yathā sasarjāgra idaṃ nirīhaḥ

 saṃsthāpya vṛttiṃ jagato vidhatte ||

śrīdharaḥ : karoti karmāṇītyādīnāṃ varṇayeti pañcamaśloke
kriyāsaṃbandhaḥ | yathā yena prakāreṇa puruṣarūpeṇa kṛtāvatāraḥ san
tryadhīśaḥ triguṇamāyāniyantā, ataḥ svatantra eva, yāni karmāṇi
karoti | karmāṇy eva viśeṣataḥ pṛcchati—yathetyādinā | nirīho niṣkriyo
niḥspṛho vā saṃsthāpya susthitaṃ kṛtvā | vṛttiṃ jīvikām ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra bahuṣu sādhaneṣu satsu nijahṛdyaṃ
nivedayati—karotīty ādibhiḥ | ṭīkāyāṃ yathetyādineti | ubhayatrāpi
yathāśabdasya sambandhāt pūrvam api yojitam ||5||

viśvanāthaḥ :  karoti karmāṇītyādīnāṃ varṇayeti pañcamaślokasthenānvayaḥ
| tryadhīśaḥ puruṣatrayeśaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ karmāṇi govardhanoddharaṇādīnī |
triguṇamāyādhiṣṭhātā mahāviṣṇuś ca yathā idam agre pūrvamahākalpānte
saṃsthāpya saṃhṛtya punar etanmahākalpādau sasarja, sṛṣṭvā ca vṛttiṃ
jīvikāṃpālanam ity arthaḥ ||5||


 || 3.5.6 ||

yathā punaḥ sve kha idaṃ niveśya

śete guhāyāṃ sa nivṛttavṛttiḥ |

yogeśvarādhīśvara eka etad

anupraviṣṭo bahudhā yathāsīt ||

śrīdharaḥ : sve svīye sve hṛdayākāśe niveśya sthāpayitvā | nivṛttā vṛttayo
yasya | guhāyāṃ yogamāyāyām | bahudhā brahmādirūpeṇa ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sve svasvarūpe khe ākāśe ākāśas talliṅgād
ityādinyāyena brahmakhe niveśya vilāpya guhāyāṃ kasmiṃścit
sarvāgocarapradeśe tattādātmyena tiṣṭhati mahat sraṣṭṛpuruṣa iti śeṣaḥ
||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : yathā punaś ca sve svīye hṛdayākāśe niveśya sthāpayitvā
guhāyāṃ sarvāgamyatvād virajāyāṃ nadyām ity arthaḥ |
nivṛttamāyāguṇavṛttiḥ | punaś ca etaj jagat sṛṣṭvānupraviṣṭaḥ | bahudhā
devamanuṣyādirūpo yathāsīd iti sṛṣṭyādipraśnapaunaḥpunyaṃ prati
mahākalpagatā sṛṣṭyādilīlā ekarūpā bhinnarūpā veti jijñāsayā ||6||


 || 3.5.7 ||

krīḍan vidhatte dvijagosurāṇāṃ

  kṣemāya karmāṇy avatārabhedaiḥ |

mano na tṛpyaty api śṛṇvatāṃ naḥ

 suślokamauleś caritāmṛtāni ||

śrīdharaḥ : matsyādyavatārabhedaiḥ krīḍan yāni yathā karmāṇi vidhatte |
punar viśeṣaṃ praṣṭum autsukyam āviṣkaroti—mana iti | suślokāḥ
puṇyakīrtayaḥ, teṣāṃ maulir ivādhikyenoparivirājamānaḥ, tasyety arthaḥ
||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : avatārabhedair matsyakūrmādibhiḥ ||7||


 || 3.5.8 ||

  yais tattvabhedair adhilokanātho

 lokān alokān saha lokapālān |

acīkÿpad yatra hi sarvasattva

  nikāyabhedo'dhikṛtaḥ pratītaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : adhilokanātho lokanāthādhipatiḥ | alokān lokālokaparvatād
bahirbhāgān | acīkÿpat kalpayām āsa | yatra yeṣu sarvāṇi yāni sattvāni,
teṣāṃ nikāyāḥ, teṣāṃ bhedo'dhikṛtas tattatkarmādhikārī āśrita iti vā
||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tattvabhedair vairājapādādibhiḥ pṛthivyādyair lokān
pātālādīn alokān lokālokaparvatād bahirbhāgān acīkÿpat kalpayāmāsa,
yatra yeṣu sarvaprāṇinikāyānāṃ bhedo nānāviśeṣo'dhikṛtaḥ
bhaktijñānayogakarmādyadhikārī bhavet | pratītaḥ khyāto'bādhitaś ca
||8||


 || 3.5.9 ||

 yena prajānām uta ātmakarma

 rūpābhidhānāṃ ca bhidāṃ vyadhatta |

  nārāyaṇo viśvasṛg ātmayonir

  etac ca no varṇaya vipravarya ||

śrīdharaḥ : utāpi ca yena prakāreṇa jīvānām ātmā svabhāvas tatkṛtaṃ karma
tatkṛtaṃ rūpaṃ tatkṛtā abhidhās tāsāṃ bhedaṃ kṛtavān | viśvasraṣṭā
svayam ātmayoniḥ svataḥ siddhaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : uta api ca, yena prakāreṇa jīvānām ātmā svabhāvaḥ,
tadanusṛtaṃ karma, karmānusṛtaṃ rūpaṃ, rūpānusṛtā abhidhā, tāsāṃ bhedaṃ
kṛtavān, nārāyaṇa eva viśvasṛgviśvasṛṣṭyartham ātmayonir brahmā sann
ity arthaḥ ||9||


 || 3.5.10 ||

  parāvareṣāṃ bhagavan vratāni

 śrutāni me vyāsamukhād abhīkṣṇam |

  atṛpnuma kṣullasukhāvahānāṃ

  teṣām ṛte kṛṣṇakathāmṛtaughāt ||

madhvaḥ : ṛte avagame, ṛ gatau iti dhātoḥ teṣāṃ tātparyāvagame
kṛṣṇakaṣṭamṛtaugha evāsau yataḥ ||10||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu mahābhārate tvayā sarvaṃ śrutam eva, kiṃ punaḥ praśnaiḥ ?
tatrāha—pare traivarṇikā avare śūdrādayaḥ, teṣāṃ vratāni dharmāḥ | me mayā
| abhīkṣṇaṃ punaḥ punaḥ | teṣāṃ śravaṇenātṛpnuma tṛptāḥ sma | teṣāṃ
tucchasukhāvahatvāt | yas tu tatra kṛṣṇakathāmṛtaughaḥ sūcitas tasmād
ṛte | tatra tv alaṃbuddhir nāstīty arthaḥ ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv etat sarvaṃ mahābhārate tvayā śrutam eva, tatrāha—pare
devādyā avare paśvādyās teṣāṃ vratāni svabhāvās teṣāṃ tair atṛpnuma tṛptāḥ
smaḥ, nāgnis tṛpyati kāṣṭhānām itivat ṣaṣṭhī | kṣullaṃ tucchaṃ kintu yas
tatra kṛṣṇakaṣṭamṛtaughas tasmād ṛte | tena yad yan mayā pṛcchyate, tat
tat sarvaṃ kṛṣṇakaṣṭamṛtasampṛktam eva tvayā vaktavyam iti bhāvaḥ ||10||


 || 3.5.11 ||

  kas tṛpnuyāt tīrthapado'bhidhānāt

satreṣu vaḥ sūribhir īḍyamānāt |

 yaḥ karṇanāḍīṃ puruṣasya yāto

 bhavapradāṃ geharatiṃ chinatti ||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra hetuḥ—ka iti | tīrthapadaḥ kṛṣṇasya | abhidhānāt
kathāmṛtaughāt | satreṣu samājeṣu | sūribhir nāradādibhiḥ ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu kṛṣṇakathāpi tvayā bahuśa eva śrutā, tatrāha—ka iti |
abhidhānāt nāmata eva kim uta kathābhyaḥ | yad vā, abhidhānāt
kathanamātrāt lyablope pañcamīyam ||11||


 || 3.5.12 ||

munir vivakṣur bhagavadguṇānāṃ

sakhāpi te bhāratam āha kṛṣṇaḥ |

  yasmin nṛṇāṃ grāmyasukhānuvādair

  matir gṛhītā nu hareḥ kathāyām ||

śrīdharaḥ : mahābhāratasyāpy atraiva tātparyam ity āha—muniḥ kṛṣṇo
vedavyāso bhagavadguṇān mokṣadharmānte nārāyaṇīyākhyāne vaktum icchuḥ
san | arthakāmādivarṇanaṃ tu harikathāyāṃ matipraveśārtham evety
āha—yasminn iti | nṛṇāṃ matir grāmyasukhānuvādair dvārabhūtair nu
niścitaṃ hareḥ kathāyāṃ gṛhītā nītā | tad uktam itihāsasamuccaye—

kāmino varṇayan kāmān lobhaṃ lubdhasya varṇayan |

naraḥ kiṃ phalam āpnoti kūpe'ndham iva pātayan |

lokacittāvatārārthaṃ varṇayitvātra tena tau |

itihāsaiḥ pavitrārthaiḥ punar atraiva ninditau |

anyathā ghorasaṃsārabandhahetū janasya tau |

varṇayet sa kathaṃ vidvān mahākāruṇiko muniḥ || iti ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : munir vivakṣur iti | yasmin grāmyasukhānuvādaprāye |
kauravādīnāṃ kathāyāṃ śrīkṛṣṇakathānugatau | tad etad vidurasya
śrīvyāsāc chravaṇaṃ ca tīrthāṭanasamaya eva jñeyam ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : mahābhāratasyāpi vastutas tatraiva tātparyam ity āha—muniḥ
kṛṣṇo vedavyāsaḥ | guṇānām iti dvitīyāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhī | yad vā, utkarṣam ity
ākṣepalabhyaṃ, yasmin bhārate grāmyasukhānuvādaiḥ
arthakāmakathānukathanair nṛṇāṃ viṣayalubdhānām api matir gṛhītā
vyāsena svahastavaśīkṛtā kimarthaṃ hareḥ kathāyāṃ
bhagavadgītānārāyaṇīyopākhyānādiṣu praveśayitum ity ākṣepagamyam |
anyathā paramārthakaṣṭam aśṛṇvantas te tatsamīpam eva naivāyāsyan | tad
uktam itihāsasamuccaye—

kāmino varṇayan kāmān lobhaṃ lubdhasya varṇayan |

naraḥ kiṃ phalam āpnoti kūpe'ndham iva pātayan ||

lokacittāvatārārthaṃ varṇayitvātra tena tau |

itihāsaiḥ pavitrārthaiḥ punar atraiva ninditau ||

anyathā ghorasaṃsārabandhahetū janasya tau |

varṇayet sa kathaṃ vidvān mahākāruṇiko muniḥ || iti ||12||


 || 3.5.13 ||

 sā śraddadhānasya vivardhamānā

viraktim anyatra karoti puṃsaḥ |

  hareḥ padānusmṛtinirvṛtasya

  samastaduḥkhāpyayam āśu dhatte ||

madhvaḥ: hareḥ kathāyāṃ vivardhamānā matiḥ ||13||

śrīdharaḥ : śrīharikathāyāṃ mitipraveśasya phalam āha—sā katha matir vā
| anyatra grāmyasukhe | tataḥ kim ata āha—harer iti ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sā hareḥ kathā | samasteti śrīharisākṣātkāreṇeti
bhāvaḥ ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ : harikathāyāṃ matipraveśasya phalam adhikāribhedenāha—sā
harikathā śraddadhānasya harikathāyām eva paramapuruṣārthabuddhyā
viśvasataḥ śuddhabhaktasyety arthaḥ | anyatra dharmārthakāmamokṣeṣu |
nanu kathaṃ mokṣe'pi viraktiṃ cet karoti tataḥ kathaṃ nirvṛtiḥ
saṃsāraduḥkhanāśo vā ? tatrāha—hareḥ padayor anusmṛtiḥ pratikṣaṇam eva
mādhuryānubhūtis tayaiva nirvṛtasya labdhaparamānandasya puṃsaḥ
samastaduḥkho yaḥ saṃsāras tasyāpi apyayaṃ nāśaṃ tatrāpi āśu śīghram eva
||13||


 || 3.5.14 ||

 tāñ chocyaśocyān avido'nuśoce

hareḥ kathāyāṃ vimukhān aghena |

 kṣiṇoti devo'nimiṣas tu yeṣām

āyur vṛthāvādagatismṛtīnām ||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃbhūtāyāṃ kathāyāṃ ye na ramante, tān śocati | śocyā ye,
teṣām api śocyāṃś ca | tatrāvido bhāratatātparyān abhijñān śocyān | ye tu
jñātvāpi hareḥ kathāyāṃ vimukhāḥ, tāṃs teṣām api śocyān iti yojyam |
animiṣaḥ kālo yeṣām āyuḥ kṣipati | atraiva hetuḥ—vṛthaiva
vādagatismṛtayo vāgdehamanovyāpārā yeṣām ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atra trividhā eva janā dṛśyante, kecid āveśena
harikathāyāṃ śrotāraḥ kecid anāveśena kecit tu vimukhā eveti |
tatrāveśinām anāveśinaḥ śocyāḥ | vimukhās tv anāveśinām apīti
paryālocyāha—tān iti | spaṣṭam eva ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : atra harikathāyāṃ trividhā janāḥ sambhavanti—śraddadhānā
aśraddadhānā vimukhāś ca | śrībhāgavatamate bhaktau
paramapuruṣārthatvena viśvasantaḥ śraddadhānā ucyante—

tāvat karmāṇi kurvīta na nirvidyeta yāvatā |

matkathāśravaṇādau vā śraddhā yāvan na jāyate || [bhā.pu. 11.20.9]

jātaśraddho matkathāsu [bhā.pu. 11.20.27] ity ādau, tathā
pratipādayiṣyamāṇatvāt | puruṣārthasādhanamātratvenaiva
viśvasanto'śraddadhānāḥ | bhaktyā vinaiva puruṣārthān siṣādhayiṣavo
vimukhāḥ, tatra prathamān sābhinandanam uktvā dvitīyān ullaṅghya tṛtīyān
śocati—śuddhabhaktair ye śocyāḥ svargamokṣādisādhanaratās tair api
bhaktirahitakarmajñānayogādimato'nuśocāmi | tatra hetuḥ—avdiaḥ
śāstrāny adhītyādhītyāpi tattātparyam aviduṣaḥ, yato harer ity ādi |
aghena prācīnārvācīnamahāparādhenaiva hetunety arthaḥ | animiṣaḥ kālaḥ |
nanu te'pi svasvamatasthāpane nānāvādanānāgatinānāsmṛtyādimantaḥ
sabhāyāṃ pragalbhante, tatra sadhikkāram āha—vṛthety ādi ||14||


 || 3.5.15 ||

 tad asya kauṣārava śarmadātur

hareḥ kathām eva kathāsu sāram |

uddhṛtya puṣpebhya ivārtabandho

 śivāya naḥ kīrtaya tīrthakīrteḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tat tasmād dhe kaupārava ! asya viśvasya śivāya kathāsu
sārabhūtāṃ hareḥ kathām evoddhṛtya naḥ kīrtaya | yathā puṣpebhyo madhu
madhupa uddharati tadvad uddhṛtya ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tat tasmāt he kauśārava ||15||


 || 3.5.16 ||

  sa viśvajanmasthitisaṃyamārthe

 kṛtāvatāraḥ pragṛhītaśaktiḥ |

cakāra karmāṇy atipūruṣāṇi

  yānīśvaraḥ kīrtaya tāni mahyam ||

śrīdharaḥ : viśeṣataḥ śrīkṛṣṇakathā kathanīyety āśayenāha—sa iti | yo
viśvasargādyarthaṃ pūrvaṃ gṛhītaśaktiḥ sa eva puruṣeṣu kṛtāvatāraḥ san
puruṣān atikramya vartamānāni yāni cakāra tāni vistarād vada ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atra viśeṣataḥ śrīkṛṣṇakathānuraktatve'pi
virahaduḥkhavṛddhibhayāt sāmānyata eva pṛcchati—sa viśveti | ata eva
śrīmaitreyo'pi tatkathāṃ na prastutavān iti jñeyam | kutaḥ ? sampraty
avatāro yena saḥ śrīkṛṣṇo janmādyarthapragṛhītaśaktitrayaḥ san yāni
cakāreti yojyam ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : ato nirākāṅkṣatvārtham uktalakṣaṇānāṃ matpraśnānām uttaraṃ
saṅkṣepeṇoktvā madhureṇa samāpayed iti nyāyena śṛṅkhalāvatārakathaiva
vistārya kīrtanīyety āha—sa iti | kṛtāḥ pūrvaṃ puruṣādayo'vatārā yena sa
mahyaṃ māṃ prasādayitum ||16||


 || 3.5.17 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

sa evaṃ bhagavān pṛṣṭaḥ kṣattrā kauṣāravo muniḥ |

 puṃsāṃ niḥśreyasārthena tam āha bahu mānayan ||

śrīdharaḥ : puṃsāṃ niḥśreyasam evārthaḥ prayojanaṃ tena hetunā pṛṣṭaḥ
||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : puṃsāṃ sarveṣām eva puruṣāṇāṃ yan niḥśreyasaṃ maṅgalaṃ
bhaktirūpaṃ, tad evārthaḥ puruṣārtho yasya tena ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ : kṣattrā kīdṛśena ? puṃsāṃ kalau janiṣyamāṇānāṃ niḥśreyasaṃ
nistāra evārtho yasya tena tasya śrīkṛṣṇapārṣadatvena kṛtārthatvād eveti
bhāvaḥ ||17||


 || 3.5.18 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ tvayā sādho lokān sādhv anugṛhṇatā |

  kīrtiṃ vitanvatā loke ātmano'dhokṣajātmanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : bahumānam evāha—sādhv iti pañcabhiḥ | adhokṣaje evātmā mano
yasya tasyātmanaḥ svasya kīrtiṃ ca prasaṅgād vitanvatā ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : adhokṣaja eva ātmā mano yasya ātmanaḥ svasya ||18||


 || 3.5.19 ||

 naitac citraṃ tvayi kṣattar bādarāyaṇavīryaje |

 gṛhīto'nanyabhāvena yat tvayā harir īśvaraḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : harir yad gṛhītaḥ etac citraṃ na bhavati | kutaḥ ?
bādarāyaṇavīryajo dhṛtarāṣṭro'pi bhavati, satyam, parantu tvayi tato
viśeṣa ity āha—gṛhīta iti ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tvayy etan nāścaryaṃ, yato bādarāyaṇasya vīryāj jātaḥ, yataś
ca gṛhīta ity ādi ||19||


 || 3.5.20 ||

 māṇḍavyaśāpād bhagavān prajāsaṃyamano yamaḥ |

  bhrātuḥ kṣetre bhujiṣyāyāṃ jātaḥ satyavatīsutāt ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu tarhi kathaṃ śūdratvaṃ ? kathaṃ ca lokānugrāhakatvaṃ ?
tatrāha—māṇḍavyaśāpād iti | bhrātur vicitravīryasya kṣetre kṣetratvena
svīkṛtāyāṃ bhujiṣyāyāṃ dāsyāṃ yama eva tvaṃ jāto'si ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : na tvaṃ prākṛto lokas tvām ahaṃ paricinomy evety
āha—māṇḍavyeti | bhrātur vicitravīryasya kṣetre kṣetratvenan svīkṛtāyāṃ
bhujiṣyāyāṃ dāsyām ||20||


 || 3.5.21 ||

 bhavān bhagavato nityaṃ sammataḥ sānugasya ha |

  yasya jñānopadeśāya mādiśad bhagavān vrajan ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, bhavān iti | kutaḥ ? yasya tava jñānopadeśāya mām
ādiṣṭavān | cakārāt svayam api smṛtyaivopadiṣṭavān iti ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sānugasyeha yaj jñānopadeśāya ca mām ādiśad bhagavān
aja iti sambandhoktipāṭhaḥ ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : na kevalaṃ mamatvena tvam adhikṛtabhakta eva, kintu
bhagavannityapārṣado'pi prakārāntare bhavasīty āha—bhavān iti | mā māṃ
vrajan vaikuṇṭhaṃ gacchan ||21||


 || 3.5.22 ||

atha te bhagavallīlā yogamāyorubṛṃhitāḥ |

  viśvasthityudbhavāntārthā varṇayāmy anupūrvaśaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : viśvasthityādayo'rthā viṣayā yāsāṃ tāḥ ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tatra prathamaṃ yathā sasarjāgra idaṃ nirīha iti
tatpraśnasyottaratvena puruṣāvatāralīlāṃ vacmīty āha—yogamāyā
svarūpaśaktivṛttiviśeṣaḥ tayā upabṛṃhitāḥ svāṃśamāyādvārā vistāritāḥ
viśvasthityādayaḥ arthā viṣayā yāsāṃ tāḥ | māyāśakter
yogamāyāṃśabhūtatvasya nāradapañcarātre dṛṣṭatvāt ||22||


 || 3.5.23 ||

bhagavān eka āsedam agra ātmātmanāṃ vibhuḥ |

  ātmecchānugatāv ātmā nānāmatyupalakṣaṇaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : ātmanāṃ vibhujīvādhipatiḥ ||23||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra sṛṣṭilīlāṃ varṇayituṃ tataḥ pūrvāvasthām āha—idaṃ
viśvam agre sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvaṃ paramātmā bhagavān eka eva āsa āsīt | ātmanāṃ
jīvānām ātmā svarūpaṃ vibhuḥ svāmī ca | nānyad draṣṭṛdṛśyātmakaṃ kiñcid
āsīt | kāraṇātmanā sattve'pi pṛthak pratīty abhāvād ity āha—anānām
atyupalakṣaṇo nānād raṣṭṛdṛśyādimatibhir nopalakṣyata iti tathā | yad
vā, akārapraśleṣaṃ vinaivāyam arthaḥ | yaḥ sṛṣṭau nānāmatibhir
upalakṣyate sa tadaika evāsīd iti | kutaḥ ? ātmecchā māyā tasyā anugatau
laye sati | yad vā, ātmana ekākitvenāvasthānecchāyām anuvṛttāyām ity
arthaḥ ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha tatprārthitalīlākathāṃ kathayann eva
śrīmadbhagavadādiṣṭacatuḥślokījñānaṃ vivṛtyāha—bhagavān ity ādi,
aśeṣasaṅkleśaśamaṃ vidhatte [bhā.pu. 3.7.14] ityādyantena granthena |
atha kathākramānurodhena caturṇām arthā viparyayeṇa vaktavyāḥ | tatra
aham evāsam evāgre nānyad yat sad asat paraṃ [bhā.pu. 2.9.32] ity
ardhasyārthaṃ sṛṣṭilīlopakrameṇa darśayati—bhagavān iti dvābhyām | idaṃ
viśvaṃ puruṣādipārthivaparyantaṃ tadānīm ekākinā sthitena bhagavatā
sahaikībhūyāsīd ity arthaḥ | ātmanāṃ śuddhajīvānām api raśmisthānīyānām
ātmā maṇḍalasthānīyaṃ paramasvarūpam | na ca tasyāpy anyat tad asti,
yata ātmā svayaṃ siddhasvarūpa ity arthaḥ | iti tatra svāṃśānām apy
aṃśitvaṃ darśitam | brahmābhinnatvaṃ ca | kadā ? ātmecchā tasya
sṛṣṭyādīcchā tasyānugatau līnatāyāṃ satyām ity arthaḥ | nanu
vaikuṇṭhādibahuvaibhave'pi sati katham eka evāsīt ? tatrāha—vaikuṇṭhādi
nānāmatyāpi sa evaika upalakṣita iti | senāsametatve'pi rājāsau
prayātītivat ||23||

viśvanāthaḥ : sṛṣṭilīlāṃ varṇayituṃ tataḥ pūrvāvasthām āha—idaṃ viśvam
agre sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvaṃ bhagavān ṣaḍaiśvaryapūrṇa eka eva āsa āsīt |
bhagavati līnatvena bhagavato'dhiṣṭhānakāraṇatvād ity eke |
bhagavacchaktikāryatvād ity anye | yad vā, idam agre ity ekapadyena
asyāḥ sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvam ity arthaḥ | tathā sa eva yogamārgeṇopāsya ātmanāṃ
jīvānām ātmā antaryāmī, tathā sa eva jñānamārgeṇopāsyaḥ sarvavyāpako
brahmety arthaḥ | evam upāsakānāṃ bhaktayogijñānināṃ matabhedān
nānāmatibhir upalakṣaṇaṃ yasya saḥ | tathaiva śrutayo'pi, yathā—vāsudevo
vā idam agra āsīn, na brahmā, na ca śaṃkara iti | eko nārāyaṇa evāsīn na
brahmā neśāna iti | ātmaivam agra āsīd iti | sad evāsīd ity ādyāḥ |

nanu sṛṣṭeḥ pūrvam api kaṃ samayam ārabhya sa eka āsety apekṣāyām
āha—ātmanāṃ jīvānāṃ tathā icchāyāḥ sisṛkṣāyāś ca anugatau laye sati
prācīnaprākṛtikapralayam ārabhyety arthaḥ ||23||


 || 3.5.24 ||

  sa vā eṣa tadā draṣṭā nāpaśyad dṛśyam ekarāṭ |

 mene'santam ivātmānaṃ suptaśaktir asuptadṛk ||

madhvaḥ : paramātmā yato jīvaṃ mene'santam aśaktitaḥ |

asannasāvato nityaṃ satyajñāno yato hariḥ || ity āgneye |

śakyatvāt śaktayo bhāryāḥ śaktiṃ sāmarthyam ucyate iti brahmatarke |

suptis tu prakṛteḥ proktā atīva bhagavadratiḥ |

anāsthānyatra ca proktā viṣṇottamś cakṣur nimīlanam || iti
vyomasaṃhitāyām ||24||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra prathamaṃ māyodbhavaprakāram āha dvābhyām | sa vai eṣa
draṣṭā san dṛśya nāpaśyat | yata ekarāṭ eka eva tadā prakāśate | ātmānam
asantam iva mene | dṛśyābhāve draṣṭṛtvābhāvāt | tadāha—suptā māyādyāḥ
śaktayo yasya saḥ | na tv asantam eva mene | yato'suptā dṛk cicchaktir
yasyeti |

kramasandarbhaḥ : dṛśyaṃ viśvaṃ nāpaśyat | taddarśanābhāvādeva
tallīnamāsīdity arthaḥ | tathātmānam ātmāṃśaṃ puruṣam api asantamiva mene
bhedena nāpaśyadity arthaḥ | śaktirmāyā | dṛk cicchaktiḥ
svarūpabhūtāntaraṅgaśaktirity arthaḥ | ekarāṭ sarvādhikārī |

viśvanāthaḥ : sa vai niścitaṃ draṣṭā prakṛtīkṣaṇakartā puruṣaḥ tadā
sṛṣṭyārambhakāle dṛśyaṃ sṛṣṭyarthaṃ draṣṭavyaṃ pradhānaṃ nāpaśyat |
tataś cātmānaṃ svaṃ virājantam api asantam iva mene, gṛhiṇīṃ vinā gṛhastha
iveti kāvyarītyukteḥ | yad vā, utpatsyamānam ātmānaṃ samaṣṭivirājaṃ
svasmin sūkṣmarūpeṇa santam apy asantam eva mene | prakṛtīkṣaṇaṃ vinā
tasya prākaṭyāsambhavād iti bhāvaḥ |

nanu dṛṣṭyaiva bhogyā sā kāntā māyā tasya tadā kīdṛśyāsīt ? tatrāha—suptā
svāpavatī śaktir māyā yasya saḥ | na hi svāpavatī kāntā sambhujyata iti
bhāvaḥ | kiṃ ca tasyānandārtham anyāḥ subhagā bahvya eva kāntā jāgratya
eva vartanta ity āha—asuptā dṛśaś cicchaktivṛttayo lakṣmyādyā yasya saḥ
| tad api viśvasṛṣṭyādyarthaṃ bahiraṅgā durbhagāpi yā sā māyāśaktis
tadānīm apekṣitavyaiveti bhāvaḥ ||24||


 || 3.5.25 ||

 sā vā etasya saṃdraṣṭuḥ śaktiḥ sadasadātmikā |

  māyā nāma mahābhāga yayedaṃ nirmame vibhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : sā vai dṛaṣṭṛdṛśyānusandhānarūpā sadasadātmikā
kāryakāraṇarūpā | yad vā, sad dṛśyam, asad adṛśyam ātmā svarūpaṃ ca
tayor ātmā yasyāḥ | tadubhayānusandhānarūpatvāt ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : paścād ahaṃ yad etac cety asyārthaṃ kathayan
sṛṣṭyupayuktaṃ bahiraṅgaśaktyantaram āhaṃsīta | śaktitvena
nimittarūpatvaṃ sadasadātmakatvenopādānarūpatvaṃ cāṃśato vyañjitam
||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : tataś ca tadicchayā sā māyāśaktis tadā jajagārety āha—sā
prasiddhā vai niścitaṃ sadasadātmik kāryakāraṇarūpā idaṃ viśvaṃ vibhuḥ
parameśvaraḥ ||25||


 || 3.5.26 ||

 kālavṛttyā tu māyāyāṃ guṇamayyām adhokṣajaḥ |

 puruṣeṇātmabhūtena vīryam ādhatta vīryavān ||

śrīdharaḥ : kālavṛttyā kālaśaktyā guṇamayyāṃ kṣubhitaguṇāyām |
adhokṣajaḥ paramātmā | ātmāṃśabhūtena puruṣeṇa prakṛtyadhiṣṭhātṛrūpeṇa
vīryaṃ cidābhāsam ādhatta | vīryavāṃś cicchaktiyuktaḥ ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sṛṣṭim āha—kālavṛttyeti | bhagavān eka āsedaṃ [bhā.pu.
3.5.23] iti pūrvoktāt adhokṣajo bhagavān | puruṣeṇa prakṛtidraṣṭrā
ātmabhūtena svāṃśena dvārabhūtena kālo vṛtir yasyāṃ tayā māyayā
nimittabhūtayā guṇamayyāṃ māyāyām avyakte vīryaṃ jīvākhyam ādhatta |
hantemās tisro devatā ityādiśruteḥ ||26|| [paramātmasandarbha 58]

viśvanāthaḥ : māyābhartur ādipuruṣasyāpy aṃśī mahāvaikuṇṭhanātho
bhagavān eva sarvakāraṇakāraṇam āśrayatattvam iti darśayan sargārambham
āha—kālasya vṛttyā prāthamikyā
mahāpuruṣaniḥśvāsarecanaprathamekṣaṇenety arthaḥ | adhokṣajo
mahāvaikuṇṭhanātho bhagavān ātmabhūtena svāṃśarūpeṇa
mātrātmadhiṣṭhātrā ādipuruṣeṇa dvārā māyāṃ dūrād īkṣaṇenaiva saṃbhuktāyāṃ
vīryaṃ cidābhāsākhyaṃ jīvaśaktim ādhatta | mama yonir mahad brahma 
tasmin garbhaṃ dadhāmy ahaṃ [gītā 14.2] ity atra garbhaṃ cidābhāsaṃ
dadhāmi | pralaye mayi līnaṃ santam avidyākāmakarmānuśayavantaṃ
kṣetrajñaṃ sṛṣṭisamaye bhogyena kṣetreṇa saṃyojayāmīty arthaḥ iti
svāmicaraṇā madhusūdanasarasvatīpādāś ca | māyāśaktijīvaśaktyor
melanenaiva jagadutpattisambhavāt | mayā kṣetrajñaśaktiḥ sā tāratamyena
vartata iti vaiṣṇavokter māyāśaktau jīvaśakteḥ praveśanān
māyāśaktyadhīnāṃ jīvaśaktiṃ cakāreti vākyārthaḥ | kiṃ ca, śakter
ānantyāt māyāyām apraviṣṭā apy anantā eva tasya jīvā viṣvaksenādināmāno
vyaktā avyaktāś ca nityasiddhāḥ santīty āha—vīryavān iti | striyām āhitād
vīryād adhikapramāṇam eva vīryaṃ puṃsi tiṣṭhatīti lokeṣv api prasiddheḥ
||26||


 || 3.5.27 ||

tato'bhavan mahattattvam avyaktāt kālacoditāt |

 vijñānātmātmadehasthaṃ viśvaṃ vyañjaṃs tamonudaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kālapreritād avyaktān māyātaḥ | tattvapadaṃ parityajya
mahato lakṣaṇam, ataḥ puṃliṅganirdeśo vijñānātmeti | sattvapradhānatvāt
svadehasthaṃ viśvam ucchūnabījagatam aṅkurādirūpaṃ vṛkṣam iva vyañjan
vyañjayan prakāśayan | yato'sau tamo nudatīti tamonudaḥ | tad uktaṃ
sātvatatantre—

viṣṇos tu trīṇi rūpāṇi puruṣākhyāny atho viduḥ |

prathamaṃ mahataḥ sraṣṭṛ dvitīyaṃ tv aṇḍasaṃsthitam |

tṛtīyaṃ sarvabhūtasthaṃ tāni jñātvā vimucyate || iti ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tat iti vijñānātmako'pi padārthaḥ samabhavat | tad eva
nāmnā mahat tattvam iti | tamonudaḥ pralayagatājñānadhvaṃsakartā
||27|| [paramātmasandarbha 58]

viśvanāthaḥ : puruṣādhiṣṭhānena labdhacetanāyā māyāyāṃ tasyās
trayoviṃśatau bhāgeṣu kāryakāraṇabhāvenotpatsyamāneṣu prathamaṃ
mahattattvasya janmāha—tata iti | avyaktāt māyātaḥ kīdṛśāt kālacoditāt
tadutpattyucitakālaprāpitavikṛteḥ | tattvapadaṃ parityajya mahato
lakṣaṇam āha—vijñānātmā sa mahān sattvāṃśaprādhānyena
viśiṣṭajñānasvarūpaḥ sarvadeheṣu cittarūpeṇa yo'ṃśena vartata ity
arthaḥ | svadehasthaṃ viśvam ucchūnabījagatāṅkurādirūpaṃ vṛkṣam iva
vyañjayan prakāśayan yato'sau tamonudaḥ pralayagatājñānadhvaṃsakartā
tato rajo'ṃśaprādhānye sati kriyāśaktyā mahattattvabhedaḥ
sūtratattvam abhūd ity api jñeyam ||27||


 || 3.5.28 ||

 so'py aṃśaguṇakālātmā bhagavaddṛṣṭigocaraḥ |

  ātmānaṃ vyakarod ātmā viśvasyāsya sisṛkṣayā ||

madhvaḥ : aṃśo jīvaḥ |

kālajīvaguṇādīnām abhimānī caturmukhaḥ |

sarvajīvābhimānitvād aṃśa ity eva cocyate || iti brāhme ||28||

śrīdharaḥ : ahaṅkārotpattim āha sārdhābhyām, so'pīti | aṃśaś cidābhāso
nimittaṃ, guṇā upādānaṃ, kālaḥ kṣobhakaḥ, tadātmā tadadhīnaḥ bhagavān
sarvādhyakṣas taddṛṣṭigocaraḥ san svayam ātmānaṃ vyakarot rūpāntaram
anayat ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : so'pīti | bhagavān etadaṃśaḥ puruṣa ātmā vijñānātmaiva
sisṛkṣayety aupacārikam eva | nadī kūlaṃ pipatiṣatītivat ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : tamo'ṃśaprādhānye saty ahaṅkārotpattim āha—so'pi mahān
aṃśaḥ puruṣaḥ vīryaṃ jīvaśaktiḥ guṇāḥ prakṛtyaṃśāḥ sattvādyāḥ kālaś ca
tadutpattyupayogī tair eva kāraṇair ātmā svarūpaṃ yasya saḥ | bhagavato
dṛṣṭir icchā tadviṣayībhūtaḥ san ātmānaṃ svg vyakarot rūpāntaram anayati
| kīdṛśaḥ ? viśvasyāsya janiṣyamāṇasya ātmā āśrayaḥ | sisṛkṣayā
ahaṅkārasṛṣṭīcchayā ||28||


 || 3.5.29 ||

mahattattvād vikurvāṇād ahaṃtattvaṃ vyajāyata |

 kāryakāraṇakartrātmā bhūtendriyamanomayaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : ahaṅkārasya lakṣaṇam āha—kāryam adhibhūtam, kāraṇam adhyātmam,
kartṛ adhidaivaṃ, teṣām ātmā āśrayaḥ | atra hetuḥ, bhūtendriyamanomayas
tadvikāravān | mana iti devānām apy upalakṣaṇam ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : mahattattvād ity ardhakam ||29||

viśvanāthaḥ : vikurvāṇāt vikriyamāṇāt | ahaṅkārasya lakṣaṇam āha—kāryam
adhibhūtaṃ kāraṇam adhyātmaṃ kartṛ adhidaivaṃ teṣām ātmā āśrayaḥ | tatra
hetuḥ—bhūtendriyamanomayaḥ tadvikāravān mana iti devānām apy upalakṣaṇam
||29||


 || 3.5.30 ||

vaikārikas taijasaś ca tāmasaś cety ahaṃ tridhā |

 ahaṃtattvād vikurvāṇān mano vaikārikād abhūt |

 vaikārikāś ca ye devā arthābhivyañjanaṃ yataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : etad eva vibhāgataḥ prapañcayati—vaikārika ityādinā |
vaikārikaḥ sāttvikaḥ, taijaso rājasaḥ | devāś ca vaikārikāḥ,
sāttvikāhaṅkārakāryabhūtā ity arthaḥ | yato yebhya indriyādhiṣṭhātṛbhyo
devebhyo hetubho'rthābhivyañjanaṃ śabdādiprakāśo bhavati ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : etad eva vibhajya vaktum āha—vaikārikaḥ sāttvikaḥ, taijasaḥ
rājasaḥ | ye devā digādyanto'pi vaikārikāḥ vaikārikajanyāḥ yato yebhyo
devebhya indriyādhiṣṭhātṛbhyo'rthābhivyañjanaṃ śabdādiprakāśo bhavati
||30||


 || 3.5.31 ||

  taijasānīndriyāṇy eva jñānakarmamayāni ca |

  tāmaso bhūtasūkṣmādir yataḥ khaṃ liṅgam ātmanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : taijasāny evety anvayaḥ | jñānamayānāṃ sāttvikatvaśaṅkā mā
bhūd ity evakāraḥ | tāmaso bhūtasūkṣmasya śabdasyādiḥ kāraṇam | yataḥ
śabdāt kham ākāśo bhavati | ātmano liṅgaṃ svaguṇaśabdarūpeṇa prakāśakaṃ
hṛdayākāśatayā vā | yad vā, liṅgaṃ śarīram ākāśaśarīraṃ brahma iti śruteḥ
||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : taijasānīti | ātmanaḥ paramātmanaḥ | tasya liṅgaṃ
bodhakaṃ—tasmād vā etasmād ātmanaḥ ākāśaḥ sambhūtaḥ ity asyāḥ śrutes
tadvārā tadbādhakatvāt ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ : indriyāṇi taijasāny evety anvayaḥ | jñānendriyāṇāṃ
jñānamayānāṃ sāttvikatvāśaṅkya mābhūd ity evakāraḥ | tāmaso
bhūtasūkṣmasya śabdasyādiḥ kāraṇam | yataḥ śabdāt kham ākāśo bhavati |
ātmanaḥ parameśvarasya liṅgaṃ svaguṇaśabdarūpeṇa prakāśakam | yad vā,
tasmād vā etasmād ātmanaḥ ākāśaḥ sambhūta iti śruter ātmakāryatvād
ātmajñāpakam ||31|| (3132)


 || 3.5.32 ||

  kālamāyāṃśayogena bhagavadvīkṣitaṃ nabhaḥ |

nabhaso'nusṛtaṃ sparśaṃ vikurvan nirmame'nilam ||

śrīdharaḥ : nabhasaḥ svasmād anusṛtam udbhūtaṃ sparśaṃ vikurvad rūpāntaraṃ
nayad anilaṃ vāyum | eva sarvatra tanmātradvārā bhūtotpattir iti
jñātavyam ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sparśaṃ sparśātmakaṃ bhūtasūkṣmarūpaṃ vāyum ity
arthaḥ | evam uttaratrāpi ||32||

viśvanāthaḥ : nabhaḥ kartṛ nabhasaḥ svasmād anusṛtam udbhūtaṃ sparśaṃ
vikurvat rūpāntaraṃ prāpayat sat anilaṃ nirmame | evaṃ sarvatra
tanmātradvārā bhūtotpattir iti jñeyam ||32|| (33)


 || 3.5.33 ||

 anilo'pi vikurvāṇo nabhasorubalānvitaḥ |

 sasarja rūpatanmātraṃ jyotir lokasya locanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : nabhasā sahitaḥ svayaṃ corubalānvitaḥ tato jyotis tejaḥ |
locanaṃ prakāśakam ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  nabhasā sahitaḥ svayaṃ corubalānvitaḥ, rūpatanmātrāt
jyotir abhūt, lokasya locanaṃ prakāśakam ||33|| (34)


 || 3.5.34 ||

anilenānvitaṃ jyotir vikurvat paravīkṣitam |

  ādhattāmbho rasamayaṃ kālamāyāṃśayogataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : rasamayaṃ rasaguṇam antaḥ ādhatta asṛjat ||34|| (35)


 || 3.5.35 ||

jyotiṣāmbho'nusaṃsṛṣṭaṃ vikurvad brahmavīkṣitam |

 mahīṃ gandhaguṇām ādhāt kālamāyāṃśayogataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : saṃsṛṣṭaṃ saṃyuktam ||35|| (36)


 || 3.5.36 ||

 bhūtānāṃ nabhāadīnāṃ yad yad bhavyāvarāvaram |

  teṣāṃ parānusaṃsargād yathā saṅkhyaṃ guṇān viduḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : he bhavya vidura | pāṭhāntare bhāvyaṃ kāryam | yad yad avaram
avaraṃ kāryaṃ teṣāṃ kāryāṇāṃ paraiḥ kāraṇair anusaṃsargād yathāsaṅkhyaṃ
yathākramam uttarottaram adhikān guṇān viduḥ | tathāhi nabhasaḥ śabda eva
guṇo'nyānvayābhāvāt | vāyos tu sparśa ākāśānvayāc chabdaś ca | evaṃ
taijasas tau ca rūpaṃ ca | ambhasas tāni rasaś ca | mahyāḥ sarve ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ pādatrayārtho darśitaḥ, yo'vaśiṣyeta so'smy
aham iti tu bhagavān eka āsedaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.5.23] ity anenaiva darśitaḥ |
evaṃ prathamaślokārthajñānaṃ darśayitvā dvitīyaślokārthaṃ vijñānaṃ
vakṣyamāṇatayā tyaktvā parāt paro'py asau bhaktivaśaḥ syād iti
rahasyatatsādhanajñāpakatṛtīyacaturthaślokārthaṃ darśayati—ete devā
ity ādinā iti tāsāṃ svaśaktīnām ityādyantena granthena | viṣṇoḥ kalā
vibhūtayaḥ kālādayo liṅgaṃ ca śarīraṃ sahāyatvena vidyante yeṣāṃ te, ata
eva prāñjalayaḥ procur iti ||36||

viśvanāthaḥ : saṃsṛṣṭaṃ saṃyuktam ||36||


 || 3.5.38 ||

  devā ūcuḥ—

  namāma te deva padāravindaṃ

 prapannatāpopaśamātapatram |

 yanmūlaketā yatayo'ñjasoru

 saṃsāraduḥkhaṃ bahir utkṣipanti ||

madhvaḥ : kālamāyāṃśaliṅginaḥ | tannimittaśarīrāḥ hiraṇyagarbhasyaiva
kālābhimānījīvābhimānau iti dvividhaṃ rūpam |  kālajīvābhimānī
rūpadvandvī caturmukhaḥ  || iti pādme ||38||

śrīdharaḥ : mithaḥ spardhiṣṇavo devān amilantaḥ parasparam | viśvakarmaṇy
anīśānā nirviṇṇā harim īḍire—namāmeti | prapannānāṃ tāpopaśame | ātapatraṃ
chatram | tatra hetuḥ—yasya pādāravindasya mūlaṃ talaṃ keta āśrayo yeṣāṃ
te | saṃsāraduḥkhaṃ bahir dūrata utkṣipanti parityajanti | pānthāḥ
svagṛhaṃ prāpya mārgaśramam iva ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : ātapatraṃ chatram | yasya pādāravindasya mūlaṃ talaṃ keta
āśrayo yeṣāṃ tathābhūtā eva yatayo nānye añjasā śīghram eva uru samūlam
eva saṃsāraduḥkhaṃ svagātralagnaṃ jalaukasam iva balena niṣkāsya bahir
dūrata eva uccīkṛtya kṣipanti yathā punaḥ svasamīpaṃ nāyāti atra añjaseti
urv iti bahir ity utkṣipantīti padais tad anāśritayatayo vilambenaiva
nāpi samūlaṃ, tathā kṣipanti yathā tān punaḥ saṃsāro grasatīti labhyate |
yadyapi tadānīṃ yatayo na vartante sma, tad api
sarvaśāstrasāṅkhyhetuavijñatayaiva tattvavedās trikālajñās tathā
prāhur iti jñeyam ||38|| (39)


 || 3.5.39 ||

dhātar yad asmin bhava īśa jīvās

 tāpatrayeṇābhihatā na śarma |

 ātman labhante bhagavaṃs tavāṅghri

  cchāyāṃ savidyām ata āśrayema ||

madhvaḥ :  brahmavidyā hareś chāyā tadaṃśo hi sureṣv api |

sarvavidyā śreyaḥ proktā pradhānāṃśaś caturmukhaḥ || iti brāhme ||39||

śrīdharaḥ : śramaṃ vinivedayanta āhuḥ | he dhātaḥ pitaḥ, yat yasmād bhave
saṃsāre | ātmann ātmani | saṃbodhanaṃ vā | śarma sukham | “ṛte” yad iti
pāṭhe yat pādabhajanaṃ vinā śarma na labhante | nanu jñānād ajñānakṛtas
tāpo nivartate, kiṃ madaṅghricchāyāśrayaṇena tatrāhuḥ | savidyāṃ
tadāśrayaṇam eva vidyāprāpakam ity arthaḥ ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv ajñānamūlakaṃ saṃsāraduḥkhaṃ jñānenaivopaśāmyed iti
jñānināṃ kiṃ bhaktyeti tatrāhuḥ ṛte iti | yatpādabhajanaṃ vinā asmin
bhave saṃsāre ātman svasmin, sambodhanaṃ vā, śarma na labhante | tatra 
hetuḥ—savidyāṃ vidyayā saha vartamānām | tavāṅghricchāyāyām eva vidyā
vartate nānyatreti | bhaktyā vinā jñānam eva na siddhyatīti te
mithyājñānina iti bhāvaḥ ||39|| (40)


 || 3.5.40 ||

  mārganti yat te mukhapadmanīḍaiś

  chandaḥsuparṇair ṛṣayo vivikte |

 yasyāghamarṣodasaridvarāyāḥ

padaṃ padaṃ tīrthapadaḥ prapannāḥ ||

madhvaḥ: dyusarito dharāyāś ca ||40||

śrīdharaḥ : ajñātasyāśrayaṇāyogāt tajjñānasādhanam āhuḥ | mārganty
anveṣayanti yat tat tīrthapadas tava padaṃ vayaṃ prapannāḥ | kair
mārganti ? chandaḥsuparṇair vedapakṣibhiḥ | tavaiva mukhapadmaṃ nīḍaṃ
yeṣām | yathā pakṣiṇo nīḍād udgatāḥ, tatas tataḥ paribhramya punas
tatraiva viśanti, tathā vedā api tvatta udgatās tvayy eva paryavasyanti |
ato vedānāśritya tvatpadaṃ mṛgayanta iti | vivikte asaṅge manasi | kiṃ
ca, aghamarṣam aghanāśakamudam udakaṃ yāsāṃ saritāṃ tāsu varāyā
gaṅgāyāḥ padam udgamasthānam | ato gaṅgām anusevamānā api tad
udgamasthānaṃ tvatpadaṃ prāpnuvantīty arthaḥ ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ : mārgantīti yasya yatpadaṃ mārganti, tasya te tatpadaṃ
vayaṃ prapannā iti yojyam | nīḍamārgiṇo'pi padasthānīyaṃ vṛkṣamūlam eva
prapadyanta iti bhāvaḥ ||40||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv ajñānamūlakaṃ saṃsāraduḥkhaṃ jñānenaivopaśāmyed iti
jñānināṃ kiṃ bhaktyeti tatrāhuḥ ṛte iti | yatpādabhajanaṃ vinā asmin
bhave saṃsāre ātman svasmin, sambodhanaṃ vā, śarma na labhante | tatra
hetuḥ savidyāṃ vidyayā saha vartamānam | tavāṅghricchāyāyām eva vidyā
vartate nānyatreti | bhaktyā vinā jñānam eva na siddhyatīti te
mithyājñānina iti bhāvaḥ ||40|| (41)


 || 3.5.41 ||

 yac chraddhayā śrutavatyā ca bhaktyā

 sammṛjyamāne hṛdaye'vadhāya |

 jñānena vairāgyabalena dhīrā

vrajema tat te'ṅghrisarojapīṭham ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu viṣayākṛṣṭacittānāṃ kutas tadanveṣaṇaṃ ?
tatrāhuḥ—yaddhṛdaye'vadhāya dhyātvā, vairāgyaṃ balaṃ yasya tena jñānena
dhīrā bhavanti | sarāge citte dhyānam eva kutaḥ ? tatrāhuḥ—śraddhayā
śravaṇapūrvikayā bhaktyā ca saṃmṛjyamāne saṃśodhyamāne ||41||

kramasandarbhaḥ : śraddhayā śravaṇādareṇa ||41||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, tebhyo'pi kevalabhaktimātrāśrayiṇaḥ śreṣṭhā ity
āhuḥ—yat tava padaṃ śrutaṃ gurumukhopadiṣṭaṃ bhajanavartma vartate
yasyāṃ tayā bhaktyā svahṛdaya evāvadhāya anubhūya labdhena jñānena
tanmādhuryāsvādarūpeṇa kīdṛśena vairāgyasya sarvatra vaitṛṣṇasya balaṃ
yasmāt tena dhīrā bhavanti, aṅke cen madhu vindeta kimarthaṃ parvataṃ
vrajed iti nyāyena pūrvam iva vedādyanveṣaṇaśramavanto na bhavanti
||41|| (42)


 || 3.5.42 ||

  viśvasya janmasthitisaṃyamārthe

 kṛtāvatārasya padāmbujaṃ te |

 vrajema sarve śaraṇaṃ yad īśa

  smṛtaṃ prayacchaty abhayaṃ svapuṃsām ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhaktānugrahaṃ smaranta āhuḥ—viśvasyeti ||42||

kramasandarbhaḥ : khapuṃsāmadhīnamanyeṣāṃ smṛtamabhayaṃ prayacchati |

viśvanāthaḥ : tādṛśyā bhakteḥ sugamatvārthaṃ tasya bhaktānugrahaṃ smaranta
āhuḥ—viśvasyeti ||42|| (43)


 || 3.5.43 ||

 yat sānubandhe'sati dehagehe

mamāham ity ūḍhadurāgrahāṇām |

puṃsāṃ sudūraṃ vasato'pi puryāṃ

 bhajema tat te bhagavan padābjam ||

śrīdharaḥ : antaryāmitayā nityaṃ sannihite'narthakaṃ vrajanam ity
āśaṅkyāhuḥ—yad iti | sānubandhe sopakaraṇe | asati tucche | puryāṃ
svadeha eva vasato'pi | yat sudūraṃ duṣprāpam ||43||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svatas tv anyeṣāṃ nikaṭam api sudūram ity āhuḥ yad iti
||43||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad api durjīvair bhaktir durlabhyety āhuḥ—yad iti | puryāṃ
mathurādvārakādau prakaṭāprakaṭaprakāśābhyāṃ sadā vasato'pi
dehe'ntaryāmirūpeṇa vā ||43|| (44)


 || 3.5.44 ||

tān vai hy asadvṛttibhir akṣibhir ye

 parāhṛtāntarmanasaḥ pareśa |

 atho na paśyanty urugāya nūnaṃ

  ye te padanyāsavilāsalakṣyāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu yadi hṛdisthasyāpi padābjaṃ keṣāñcit sudūraṃ, tarhy
anyeṣām api tathaiva syād aviśeṣād ity āśaṅkyāhuḥ—tān iti | asadvṛttibhir
bahirmukhair akṣibhir indriyaiḥ parāhṛtaṃ dūram apahṛtam antasthaṃ mano
yeṣāṃ te | atho ata eva te nūnaṃ tān na paśyanti | vai prasiddham | kutaḥ
punas teṣāṃ tatsaṅgaḥ syāt ? kān ? te tava padanyāso gamanaṃ tasya
vilāso vibhramas, tasya lakṣmīḥ śobhā, tasyā ye, tvallīlākathādibhiḥ
śobhamānāṃs tvadbhaktān ity arthaḥ | “patha” iti “lakṣyā” iti ca pāṭhe
tvatpadanyāsavilāso lakṣyo yeṣāṃ tān | pathas tvanmārgabhūtān sato
mārgān vā śravaṇādīn na paśyantīty arthaḥ | yad vā, ye evaṃbhūtā
bhāgavatās te tān unmattān nūnaṃ naiva paśyantīty anvayaḥ |
satsaṅgābhāvena harikathāśravaṇābhāvād dhṛdi sthitam api teṣāṃ sudūram
iti bhāvaḥ ||44||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tasmād yeṣu svapuṃsāṃ kṛpā syāt, teṣām eva
tatsmaraṇaviṣayaḥ syāt | sā ca kṛpā na sarvatra syāt | tad evaṃ yad atra
nopalabhyate satsaṅgaḥ, tatrāpy ādhunikaḥ prāktano vā pārampariko
vānumeya eva | tatra kṛtaśrīnāradādidarśanāder api devatādeḥ
śrīnalakūbarādivat tādṛśatvaprāptir na śrūyata ity ata evaṃ vivecanīyam
| yadyapy aparādhasadbhāvo vartate puruṣe, tadā taddoṣeṇa, satsu
nirādarāṇāṃ sādhāraṇamunyādidṛṣṭīnāṃ ca taddoṣaśāntyarthaṃ
satsaṅgasya bhagavatsāmmukhyakāraṇatve tatkṛpāsāhāyyam apekṣyate |
niraparādhatve sati satsaṅgenaiva jātaparamottamadṛṣṭīnāṃ tu teṣāṃ teṣu
mano'vadhānābhāve'pi satsaṅgamātraṃ tatkāraṇam iti | ataḥ sāparādhān
evādhikṛtyoktaṃ—tān iti |

te tava padanyāsavilāsalakṣmyāḥ sambandhino ye bhaktā ity arthaḥ | te
tān nūnaṃ prāyo na paśyanti, na kṛpādṛṣṭiviṣayīkurvantīty arthaḥ | kān
? ye'sadvṛttibhiḥ sāparādhaceṣṭair akṣibhir indriyaiḥ
parākṛtāntarmanaso dūrīkṛtāntarmukhacittavṛttayo bahirmukhā ity evaṃ
vyākhyānam apy atrānusandheyam | atra sādhāraṇāsadvṛttitvaṃ na gṛhyate |
sarvasya tatkṛpāyāḥ prāk tathābhūtatvāt | janasya kṛṣṇādvimukhasya
daivād  [bhā.pu. 3.5.3] ityādikaviṣayaṃ syād iti | tasmād
anaparādhasadvṛttau teṣāṃ kṛpā pravartata eva | kathañcid
aparādhābhāvena tadapravṛttāv api saṅgamātreṇaiva teṣāṃ sanmatiḥ syāt |
yatra tu sāparādhe'pi svairatayaiva kṛpāṃ kurvanti tasyaiva tanmatiḥ syāt
nānyasya nalakūbarādivat sādhaṛaṇā devatāvacceti |

yatra tu sāparādhe'pi svairatayaiva kṛpāṃ kurvanti, tasyaiva tanmatiḥ
syāy, nānyasya, nalakūvarādivat sādhāraṇadevatāvac ceti ||44||
[bhaktisandarbhaḥ 179]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu jagaty asmin itas tataś caratāṃ sādhūnāṃ bahutvāt teṣāṃ
saṅgaṃ kṛtvā tatprasādasulabhatāṃ śuddhāṃ bhaktiṃ te kathaṃ na
kurvantīti tatrāhuḥ—tān iti | asadvṛttibhir bahirmukhair indriyaiḥ
parāhṛtaṃ dūram apahṛtam antaḥsthaṃ mano yeṣāṃ te, atho ata eva tān vai
niścitaṃ na paśyanti kutas teṣāṃ tatsaṅgaḥ | tān kān ? te tava padanyāso
gamanaṃ tasya vilāso vibhramas tasya lakṣmīḥ sampattis tasyāḥ sambandhino
ye tān tvallīlākathāvilāsasmaraṇakīrtanādibhiḥ pūrṇān
paramakṛtārthāṃs tv abhaktān ity arthaḥ | patha iti lakṣmyā iti pāṭhe
tvatpadanyāsavilāso lakṣmyā yeṣāṃ te ye tān pathaḥ tanmārgabhūtān
sādhūn na paśyantīty arthaḥ | yad vā, ye evaṃbhūtā bhāgavatās te tān
unmattān sāparādhān naiva paśyantīty anvayaḥ ||44||


 || 3.5.45 ||

 pānena te deva kathāsudhāyāḥ

  pravṛddhabhaktyā viśadāśayā ye |

  vairāgyasāraṃ pratilabhya bodhaṃ

 yathāñjasānvīyur akuṇṭhadhiṣṇyam ||

śrīdharaḥ : etad eva sphuṭayanti—pāneneti dvābhyām | vairāgyaṃ sāro balaṃ
yasya bodhasya taṃ labdhvā | anvīyuḥ prāpnuyuḥ | akuṇṭhadhiṣṇyaṃ
vaikuṇṭhalokam ||45||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatkathāyāṃ satyāṃ tu paramaphalaprāptiṃ kramād
āhuḥ—pāneneti | viśadāśayāḥ projjhitakaitavāḥ sevaikapuruṣārthāḥ
akuṇṭhadhiṣṇyaṃ vaikuṇṭhalokam iti ṭīkā ||45||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhaktā yathā sādhanadaśām ārabhyaiva paramasukhinas tathā
jñāninaḥ | sādhanadaśām ārabhyaiva paramaduḥkhina iti bhaktijñānayor
etāvad evāntaram ity āhur dvābhyām | pāneneti .viśeṣasya sāro
brahmasāyujyopary api balaṃ yasmāt tathābhūtaṃ bodhaṃ
pravṛddhabhaktyutthaṃ bhagavanmādhuryānubhavaṃ prāpya |
akuṇṭhadhiṣṇyaṃ vaikuṇṭhalokam iti svāmicaraṇāḥ ||46||


 || 3.5.46 ||

 tathāpare cātmasamādhiyoga

  balena jitvā prakṛtiṃ baliṣṭhām |

tvām eva dhīrāḥ puruṣaṃ viśanti

 teṣāṃ śramaḥ syān na tu sevayā te ||

madhvaḥ :  vāyoś ca prakṛter viṣṇor jayo bhaktyaiva nānyathā  iti
dattātreyayoge ||46||

śrīdharaḥ : ātmani samādhir manaḥsthairyaṃ sa eva yoga upāyaḥ, tasya
balena | jñānayogataḥ śrameṇa mokṣaḥ satsaṅgatas tvatkathāśravaṇādinā
tv anāyāsenaiva | ahaṃ mamatāviṣṭānāṃ tu na kathañcid iti bhāvaḥ ||46||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ye tu jñānisaṅginas teṣāṃ sādhanasādhyayoḥ
kaniṣṭhatvam āha—tatheti | apare mokṣamātrakāmāḥ tanmātrapuruṣārthe'pi
teṣāṃ śramaḥ syāt | ye tu sevaikapuruṣārthās teṣāṃ sevayā śramo na syāt,
sadaiva sevāparamānandam anubhavatām ānuṣaṅgikatayā mokṣaś ca syād ity
arthaḥ ||46||

viśvanāthaḥ : ātmani samādhir manaḥsthairyaṃ, sa eva yoga upāyaḥ, tasya
balena jñānayogata ity arthaḥ | yad vā, aṣṭāṅgayogataḥ tvāṃ puruṣaṃ
viśanti tvayi sāyujyaṃ prāpnuvantīty arthaḥ | kintu teṣāṃ śramaḥ syād iti
teṣāṃ bhaktirāhitye—śreyaḥsṛtiṃ bhaktim udasya te vibho  kliśyanti 
[bhā.pu. 10.14.4] ity ādeḥ, pureha bhūman bahavo'pi yoginaḥ [bhā.pu.
10.14.5] ity ādeś ca, bhaktiṃ vinā vāstavaṃ jñānam eva na syāt, kuto
muktir iti te paramaduḥkhina eva | yad uktaṃ,

teṣām asau kleśala eva śiṣyate

nānyad yathā sthūlatuṣāvaghātinām || [bhā.pu. 10.14.4] iti |

jñānāṅgabhaktisāhitye tu sāyujyaṃ prāpnuvanty eva, kintu sādhanadaśāyāṃ
cittaikāgryārtham upāyānveṣaṇānuṣṭhānādiṣu śramaḥ spaṣṭa eva
sādhyadaśāyāṃ tvadvaśīkārakāraṇaṃ premāṇaṃ prāpnuvadbhis tvadbhaktaiḥ
parityaktasya tvatpraveśasya grahaṇam eva niṣkarṣaḥ | sa ca duḥkham eveti
bhaktānāṃ mate tad api te duḥkhina evety arthaḥ |

nanu paricaryādibhir bhaktānām api śramo'numīyate, tatrāhuḥ—na tu sevayā
te iti | atra ta evānubhavinaḥ pramāṇaṃ yathāśramiṇor api strīpuṃsayor na
śramaḥ, kintu śramāprāptyaiva śramas tathā tvadbhaktānāṃ pratyuta sevayā
daivād aprāptyaiva mano duḥkharūpo mahāśramaḥ syād iti bhāvaḥ | atra
sevayā tvāṃ viśantīti na yogjanīyam anvīyur akuṇṭhadhiṣṇyam iti
pūrvoktena virodhāt, na ca kuṇṭhaṃ dhiṣṇyaṃ yasya taṃ tvām anvīyur iti,
tatrāpi vyākhyeyam | viśeṣaṇasyāpuṣṭārthatvāt | anvīyur iti
anugayarthakapadopanyāsasyāpi vaiyarthyam ||46||


 || 3.5.47 ||

 tat te vayaṃ lokasisṛkṣayādya

 tvayānusṛṣṭās tribhir ātmabhiḥ sma |

  sarve viyuktāḥ svavihāratantraṃ

  na śaknumas tat pratihartave te ||

madhvaḥ : tribhir ātmabhiḥ kālamāyāṃśaiḥ ||47||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evaṃ stutvā prārthayante caturbhiḥ | tat tasmāt he ādya,
te tvadīyā vayaṃ yasmāl lokānāṃ sisṛkṣayā tvayānusṛṣṭāḥ krameṇotpāditāḥ |
tribhir ātmabhiḥ sattvādisvabhāvaiḥ, ata eva viruddhasvabhāvatvād
viyuktāḥ santo yadarthaṃ sṛṣṭāḥ, tat svavihāratantraṃ
tvatkrīḍopakaraṇaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ, te tubhyaṃ pratihartave pratihartuṃ
samarpayituṃ na śaknumaḥ, atas tvaṃ naḥ svacakṣuḥ paridehīti trayāṇāṃ
ślokānāṃ caturthenānvayaḥ ||47||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yasmād evaṃ sarveṣāṃ bhavadāśrayeṇaivottamatvaṃ tat
tasmāt ||47||

viśvanāthaḥ : tat tasmāt te tavaiva sevakā vayaṃ sevām aprāpyaiva kliśyāma
iti bhāvaḥ | sevāyā aprāptiṃ vivṛṇvanti | lokānāṃ sisṛkṣayā tvayā
anusṛṣṭāḥ krameṇotpāditāḥ sma | tribhir ātmabhiḥ sattvādisvabhāvaiḥ, ata
eva viruddhasvabhāvatvāt mitho vyuktāḥ santaḥ yadarthaṃ sṛṣṭyas tat
svavihāratantraṃ tvatkrīḍopakaraṇaṃ samaṣṭiṃ te tubhyaṃ pratihartave
pratihartuṃ samarpayituṃ na śaknumaḥ ||47||


 || 3.5.48 ||

 yāvad baliṃ te ñja harāma kāle

yathā vayaṃ cānnam adāma yatra |

  yathobhayeṣāṃ ta ime hi lokā

 baliṃ haranto'nnam adanty anūhāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : asāmarthyam eva prapañcayituṃ kāryasyātivaicitryam āhuḥ | bho
aja ! kāle tattadavasare baliṃ bhogaṃ yāvat sākalyena te tubhyaṃ harāma
samarpayāma | yathā yena prakāreṇānnam adāma bhakṣayāmety anenānnamātraṃ
cāsmākam, aiśvaryeṇa tu bhogas tavaivety uktam | ubhayeṣāṃ tava cāsmākaṃ
ca yatra sthitvā ime jīvā anūhā apratyūhā nirvighnāḥ | yad vā, anūhā
avitarkāḥ, niḥsaṃśayā ity arthaḥ | tathā ca śrutiḥ—tā enam abruvann
āyatanaṃ naḥ prajānīhi yasmin pratiṣṭhitā annam adām iti ||48||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra nijakartavyasevārūpāśrayaṃ nivedayanti—yāvad
iti | annaṃ yat kiñcid bhagavaddattaṃ svasvopajīvyam ||48||

viśvanāthaḥ : tarhi kiṃ yuṣmadvāñchitaṃ karavāṇi tad brūtheti āhuḥ—he aja
! kāle samucitasamaye baliṃ pūjopahāraṃ yāvat sākalyena te harāma |
devamanuṣyādivividhapurasaṅkulasamaṣṭivyaṣṭyātmakaprāpañcikatvatkrīḍopakaraṇavṛndaṃ
nirmāya tubhyaṃ yathā samarpayāma | yathā ca vayaṃ
tvanmāyāśaktivṛttayo'nnam adāma | rājñā ādiṣṭā gṛhanirmātāro
vardhakayo yathā vetanarūpaṃ svasvodarapuram annaṃ prāpnuvantīty arthaḥ
| yathā ca ime lokā devatiryagādayas tvajjīvaśaktivṛttayas
tadadhīnatvāt | tanmāyāśaktyadhīnatvāc ca | ubhayeṣāṃ tava cāsmākaṃ ca
baliṃ haranto vividhayāgayogajñānādirūpam ārādhanaṃ kurvanto'nnam
adanti svasvakarmaphalaṃ prāpnuvanti anūhā avitarkāḥ prabhur asmabhyaṃ
karmaphalaṃ dāsyati na dāsyati vety abhyūhaśūnyā iti etad
evāsmadvāñchitaṃ sampādayeti bhāvaḥ | tathā ca śrutiḥ—tā enam abruvan
āyatanaṃ naḥ prajānīhi yasmin pratiṣṭhitā annam adāmeti ||48||


 || 3.5.49 ||

tvaṃ naḥ surāṇām asi sānvayānāṃ

  kūṭastha ādyaḥ puruṣaḥ purāṇaḥ |

  tvaṃ deva śaktyāṃ guṇakarmayonau

 retas tv ajāyāṃ kavim ādadhe ñjaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : avaśyaṃ ca tvayā'smākam eṣāṃ ca kāryopādhīnāṃ jīvānāṃ vṛttiḥ
parikalpanīyā janakatvād ity āhuḥ | no'smākaṃ sānvayaṇāṃ sakāryāṇām | yad
vā, anvetīty anvayaḥ | kāraṇaṃ tatsahitānāṃ tvam evādyaḥ kāraṇam | atra
hetavaḥ—kūṭastho'vikriyaḥ, puruṣo'dhiṣṭhātā, purāṇaḥ purātanaḥ | etad
upapādayanti—tvam iti | he deva ! aja eva tvaṃ guṇānāṃ sāttvādīnāṃ
karmaṇāṃ janmādīnāṃ ca yonau kāraṇabhūtāyāṃ śaktyāṃ māyāyāṃ prathamaṃ
reta ādadhe | nihitavān asīty arthaḥ | kīdṛśaṃ ? kaviṃ sarvajñaṃ
mahattattvarūpam ||49||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kaviṃ samaṣṭijīvam ||49||

viśvanāthaḥ : sevyasevakalakṣaṇaṃ sambandham upapādayanti—no'smākaṃ
sānvayānām anvetīty anvayaḥ kāraṇaṃ tatsahitānāṃ kūṭastho nirvikāra
evādyaś cintāmaṇir iva kāraṇaṃ puruṣo'dhiṣṭhātā purāṇaḥ purātanaḥ
ādiśūnya ity arthaḥ | yatas tvaṃ he deva śaktyāṃ yāmāyāṃ guṇānāṃ
sattvādīnāṃ karma mahadādikaṃ yatra tatrabhūtāyāṃ yonau retaḥ
samaṣṭijīvarūpaṃ kaviṃ vijñam ato'smākaṃ jīvānāṃ ca pitṛtvāt tvam eva
sevya iti bhāvaḥ ||49||


 || 3.5.50 ||

  tato vayaṃ matpramukhā yadarthe

babhūvimātman karavāma kiṃ te |

 tvaṃ naḥ svacakṣuḥ paridehi śaktyā

  deva kriyārthe yadanugrahāṇām ||

madhvaḥ : matpramukhāḥ mahadādayaḥ ||50||

śrīdharaḥ : tathā he ātman deva ! satpramukhā mahadādayo vayaṃ
yadarthaṃ babhūvima, tat kiṃ te kāryaṃ karavāma ? sṛṣṭim iti cet tatrāhuḥ
| tarhi no'smākaṃ tvaṃ svacakṣuḥ svīyaṃ jñānaṃ śaktyā saha paridehi
prayaccha | yasmāt tvatta evānugraho yeṣāṃ te yadanugrahās teṣām asmākam
| kriyārthe iyān evaitāvān anugraho yeṣām ity ekaṃ vā padam |
tvadīyajñānakriyāśaktibhyām eva vayaṃ sṛṣṭau kṣamā nānyathety arthaḥ
||50||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tata iti tatraiṣāṃ pṛthivīnyāyena
tattvādhiṣṭhātṛdevānāṃ bhaktatvena svayam eva purā śarīranirmāṇam
īśvareṇa anyeṣāṃ tu tatprārthanayaiva bhaviṣyatīti jñeyam ||50||

viśvanāthaḥ : matpramukhā mahadādyā vayaṃ he ātman kiṃ te karavāma
sṛṣṭim iti cet tatrāhuḥ—tarhi no'smākaṃ tvaṃ svacakṣuḥ śaktyā saha
paridehi vairājanirmāṇe jñānaṃ dehi śaktiṃ ca dehīty arthaḥ |
tvadīyajñānakriyāśaktibhyām eva vayaṃ sṛṣṭau kṣamā nānyathā iti bhāvaḥ
| he deva asmākaṃ kriyārūpe'rthe iyān evānugrahas tvayā kartum ucito yeṣu
teṣāṃ tvadādiṣṭāṃ sevām eva sukhena karavāmety etāvad evāsmadvāñchitaṃ
nānyad iti bhāvaḥ | atra tattvādhiṣṭhātṛdevānāṃ bhaktatvāt svayam eva
śarīranirmāṇam īśvareṇa anyeṣāṃ tu tatprārthanaiveti sandarbhaḥ ||50||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

ekaviṃśo'tra daśame saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe

 mahadādyutpattir nāma

 pañcamo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.5 ||

 (3.6)

 || 3.6.1 ||

 ṛṣir uvāca—

  iti tāsāṃ svaśaktīnāṃ satīnām asametya saḥ |

 prasuptalokatantrāṇāṃ niśāmya gatim īśvaraḥ ||

madhvaḥ : śakyatvāc chaktayo viṣṇor mahadādyā ramā tathā |

svarūpaśaktiḥ śaktitvāt mukhyaśaktitvāt mukhyaśaktir hi sā yataḥ || iti
brahmatarke |

sametyāsatīnām asametānāṃ prasuptalokatantrāṇām
anāvirbhūtalokasṛṣṭiśaktīnām |

tanute yena kāryaṃ taṃ tantraṃ sādhanam ucyate |

kāraṇānāṃ svaśaktir vā pradhānaṃ sādhanaṃ yataḥ || iti brahmatarke ||1||

śrīdharaḥ :

ṣaṣṭhe tair īśvarāviṣṭaiḥ sṛṣṭim āha virāṭtanoḥ |

 adhidaivādibhedaṃ ca tatraiva bhagavatkṛtam ||

svaśaktīnāṃ mahadādīnām asametyāmilitvā satīnāṃ sthitānām | prasuptaṃ
lokatantraṃ viśvaracanā yāsām | yad vā, prasuptajīvopakaraṇānāṃ gatiṃ
sthitiṃ dṛṣṭvā āviśad ity uttareṇānvayaḥ ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :

ṣaṣṭhe virāḍ abhūt tattvair antaryāmipraveśataḥ |

adhibhūtādibhedaś tasya dehe prapañcitaḥ ||

svaśaktkāryatvāt svaśaktīnāṃ mahadādīnām asametyāmilitvā satīnāṃ
sthitānām | prasuptaṃ lokatantraṃ viśvanirmāṇakriyā yāsāṃ tāsāṃ gatiṃ
dṛśā dṛṣṭvā ||1||


 || 3.6.2 ||

  kālasaṃjñāṃ tadā devīṃ bibhrac chaktim urukramaḥ |

  trayoviṃśati tattvānāṃ gaṇaṃ yugapad āviśat ||

madhvaḥ : śabdādyā nabhāadyāś ca manoyuktendriyāṇi ca |

ahaṅkāro mahāṃś caiva trayoviṃśatiko gaṇaḥ ||

devatendriyor aikyān na pṛthaggaṇanaṃ tayoḥ |

prakṛtis tu caturviṃśā pañcaviṃśā hariḥ svayam ||

yadā jaḍāṃśasvīkāro jīvas tatpañcaviṃśakāḥ |

ṣaḍviṃśako mahāviṣṇuḥ śriyā vā saptaviṃśakāḥ || iti tattvanirṇaye |

trayoviṃśatitattvāni prāviśat ramayā saha |

kālākhyayā svayaṃ viṣṇuḥ śakyatvāt śaktirūpayā ||

sarvaceṣṭakarūpeṇa svasāmarthyena keśavaḥ |

tāni bhinnāni tattvāni yojayāmāsa cāṃśataḥ || iti ca ||2||

śrīdharaḥ : kālena saṃjñā udbodho yasyāḥ, kālayati kṣobhayati
svakāryāṇīti vā kālasaṃjñā prakṛtis tāṃ śaktim | prakṛtyā saha praveśāt
trayoviṃśatitattvānām ity uktam | antaryāmitayā prāviśat ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kālayati sarvaṃ melayatīti kālaḥ | kālo vṛttiviśeṣaḥ |
kāla evaṃ saṃjñā yasyās tām | trayoviṃśatitattvānām iti | mahadādīnām
eva parasparamelanāt prakṛtes tu sarvānugateḥ ||2||

viśvanāthaḥ : kālenaiva saṃjñā mahadādyā vividhā yasyā sā kālasaṃjñā
prakṛtiḥ tāṃ bibhrat san āviśat | prathamaṃ saṃhananakāriṇyā śaktyaiva
tato varṣasahasrānte antaryāmitayety arthaḥ | prakṛtyā saha praveśāt
trayoviṃśatīty uktaṃ mahad ahaṅkāraḥ pañcatanmātrāni pañcamahābhūtāni
ekādaśendriyīti trayoviṃśatiḥ | yad uktaṃ—

mūlaprakṛtir avikṛtir mahadādyāḥ prakṛtivikṛtayaḥ sapta |

ṣoḍaśakas tu vikāro na prakṛtir na vikṛtiḥ puruṣaḥ || iti |

tat sṛṣṭvā tad evānuprāviśad iti śruteḥ ||2||


 || 3.6.3 ||

 so'nupraviṣṭo bhagavāṃś ceṣṭārūpeṇa taṃ gaṇam |

bhinnaṃ saṃyojayām āsa suptaṃ karma prabodhayan ||

madhvaḥ : mātrābhiḥ aṃśaiḥ ||3||

śrīdharaḥ : ceṣṭārūpeṇa kriyāśaktyā | karma teṣāṃ kriyāṃ jīvānām adṛṣṭaṃ
vā ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ceṣṭārūpeṇa pūrvoktena kālākhyenaiva kāraṇabhūtena |
yo'yaṃ kālas tasya te'vyaktabandho ceṣṭām āhur ity ukteḥ ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : ceṣṭārūpeṇa kriyāśaktyā karma teṣāṃ kriyāṃ jīvānām adṛṣṭaṃ
vā ||3||


 || 3.6.4 ||

  prabuddhakarma daivena trayoviṃśatiko gaṇaḥ |

 prerito'janayat svābhir mātrābhir adhipūruṣam ||

madhvaḥ : mātrābhiḥ aṃśaiḥ ||4||

śrīdharaḥ : prabuddhaṃ karma kriyāśaktir yasya sa trayoviṃśater gaṇaḥ
daiveneśvareṇa preritaḥ | mātrābhir aṃśaiḥ | adhipūruṣaṃ virāḍdeham ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : adhipūruṣaṃ brahmāṇḍarūpaṃ, kvāhaṃ
tamomahadahaṅkhacarāgnivārbhūḥ ity ādy ukteḥ ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : prabuddhaṃ karma kriyāśaktir yasya saḥ | daiveneśvareṇa |
mātrābhir aṃśaiḥ | adhipūruṣaṃ virāḍdeham ||4||


 || 3.6.5 ||

 pareṇa viśatā svasmin mātrayā viśvasṛggaṇaḥ |

 cukṣobhānyonyam āsādya yasmin lokāś carācarāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : jananam evāha—pareṇeśvareṇa | viśvasṛjāṃ sattvānāṃ gaṇaḥ |
mātrayā cukṣobha pariṇato na sarvātmanā | yasmil lokāḥ sthitāḥ ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : jananaprakāram āha—viśvasṛjāṃ tattvānāṃ gaṇaḥ svasmin
pareṇa parameśvareṇa mātrayā aṃśena viśatā satā anyonyam āsādya
pradhānaguṇabhāvaṃ prāpya cukṣobha garbharūpeṇa pariṇato'bhūt ||5||


 || 3.6.6 ||

hiraṇmayaḥ sa puruṣaḥ sahasraparivatsarān |

āṇḍakośa uvāsāpsu sarvasattvopabṛṃhitaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : sa puruṣo'dhipuruṣa ity uktaḥ | āṇḍakośe brahmāṇḍamadhye |
sarvaiḥ sattvair anuśāyibhir jīvaiḥ sahitaḥ ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : hiraṇmayo brahmāṇḍas tasmin sthito hiraṇyagarbhaḥ apsu
iti pūrvaṃ jalenāntaḥ pūrṇatvāt ||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : sa samaṣṭivirāṭ hiraṇmayaḥ caturdaśabhuvanātmaka aṇḍakoṣa
yā āpaḥ garbhodakāni tāsu | yad vā, apsu yo'ṇḍakoṣas tasmin
sarvasattvair anuśāyibhir jīvair upabṛṃhato vistṛtaḥ ||6||


 || 3.6.7 ||

sa vai viśvasṛjāṃ garbho devakarmātmaśaktimān |

  vibabhājātmanātmānam ekadhā daśadhā tridhā ||

madhvaḥ :  īśvaro daivam uddiṣṭaṃ sarvasyāpi prabhutvataḥ  iti ca |
ātmaśaktiḥ prakṛtiḥ ||7||

śrīdharaḥ : garbhaḥ kāryarūpo virāṭ | devaśaktir jñānaśaktis tayaikadhā
hṛdayāvacchinnacaitanyarūpeṇa | karmaśaktiḥ kriyāśaktis tayā daśadhā
prāṇarūpeṇa prāṇādayaḥ pañca—nāgaḥ kūrmaś ca kṛkalo devadatto dhanañjayaḥ
ity ete pañca | evaṃ vṛttibhedena daśavidhaḥ prāṇaḥ | ātmaśaktir
bhoktṛśaktis tayādhyātmādhibhedena tridhātmānaṃ vibhaktaṃ kṛtavān ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sa vai iti daivakarmātmaśaktimān ity atra
daivaśaktyā karmaśaktyā ātmaśaktyā ca yukta ity arthaḥ ||7||

viśvanāthaḥ : atha tasya mukhādyaṅgasiddhyarthaṃ prathamaṃ
triśaktitvam āha—viśvasṛjāṃ mahadādīnāṃ garbhaḥ kāryarūpānand |
daivakarmātmaśaktimān jīvaprāṇādhyātmādiśaktiyuktaḥ | ātmanaivātmānaṃ
vibabhāja vibhaktaṃ kṛtavān | ekadhā jīvaśaktyā daśadhā prāṇaśaktyā
tridhā adhātmādiśaktyā ||7||


 || 3.6.8 ||

  eṣa hy aśeṣasattvānām ātmāṃśaḥ paramātmanaḥ |

  ādyo'vatāro yatrāsau bhūtagrāmo vibhāvyate ||

madhvaḥ : puruṣeṇātmabhūtena iti yo'ṇḍam asṛjat | sa eva ity uktaḥ |

ādyo'vatāro viṣṇos puruṣo nāma kīrtitaḥ |

asṛjat sa mahattattvaṃ sa evāntaṃ samāviśat |

sa brahmaṇo hṛdisthatvād dhṛdayaṃ ceti kīrtyate || iti ca ||8||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃ vibhāgasāmarthyāya tasyotkarṣam āha—eṣa hīti |
aśeṣasattvānāṃ prāṇinām ātmā | vyaṣṭīnāṃ tadaṃśatvāt | aṃśo jīvaḥ |
avatāratvoktis tasmin nārāyaṇāvirbhāvābhiprāyeṇa ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : paramātmopāsakānāṃ cittaśuddhārthaṃ prathamamayam evopāsya
ity āha—eṣa hīti | aśeṣasattvānāṃ prāṇinām ātmā, vyaṣṭīnāṃ tadaṃśatvāt |
avatāra iti yogināṃ tadantaryāminā saha tasyaikyabhāvanayā bhūtagrāmo
devamanuṣyādisamūhaḥ ||8||


 || 3.6.9 ||

sādhyātmaḥ sādhidaivaś ca sādhibhūta iti tridhā |

virāṭ prāṇo daśavidha ekadhā hṛdayena ca ||

madhvaḥ : prāṇādipañcakaṃ caiva tathā nāgādipañcakam |

sanāgakūrmakṛkaladevadattadhanañjayāḥ |

evaṃ tu daśadhā prāṇaḥ adhyātmāditridhākhilā || iti ca vyomasaṃhitāyām |

prāṇaḥ prathamajo yas tu pradhāno vāyur īritaḥ |

tvagātmādyās tu tatputrā dvidhābhūtam udāhṛtam || iti tattvanirṇaye
||9||

śrīdharaḥ : pūrvaślokārthaṃ vivṛṇoti | sādhyātmaḥ adhyātmānīndriyāṇi tat
sahitaḥ | virāḍ iti sarvatra ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atra devasya īśvarasya jīvarūpā cicchaktiḥ tayā
hṛdayasthayā ekadhā ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : ekadhā daśadhā tridheti pūrvaślokoktaṃ vyutkrameṇa
vivṛṇoti—sādhyātmaḥ ādhyātmānīndriyāṇi tatsahitaḥ | adhidaivānīndriyāṇāṃ
devatāḥ | adhibhūtāni adhiṣṭhānāni viṣayāś ca |

prāṇo'pānaḥ samānaś ca udāno vyāna eva ca |

nāgaḥ kūrmaś ca kṛkalo devadatto dhanañjayaḥ ||

iti vṛttibhedena daśavidhaḥ prāṇa iti daśavidhenānena virāḍ eva daśavidha
ity arthaḥ | tatra prāṇaḥ prākkramaṇo nāsāgravartī | apāno'vākkramaṇaḥ
pāyvādisthānavartī | samāno bhuktapītānnādisamīkaraṇaḥ
śarīramadhyavartī | udāna utkramaṇaḥ kaṇṭhasthānavartī | nāgaḥ
udgīraṇakaraḥ | kūrmaḥ unmīlanakaraḥ | kṛkaraḥ kṣudhākaraḥ | devadatto
jṛmbhākaraḥ | dhanañjayaḥ poṣaṇakaraḥ | hṛdayena hṛdayāvacchinnena
caitanyena jīvena ||9||


 || 3.6.10 ||

  smaran viśvasṛjām īśo vijñāpitam adhokṣajaḥ |

virājam atapat svena tejasaiṣāṃ vivṛttaye ||

śrīdharaḥ : adhyātmādibhedaṃ prapañcayitum āha—smarann iti | vijñāpitaṃ
yāvad baliṃ te'ja harāma [bhā.pu. 3.5.48] ityādi | svena tejasā
cicchaktyā | atapat evaṃ kariṣyāmīty ālocitavān | yasya jñānamayaṃ tapaḥ
iti śruteḥ | vivṛttaye vividhavṛttilābhāya ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanu virāṭ puruṣasyedṛśī śaktiś ced īśvarapraveśena
kiṃ tatrāha smarann iti | adhokṣajāṃśaḥ puruṣaḥ | kāraṇānugraheṇaiva
kāryaśaktir uddhavatīti bhāvaḥ | ata etad anantaram eva sa vai
viśvasṛjām ityādyuktaṃ jñeyam | atapat svena tejasā prakāśayitum
iṣṭavān ||10||

viśvanāthaḥ : adhyātmādibhedaṃ prapañcayitum antaryāmirūpeṇa
praviṣṭasyeśvarasya kim api kṛtyam āha—smarann iti | vijñāpitaṃ yāvad
baliṃ te'ja harāma [bhā.pu. 3.5.48] ityādi | svena tejasā cicchaktyā |
atapat prakāśayāmāsa | eṣāṃ viśvasṛjāṃ vivṛttaye vividhavṛttilābhāya
cakṣuṣaś cakṣur uta śrotrasya śrotram ityādiśruteḥ | kāraṇaśaktir eva
kāryeṣūdbhavatīti bhāvaḥ ||10||


 || 3.6.11 ||

 atha tasyābhitaptasya katidhāyatanāni ha |

  nirabhidyanta devānāṃ tāni me gadataḥ śṛṇu ||

śrīdharaḥ : me mattaḥ śṛṇu ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tasya samaṣṭivirājaḥ abhitaptasya parameśvareṇa
prakāśitasya āyatanāni sthānabhedāḥ nirabhidyanta pṛthag bhuvan | me
mattaḥ ||11||


 || 3.6.12 ||

tasyāgnir āsyaṃ nirbhinnaṃ lokapālo'viśat padam |

 vācā svāṃśena vaktavyaṃ yayāsau pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : āyatanāny evāha—tasyāgnir ityādi caturdaśabhiḥ | āsyaṃ
nirbhinnaṃ pṛthagjātam | padaṃ svasthānam | svāṃśena svaśaktyā vācā
sahāviśat | asau jīvaḥ | vaktavyaṃ pratipadyate—śabdam uccārayatīty arthaḥ
| sarvatra yan nirbhinnaṃ tad adhiṣṭhānam | agnyādiprathamāntam
adhidaivam | vāgādīndriyam | tṛtīyāntam adhyātmam | pratipattavyam
adhibhūtam ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : nirbhinnaṃ pṛthagjātam āsyaṃ padaṃ svasthānaṃ vācā
vāgindriyeṇa saha agnir aviśat svāṃśena svenaikāṃśena yayā vācaiva asau
jīvaḥ virāṭ vaktavyaṃ pratipadyate śabdam uccārayatīty arthaḥ | evaṃ
sarvatra yan nirbhinnaṃ dvitīyāntaṃ tad adhibhūtam adhiṣṭhānam | yad
agnyādiprathamāntaṃ tad adhidaivam | yad vāgāditṛtīyāntaṃ tad
adhyātmam | yat punar dvitīyāntaṃ kvacit ṣaṣṭhyantaṃ tad adhibhūtaṃ
viṣayaḥ ||12||


 || 3.6.13 ||

 nirbhinnaṃ tālu varuṇo lokapālo'viśad dhareḥ |

  jihvayāṃśena ca rasaṃ yayāsau pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : harer virājaḥ ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : hareḥ haritvena dhyeyasya virājaḥ ||13||


 || 3.6.14 ||

  nirbhinne aśvinau nāse viṣṇor āviśatāṃ padam |

ghrāṇenāṃśena gandhasya pratipattir yato bhavet ||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yato ghrāṇāt ||14||


 || 3.6.15 ||

 nirbhinne akṣiṇī tvaṣṭā lokapālo'viśad vibhoḥ |

 cakṣuṣāṃśena rūpāṇāṃ pratipattir yato bhavet ||

śrīdharaḥ : tvaṣṭā ādityaḥ ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tvaṣṭā sūryaḥ ||15||


 || 3.6.16 ||

 nirbhinnāny asya carmāṇi lokapālo'nilo'viśat |

 prāṇenāṃśena saṃsparśaṃ yenāsau pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ : prāṇeneti | prāṇavad dehavyāpinā
tvagindriyeṇety arthaḥ ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : carmāṇīti carmopalakṣitā tvag ity arthaḥ iti
dvitīyaskandhe ṭīkāsya vartate | prāṇenendriyeṇātra tu tvagrūpeṇety
arthaḥ ||16||


 || 3.6.17 ||

 karṇāv asya vinirbhinnau dhiṣṇyaṃ svaṃ viviśur diśaḥ |

śrotreṇāṃśena śabdasya siddhiṃ yena prapadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : śabdasya siddhiṃ jñānam ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : siddhiṃ jñānam ||17||


 || 3.6.18 ||

  tvacam asya vinirbhinnāṃ viviśur dhiṣṇyam oṣadhīḥ |

 aṃśena romabhiḥ kaṇḍūṃ yair asau pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : tvacaṃ carma | oṣadhīr oṣadhayaḥ | tvagindriyasyaiva
sthānabhedena viṣayadvayaṃ kaṇḍūḥ sparśaś ca | tatra cāyaṃ nāmabhedo
devatābhedaś ceti dvitīyaskandha eva vyākhyātaḥ ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tvacam iti | ekasminn api sparśagrāhake bhedadvayam
idaṃ kalpyaṃ bahiradhiṣṭhānaṃ carma indriyaṃ lomadevatāś ca
oṣadhyadhiṣṭhātrya ity ekaḥ antarbahiradhiṣṭhānaṃ tu tvagindriyam api
tvag indriyam api tvag devatā ca vāyur ity anyo bhedaḥ ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ :  oṣadhīr oṣadhayaḥ | atra tvacy adhiṣṭhāne tvak romāṇi
cendriyadvayam | tatra tvagindriye anilo devatā sparśo viṣayaḥ |
romendriye oṣadhyo devatāḥ kaṇḍuviṣayaḥ ||18||


 || 3.6.19 ||

 meḍhraṃ tasya vinirbhinnaṃ svadhiṣṇyaṃ ka upāviśat |

retasāṃśena yenāsāv ānandaṃ pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : kaḥ prajāpatiḥ ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kaḥ prajāpatiḥ retasā reta upalakṣitena upasthena ity
arthaḥ ||19||


 || 3.6.20 ||

  gudaṃ puṃso vinirbhinnaṃ mitro lokeśa āviśat |

pāyunāṃśena yenāsau visargaṃ pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : visargaṃ malamūtrotsargam ||20||


 || 3.6.21 ||

  hastāv asya vinirbhinnāv indraḥ svarpatir āviśat |

  vārtayāṃśena puruṣo yayā vṛttiṃ prapadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : svarpatiḥ svargasya patiḥ | vārtayā krayavikrayādiśaktyā |
vṛttiṃ jīvikām ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  vārtayā krayavikrayādiśaktyeti vārtā
balaśilpādiśabdavācyam adhyātmam | vṛttiṃ jīvikām ||21||


 || 3.6.22 ||

  pādāv asya vinirbhinnau lokeśo viṣṇur āviśat |

 gatyā svāṃśena puruṣo yayā prāpyaṃ prapadyate ||

na katamena vyākhyātam.


 || 3.6.23 ||

  buddhiṃ cāsya vinirbhinnāṃ vāgīśo dhiṣṇyam āviśat |

bodhenāṃśena boddhavyaṃ pratipattir yato bhavet ||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : buddhiṃ buddhyāspadaṃ golakaṃ hṛdayaikadeśam | vāgīśo
brahmā bodhena buddhyā | śloko'yam asarvasammataḥ ||23||


 || 3.6.24 ||

  hṛdayaṃ cāsya nirbhinnaṃ candramā dhiṣṇyam āviśat |

manasāṃśena yenāsau vikriyāṃ pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : vikriyāṃ saṅkalpādirūpām ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vikriyāṃ saṅkalpādirūpām ||24||


 || 3.6.25 ||

 ātmānaṃ cāsya nirbhinnam abhimāno'viśat padam |

  karmaṇāṃśena yenāsau kartavyaṃ pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : ātmānam ahaṅkāram | abhimanyate'nenety abhimāno rudraḥ |
karmaṇā'haṃ vṛttyā | kartavyam iti kriyām ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ātmānam ahambhāvāspadaṃ karmaṇā ahambhavenendriyeṇa
||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : ātmānam ahaṅkārāspadaṃ golakaṃ hṛdayaikadeśam |
abhimanyate'neneti abhimāno rudraḥ | karmaṇāhaṅkāreṇa kartavyam
abhimantavyam ||25||


 || 3.6.26 ||

  sattvaṃ cāsya vinirbhinnaṃ mahān dhiṣṇyam upāviśat |

  cittenāṃśena yenāsau vijñānaṃ pratipadyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : sattvam iti buddhicittayor abhedena nirdeśaḥ | mahān iti
brahmā | cittena cetanayā ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sattvaṃ cittāspadaṃ golakaṃ cittenendriyeṇa vijñānaṃ
sāmānyato jñeyam, tac ca buddher apy upalakṣaṇaṃ kvacit tu pādāv asyety
anantaraṃ buddhiṃ cāsyety ādikam api padyaṃ pṛthag asti ||26||

viśvanāthaḥ : sattvaṃ cittāspadaṃ golakaṃ hṛdayaikadeśaṃ mahān viṣṇuḥ
vijñānaṃ cetanām ||26||


 || 3.6.27 ||

śīrṣṇo'sya dyaur dharā padbhyāṃ khaṃ nābher udapadyata |

guṇānāṃ vṛttayo yeṣu pratīyante surādayaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ : trilokotpattim āha—śīrṣṇa iti | vṛttayaḥ
pariṇāmāḥ ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : śīrṣṇa iti asya virājaḥ śīrṣṇo dyulokakāraṇāṃśāt |
evam anyatrāpi jñeyaṃ bhūvarlokaḥ ||27||


 || 3.6.28 ||

ātyantikena sattvena divaṃ devāḥ prapedire |

 dharāṃ rajaḥsvabhāvena paṇayo ye ca tān anu ||

śrīdharaḥ : etad eva prapañcayati dvābhyām | ātyantikenorjitena | “paṇa
vyavahāre” | paṇante yāgādinā vyavaharantīti paṇayo manuṣyāḥ, tān anu
etadupakaraṇabhūtā ye gavādayas te'pi dharāṃ prapedire ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ātyantikenorjitena | paṇante yāgādinā vyavaharantīti paṇayo
manuṣyāḥ paṇavyavahāre | tān anuvartante ye tadupakaraṇabhūtā ye
gavādayas te'pi dharāṃ prapedire ||28||


 || 3.6.29 ||

  tārtīyena svabhāvena bhagavannābhim āśritāḥ |

 ubhayor antaraṃ vyoma ye rudrapārṣadāṃ gaṇāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tṛtīyaṃ tamas tadīyena tāmasena | ubhayor dyāv āpṛthivyor
antaraṃ madhyaṃ vyomāntarikṣaṃ, tad eva bhagavato nābhis tām āśritā
rudrapārṣadāṃ rudrasya pārṣadānāṃ bhūtādīnāṃ gaṇāḥ ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tṛtīyaṃ tamas tadīyena tāmasenety arthaḥ | ye rudrapārṣadāṃ
bhūtādīnāṃ gaṇās te bhagavato virājo nābhim āśritā ity anvayaḥ | nābhir
eva kā ? tatrāha—ubhayor dyāv āpṛthivor antarajṃ madhyaṃ vyoma ākāśaṃ
bhuvarlokam ||29||


 || 3.6.30 ||

mukhato'vartata brahma puruṣasya kurūdvaha |

yas tūnmukhatvād varṇānāṃ mukhyo'bhūd brāhmaṇo guruḥ ||

madhvaḥ : brahmābhimānī tu bhṛgur ajani brahmaṇo mukhāt |

kṣatrābhimānī tu manubrahmabāhvor ajāyata ||

ūrvor viḍabhimānī ca vāstuḥ pādāt kṛtis tathā |

ete pūrvaṃ harer jātā brahmaṇas tadanantaram |

evaṃ rudrāc ca vāyoś ca tadantasthaharer yataḥ || iti ṣāḍguṇye ||30||

śrīdharaḥ : avartata pravṛttam | brahma vedaḥ | yas tūnmukhatvān
mukhodbhavatvād varṇānāṃ mukhyaḥ mukham iva prathamo guruś ca abhūt so'pi
mukhato'vartatety anuṣaṅgaḥ | adhyāpanādinā brāhmaṇasya vedo vṛttiḥ | tayā
vṛttyā saha brāhmaṇo mukhato jāta ity arthaḥ | evam uttaratra
varṇatraye'pi jñātavyam ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : cāturvarṇyotpattim āha | brahma vedaḥ | puruṣasya
parameśvareṇaikyāt tasya mukhato'vartata abhūt, yas tūnmukhatvād
vedonmukhatvād dhetor varṇānāṃ mukhyo guruś ca abhūt brāhmaṇaḥ so'pi
mukhato'vartatety anuṣaṅgaḥ ||30||


 || 3.6.31 ||

bāhubhyo'vartata kṣatraṃ kṣatriyas tad anuvrataḥ |

yo jātas trāyate varṇān pauruṣaḥ kaṇṭakakṣatāt ||

śrīdharaḥ : kṣatraṃ pālanarūpā vṛttis tat kṣatram anuvrato'nusṛtaḥ
kṣatriyo'pi bāhubhyo'vartata ity arthaḥ | tadanuvratatvam evāha—ya iti |
pauruṣaḥ puruṣasya viṣṇor aṃśaḥ | kaṇṭakāś corādayas tebhyo yat kṣatam
upadravas tasmāt trāyate rakṣati ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  kṣatraṃ pālanaśaktiḥ tadanuvratas tadunmukhaḥ
kṣatriyo'pi bāhubhyo'vartata ity arthaḥ | kaṇṭakāś corādayas tebhyo yat
kṣatam upadravas tasmāt trāyate rakṣati, yataḥ pauruṣaṃ puruṣasyāyaṃ
tadīyapālanaśaktimattvād ity arthaḥ ||31||


 || 3.6.32 ||

 viśo'vartanta tasyorvor lokavṛttikarīr vibhoḥ |

  vaiśyas tadudbhavo vārtāṃ nṛṇāṃ yaḥ samavartayat ||

śrīdharaḥ : viśaḥ kṛṣyādivyavasāyāḥ | lokasya vṛttikarīr jīvikāhetavaḥ
| tasya vibhor ūrvoḥ pravṛttāḥ | tadudbhava ūrujo vārtāṃ jīvikāṃ yaḥ
svavṛttyā saṃpāditavān ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  viśaḥ kṛṣyādivyavasāyāḥ | ūrvoḥ ūrubhyāṃ lokānāṃ
vṛttikarīr jīvikāhetavaḥ | vaiśyo'pi tadudbhava ūrubhavaḥ | vārtāṃ
jīvikāṃ yaḥ svavṛttyā samavartayat saṃpāditavān ||32||


 || 3.6.33 ||

padbhyāṃ bhagavato jajñe śuśrūṣā dharmasiddhaye |

  tasyāṃ jātaḥ purā śūdro yadvṛttyā tuṣyate hariḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tasyāṃ nimittabhūtāyām | yasya vṛttyā hariḥ svayam eva
tuṣyati ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : padbhyām iti | yadvṛttyā śuśraṣārūpayā brāhmaṇādinā
sarveṇāpi svasmin kṛtaya harir api tuṣyatīti tadvṛtter mahimā darśitaḥ |
tyaktvā svadharmaṃ [bhā.pu. 1.5.17] ity ādau na kevalena svadharmeṇa,
bhagavattoṣānaṅgīkārāt ||33||

viśvanāthaḥ : śuśrūṣā paricaryā karmaṇo varṇāśramadharmasya siddhaye
śuśrūṣāṃ vinā karmamātrasyaiva siddhir na bhavatīti sā śūdrasya vṛttir
bhavanty api vastutaḥ sārvavarṇiky eveti bhāvas tasyāṃ viṣaye śūdro jātaḥ,
padbhyām iti śeṣaḥ | yadvṛttyā haris tuṣyatīti vedādibhyo'pi śuśrūṣāyā
utkarṣaḥ sūcitaḥ ||33||


 || 3.6.34 ||

ete varṇāḥ svadharmeṇa yajanti svaguruṃ harim |

śraddhayātmaviśuddhyarthaṃ yajjātāḥ saha vṛttibhiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra prathamajātaiḥ sarvair etais tu svasvadharmaḥ
hariyajanarūpatayaiva bhāvita iti tadānīntanānāṃ vaiśiṣṭyam
abhipretyāha—eta iti | atra yad iti | virājo hariśaktita eva tacchakteḥ
ato haribhajane eva tadabhedoktes tātparyam ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yat yasmāj jātāḥ gurutvāj janakatvād vṛttipradatvāc ca
harer ārādhanaṃ teṣāṃ paro dharma ity arthaḥ ||34||

viśvanāthaḥ : sahavṛttibhir iti hariyajane jīvikārthaṃ cintā na kāryeti
bhāvaḥ ||34||


 || 3.6.35 ||

 etat kṣattar bhagavato daivakarmātmarūpiṇaḥ |

 kaḥ śraddadhyād upākartuṃ yogamāyābalodayam ||

madhvaḥ : adhikatvād devaśabdo daivateṣv adhiko yataḥ |

daivaṃ hariḥ karmamūlaṃ kṛtir ity eva bhaṇyate |

āptatvād ātmaśabdaś ca śrīpatitvāc ca mādhavaḥ || iti ca ||35||

śrīdharaḥ : bho kṣattaḥ, devakarmātmarūpiṇaḥ
kālakarmasvabhāvaśaktimatā bhagavato yogamāyābalenojjṛmbhitam etad
virāḍrūpam upākartuṃ sākalyena nirūpayituṃ kaḥ śraddadhyād iccheta |
icchāpy aśakyā nirūpaṇaṃ tu dūrata ity arthaḥ ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yogamāyātra viśvasṛṣṭyādiśāktiḥ ||35||

viśvanāthaḥ : daivakarmātmānaḥ kālakarmasvabhāvāḥ svīyaśaktitvād
rūpāṇi tadvataḥ | yogamāyābalena udayo yasya tad etad viśvam upākartuṃ
sāmastyena nirūpayituṃ kaḥ śraddadhyāt icchet icchāpy aśakyo nirūpaṇaṃ tu
dūrata eveti bhāvaḥ ||35||


 || 3.6.36 ||

 tathāpi kīrtayāmy aṅga yathāmati yathāśrutam |

 kīrtiṃ hareḥ svāṃ satkartuṃ giram anyābhidhāsatīm ||

śrīdharaḥ : aṅga vidura, athāpi hareḥ kīrtiṃ kīrtayāmi | yathāśrutaṃ
gurumukhāt | tad api na sarvātmanā, kintu yathāmati svamatyanusāreṇa |
anyābhidhā harivyatiriktārthābhidhānaṃ tayā asatīṃ malināṃ svīyāṃ vācaṃ
satkartuṃ pavitrīkartum ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kīrtiṃ tādṛgvirāṭsṛṣṭyādivarṇanarūpāṃ giraṃ
vāgindriyam ||36||

viśvanāthaḥ : yathāśrutaṃ gurumukhāt tathāpi yathāmati svabuddhyā
yāvadgṛhītaṃ tāvad eva, na tu yad yad eva śrutam ity arthaḥ | anyābhidhā
harivyatiriktā kathā tayā asatīṃ malināṃ svīyaṃ vācaṃ satkartuṃ
pavitrīkartum ||36||


 || 3.6.37 ||

 ekāntalābhaṃ vacaso nu puṃsāṃ

suślokamauler guṇavādam āhuḥ |

śruteś ca vidvadbhir upākṛtāyāṃ

kathāsudhāyām upasamprayogam ||

śrīdharaḥ : ajñātvāpi yathāmati kīrtane śravaṇe vā āvaśyakaṃ kaivalyam
ity āha—ekāntato lābhaṃ nu niścitam āhuḥ | śruteḥ śrotrasya | upākṛtāyāṃ
nirūpitāyām | upasaṃprayogaṃ sannidhāv arpaṇam ||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ekānteti | kaivalyasukhasyāpy atikramād iti bhāvaḥ
||37||

viśvanāthaḥ : harikaṣṭamṛtābdher apāratvāt sāmastyena jñānaṃ na kasyāpy
ato yat kiñcij jñāne eva tatkīrtanaśravaṇābhyāṃ lokāḥ kṛtārthībhūya taṃ
prāpnuvantīty āha—guṇavādaṃ guṇakīrtanam eva ekāntato lābham āhur anyat
sarvaṃ vacaso'pacayam evety arthaḥ | śruteḥ śotrasyāpi upākṛtāyāṃ
kīrtitāyām upasamprayogaṃ sannidhāv arpaṇam ||37||


 || 3.6.38 ||

  ātmano'vasito vatsa mahimā kavinādinā |

  saṃvatsarasahasrānte dhiyā yogavipakvayā ||

śrīdharaḥ : na cātīva jñāne nirbandhaḥ kartavyaḥ, brahmaṇo'pi durjñeyatvād
ity āha—ātmano harer mahimā yogavipakvayāpi dhiyā
saṃvatsarasahasrānte'py ādikavinā brahmaṇāpi kim avasitaḥ kiṃ jñātaḥ ?
iti kākūktyā etāvān iti na jñāta evety uktam ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ātmana iti sārdhakaṃ paramātmano mahimā
acintyaiśvaryādirūpaḥ saṃvatsarasahasrānte yogavipakvayā dhiyaiva
vasitaḥ acintyaśaktitvenaiva niścitaḥ ||38||

viśvanāthaḥ : na cātīva jñāne nirbandhaḥ kāryaḥ, brahmaṇo'pi durjñeyatvād
ity āha—ātmano harer mahimā yogavipakvayāpi saṃvatsarasahasrānte'py
ādikavinā brahmaṇāpi kim avasitaḥ kiṃ jñātaḥ ? iti kākūktyā etāvān iti na
jñāta evety arthaḥ | yad vā, saṃvatsarasahasrānta eva mahimā iti
acintyatvānantatvābhyāṃ durjñeyatvena niścīyate, tad eva bhagavanmahimno
jñānam etāvad idam itthaṃkāreṇa jñānaṃ tajjñānam eveti bhāvaḥ | tathā ca
śrutiḥ—ayatiṣaṣṭhataṃ tasya mataṃ yasya na veda sa iti ||38||


 || 3.6.39 ||

  ato bhagavato māyā māyinām api mohinī |

yat svayaṃ cātmavartmātmā na veda kim utāpare ||

madhvaḥ : ātmā brahmā na veda | ahaṃ rudraḥ |

guṇapūrter ātmaśabdo brahmā hīnatvato haraḥ |

ahaṃ śabdas tathāpy etau na jānīto hariṃ param || iti brāhme |

bhagavato māyāṃ bhagavato mahimānam | māyā tu mahimā proktā prācurye tu
mayaṭ yataḥ iti pādme | ātmavartmā paramātmagatiḥ ||39||

śrīdharaḥ : yat yasmāt svayam apy ātmā harir ātmavartma svamāyāgatim
etāvad iti na veda, anantatvāt ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ato ye tu cintyatvenaiva niścinvanti teṣām anyān
pratimāyināṃ mohakāriṇām api bhagavato māyā mohinī bhavatīty arthaḥ |
ataḥ kāraṇāt tanmāyā māyinām api mohinīti sārdhenānvayaḥ | bhagavata ity
atra bhagavatīti kvacit pāṭhaḥ | acintyatvam eva darśayati yad iti
sārdhakena | yat yasmāt svayam api ātmā vartmasvarūpaiśvaryaṃ na veda
sārvajñenāpi na paricchinatti anantatvāt atas tasmai nama eva kevalam ity
arthaḥ ||39||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv ātmatattvaṃ jānanto'nyān api jñāpayanto dārśanikā
bahava eva dṛśyante, tatrāha—ata iti | ataḥ kāraṇāt tanmāyā māyināṃ
bodhayitavyeṣu svaśiṣyeṣu māyām evārpayatāṃ teṣām api mohinī niścayenaiva
mohinī muhur api saṃsāreṣu pātayitum iti bhāvaḥ | yad yataḥ svayam ātmā
parameśvaro'pi ātmavartma svasvarūpaṃ na veda na jānāti, apare varākā
kim uta jānīyuḥ ? ||39||


 || 3.6.40 ||

  yato'prāpya nyavartanta vācaś ca manasā saha |

  ahaṃ cānya ime devās tasmai bhagavate namaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : ato durjñeyatvāt kevalaṃ namaskaroti—yata iti | yasya jñānāya
pravṛttā vāco'pi manasā saha tam aprāpyaiva nyavartanta durjñeyatvāt | na
kevalaṃ vāṅ manasī, aham ahaṅkārasyādhiṣṭhātā rudro'pi | ime
indriyādhiṣṭhātāro devā anye ca ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tam eva viśinaṣṭi yat iti nivartanta iti kvacit pāṭhaḥ
||40||

viśvanāthaḥ : ato durjñeyatvam eva sthāpayan namaskaroti | aprāpya antam
alabdhvā yataḥ sakāśān nivartate vācaḥ samaṣṭivyaṣṭīnāṃ sarveṣām api
vāgindriyāṇi manasā saheti manāṃsi ca | yad vā, brahmaṇo mukhān nirgatāḥ
sarve vedā eva vācaḥ, tasyaiva manasā saha, aham ahaṅkārādhiṣṭhātā rudraḥ,
ime devā bṛhaspatyādayaś ca yato nivartante | kutaḥ ? aprāpya
yannāmarūpacaritrādināṃ samyaṅmādhuryagrahaṇāsamarthyāt apārāṇāṃ
teṣām antaprāptasāmarthyāc cety arthaḥ | śrutir apy ācaṣṭe—yato vāco
nivartante aprāpya manasā saha [tai.u. 2.4.1]  iti | atrāpādānanirdeśe
eva vāṅmanaḥsaṃśleṣapratyāyako nivṛttis tv anantatvena pramātum
aśakyatvād iti jñeyam | sarvathaiva vāgādyagamyatvaṃ tv ātmano na
vyākhyeyam |  vedaiś ca sarvair aham eva vedyaḥ [gītā 15.15] iti,
manasaivānudraṣṭavyam etad ameyaṃ dhruvaṃ, tad viṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ sadā
paśyanti sūrayaḥ ityādiśrutivirodhāpatteḥ ||40||


iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

ṣaṣṭho'dhyāyas tṛtīye'smin saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


  iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye

 pāramahaṃsyaṃ saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ

 tṛtīyaskandhe viduroddhavasaṃvāde

  ṣaṣṭho'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.6 ||

 (3.7)

  saptamo'dhyāyaḥ

 || 3.7.1 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

 evaṃ bruvāṇaṃ maitreyaṃ dvaipāyanasuto budhaḥ |

 prīṇayann iva bhāratyā viduraḥ pratyabhāṣata ||

śrīdharaḥ :

 saptame saṃśayacchedi pratinandya muner vacaḥ |

punaḥ kṣattrā kṛtā nānā praśnāḥ samyag udīritāḥ ||

atha te bhagavallīlā  yogamāyopabṛṃhitāḥ [bhā.pu. 3.5.22] ityādinā
māyāguṇair līlayā bhagavān sṛṣṭyādi karotīty evaṃ bruvāṇaṃ maitreyaṃ
bhāratyā prārthanārūpayā prīṇayann ivety abhiprāyājñānenākṣepāt ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : iveti vākyālaṅkāre ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

 saptame bhagavajjīvagatānyat saṃśayacchidā |

 bhaktijijñāsayānyo'pi kṣattuḥ praśnāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

evaṃ—

sā vā etasya sandraṣṭuḥ śaktiḥ sadasadātmikā |

māyānāma mahābhāga yayedaṃ nirmame vibhuḥ |

kālavṛttyā tu māyāyāṃ guṇamayyām adhokṣajaḥ |

puruṣeṇātmabhūtena vīryam ādhatta vīryavān || [bhā.pu. 3.5.2526]

ity ādi bruvāṇaṃ bhāratyā brahmaṃs tvayā saṃsārakūpād uddhṛta evāham iti
madhurayā vācā prīṇayan iveti viduramanogatākṣepasya sahasaiva
maitreyeṇāvagatatvān maitreyaṃ prīṇayitum aśaknuvann ity arthaḥ ||1||


 || 3.7.2 ||

vidura uvāca—

brahman kathaṃ bhagavataś cinmātrasyāvikāriṇaḥ |

 līlayā cāpi yujyeran nirguṇasya guṇāḥ kriyāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nirvikārasya ktiyā, nirguṇasya ca guṇāḥ katham | līlayety
uktiḥ prayojanābhāvaṃ pariharati na vastuvirodham iti bhāvaḥ ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha svābhāvikamāyāśaktyā parameśvaro
viśvasṛṣṭyādikaṃ karoti | jīvaś ca tatra muhyatīty uktam | tatra
sandehaṃ praśnottarābhyāṃ pariharati—brahmann ity ādinā | he brahman!
kathaṃ bhagavataś cinmātrasya svataḥ svarūpaśaktyā bhagavataḥ
śrīmadvaikuṇṭhādigatatādṛśaiśvaryādiyuktasya, ata eva nirguṇasya
prākṛtaguṇāspṛṣṭasya, tata eva cāvikāriṇaḥ
tādṛksvarūpaśaktivilāsabhūtānāṃ kriyāṇām anantānām api
sadoditvarānantavidhaprakāśe tasmin nityasiddhatvāt
tattatkriyāvirbhāvakartur iva na nirvikārāpattir iti nirvikārasya
kathaṃ sattvādayaḥ prākṛtaguṇāḥ ? kathaṃ vā tadāsaṅgahetukā
sthāpanādayaḥ kriyāś ca yujyeran ? tataś ca cinmātravastuvirodhād eva
te ca tāś ca na yujyante | bhagavattve tu svairaceṣṭayāpi na yujyerann,
ity āha—līlayā vāpīti | atrāvikāritvanirguṇatvābhyāṃ saha cinmātratvaṃ
bhagavattvaṃ cety ubhayam api svīkṛtyaiva pūrvapakṣiṇā pṛṣṭam ||2||
[paramātmasandarbha 84]

viśvanāthaḥ : cinmātrasya guṇāḥ sattvādayaḥ kriyāḥ sṛṣṭyādayaś ca kathaṃ
? atra cidrūpasya cinmayasyetyādikam aprayujya cinmātrasyety
avadhāraṇavācimātraśabdaprayogād acidgandhasyāpi tatra rāhityaṃ
bodhitaṃ tataś ca sā vā etasyety anena sattvādiguṇamayyā māyāyā
bhagavacchaktitvenoktatvāc chakteś ca svabhinnatvāsambhavāt vastuto
guṇās tadīyā eveti, tasya cinmātratve kathaṃ sattvādijaḍaguṇavattvaṃ
sattvādijaḍaguṇavattve ca kathaṃ cinmātr|atvam ity ākṣepa ekaḥ | tathā
vikāro hi kālahetuko guṇadharma eveti tasya tu cinmātratvād evāvikāritve
kathaṃ vikāravyañjakakriyāvattvaṃ, kriyāvattve ca katham avikāritvam iti
dvitīyaḥ |

nanv evam asambhavanto'pi guṇāḥ kriyāś ca tasya svairalīlatvāt
sambhaveyuḥ ? tatrāha—līlayā veti nahi līlayety uktyā virodhaḥ parihartuṃ
śakyate, tasya tādṛśalīlatve guṇavattvasya duṣpariharatvād iti bhāvaḥ |
atra bhagavata iti viśeṣyaṃ bhagavān eva cinmātrā, na tu bhaga iti
vācyaṃ, yato bhagasyāpi bhagavattvam aprākṛtatvaṃ viṣṇupurāṇe dṛṣṭaṃ,
yathā—

jñānaśaktibalaiśvaryavīryatejāṃsy aśeṣataḥ |

bhagavacchabdavācyāni vinā heyair guṇādibhiḥ || [vi.pu. 6.5.79] iti |

ata eva dehadehivibhāgo'yaṃ neśvare vidyate kvacid ity uktam, ata eva
bhagaśabdavācyānāṃ ṣaḍaiśvaryāṇām api cinmātratvam eva, na tu
sattvādiguṇapariṇāmatvam iti bhagavattvaṃ svarūpalakṣaṇam eva |
bhagavattvasya māyikatv taṭasthalakṣaṇatvam iti vyācakṣāṇā bhrāntā eva |
indrasya māyeyam iti indro māyayā vṛṣabho bhavatīty ukte indrasya
vṛṣarūpatvam eva svamāyākṛtaṃ pratīyate, na tv indratvaṃ yathā tathaiva
seyaṃ bhagavato māyeti bhagavān eva māyayā viśvaṃ bhavatīty uktyā
bhagavato viśvarūpatvam eva māyikaṃ syān, na tu bhagavattvam iti yukteś
ca ||2||


 || 3.7.3 ||

 krīḍāyāṃ ūdyamo'rbhasya kāmaś cikrīḍiṣānyataḥ |

svatastṛptasya ca kathaṃ nivṛttasya sadānyataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : arbhakaval līlāpi na yujyate vaiṣamyād ity āha—udyamayati
pravartayatīty udyamaḥ | arbhakasya krīḍāyāṃ pravṛttihetuḥ kāmo'sti |
anyatas tu vastvantareṇa bālāntarapravartanena vā tasya krīḍecchā
bhavati | īśvarasya tu svatas tṛptasya kathaṃ kāmaḥ ? anyataḥ sadā
nivṛttasya cāsaṅgādvitīyasya katham anyataś cikrīḍiṣā ? ity arthaḥ ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tataś ca tasya cinmātrasvarūpasya bhavatu bhagavattvaṃ
tanmātre'smākaṃ na sandehaḥ, kintu tasya katham itaraguṇādisvīkāro
yujyate ? ity eva pṛcchyate iti vākyārthaḥ | tataś ca cinmātratve
bhagavanmātratve ca tasya tucchā guṇāḥ kriyāś ca na sambhavanty eveti
dviguṇībhūyaiva praśnaḥ | līlayā vāpi kathaṃ yujyeran ? iti
viśadayati—krīḍāyām iti | adhikāritvāditattadutkarṣahīnasyārbhakasya
cikrīḍiṣārūpaḥ kāmaḥ, tābhyām anyasya krīḍāyāṃ ūdyame hetur bhavati |
bhagavatas tu svenātmasvarūpavaibhavena ca tṛptasya, ata evānyataḥ sadā
vivṛttasya ca katham asāv anyataḥ sambhavet ||3|| [paramātmasandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, līlayety uktyā virodhaparihāro māstu līlaiva tāvad
īśvare hetvabhāvān na ghaṭata iti sadṛṣṭāntam āha—krīḍāyām iti |
udyamayati pravartayatīty udyamaḥ kāma evārbhakasya svābhāvikaḥ krīḍāyāṃ
pravṛttihetur asti | tathā anyato bālāntarapravartanam api cikrīḍiṣāsti
parameśvarasya ātmārāmatvāt kathaṃ kāma īśvarāntarābhāvāt ? katham anyataś
cikrīḍiṣā ? ity āha—svatas tṛptasyety ādi | anyato nivṛttasya
anyarahitasya ||3||


 || 3.7.4 ||

 asrākṣīd bhagavān viśvaṃ guṇamayy ātmamāyayā |

tayā saṃsthāpayaty etad bhūyaḥ pratyapidhāsyati ||

śrīdharaḥ : yac coktaṃ smaran viśvasṛjām īśo vijñāpitam adhokṣaje
[bhā.pu. 3.6.1] ityādināvidyopādher jīvasya bhogārtham īśvaraḥ sṛṣṭyādi
karotīti tad apy ākṣeptum anuvadati—

asrākṣīd iti | guṇamayī ātmano jīvasya kartṛtvabhoktṛtvādimohotpādikā
yā māyā, tayā sṛṣṭavān | tad uktaṃ prathame—

yayā saṃmohito jīva ātmānaṃ triguṇātmakam |

paro'pi manute'narthaṃ tatkṛtaṃ cābhipadyate || [bhā.pu. 1.7.5] ityādinā
|

atra ca, ato bhagavato māyā māyinām api mohinī [bhā.pu. 3.6.39] iti |
saṃsthāpayati pālayati | pratyapidhāsyati prātilomyena tirohitaṃ kariṣyati
| pāṭhāntare prātilomyenātmany abhito dhārayiṣyati ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na ca tasya te guṇās tāḥ kriyāś ca na vidyanta ity
apalapanīyaṃ tathaiva prasiddher ity āha—asrākṣīd iti | guṇamayyā
traiguṇyavyañjinyā ātmāśritayā māyayā saṃsthāpayati pālayati
pratyapidhāsyati prātilomyena tirohitaṃ kariṣyati ||4||
[paramātmasandarbha 86]

viśvanāthaḥ : na ca tasya te guṇāḥ kriyāś ca na satnīty apalapanīyaṃ
tathaiva prasiddher ity āha—asrākṣīd iti | pratyapidhāsyati prātilomyena
tirohitaṃ kariṣyati ||4||


 || 3.7.5 ||

 deśataḥ kālato yo'sāv avasthātaḥ svato'nyataḥ |

aviluptāvabodhātmā sa yujyetājayā katham ||

madhvaḥ: durbhagakleśaśarīrasthatvāt tasyāpi bhāvyam | na ca tad
yujyate | seyaṃ bhagavato māyā, ayaṃ hi bhagavanmahimā | tasya kārpaṇyaṃ
bandhanādi na yujyata iti yad uktaṃ tan nāyyam eva | durbhagādi
śarīrasthasyāpi taddoṣāsparśa eva tanmahimety arthaḥ |

kathaṃ dehaparo devo lipyeta sa hi bandhanaiḥ |

kathaṃ na duḥkhī sa bhaved duḥkhī ced īśvaraḥ kutaḥ ||

mahimā paramasyaiṣa yad dehastho na bādhyate |

yad duḥkhī na sa īśāno māyeti mahimocyate ||

pradhānaṃ maya ity āhuḥ prādhānyān mayatā bhavet || iti bhāllaveyaśrutiḥ
|

aviluptabodharūpatvān nāsau prakṛtidehavān |

na sṛṣṭyādikaṃ bhrāntir bhrāntivādā hi dānavāḥ ||

ato bhrāntyādisambandho nāsya kvacana yujyate |

bhrāntyā jīvasya saṃsāra īśajñānād vilīyate |

bhrāntir dehādyabhimatir īśajñānād vinaśyati || iti brahmāṇḍe ||5||

śrīdharaḥ : etac ca jīvasyāvidyāśrayatve ghaṭeta, na tu tat saṃbhavatīty
āha—deśata iti | yo'sau deśādibhir aviluptāvabodha ātmā jīvaḥ,
brahmasvarūpatvāt | sa katham ajayā'vidyayā yujyeta ? tatra deśato
dīpaprabhāyā iva lopo nāsti, sarvagatatvāt | na kālataḥ, vidyuta iva
nityatvāt | nāvasthātaḥ, smṛtivad avikriyatvāt | na svataḥ, svapnavat
satyatvāt | nānyataḥ, ghaṭādivad advitīyatvāt | evam etair yasya bodho na
lupyate, sa katham ajayā yujyeta ? ajā cātrāvidyaiva, na māyā, tasyā
avabodhena virodhābhāvāt ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : jīvasya kathaṃ māyāmohitatvaṃ ghaṭeta ? ity
ākṣepāntaram āha—deśata iti | yo'sau deśādibhir aviluptāvabodha ātmā jīvaḥ
sa katham ajayāvidyayā yujyate ? tatra deśavyavadhānato deśagatadoṣato
vā cakṣuḥprakāśa iva, kālato vidyud iva, avasthātaḥ smṛtir iva, svataḥ
śuktirajatam iva, anyato ghaṭādivastv iva, na tasyāvabodho lupyate
avyāhatasvarūpabhūtajñānāśrayatvād evety arthaḥ ||5||
[paramātmasandarbha 87]

viśvanāthaḥ : jīvasya ca kathaṃ māyāmohitatvaṃ ghaṭetety ākṣepāntaram
āha—deśata iti | yo'sau nityajñānatvāt deśādibhir aviluptāvabodha ātmā
jīvaḥ sa katham ajayā avidyayā yujyeta ajāyogotthas tasyāvabodhalopaḥ
kathaṃ syād ity arthaḥ | tatra deśata ūṣaradeśata uptaṃ bījam iva kālato
vidyud iva avasthātaḥ smṛtir iva svataḥ svapna iva anyato ghaṭādir iva
yasya cidvastutvād avabodho na lupto bhavitum arhati sa katham avidyayā
viluptavibodhaḥ kriyata ity arthaḥ ||5||


 || 3.7.6 ||

 bhagavān eka evaiṣa sarvakṣetreṣv avasthitaḥ |

amuṣya durbhagatvaṃ vā kleśo vā karmabhiḥ kutaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca brahmarūpatvād eva jīvasya saṃsāro'pi na vidyata ity
ākṣipati | sarvakṣetreṣv avasthito bhoktāpi vastuto bhagavān eva,
cidrūpatvena tadvyatirekābhāvāt | evaṃ ca saty amuṣya jīvasya
durbhagatvam ānandādibhraṃśaḥ karmabhir hetubhūtaiḥ kleśo vā kutaḥ,
karmasaṃbandhābhāvāt | anyatheśvarasyāpi tatprasaṅgaḥ syād iti bhāvaḥ
||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatraiva virodhāntaram āha bhagavān eka eveti | eṣa eka
eva bhagavān paramātmāpi sarvakṣetreṣu sarvasya jīvasya kṣetreṣu deheṣu
avasthitaḥ | tatra sati katham amuṣyaiva bhagavadvad eva
cidrūpatvasvarūpabhūtajñānavattvāvyabhicāriṇo jīvasya durbhagatvaṃ
svarūpabhūtajñānādilopaḥ karmabhiḥ kleśaś ca tasya vā kuto nāsti na hy
ekasmin jalādau sthitayor vastutaḥ kasyacit tatsaṃsargaḥ kasyacin neti
yujyata ity arthaḥ ||6||

[paramātmasandarbha 88]

viśvanāthaḥ : na cāyam anyāyo'rājaka dvairājyayor iva sambhāvanīyo yad ajā
niraparādhaṃ jīvaṃ parābhaved ity āha—sarveṣām api jīvānāṃ kṣetreṣu deheṣu
bhagavān eva avasthitaḥ antaryāmirūpeṇa svayam eva sthitaḥ, na tu rājeva
svarājyeṣu svapratinidhipuruṣadvārety arthaḥ | eka eveti
dvairājyaśaṅkāpi parihṛtā | ata eva tasmin bhagavati sarvapratipālake
atraiva tiṣṭhaty api amuṣya jīvasya durbhagatvam ānandādibhraṃśo vā
karmabhir āvidyakaiḥ kleśo vā kutaḥ ||6||


 || 3.7.7 ||

 etasmin me mano vidvan khidyate'jñānasaṅkaṭe |

 tan naḥ parāṇuda vibho kaśmalaṃ mānasaṃ mahat ||

śrīdharaḥ : ajñānam eva saṅkaṭaṃ durgaṃ tasmin | tan mānasaṃ kaśmalaṃ
mohaṃ parāṇuda apākuru ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : ajñānam eva saṅkaṭaṃ durgaṃ tasmin kaśmalaṃ mohaṃ parāṇuda
apākuru na ity asmador dvayoś ceti bahuvacanam ||7||


 || 3.7.8 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

sa itthaṃ coditaḥ kṣattrā tattvajijñāsunā muniḥ |

  pratyāha bhagavaccittaḥ smayann iva gatasmayaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : codita ākṣiptaḥ smayann iva prauḍhim āviṣkurvann iva |
vastutas tu gatasmayaḥ ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : munir bhagavaccitta iti katham atra samādhāsya iti
mananaparo bhagavantaṃ sasmārety arthaḥ | tataś ca sahasaivopalabdhārthaḥ
smayann iva aho duḥsamādhānā ime ākṣepā iti bahir vismayaṃ prāpnuvantas tu
susamādhānā eveme iti vismayarahita evety arthaḥ ||8||


 || 3.7.9 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

seyaṃ bhagavato māyā yan nayena virudhyate |

 īśvarasya vimuktasya kārpaṇyaṃ ūta bandhanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavato'cintyaśakter īśvarasya seyaṃ māyā nayena tarkeṇa
virudhyata iti yat | tarkaṃ virodham evānuvadati—vimuktasyaiva
puṃso'vidyābandhanaṃ kārpaṇyaṃ ceti ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra kevalaṃ cinmātratvaṃ jīve'pi na sambhavatīti
bhagavattvam evāṅgīkṛtya śrīmaitreya uvāca—seyam iti | yayā
viśvasṛṣṭyādikaṃ bhavati, seyaṃ bhagavato'cintyasvarūpaśakter māyākhyā
śaktiḥ, yat yā nayena tarkeṇa viruddhyate tarkātītatayā seyam apy
acintyety arthaḥ | yadyapy evaṃ dvayor apy acintyatvaṃ, tathāpi bhagavato
māyety anena vyaktatvāt svarūpaśakter antaraṅgatvād bahiraṅgāyā māyāyā
guṇaiḥ sattvādibhis tatkāryaiḥ sthāpanādibhiś ca nāsau spṛśyata ity
arthaḥ | tantreṇa cāyam arthaḥ—yat yathā māyayā yena bhagavatā saha na
viruddhyate, nāsau virodhaviṣayīkriyata iti | yat yā yena bhagavatā na
viruddhyate, na sarvathā nirviṣayīkriyata iti ca | evam eva ṣaṣṭhe
navamādhyāye—

duravabodha iva tavāyaṃ vihārayogo yad aśaraṇo'śarīra idam
anavekṣitāsmatsamavāya ātmanaivāvikriyamāṇena saguṇam aguṇaḥ sṛjasi pāsi
harasi || [bhā.pu. 6.9.34]

iti gadyena tasya saguṇakartṛtvaṃ virudhya, punaḥ—

atha tatra bhavān kiṃ devadattavad iha guṇavisargapatitaḥ pāratantryeṇa
svakṛtakuśalākuśalaṃ phalaṃ ūpādadāty āho svid ātmārāma upaśamaśīlaḥ
samañjasadarśana udāsta iti ha vāva na vidāmaḥ || [bhā.pu. 6.9.35]

iti gadyenāntaryāmitayā guṇavisargapatitattvena jīvavad bhoktṛtvayogaṃ
sambhāvya,

na hi virodha ubhayaṃ bhagavaty aparimitaguṇagaṇa
īśvare'navagāhyamāhātmye'rvācīnavikalpavitarkavicārapramāṇābhāsakutarkaśāstrakalilāntaḥkaraṇāśrayaduravagrahavādināṃ
vivādānavasara uparatasamastamāyāmaye kevala evātmamāyām antardhāya ko
nv artho durghaṭa iva bhavati svarūpadvayābhāvāt || [bhā.pu. 6.9.36]

iti gadyena tatra tatrāvitarkyaśaktitvam eva siddhānte yojitam | tatra
tatrāvitarkyaśaktitvena siddhānte siddhānte yojitam | tatra
svarūpaśakter avitarkyatvaṃ bhagavatītyādibhir viśeṣaṇair māyāyāś ca,
ātmamāyam ity antena darśitam | tatra svarūpadvayābhāvād iti tathāpy
acintyaśaktyā tattatkartṛtvaṃ tadantaḥpātitvaṃ ca na vidyata ity
arthaḥ | samaviṣamamatīnāṃ [bhā.pu. 6.9.37] iti tu gadyaṃ tathāpy
uccāvacabuddhīnāṃ tathā tathā sphurasīti pratiprattyarthaṃ jñeyam |
duravabodha iveti prāktanagadye tv aśarīra iti śarīraceṣṭāṃ vinā aśaraṇa
iti bhūmyādyāśrayaṃ vinety arthaḥ |

atha tatra ity ādau svakṛteti tasyāpi hetukartṛtvaṃ yojanīyaṃ tasmād
atrāpi svarūpaśakter eva prābalyaṃ darśitam, ata eva ṛte'rthaṃ yat
pratīyeta [bhā.pu. 2.9.33] ity ādau māyāyā ābhāsasthānīyatvaṃ pradarśya,
tadaspṛśyatvam eva bhagavato darśitam | tvam ādyaḥ puruṣaḥ sākṣād 
[bhā.pu. 1.7.23] ity ādau, māyā vyudasya cicchaktyā ity anena ca tathā
jñāpitam | māyā paraityābhimukhe ca vilajjāmānā [bhā.pu. 2.7.47] ity anena
ca |

tad evaṃ bhagavati tadvirodhaṃ parihṛtya jīve'py avidyāsambandham
atarkyatvena darśitatayā tanmāyayaiva samādadhāti īśvarasyeti | yad ity
anenaiva sambadhyate arthavaśād atra ca tṛtīyayā pariṇamyate yat yathā
īśvarasya svarūpajñānādibhiḥ samarthasya, ata eva vimuktasya kārpaṇyaṃ
tattatprakāśatirobhāvaḥ, tathā bandhanaṃ
darśitaguṇamayajālapraveśaś ca bhavatīti | tad
uktaṃ—tatsaṅgabhraṃśitaiśvaryaṃ [bhā.pu. 6.5.15] iti tad evaṃ sarvam
abhipretya śrutayo'py āhuḥ sa yad ajayā tv ajāṃ [bhā.pu. 10.87.38] ity
ādāv apetabhaga iti ca | atra mūlapadye bhagavato māyety anena
bhagavattvaṃ māyikam ity āyātam | indrasya māyety atra yathendratvam evaṃ
pūrvatrāpi jñeyam ||9|| [paramātmasandarbha 25, 91]

viśvanāthaḥ : sā prasiddheyaṃ bhagavato'cintyaiśvaryasya māyā yat yā
nayena tarkeṇa viruddhyate atarkyety arthaḥ | svayam acidrūpāpi
cinmātrasya atva eva śaktir atas tadīyāḥ sattvādayo'pi bhagavata eva guṇā
ucyante | tad api bhagavān svarūpato nirguṇa eva | yathā jyotirmātrasyāpi
sūryasya meghāndhakārahimādayo jyotiḥ pratikūlā api tasyaiva bhavanti |
yathaiva sūryāt prabhavanti [bhā.pu. 4.31.15] ity anantaraṃ, yathā nabhasy
abhratamaḥprakāśā [bhā.pu. 4.31.17] iti caturthe | prāṇādibhiḥ
svavibhavair upagūḍham anyo manyeta sūryam iva meghahimoparāgair iti
śrīdaśame ca śrīnāradokter dṛṣṭānte'py atrātarktyataiva | evam eva
svarūpato nirvikārasyaiva bhagavataḥ śaktyā māyayaiva
viśvasṛṣṭyādikriyāḥ śaktiśaktimator abhedāt | yad uktaṃ bhagavatā—

prakṛtir yasyopādānam ādhāraḥ puruṣaḥ paraḥ |

sato'bhivyañjakaḥ kālo brahma tat tritayaṃ tv aham || [bhā.pu. 11.24.19]
iti |

tad evam iśarīragataṃ saṃśayaṃ chittvā deśataḥ kālata ity ādinoktaṃ
jīvagatam api saṃśayaṃ chinatti īśvarasyeti sārdhadvayena | īśvarasya
svarūpajñānānandādyanubhavasamarthasyāpi jīvasya
durbhagatvādikārpaṇyaṃ tathā vimuktasyāpi bandhanaṃ yat seyaṃ māyā
māyāvṛttir avidyā | avidyānibandhanam evaitad dvayam ity arthaḥ |

ayam arthaḥ—ajayā jīvasya kathaṃ jñānalopa iti tvayocyate | sa ca
jñānalopo yadi satyaḥ syāt, tadā sā ajā svaśaktir api bhagavatā daṇḍyā
syāt, kintu sa naiva satyaḥ yathā hṛdi sthitam api ratnapadakaṃ vismṛtya
janena nāsti padakam iti khidyate | yathā cānyena kṛtam api cauryaṃ
vibhrāntivaśān mayaiva hṛtam ity abhimanyate, tadanantaraṃ ca
rājakīyapuruṣadattaṃ tatphalaṃ duḥkham api bhujyata eva,
tathaivānādyavidyāsaṅgavaśāt jīvena svajñānānandaṃ vismṛtya
dehābhimānaprāptaṃ dehadharmaṃ durbhagatvādikaṃ ca prāpya yadi kliśyati,
tarhi kasmai doṣo deya iti | atra tatsaṅgabhraṃśitaiśvaryaṃ saṃsarantaṃ
kubhāryavad ity ādi dṛṣṭeḥ kiñcid aiśvaryasambhavāt
jīvo'pīśvaraśabdenoktaḥ |

kecit punar evaṃ vyācakṣante—deśataḥ kālata ity ādy aviluptāvabodha ātmā
paramātma śuddhacaitanyarūpaḥ sa katham avidyayā yujyata iti paramatam
āśritya pūrvapakṣiṇaḥ praśnasyottaram āha—seyam iti | iyam eva bhagavato
māyā bhavet | māyāmohitatvaṃ vinā īdṛśaḥ praśno na ghaṭata ity arthaḥ |
yad yasmāt nayena nītyā viruddhyate | nītivirodham evāha—īśvarasya
paramātmano'pi māyāmohitatvena jīvatve sati kārpaṇyaṃ bandhanaṃ ca na hy
ekam eva śuddhacaitanyaṃ māyayā mohitaṃ sad eva jīva iti tadaiva amohitaṃ
sad eva paramātmeti vaktuṃ yujyate | na hi svamāyayā svayaṃ mohitaś
cāmohitaś ca yugapad eva ko'pi bhavatīti parama evānayaḥ | tasmāt yair
evaṃ pṛcchyate kaṣṭasṛṣṭyā samādhīyate ca ta eva māyāmohitā jñeyā iti |
vastutas tu paramātmajīvātmanau sūryatatkiraṇāv iva jātyaiva mitho
vilakṣaṇau caitanyacaitanyakaṇau bhavata iti siddhāntaḥ | chāyākiraṇau
yathā sūryata eva bhavataḥ, athāpi sūryatulyakaṇau sūryān na bhidyete
bhadyete ca, tathaiva māyāśaktijīvaśaktī parameśvarād udbhūte apy anādī
abhinne api svarūpato bhinne eva | tathā ca vaidyake—puṃso'sti prakṛtir
nityā praticchāyaiva bhāsvata iti | tathā ca śrutiḥ—yathāgneḥ visphuliṅgā
vyuccaranti [bṛ.ā.u. 2.1.20] ity evam evātmana iti jīvasya śaktitvam |

apareyam itas tv anyāṃ prakṛtiṃ viddhi me parām |

jīvabhūtāṃ mahābāho yayedaṃ dhāryate jagat || [gītā 7.5] iti
śrīgītāsūktam ||9||


 || 3.7.10 ||

  yad arthena vināmuṣya puṃsa ātmaviparyayaḥ |

  pratīyata upadraṣṭuḥ svaśiraśchedanādikaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : atrodāharaṇam āha—yat yathā arthena śiraśchedādinā vināpy
upadraṣṭuḥ svapnasākṣiṇo mamedaṃ śiraś chinnam ity ātmaviparyayaḥ
kevalaṃ mṛṣaiva pratīyate, tadvat ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : punar api jīvasya vastutaḥ tattadavasthatvābhāve'pi
bhagavanmāyayaiva tattatpratītir iti sadṛṣṭāntaṃ ūpapādayati—yad
arthena vināmuṣyeti | yat yasyā māyāyā hetor arthena vināpi yadyapi tasya
kālatrayam api so'rtho nāsti, tathāpi ātmaviparyayaḥ
ātmavismṛtipūrvakaparābhimānenāham eva taddharmīty evaṃ rūpo yaḥ
so'rthaḥ syāt, tathā hi upadraṣṭur jīvasya tṛtīyārthe ṣaṣṭhī |
svapnāvasthāyāṃ jīvena svaśiraśchedanādiko'pi paśyet, kintu
bhagavanmāyaivānyatra siddhaṃ tadrūpam arthaṃ tasminn āropayati,
māyāmātraṃ tu kārtsnyenānabhivyaktasvarūpatvāt [veṣū. 3.2.3] iti
nyāyena ||10|| [paramātmasandarbha 31, 92]

viśvanāthaḥ : tatra bhagavataḥ pṛṣṭhasthitayā anādyavidyayā
tamaḥsvarūpayā anādivaimukhyarūpabhagavatpṛṣṭhasthānāṃ jīvānāṃ
jñānaṃ yal lupyate, tasya na vastutvaṃ kāraṇaṃ nāpi prayojanaṃ kim apy
asti tamasaḥ svabhāv evāyaṃ yatg kṣīṇatejasvinas tejas tena lupyate ity
āha—yad artheneti | yad yataḥ arthena vastunā kāraṇena prayojanena ca
vinaivāmuṣya puṃso jīvasya ātmaviparyayo jñānānandabhraṃśaḥ pratīyate |

artho viṣayārthanayor dhanakāraṇavastuṣu |

abhidheye ca śabdānāṃ nivṛttau ca prayojane || iti medinī |

atra dṛṣṭāntaḥ—draṣṭuḥ svapnasākṣiṇaḥ upa samīpe memedaṃ śiraś cinnam iti
śirasaḥ sattve'pi śiraso'bhāvaḥ svapnadaśāyāṃ pratīyate, tathaiva vastuto
jñānānandādibhraṃśābhāve'py avidyādaśāyāṃ tadbhraṃśaḥ pratīyate |
tamasāpi taijasasya svarṇarūpyādes tejo nalupyate, kintu āvriyate mātraṃ,
tathā balavattejasā padmarāgādinā tamo'pi lupyate yathā tathā
bhaktajīvenāvidyāpi bhidyata iti jñeyam |

dvitīyavyākhyāyāṃ tu tasmād īśvarasya pūrṇasaccidānandasya paramātmaḥ
sarvajñasya sarvavyāpakasyāvidyābandhāśaṅkāpi doṣa eva | sa evāvidyāyā
jīvātma sa evāvidyāpagame paramātmeti siddhānto'pi bahirmukhataiva |
kintv īśvaracaitanyāj jātasyaiva vilakṣaṇasya citkaṇasyāsarvajñasya
tadīyataṭasthaśakter jīvasyaivāvidyayā bandhaḥ sa cāpy avastubhūta
evety āha—yad artheneti | pūrvavad eva vyākhyā amuṣya puṃso jīvasyaiva na
tv anyasyāsmadanubhūtacarasya paramātmano harer ity arthaḥ ||10||


 || 3.7.11 ||

 yathā jale candramasaḥ kampādis tatkṛto guṇaḥ |

 dṛśyate'sann api draṣṭur ātmano'nātmano guṇaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tarhīśvarasyāpi kiṃ na pratīyeta ? tatrāha—yathā jale
pratibimbitasyaiva candramaso jalopādhikṛtaḥ kampādidharmo dṛśyate, na tv
ākāśe sthitasya, tathānātmano dehāder dharmo'sann api tadabhimānino
draṣṭur ātmano jīvasyaiva, na tv īśvarasyety arthaḥ ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ata eva śuddhasyāpi sato jīvasyaupādhikenaiva
rūpeṇopādhidharmāpattir iti dṛṣṭāntāntareṇopapādayati—yathā jale iti |
yathā jale pratibimbitasyaiva candramaso'yaṃ jalopādhikṛtakampādidharmo
dṛśyate, na tv ākāśe sthitasya, tadvad anātmanaḥ prakṛtirūpopādher dharma
ātmanaḥ śuddhasyāsann api māyayā aham eva so'yam ity āveśāt
māyopādhitādātmyāpannasyāhaṅkārabhāvasya pratibimbasthānīyasya tasya
draṣṭur ādhyātmikādyavasthasyaiva yadyapi syāt, śuddhe'sau
tadabhedābhimānena taṃ paśyatīti tasyaiva syād ity arthaḥ | tathāpi
taduktam ekādaśe śrībhagavatā—

nṛtyato gāyataḥ paśyan tathaivānukaroti tān |

evaṃ buddhiguṇān paśyann anīho'py anukāryataḥ || [bhā.pu. 11.22.53] iti |

tathaivoktaṃ śuddho vicaṣṭe hy aviśuddhakartur iti | viśabdasya cātra
tadāveśa eva tātparyam | tasmāt
bhagavato'cintyasvarūpāntaraṅgamahāprabalaśaktitvād bahiraṅgayā
prabalayāpy acintyayāpi māyayā na sṛṣṭiḥ | jīvasya tu tayā sṛṣṭir iti
siddhāntitam ||11|| [paramātmasandarbha 92]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu jñānānandādyāvaraṇaṃ jīvasya bhavatu nāma |
rāgadveṣaśokamohakāmodayo dharmās tena kuto labdhāḥ ? tatrāha—yatheti |
anātmano'ntaḥkaraṇasyaiva guṇaḥ śokamohādi draṣṭur ātmano jīvasyāsan
tatra na sambhavann api dṛśyate, tatra liṅgadehādhyāsāt pratīyate ity
arthaḥ | upādhidharmasyopahitavṛttitvena pratītau dṛṣṭāntaḥ | yathā jale
iti tatkṛtaḥ jalopādhikṛtaḥ kampādiś candrasya pratīyate, vastutas tu na
sa candrasya kintu jalasyaivāyam arthaḥ | jale yaś candro dṛśyate, sa hi
candramaṇḍalasya kiraṇapuñja eva, na tu candraḥ | tathā hi
candrasūryādikiraṇaḥ jalasthalavṛkṣabhittipāṣāṇādiṣu prasarpann api
teṣu madhye yat svacchaṃ tatra lokaiḥ sa pratibimbatayocyate | candro hi
mukhanāsikāhastapādādibhūṣaṇavāhanādiparikaraviśiṣṭatvenaiva
tatratyajanair anubhūyate | sa hi bhagavaddṛṣṭāntaḥ | sa eva
svasvarūpabhūtakiraṇapuñjavyāptas tu kiñcid antikasthaiḥ kiñcid
dūrasthaiś ca kiñcid viśeṣatvena cānubhūyamānaḥ krameṇa
paramātmadṛṣṭānto brahmadṛṣṭāntaś ca jñeyaḥ |
tadbahirbhūtakiraṇapuñjas tu maṇḍalākārasamaṣṭijīvadṛṣṭāntaḥ
tatpratibimbo yo jale dṛśyate, sa pratibimbatvena pratīyate mātraṃ, na tu
vastutaḥ pratibimbas tatra jale'pi kiraṇapuñjasya satyasyaiva
dṛśyamānatvāt | ataḥ sa eva jalopādhivartī jaladharmaiḥ kampādibhir
yathānvitas tathaivāntaḥkaraṇadharmaiḥ śokamohādibhir anvito jīvas
tadadhyāsāt tad itas tataḥ prasṛmarāḥ kiraṇās tu vyaṣṭijīvadṛṣṭāntā
jñeyā iti ||11||


 || 3.7.12 ||

sa vai nivṛttidharmeṇa vāsudevānukampayā |

 bhagavadbhaktiyogena tirodhatte śanair iha ||

śrīdharaḥ : tannivṛttyupāyam āha—sa vai anātmano guṇo nivṛttidharmeṇa
vāsudevasyānukampā tayā ca tasmin bhaktiyogas tena tirodhatte'dṛśyo
bhavati | śanair ity anena sādhanānusāreṇety uktam ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sa vai iti nivṛttidharmeṇa niṣkāmasvabhāvena
bhaktiyogena yā vāsudevānukampā tayā śanais tadanukampātāratamyena
tirodhatte ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : tarhi jīvasya kathaṃ nistāraḥ ? tatrāha—anātmano guṇaḥ
nivṛttadharmeṇa nivṛttidharmajanyena bhaktimiśrajñānenety arthaḥ |
tathā svabhaktadvārayā vāsudevānukampayā udbhūtena
bhagavadbhaktiyogena tirodhatte | tannivṛttyupāyo hi jñānaṃ vā
bhavatir vā bhaved iti vākyārthaḥ | śanair iti
sādhanānusāreṇānarthanivṛttitāratamyenety arthaḥ ||12|||


 || 3.7.13 ||

 yadendriyoparāmo'tha draṣṭr ātmani pare harau |

 vilīyante tadā kleśāḥ saṃsuptasyeva kṛtsnaśaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : indriyoparāmākhyaḥ puruṣārtho muktiḥ ||13||

śrīdharaḥ : tarhi sarvānarthanivṛttiḥ kadety apekṣāyām āha—yadendriyāṇāṃ
ūparāmo naiścalyam | kva ? draṣṭur ātmany antaryāmirūpe | athānantaram
eva | kṛtsnakleśavilayamātre dṛṣṭāntaḥ saṃsuptasyeveti | na tu punar
utthāne ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : tarhi sarvānarthanivṛttiḥ kadety apekṣāyām āha—yadeti |
tatra jñānamate indriyāṇāṃ manovṛttīnāṃ ūparāmo layaḥ |
suṣuptivyāvṛttyartham āha—draṣṭur ātmany antaryāmiṇi pare brahmaṇi harau
bhagavati vā jñānāṅgabhūtayā bhaktyā anubhūyamāne satīti śeṣaḥ |
kṛtsnakleśavilayamātre dṛṣṭāntaḥ | saṃsuptasya suṣuptiṃ prāptasya yathā
dhanaputrādināśaduḥkhāni līyante | atha bhaktimate harau
svasaundaryādibhir manohāriṇi yadā indriyāṇāṃ cakṣuḥśrotrādīnāṃ ūparāmo
naiścalyaṃ bhagavatsambandhi
saundaryasaurabhyasaukumāryamādhuryavaidagdhyeṣv eva
cakṣuḥśrotraghrāṇatvagjihvāmanāṃsi sarvathā nimajjanti | na punaḥ
prākṛtarūpaśabdādyāsvādaṃ jighṛkṣanti | harau kathambhūte draṣṭātmani
draṣṭṛsvarūpe svīyabhaktaṃ kṛpākaṭākṣaviṣayaṃ kurvantīty arthaḥ | pare
parameśvare prakṛteḥ paratreti vā | kleśābhāvamātre dṛṣṭāntaḥ |
saṃsuptasya na tu svapataḥ suptotthitasyety arthaḥ | tasya yathā
svapnadṛṣṭāḥ svaśiraśchedanādikleśā līyanta iti ||13||


 || 3.7.14 ||

 aśeṣasaṅkleśaśamaṃ vidhatte

 guṇānuvādaśravaṇaṃ murāreḥ |

kiṃ vā punas taccaraṇāravinda

parāgasevāratir ātmalabdhā ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhaktiyogena kleśanivṛttiṃ darśayati, aśeṣeti | guṇānām
anuvādaś ca śravaṇaṃ ca | ātmani manasi labdhā śravaṇakīrtanāpekṣayā
sapremadhyāne kiṃ punar nyāyoktiḥ |

kramasandarbhaḥ : aśeṣeti | atra brahmann [bhā.pu. 3.7.23] ity ādidvaye
prathamapraśnābhiprāyo'yam | tattvadevatāprārthane bhavatā yad
vyañjitaṃ bhaktivaśatāmayalīlāyā bhagavān ṣṛṣṭyādau pravartata iti,
tad apy aghaṭamānaṃ, vastuvirodhāt svabhāvavirodhāc ceti | deśata
[bhā.pu. 3.7.56] ity ādidvaye tu tatprastāvatvena praśnāntaraṃ jñeyam |
athottaram—upadeṣṭavyāvaśiṣṭavijñānarūpacatuḥślokī
dvitīyaślokārthānusāreṇaiva | tatra seyam ity atra bhagavata [bhā.pu.
3.7.9] ity anenācintyaśaktitvam eva siddhāntaḥ | atra bhaktyākhyaśakter
api tādṛśasāmarthyaṃ vyañjitam | yataḥ punaś ca sa vai nivṛttidharmeṇa
[bhā.pu. 3.7.12] ity ādibhiḥ sasādhanaṃ rahasyaṃ ūpadiṣṭaṃ yatraiva kutaḥ
punar atyantimārdhe kaimutyena tatsevārateḥ phalam
aśeṣasaṅkleśaśamanamātraṃ na bhavati, kintu pūrvoktarītyā
śrībhagavadvaśīkaraṇam eveti ca dyotitam ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv avidyopaśamārthamuktayor jñānabhaktiyogayor madhye
katarasya śraiṣṭhyaṃ ? tatra bhaktir eva śreṣṭhety āha—aśeṣeti | kiṃ veti
kiṃ punar ity arthaḥ | sevāyāṃ ratir atyāsaktir ity arthaḥ | ātmalabdhā
svenaiva svasmin vā prāpteti rateḥ svaprakāśatvenājanyatvaṃ vyañjitam |
sādhanabhaktir evāvidyāṃ ūpaśamayati kiṃ punas tatsādhyā ratir iti rater
mukhyaṃ phalam avidyopaśamo na bhavati, kintu bhagavadvaśīkāra iti bhāvaḥ
||14||


 || 3.7.15 ||

vidura uvāca—

 sañchinnaḥ saṃśayo mahyaṃ tava sūktāsinā vibho |

  ubhayatrāpi bhagavan mano me sampradhāvati ||

śrīdharaḥ : uttaram abhinandann ātmanaḥ kṛtārthatām āviṣkaroti—sañchinna
iti ṣaḍbhiḥ | cidrūpatvāviśeṣe'pi katham īśvarasya jagatkartṛtvādi,
kathaṃ vā jīvasya saṃsāraḥ ? iti yaḥ saṃśayo mamāsīt, sa tava sūktaṃ
sopapattikaṃ vākyam evāsiḥ khaḍgas tena sañchinnaḥ | ata idānīṃ me mana
ubhayatrāpīśvarasvātantrye jīvapāratantrye ca sampradhāvati samyak
praviśati | evaṃ vāviluptāvabodharūpasyātmanaḥ katham avidyayā bandhaḥ,
kuto vā tannivṛttiḥ ? iti saṃśayaḥ | ubhayatreti, bandhe mokṣe cety
arthaḥ ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ata evāha—sañchinna iti | ubhayatra īśvare jīve ca |
yad vā, jñānavijñānarūpe jñāne premaṇi tatsādhanarūpāyāṃ bhaktau cety
arthaḥ | saṃpradhāvati samyak praviśati ||15||

viśvanāthaḥ : mahyaṃ mama māṃ bodhayituṃ tava yat sūktaṃ tad evāsiḥ, tena
ubhayatra īśvare jīve ca sampradhāvati savivekaṃ praviśati ||15||


 || 3.7.16 ||

sādhv etad vyāhṛtaṃ vidvan nātmamāyāyanaṃ hareḥ |

  ābhāty apārthaṃ nirmūlaṃ viśvamūlaṃ na yad bahiḥ ||

madhvaḥ : svarūpasāmarthyāśrayaṃ yad vyāhṛtam | apārthaṃ nirmūlaṃ ca
deahasambandhitvād yā bhāti | viśvamūlaṃ brahma| ca yan mama jñānād
abahir na bhavati | tasmād ubhayatra dhāvati | tasmād antarito'smi |
tathāpi tāṃ pratītiṃ parāṇude |

ātmanas tu guṇābhāvaṃ vadato na tv asatyatā |

apṛṣṭasya damārthaṃ ca guṇāyaiva bhavaty api || iti vyāsasmṛteḥ |

vidyamānam apy anubhavam anyathā vadati viduraḥ |

droṇadrauṇikṛpāḥ pārthā bhīṣmā vidurasañjayau |

ye cānye tatra devāṃśāḥ samyak tattvāparokṣiṇaḥ || iti skānde ||1618||

śrīdharaḥ : yasmāt tvayā sādhu vyāhṛtam | kiṃ tat ? hareḥ śaktir yā
ātmamāyā jīvaviṣayā māyā tadayanaṃ tadāśrayam etad durbhagatvādikaṃ
bhātīti | yat yasmāt svaśiraś chedādivad apārtham avastubhūtaṃ nirmūlaṃ
mūlaśūnyaṃ ca | yasmād asya mūlaṃ viśvasya mūlaṃ svājñānaṃ bahir vinā
nāsti ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : saṃśayacchedane hetur avadhāritārtham
evānuvadati—sādhv iti pañcabhiḥ | harer ātmādhīnamāyāyā ayanam acintyā
gatir ity etat sādhv eva vyākhyātam | yad yasmād bahir vinā apārtham
avastubhūtaṃ mūlaśūnyaṃ ca viśvamūlaṃ tad adhyāsahetubhūtam ajñānaṃ
jīvānām api nāstīti ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu mama sūktaṃ tvayā kīdṛśam avadhāritaṃ ? tatrāha—he
brahman ! sādha yathā syāt tathā tvayā vyāhṛtaṃ kiṃ tat ? harer bahiraṅgā
śaktir yā ātmamāyā tadāśraya evam etat | bhagavato nirguṇasyāpi
guṇavattvaṃ tair guṇaiḥ sṛṣṭyādikartṛtvaṃ cābhāti | apārthaṃ
niṣprayojanaṃ tasyātmārāmatvāt | nirmūlaṃ niṣkāraṇaṃ tasya
prayojakāntarābhāvād atarkyam evetīśvaragataṃ tvayā vyāhṛtam | tathā etaj
jīvasyāvidyābandhanaṃ tadutthadurbhagatvādikaṃ cātmamāyāyanam eva |
niṣprayojanaṃ niṣkāraṇam avastu ceti jīvagataṃ ca vyāhṛtam iti |
tantreṇeyaṃ viduroktiḥ, kiṃ ca yad bahiḥ yām ātmamāyāṃ vinā viśvasya
mūlaṃ kāraṇaṃ nāstīti viśvasraṣṭṛtvena bhagavataḥ saguṇatvaṃ
sakriyatvaṃ ca na svarūpasiddham iti bhāvaḥ ||16||


 || 3.7.17 ||

yaś ca mūḍhatamo loke yaś ca buddheḥ paraṃ gataḥ |

tāv ubhau sukham edhete kliśyaty antarito janaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : alpajñatvāt pūrvaṃ mama saṃśayo jāta ity āha—yaś ceti |
mūḍhatamo dehādyāsakto yaś ca buddheḥ prakṛteḥ param īśvaraṃ prāptaḥ, tau
sukhaṃ yatha bhavati tathā edhete jīvata ity arthaḥ, saṃśayakleśābhāvāt |
yas tu duḥkhānusandhānena prapañcaṃ jihāsati svānandasaṃvedanābhāvād
dhātuṃ na śaknoti, sa tu kliśyatīty arthaḥ ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : mūḍhatamaḥ sārāsāravivekarahitaḥ sukham edhete
saṃśayakleśarahitau bhavataḥ | antaritaḥ saṃśayitaḥ ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ : alpajñatvād etāvad dinaparyantam ahaṃ
sāṃśayikaduḥkhanimagna evāsam ity āha—mūḍhatamaḥ paśur iva
viṣayāsaktabuddheḥ prakṛteḥ param īśvaraṃ prāptaḥ, tau sukhaṃ yatha syād
evam edhete, saṃśayakleśābhāvād viṣayānandeśvarānandābhyāṃ vardhete | yas
tu duḥkhānusandhānena prapañcaṃ jihāsati, bhagavadbhaktyalābhād dhātuṃ
ca na śaknoti, sa tv antarito madhyavartī ānandadvayābhāvena
saṃśayasindhunimagnaḥ kliśyati ||17||


 || 3.7.18 ||

  arthābhāvaṃ viniścitya pratītasyāpi nātmanaḥ |

tāṃ cāpi yuṣmaccaraṇasevayāhaṃ parāṇude ||

śrīdharaḥ : idānīṃ tu kṛtārtho'smi, yatas tvayā saṃśayaś chinnaḥ, kevalaṃ
bādhitānuvṛttir evāvaśiṣṭā, sāpi yuṣmatprasādān nivartiṣyata ity
āha—nātmanaḥ anātmanaḥ prapañcasya pratītasyāpy arthābhāvam artho'tra
nāsti, kintu pratītimātram iti | yuṣmaccaraṇasevayā niścitya tāṃ
pratītim apy ahaṃ parāṇude, apaneṣyāmīty arthaḥ ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, sampraty api mama kleśaśeṣ vartata ity āha—ātmano
jīvasya arthābhāvaṃ vāstavadurbhagatvādyabhāvaṃ
tvanmukhoditasiddhāntena viniścityāpi na pratītasyāpy arthābhāvasya tām
apratītim ahaṃ parāṇude'paneṣyāmi ||18||


 || 3.7.19 ||

yatsevayā bhagavataḥ kūṭasthasya madhudviṣaḥ |

 ratirāso bhavet tīvraḥ pādayor vyasanārdanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : madhudviṣaḥ pādayoḥ ratirāsaḥ premotsavas tīvro durvāraḥ
svābhāvikaḥ | vyasanaṃ saṃsāram ardayati nāśayatīti tathā ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : prapañcapratītiparāṇodanamātraṃ kiyat ? yataḥ
yatsevayeti vyasanārdana ity ānuṣaṅgika evāsau yasya guṇa ity arthaḥ
||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavajjanasevāyāḥ kim aśakyam ityh āha—yad iti |
bhagavataḥ kūṭasthasya bhagavattvenaiva sarvakālavyāpina ekarūpatayā tu
yaḥ kālavyāpī sa kūṭastha ity amaraḥ | madhudviṣo madhusūdanasya madhor
iva bhaktasaṃsārasya nāśayituṃ pādayo ratyā bhāvabhaktyā rāso
vibhāvādisaṃyogotthaḥ śāntadāsyādirasasamūhaḥ tīvraḥ svamādhuryeṇa
prākṛtāprākṛtasarvamādhuryopamardī tenāpratītiparatvanodanam idaṃ
kiyanmātram iti bhāvaḥ ||19||


 || 3.7.20 ||

 durāpā hy alpatapasaḥ sevā vaikuṇṭhavartmasu |

yatropagīyate nityaṃ devadevo janārdanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : aho durlabhaṃ prāptaṃ mayety āha—durāpā durlabhā |
vaikuṇṭhasya viṣṇos tallokasya vā vartmasu mārgabhūteṣu mahatsu | yatra
yeṣu | mahatsevayā harikathāśravaṇaṃ, tato harau prema, tena ca
dehādyanusandhānam api nivartata iti tātparyam ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, seyaṃ mahatsevaivātidurlabhety āha—alpatapasa iti
lokarītyoktir mahatsevāyās tatkṛpaikalabhyatvena tapaḥphalatvābhāvāt
vaikuṇṭhasya vartmabhūteṣu tadbhakteṣu nityaṃ sādhanasādhyāvasthāyām
||20||


 || 3.7.21 ||

  sṛṣṭvāgre mahadādīni savikārāṇy anukramāt |

tebhyo virājaṃ ūddhṛtya tam anu prāviśad vibhuḥ ||

madhvaḥ : virājaṃ brahmāṇam |  brahmāṇaṃ prāviśad viṣṇuḥ sahasrākṣaḥ
sahasrapāt iti brāhme |

anupraviśya brahmāṇaṃ prāṇaṃ daśavidhaṃ tathā |

indriyāṇīndriyārthāṃś ca varṇāṃś caivāsṛjat hariḥ || iti gāruḍe ||21||

śrīdharaḥ : arthāntaraṃ praṣṭuṃ tad uktam anuvadati tribhiḥ—sṛṣṭveti |
vikārair indriyādibhiḥ sahitāni | uddhṛtya tad aṃśair virājaṃ sṛṣṭvā
||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ kṛtakṛtya ullāsena pūrvaśrutalīlāvaśeṣaṃ
pṛcchati—sṛṣṭveti ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ kṛtakṛtya ullāsena pūrvaśrutaḷakṣaṇāvaśeṣaṃ
praṣṭuṃ taduktam anuvadati—sṛṣṭveti ||21||


 || 3.7.22 ||

yam āhur ādyaṃ puruṣaṃ sahasrāṅghryūrubāhukam |

yatra viśva ime lokāḥ savikāśaṃ ta āsate ||

śrīdharaḥ : praviṣṭasya rūpam āha—yam iti | virājaṃ viśinaṣṭi—yatreti | te
ime viśve sarve lokāḥ | savikāśam asaṅkocena ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yaṃ kāraṇārṇave garbhodake ca śāyinam ||22||

viśvanāthaḥ : yaṃ kāraṇārṇavaśāyinaṃ viśve sarve samāsate tadromabileṣv
eva sarvabrahmāṇḍānāṃ sattvāt ||22||


 || 3.7.23 ||

yasmin daśavidhaḥ prāṇaḥ sendriyārthendriyas trivṛt |

tvayerito yato varṇās tadvibhūtīr vadasva naḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : prāṇādayaḥ pañca nāgādayaḥ pañcety evaṃ daśavidhaḥ |
indriyāṇi ca | arthāś ca indriyāṇi ceti punar uktis
taddevatālakṣaṇārthā, tatsahitaḥ | sarvopabṛṃhakatvāt prāṇasya
tatsāhityam | evaṃ trivṛt trividhaḥ prāṇas tvayerita uktaḥ | tasya
vibhūtīr brahmādyā visargaśabdavācyāḥ ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatra taduktam apy anuvadati—yasmin virāḍrūpe ||23||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, yasmin samaṣṭivirāji indriyārthā viṣayā indriyāṇi
ca taiḥ sahitaḥ | trivṛt sahaojobalatvena trividhaḥ | yata eva varṇāḥ
yadviśeṣā eva viprādyāḥ | atha tasya parameśvarasya vibhūtīḥ
prajāpatyādyāḥ ||23||


 || 3.7.24 ||

yatra putraiś ca pautraiś ca naptṛbhiḥ saha gotrajaiḥ |

  prajā vicitrākṛtaya āsan yābhir idaṃ tatam ||

śrīdharaḥ : yatra yāsu idaṃ viśvam | tataṃ vyāptam ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yata iti naptṛbhir dauhitraiḥ ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : tatra yāsu vibhūtiṣu naptṛbhiḥ dauhitraiḥ ||24||


 || 3.7.25 ||

  prajāpatīnāṃ sa patiś cakÿpe kān prajāpatīn |

sargāṃś caivānusargāṃś ca manūn manvantarādhipān |

 eteṣām api vedāṃś ca vaṃśānucaritāni ca ||

śrīdharaḥ : evam etat purā pṛṣṭo maitreyo bhagavān kila [bhā.pu. 3.1.1]
iti parīkṣitpraśnottaratayā viduramaitreyasaṃvādaḥ prastāvitaḥ, atas
tān eva vidureṇa kṛtān praśnān āha yāvat samāpti | prajāpatīnāṃ patir
brahmetyādīnāṃ varṇayeti vakṣyamāṇenānvayaḥ | cakÿpe'kalpayat | sargān
navavidhān | anusargāṃs tadbhedān ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : dvitīyaskandhe parīkṣitā pṛṣṭānb
evārthānaikajātīyahṛdayatvāt viduro'pi pṛcchati yāvadadhyāyasamāpti |
prajāpatīnāṃ patir brahmā sargān daśavidhān anusargāṃs tadbhedān ||25||


 || 3.7.26 ||

  upary adhaś ca ye lokā bhūmer mitrātmajāsate |

 teṣāṃ saṃsthāṃ pramāṇaṃ ca bhūrlokasya ca varṇaya ||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ :  he mitrāyā ātmaja, saṃsthāṃ sanniveśam ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |


 || 3.7.27 ||

tiryaṅmānuṣadevānāṃ sarīsṛpapatattriṇām |

 vada naḥ sargasaṃvyūhaṃ gārbhasvedadvijodbhidām ||

śrīdharaḥ : sargāṇāṃ saṃvyūhaṃ saṃvibhāgam | gārbhasvedadvijodbhidām |
gārbhā jarāyujāḥ, svedāc ca dvābhyāṃ ca jātāḥ svedadvijāḥ udbhidaś ca
teṣām ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : saṃvyūhaṃ saṃvibhāgam | gārbhā jarāyujā manuṣyādayaḥ, svedāc
ca aṇḍāc ca dvābhyāṃ jātāḥ svedajāḥ kṛmidaṃśādyāḥ, dvijāḥ pakṣiṇaḥ,
udbhidas tarugulmādyāḥ, teṣām ||27||


 || 3.7.28 ||

guṇāvatārair viśvasya sargasthityapyayāśrayam |

  sṛjataḥ śrīnivāsasya vyācakṣvodāravikramam ||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ : sargādīn āśrayaṃ ca sṛjataḥ |

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |


 || 3.7.29 ||

 varṇāśramavibhāgāṃś ca rūpaśīlasvabhāvataḥ |

  ṛṣīṇāṃ janmakarmāṇi vedasya ca vikarṣaṇam ||

madhvaḥ : vikarṣaṇaṃ vibhāgaḥ ||29||

śrīdharaḥ : rūpaṃ liṅgam, śīlam ācāraḥ svabhāvaḥ śamādiḥ, tataḥ vikarṣaṇaṃ
vibhāgam ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sargādīn teṣām apy āśrayaṃ prajāpatyādirūpaṃ ca
sṛjataḥ kurvataḥ ||29||

viśvanāthaḥ : rūpaṃ liṅgam, śīlam ācāraḥ svabhāvaḥ śamādiḥ, tair
vikarṣaṇaṃ vibhāgam ||29||


 || 3.7.30 ||

 yajñasya ca vitānāni yogasya ca pathaḥ prabho |

  naiṣkarmyasya ca sāṅkhyasya tantraṃ vā bhagavatsmṛtam ||

śrīdharaḥ : vitānāni vistārān | naiṣkarmyasya ca jñānasya tad upāyasya ca
sāṅkhyasya pathaḥ mārgān tantraṃ cety arthaḥ ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : varṇāśrama iti saptakam | bhagavatsmṛtaṃ tantraṃ
pañcarātrākhyam ||30||

viśvanāthaḥ : vitānāni vistārān | yogasyāṣṭāṅgasya patho mārgān
naiṣkarmyasya jñānasya tadupāyasya sāṅkhyasya ca mārgān | bhagavatsmṛtaṃ
tantraṃ nāradapañcarātram | cārthe vākāraḥ ||30||


 || 3.7.31 ||

  pāṣaṇḍapathavaiṣamyaṃ pratilomaniveśanam |

  jīvasya gatayo yāś ca yāvatīr guṇakarmajāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : pākhaṇḍānāṃ panthāḥ pravṛttis tad eva vaiṣamyam ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : pratilomnāṃ sūtādīnāṃ niveśanaṃ saṃsthāpanam ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ : pāṣaṇḍapathāt pāṣaṇḍamārgato hetor yad vaiṣamyaṃ
pratilomnāṃ sūtādīnāṃ niveśanaṃ saṃsthānam ||31||


 || 3.7.32 ||

 dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ nimittāny avirodhataḥ |

  vārtāyā daṇḍanīteś ca śrutasya ca vidhiṃ pṛthak ||

śrīdharaḥ : nimittāny upāyān parasparāvirodhena ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ :  nimittāny upāyān parasparāvirodhena vārtāyāḥ
kṛṣivāṇijyādiśāstrasya | daṇḍanīter arthaśāstrasya śrutasya
vedaśāstrasya ||32||


 || 3.7.33 ||

  śrāddhasya ca vidhiṃ brahman pitṇāṃ sargam eva ca |

 grahanakṣatratārāṇāṃ kālāvayavasaṃsthitim ||

śrīdharaḥ : grahādīnāṃ kālacakre saṃsthitim ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : kālāvayave dinarātrimāsavarṣādau saṃsthitiṃ sthitim
||33||


 || 3.7.34 ||

 dānasya tapaso vāpi yac ceṣṭāpūrtayoḥ phalam |

pravāsasthasya yo dharmo yaś ca puṃsa utāpadi ||

na katamenāpi vyākhyātam.


 || 3.7.35 ||

yena vā bhagavāṃs tuṣyed dharmayonir janārdanaḥ |

  samprasīdati vā yeṣām etad ākhyāhi me'nagha ||

śrīdharaḥ : yena mārgeṇa santuṣyet | yeṣām iti yādṛśānām ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ parāvareṣāṃ bhagavan vratāni śrutānīty ukter
vyāsamukhāt prāyo jñātānām apy eṣāṃ jñeyavastumātra eva nairapekṣārthaṃ
svābhīṣṭaṃ vidhitsitaṃ pṛcchati yeneti | vāśabdas tv arthe sarveṣāṃ yoniḥ
kāraṇaṃ janārdanaḥ | sakāmabhāvkṛtān kāmān yācayann apīty arthaḥ | yad
vā, śuddhabhāvkṛtān premotthenānutāpena pīḍayan yeṣāṃ veti krameṇa
tatprasādasya sādhanaṃ kiṃ ? tatrādhikāriṇaś ca kīdṛśās tan me kathayety
arthaḥ ||35||


 || 3.7.36 ||

  anuvratānāṃ śiṣyāṇāṃ putrāṇāṃ ca dvijottama |

anāpṛṣṭam api brūyur guravo dīnavatsalāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : anāpṛṣṭam apy apṛṣṭam api madyogyaṃ vaktavyam iti bhāvaḥ
||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : svābhīṣṭam api praṣṭavyam ahaṃ na jānāmy atas tatra bhavanta
eva kṛpayā kathayantv ity āha—anuvratānām iti caturthyarthe ṣaṣṭhyaḥ
||36||


 || 3.7.37 ||

tattvānāṃ bhagavaṃs teṣāṃ katidhā pratisaṅkramaḥ |

tatremaṃ ka upāsīran ka u svid anuśerate ||

śrīdharaḥ : pratisaṅkramaḥ pralayaḥ | tatra pralaye imaṃ parameśvaraṃ
śayānaṃ rājānam iva cāmaragrāhiṇaḥ ke vānuśerate śayānam anu svapanti
||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tattvānām iti | tatra teṣu pralayeṣu prakṛtiparyanteṣu
| anena pārṣadānāṃ nityatvam evābhipretam | tad uktaṃ kāśīkhaṇḍe—

na cyavante hi yadbhaktā mahatyāṃ pralayāpadi |

atocyuto'khile loke sa ekaḥ sarvago'vyayaḥ || iti |

anuśerate līnās tiṣṭhanti ||37||

viśvanāthaḥ : sādhanabhaktiṃ pṛṣṭvā sādhyabhakter nityatve vipratipattiṃ
nirasyan pralayaṃ pṛcchati tattvānām iti pratisaṅkramaḥ pralayaḥ | tatra
pralaye imaṃ parameśvaraṃ śayānaṃ rājānam iva cāmaragrāhiṇaḥ ke upāsīran
? ke vā anuśerate śayānam anusvapantīti śrīsvāmicaraṇās tena
bhagavatpārṣadānāṃ tadbhaktes tallokasya ca nityatvam abhipretam | ata
eva  na cyavante ca yadbhaktā mahatyāṃ pralayāpadi iti prasiddhaṃ
kāśīkhaṇḍavacanam ||37||


 || 3.7.38 ||

 puruṣasya ca saṃsthānaṃ svarūpaṃ vā parasya ca |

  jñānaṃ ca naigamaṃ yat tad guruśiṣyaprayojanam ||

śrīdharaḥ : puruṣasya saṃsthaṇaṃ jīvasya tattvam | parameśvarasya svarūpam
| yenāṃśena tayor aikyam | tathā jñānaṃ ca | naigamam aupaniṣadam ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : upāsakasya puruṣasya saṃsthānaṃ samyakprakāreṇa kīdṛī
sthitis tattvaṃ vā | tathā upāsyasya parasya parameśvarasya ca svarūpam |
tathā upāsanāyāś ca jñānaṃ naigamaṃ nigamoktaṃ yad guruśiṣyayoḥ
prayojanaṃ mattaḥ sakāśāt śiṣyo'yaṃ jānātu gurutaḥ sakāśād ahaṃ bhaktiṃ
jānīyām ity etallakṣaṇam | tasya nimittāni satsaṅgādīni ||38||


 || 3.7.39 ||

 nimittāni ca tasyeha proktāny anaghasūribhiḥ |

 svato jñānaṃ kutaḥ puṃsāṃ bhaktir vairāgyam eva vā ||

śrīdharaḥ : yāni sūribhiḥ proktāni tasya jñānasya sādhanāni tāni ca brūhi
| guruṃ vinaitan na bhavatīty āha—svata iti ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : puruṣasyeti sārdhakam | puruṣasya prakṛtyādidraṣṭuḥ
saṃsthānaṃ sahasraśīrṣetyādirūpaṃ tataḥ parasya śrībhagavataś ca
jñānaṃ vicārarūpaṃ svata ity ardhakam ||39||

viśvanāthaḥ : anagha, sūribhir niraparādhavijñabhāvkṛtaiḥ guruṃ vinaitan
na bhavatīty āha—svata iti ||39||


 || 3.7.40 ||

etān me pṛcchataḥ praśnān hareḥ karmavivitsayā |

brūhi me'jñasya mitratvād ajayā naṣṭacakṣuṣaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : me praśnān me mitratvāt snigdhatvād ity anvayabhedān na me
padasya paunaruktyam ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu tarhi nānāvidhāḥ praśnā etāvantaḥ kathaṃ kṛtāḥ ?
tatrāha—hareḥ karma paricaryādikaṃ tasya vivitsayā prāptīcchayā eva etān
mama praśnān brūhi sarvajijñāsitasiddhau satyām eva
bhagavatparicaryāyāṃ mano'nyanirapekṣam ekāgraṃ bhavati | manasa
aikāgrye saty eva tatprāptir iti bhāvaḥ | me mahyaṃ māṃ ūddhartum iti me
padasya paunaruktyaṃ na śaṅkyam | mitratvād iti mitrāyāḥ putras tvam api
mitram eva sarvajagatām iti bhāvaḥ ||40||


 || 3.7.41 ||

  sarve vedāś ca yajñāś ca tapo dānāni cānagha |

  jīvābhayapradānasya na kurvīran kalām api ||

śrīdharaḥ : tattvopadeśena jīvābhayapradānasya ||41||

kramasandarbhaḥ : jīvānām itas tato bhītānāṃ kiṃ ūta saṃsārabhītānām
abhayapradānasyety arthaḥ ||41||

viśvanāthaḥ : na kevalam idaṃ maduddhārārtham eva api tu bhavato'pi
puṇyayaśolābhārtham ity āha—sarva iti ||41||


 || 3.7.42 ||

  śrīśuka uvāca—

 sa ittham āpṛṣṭapurāṇakalpaḥ

kurupradhānena munipradhānaḥ |

  pravṛddhaharṣo bhagavatkathāyāṃ

  sañcoditas taṃ prahasann ivāha ||

śrīdharaḥ : purāṇe kalpate prakāśata iti purāṇakalpo bubhutsito'rthaḥ,
āpṛṣṭaḥ purāṇakalpo'yaṃ sa munipradhānaḥ ||42||

kramasandarbhaḥ : āpṛṣṭaḥ purāṇakalpo yatra saḥ ||42||

viśvanāthaḥ : purāṇeṣu purāṇatātparyeṣu kalpate vyākhyānasamartho
bhavatīti purāṇakalpaḥ | āpṛṣṭaś cāsau purāṇakalpaś ceti saḥ | prahasann
iveti, vastutas tu harṣotthasmitaviśiṣṭa ity arthaḥ ||42||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīye saptamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe

 viduramaitreyasaṃvāde

 saptamo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.7 ||

 (3.8)

 || 3.8.1 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

  satsevanīyo bata pūruvaṃśo

  yal lokapālo bhagavatpradhānaḥ |

  babhūvithehājitakīrtimālāṃ

  pade pade nūtanayasy abhīkṣṇam ||

śrīdharaḥ :

 aṣṭame samabhūd brahmā nābhes tu jalaśāyinaḥ |

 tam ajānañ jale bibhyat tapasāpoṣayad vibhum ||

śrotāram abhinandati | satāṃ sevituṃ yogyaḥ | bata aho | yat yasmād
ihāsmin vaṃśe lokapālo dharmarājas tvaṃ babhūvitha jāto'si |
kathaṃbhūtaḥ ? bhagavān eva pradhānabhūto yasya saḥ | atra hetuḥ—ajiteti
| pratikṣaṇaṃ nūtanayasi navīnāṃ karoṣi ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : evaṃ dvitīyaskandhānte pādmaṃ kalpam atho śṛṇv iti |
yad uktaṃ tadavatāraṇārthaṃ catuḥślokīmahimagarbhitam etāvantaṃ
grantham uktvā tam evāha—so'ham ity ādinā | bhāgavataṃ
saṃkarṣaṇādivartitaṃ tad bhāgavataviśeṣam ity arthaḥ ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

aṣṭame śrīharer nābhipadmodbhūtaś caturmukhaḥ |

  anveṣaṇād viramyāptasamādhis tam avaikṣata ||

bho vidura ! tāṃ cāpi yuṣmaccaraṇasevayāhaṃ parāṇude ity ādinā svato
jñānaṃ kutaḥ puṃsām ity ādinā ca tvaṃ matsaṅgaṃ prārthayase | manmate tu
sākṣāt tava saṅgaḥ paramadurlabhaḥ kena mahāsukṛticūḍāmaṇinā labhyatām
| tvatprasaṅgānuprasaṅgavaty api jane sevyamāne harau bhaktiḥ syād iti
viduraṃ stuvann abhinandati | bata aho | tayāsmāj janmārtham aṅgīkṛtaḥ |
pūruvaṃśo'pi satāṃ sevituṃ yogyaḥ kṛtaḥ yad yatra tvaṃ babhūvitha jāto'si
| kathaṃbhūtaḥ ? brahmaparamātmabhagavatsu matabhedenopāsyasvarūpeṣu
triṣu madhye bhagavān eva pradhānabhūto yasya saḥ | iha
bhagavadupāsakeṣv api madhye ajitakīrtimālām abhīkṣṇaṃ pratikṣaṇam eva
nūtanayasi kīrtimālām imāṃ svarasanāsūcyā kevalaṃ grathnāmy eva | tvaṃ
punar enām atisnigdhānurāgisvakarṇamanaḥsampuṣṭāntar nidhāya
nityanavīnīkaroṣīti tvanmāhātmyam anirvācyam eveti bhāvaḥ ||1||


 || 3.8.2 ||

 so'haṃ nṛṇāṃ kṣullasukhāya duḥkhaṃ

 mahad gatānāṃ viramāya tasya |

 pravartaye bhāgavataṃ purāṇaṃ

 yad āha sākṣād bhagavān ṛṣibhyaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : alpasukhāya mahadduḥkhaṃ prāptānāṃ tasya duḥkhasya viramāya
pravartaye prārabhe ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyátam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tvatsarvapraśnottarāṇi śrībhāgavate purāṇa evopalabhyanta
iti tadbhāgyaviśeṣam eva tvāṃ śrāvayāmīty āha—sa prasiddhaḥ
parāśaraśiṣyo'haṃ kṣullasukhāya tucchaviṣayasukhārthaṃ duḥkhaṃ
narakādi tasya duḥkhasya | etena sukhāya karmāṇi karoti loka ity atra yad
atra yuktaṃ bhagavān vaden na iti tvadādime praśno'py etad eva yuktam
uttaraṃ bhavatīty uktam ||2||


 || 3.8.3 ||

āsīnam urvyāṃ bhagavantam ādyaṃ

 saṃkarṣaṇaṃ devam akuṇṭhasattvam |

vivitsavas tattvam ataḥ parasya

  kumāramukhyā munayo'nvapṛcchan ||

śrīdharaḥ : ko'sau bhagavān ? kebhyaś ca ṛṣibhya āha ? kathaṃ ca tvayā
prāptaṃ ? ity apekṣāyām āha—āsīnam iti saptabhiḥ | urvyāṃ pātālatale
akuṇṭhasattvam apratihatajñānam | ataḥ saṃkarṣaṇāt parasya
śrīvāsudevasya ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : āsīnam iti catuṣkam | kirīṭeti saṃkarṣaṇam ity asya
viśeṣaṇam ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : ko'sau bhagavān ? kebhya ṛṣibhya āha ? kathaṃ tvayā prāptaṃ
? ity apekṣāyām āha—āsīnam iti saptabhiḥ | urvyāṃ pātālatale
akuṇṭhasattvaṃ śuddhasattvasvarūpam apratihatajñānaṃ vā | ataḥ
saṃkarṣaṇāt parasya śrīvāsudevasya ||3||


 || 3.8.4 ||

  svam eva dhiṣṇyaṃ bahu mānayantaṃ

 yad vāsudevābhidham āmananti |

pratyagdhṛtākṣāmbujakośam īṣad

 unmīlayantaṃ vibudhodayāya ||

madhvaḥ : ādhāra āśrayo dhiṣṇyaṃ nidhānaṃ cābhidhīyate ity abhidhānam
||4||

śrīdharaḥ : tam eva viśinaṣṭi—svam eva dhiṣṇyaṃ svīyam āśrayaṃ
vāsudevasaṃjñaṃ paramānandarūpaṃ dhyānapathe'nubhūya bahu mānayantaṃ
sarvotkarṣeṇa pūjayantam | pratyagdhṛtam antarmukhīkṛtaṃ
netrāmbujamukulaṃ kiñcid unmīlayantam | kṛpāvalokena sanatkumārādīnām
abhyudayārtham ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tam eva viśinaṣṭi—svam eva dhiṣṇyaṃ svīyam āśrayatattvaṃ
bahum ānayantaṃ sarvotkarṣeṇa pūjayantaṃ tad eva kiṃ ? tatrāha—yad iti |
pratyagdhṛtam antarmukhīkṛtam iti, tad
vāsudevasvarūpānandānubhavārtham ity arthaḥ | tad api īṣad iti vibudhānāṃ
sanatkumārādīnām abhyudayārtham ||4||


 || 3.8.5 ||

svardhunyudārdraiḥ svajaṭākalāpair

 upaspṛśantaś caraṇopadhānam |

  padmaṃ yad arcanty ahirājakanyāḥ

 saprema nānābalibhir varārthāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : munīnāṃ viśeṣaṇaṃ sārdhena | svardhunyā udakenārdrair iti |
śrībhāgavataśravaṇārthaṃ satyalokāt pātālaṃ pratyavataranto nirantaraṃ
gaṅgāmadhyata evāvatīrṇā iti bhāvaḥ | caraṇāv upadhīyete | yasmin padme |
tad upaspṛśanto namantaḥ | kathaṃbhūtaṃ ? tad āha—yat padmaṃ
premasahitaṃ yathā bhavaty evaṃ nānopahāraiḥ pūjayanti | varārthāḥ
patikāmāḥ ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : munīn viśinaṣṭi—sārdhena | svardhunyudārdrair iti
śrībhāgavataśravaṇārthaṃ satyalokāt pātālaṃ pratyavataranto nirantaraṃ
gaṅgāmadhyata evāvatīrṇā iti bhāvaḥ | upadhānam upabarham | varārthāḥ
patikāmāḥ ||5||


 || 3.8.6 ||

  muhur gṛṇanto vacasānurāga

 skhalatpadenāsya kṛtāni tajjñāḥ |

  kirīṭasāhasramaṇipraveka

  pradyotitoddāmaphaṇāsahasram ||

śrīdharaḥ : kṛtāni karmāṇi gṛṇantaḥ | kena ? anurāgeṇa skhalanti padāni
yasmin, tena vacasā | tāni jānantīti tajjñāḥ | sahasram eva sāhasraṃ
kirīṭānāṃ sāhasre ye maṇipravekā ratnottamāḥ, taiḥ pradyotitam
uddāmaphaṇānāṃ sahasraṃ yasya tam apṛcchann iti pūrveṇānvayaḥ ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kṛtāni karmāṇi gṛṇantaḥ | kena ? anurāgeṇa skhalanti padāni
yasmin, tena vacasā | tāni jānantīti tajjñā iti svāmicaraṇāḥ | kṛtāni
līlāḥ sahasram eva sāhasraṃ, tatra maṇipravekaiḥ ratnamukhyaiḥ,
mukhyavaryavareṇyāś ca pravekānuttamottamā ity amaraḥ | apṛcchann iti
pūrveṇānvayaḥ ||6||


 || 3.8.7 ||

proktaṃ kilaitad bhagavattamena

 nivṛttidharmābhiratāya tena |

 sanatkumārāya sa cāha pṛṣṭaḥ

  sāṅkhyāyanāyāṅga dhṛtavratāya ||

śrīdharaḥ : tena saṃkarṣaṇena sanatkumārāya proktam ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  tena saṃkarṣaṇena sanatkumārāya bhagavattameneti svārthe
tamap | yad vā, jagadutpattyādijñānavatsu bhagavatsu śreṣṭhena ||7||


 || 3.8.8 ||

sāṅkhyāyanaḥ pāramahaṃsyamukhyo

vivakṣamāṇo bhagavadvibhūtīḥ |

 jagāda so'smadgurave'nvitāya

 parāśarāyātha bṛhaspateś ca ||

śrīdharaḥ : pāramahaṃsye dharme mukhyaḥ | vivakṣamāṇa ity ātmanepadaṃ,
brūñādeśasya vacer ubhayapaditvāt | anvitāyānugatāya ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : bṛhaspater bṛhaspataye ||8||


 || 3.8.9 ||

 provāca mahyaṃ sa dayālur ukto

muniḥ pulastyena purāṇam ādyam |

so'haṃ tavaitat kathayāmi vatsa

śraddhālave nityam anuvratāya ||

śrīdharaḥ : pulastyenokta ity atraivam ākhyāyikā | pitaraṃ
rākṣasabhakṣitaṃ śrutvā parāśaro rākṣasasatre pravṛtto vasiṣṭhavacanān
nivṛttas tataḥ pulastyena svasantatirakṣaṇāt tuṣṭena varo dattaḥ
purāṇapravaktā bhaviṣyasīti ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : sa  parāśaraḥ pulastyenokta ity atreyaṃ kathā pitaraṃ
rākṣasabhakṣitaṃ śrutvā parāśaro rākṣasasatre pravṛtto vaśiṣṭhavacanān
nivṛttas tataḥ pulastyena svasantatirakṣaṇāt tuṣṭena varo dattaḥ
purāṇapravaktā bhaveti ||9||


 || 3.8.10 ||

 udāplutaṃ viśvam idaṃ tadāsīd

  yan nidrayāmīlitadṛṅ nyamīlayat |

  ahīndratalpe'dhiśayāna ekaḥ

 kṛtakṣaṇaḥ svātmaratau nirīhaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evaṃ saṃkarṣaṇāt saṃpradāyapravṛttiṃ pradarśya
vibhūtikathanāya padmodbhavaṃ vaktum āha—udāplutam ekārṇavodake nimagnaṃ
yad yadā āsīt tadāmīlitadṛg atirohitacicchaktir eva śrīnārāyaṇo netre
nimīlitavān ity arthaḥ | māyāvinodaṃ parityajya svātmaratau svarūpānanda
eva kṛtotsavaḥ | ata eva nirīho niṣkriyaḥ man ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ śrībhāgavatasya saṃkarṣaṇāt saṃpradāyapravṛttiṃ
pradarśya tatkaṣṭam ārabhate | udāplutam ekārṇavodakanimagnam eva tadā
āsīt | kadā ? yad yadā naimittikapralaye amīlitadṛg
atirohitacicchaktir eva garbhodaśāyī śrīnārāyaṇo netre nimīlitavān ity
arthaḥ | talpe ity ārṣam | ātmabhiḥ svarūpaśaktibhiḥ saha ratau ramaṇe
kṛtotsavaḥ | nirīhas tyaktamāyekṣaṇaḥ ||10||


 || 3.8.11 ||

  so'ntaḥ śarīre'rpitabhūtasūkṣmaḥ

 kālātmikāṃ śaktim udīrayāṇaḥ |

  uvāsa tasmin salile pade sve

  yathānalo dāruṇi ruddhavīryaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kālaśakteḥ preraṇaṃ punaḥ sṛṣṭyavasare prabodhanārtham | sve
pade'dhiṣṭhāne | bahirvṛttyabhāve dṛṣṭāntaḥ, yathānala iti ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha vibhūtikathanāya tad eva purāṇaṃ pravartayati |
udāplutam ity ādinā viśvam atra lokatrayaṃ so'ntar iti | bhūtasūkṣma ity
atra | vilīnapārthivāṃśatanmātrasahitāni trailokyagatajīvānāṃ
liṅgaśarīrāṇy eva jñeyāni | yāny eva samaṣṭiliṅgaśarīram ity ucyate,
trilokād bahirjalādīnāṃ vidyamānatvāt | teṣām antaḥśarīre'rpaṇārtham eva
kālātmikām ityādijalastambhanaśaktyā jalābhyantare śayitatvād
bahiḥsthitānāṃ maharlokādivāsināṃ dṛṣṭyaviṣayatvāt tasmād
yugāntaśvasanāvaghūrṇajalormicakrāt salilād virūḍham | apāśritaḥ kañjam
iti vakṣyamāṇāc cānaladṛṣṭāntaḥ saṅgamanīyaḥ ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu trailokyagatānāṃ jīvānāṃ tadā kā vārtā ? ity ata
āha—antaḥśarīre śrīvaśarīramadhya eva arpitāni bhūtasūkṣmāṇi
trailokyagatadevamanuṣyādisūkṣmaśarīrāṇi yena saḥ | kena prakāreṇa ?
ity ata āha—kālātmikāṃ kālarūpāṃ svaśaktiṃudīrayan prerayan
tadicchāvaśāt pralayārambhakālenaiva trilokasthānāṃ sarveṣāṃ
sthūlaśarīrāṇi dhvaṃsayitvā liṅgaśarīrāṇi bhagavadantaḥśarīre arpitāni
yāny eva samaṣṭiliṅgaśarīram āhur ity arthaḥ | evaṃbhūtaḥ sa sve pade
pātālatale svasthāne salile ekārṇavodakaplute'pi jalastambhanaśaktyā
uvāsa | tataś ca maharlokādivāsināṃ dṛṣṭyaviṣayatve tasya dṛṣṭāntaḥ
yathānala iti ||11||


 || 3.8.12 ||

 caturyugānāṃ ca sahasram apsu

  svapan svayodīritayā svaśaktyā |

 kālākhyayāsāditakarmatantro

lokān apītān dadṛśe svadehe ||

śrīdharaḥ : svayā cicchaktyā saha vartamāna eva yoganidrayā svapan
pūrvam eva bodhanārthaṃ niyuktayā svakālaśaktyā āsāditaṃ prāpitaṃ
karmatantraṃ kriyākalāpo yasya saḥ | apītān līnān dadarśa ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svapnānantaraṃ cāsāditaṃ jīveṣu saṃyojitaṃ
karmatantraṃ yena saḥ ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ kiyantaṃ kālaṃ sa viśaśramety āha—catur iti | svayā
cicchaktyā jāgratyā saha jāgrad api svapan māyāśaktyā śayitayā saha
śayāna evety arthaḥ | tataś ca pralayāvasānasamaye svaśaktyā kālākhyayā
āsāditaṃ bhogādyarthaṃ saṃyojitaṃ svāntaḥsthitajīveṣu prati
svakarmatantraṃ yena saḥ | tataś ca lokān api brahmādisthāvarās tān api
ityān sūkṣmarūpeṇa svasmin prāptān dadṛśe svaśarīrān niṣkriyam ayitum
iti bhāvaḥ ||12||


 || 3.8.13 ||

  tasyārthasūkṣmābhiniviṣṭadṛṣṭer

antargato'rtho rajasā tanīyān |

  guṇena kālānugatena viddhaḥ

 sūṣyaṃs tadābhidyata nābhideśāt ||

madhvaḥ :  udakaṃ vāyunā śuṣkaṃ bhinnaṃ padmam abhūd dhareḥ  iti pādme
||14||

śrīdharaḥ : lokasṛṣṭyartham arthasūkṣme'bhiniviṣṭā dṛṣṭir yasya |
kālānusāriṇā rajoguṇena viddhaḥ sakṣobhitaḥ san tanīyān atisūkṣmo'rthaḥ
sūṣyan prasoṣyann udbhaviṣyan nābhideśād udbhūta ity arthaḥ ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sūṣyan svakāryaṃ janayiṣyan abhidyata udbhūtaḥ
pravṛddha ity arthaḥ ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ : uktapoṣanyāyenāha—tasya nārāyaṇasya arthasūkṣmeṣu
sarvajīvaliṅgadeheṣu abhiniviṣṭā niṣkāsanecchayā praviṣṭā dṛṣṭir yasya
tasya tadantargata evārthaḥ | prākṛtapadārthaviśeṣaḥ tanīyān
atisūkṣmo'pi kālānusāriṇā rajasā guṇena viddhaḥ saṅkṣobhitas tataś ca
suṣyan prasoṣyan nābhideśād udabhidyata ūrdhvam upasasarpa ||13||


 || 3.8.14 ||

 sa padmakośaḥ sahasodatiṣṭhat

 kālena karmapratibodhanena |

 svarociṣā tat salilaṃ viśālaṃ

vidyotayann arka ivātmayoniḥ ||

madhvaḥ : ātmā viṣṇur asya yoniḥ ||14||

śrīdharaḥ : sa tanīyān arthaḥ padmakośaḥ sann udatiṣṭhat | karmāṇi
jīvādṛṣṭāni pratiprabodhayati yaḥ kālas tena | ātmā śrīviṣṇur yonir yasya
||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : padmakoṣo'yaṃ nārāyaṇanābhikamalād anya eva jātaḥ
prākṛtārthamayatvāt ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : sa cārthaḥ kālena padmakoṣaḥ sann udatiṣṭhat
pralayamahārṇavajalād apy ūrdhvapradeśe tasthau karmāṇi jīvādṛṣṭāni
pratibodhayatīti tena ātmā śrīviṣṇur yonir yasya sa arka iveti
svaprabhayaiva sa vyakaśad iti tatprakāśanārtham arkāntarāpekṣā nāstīti
bhāvaḥ ||14||


 || 3.8.15 ||

tallokapadmaṃ sa u eva viṣṇuḥ

prāvīviśat sarvaguṇāvabhāsam |

 tasmin svayaṃ vedamayo vidhātā

  svayambhuvaṃ yaṃ sma vadanti so'bhūt ||

madhvaḥ : padmasaṃsthāt hares tatra  brahmājani caturmukha  iti ca |
sarvaguṇāvabhāsaṃ pṛthivyātmakam |

pṛthivyāṃ hi sarve śabdādayo guṇāvabhāsante |

tasyāsanavidhānārthaṃ pṛthivī padmam ucyate || iti mokṣadharme ||15||

śrīdharaḥ : tallokātmakaṃ padmaṃ sarvān guṇān jīvabhogyān arthān
avabhāsayatīti tathā | tad yasmāj jātaṃ sa eva viṣṇuḥ | u iti saṃbodhane |
prāvīviśat prakarṣeṇāluptaśaktir evāntaryāmitayā viveśa | tasmin
viṣṇunādhiṣṭhite padme vidhātā brahmābhūt | kathaṃ bhūtaḥ ? svayam eva
vedamayo, na tv adhyayanena prāptavedaḥ | ko'sau ? adṛṣṭapitṛtvena yaṃ
svayambhuvaṃ vadanti saḥ | prākkalpānte nārāyaṇena saha nidrayaikībhūta
āsīt tasmiṃś ca prabuddhe, tata eva pādme kalpe padmadvāreṇābhivyaktiṃ
prāpta ity arthaḥ ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : talloketi | sa garbhodakaśāyy eva viṣṇurūpaḥ san
||15||

viśvanāthaḥ : tataś ca tallokapadmaṃ lokātmakaṃ virājam ity arthaḥ | u
iti saṃbodhane | sa eva pralayārambhe yasyodaram eva vairājaḥ
sūkṣmarūpeṇa prāviśat | pralayānte ca tataḥ padmarūpeṇāvirbhūtaḥ
vairājaḥ sa eva garbhodaśāyī viṣṇuḥ prāvīviśat, svārthe nic,
antaryāmitvena praviveśa | padmaṃ kīdṛśaṃ ? sarveṣāṃ guṇānāṃ guṇakāryāṇāṃ
jīvabhogyānāṃ svarganarakādīnām avabhāsaḥ prakāśo yatra tat | tasmin
padme vidhātā brahmā abhūt | ko'sau ? adṛṣṭapitṛkatvena yaṃ svayambhuvaṃ
vadanti saḥ | prākkalpānte nārāyaṇena saha nidrayaikībhūta āsīt | tasmin
prabuddhe, ata eva padmadvāreṇābhivyakta ity arthaḥ | atra sthūlo
vairājaḥ sūkṣmo hiraṇyagarbhaḥ sṛṣṭyādikartā caturmukha iti brahmaṇa eva
trarūpyaṃ jñeyam ||15||


 || 3.8.16 ||

tasyāṃ sa cāmbhoruhakarṇikāyām

 avasthito lokam apaśyamānaḥ |

parikraman vyomni vivṛttanetraś

catvāri lebhe'nudiśaṃ mukhāni ||

śrīdharaḥ : sa ca tasmin kalpe caturmukho'bhūd ity āha—tasyām iti |
parikramaṃs tatrastha eva grīvāṃ cālayan lokanirīkṣaṇārthaṃ vivṛtte
vicalite netre yasya ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tatraiva parikraman bhraman vivṛttanetraḥ śvasan
yugapat caturdiśo darśanotkaṇṭhayā catvāri mukhāni lebhe ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : parikraman tatrastha eva lokanirīkṣaṇārthaṃ grīvāṃ cālayan
yugapad eva dikcatuṣṭaye vyomni nirjanatvād ākāśamātre vivṛttanetraḥ,
nikṣiptadṛṣṭiḥ caturdikṣu catvāri mukhāni lebhe ||16||


 || 3.8.17 ||

tasmād yugāntaśvasanāvaghūrṇa

  jalormicakrāt salilād virūḍham |

upāśritaḥ kañjam u lokatattvaṃ

nātmānam addhāvidad ādidevaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tasya ca śrīnārāyaṇopāsanayaivāvirbhūtajñānakriyāśakter
lokakartṛtvaṃ na svata iti vaktuṃ prathamaṃ tasya vimoham āha—tasmāt
salilād virūḍham udgataṃ kañjam upāśriyo'pi sākalyena tat kañjaṃ
lokatattvaṃ cātmānaṃ ca sākṣān na jñātavān | u iti vismaye |
kathaṃbhūtāt ? yugāntaśvasanaḥ pralayavāyus tenāvaghūrṇaṃ tatra tatra
prakampitaṃ yasmāt sarvata ūrmicakraṃ yasmin ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : salilād virūḍham iti | śrīnārāyaṇaśayanāvakāśasyopary
apy anāvṛtatvāt ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavaddattayaiva śaktyā brahmaṇaḥ sṛṣṭyādiśaktir na
svata iti lokeṣu jñāpayituṃ pūrvābhyastasṛṣṭyādiśilpasyāpi brahmaṇo
vimohanam āha, tasmāt salilāt virūḍham udgata kañjam apāśritaḥ san | u iti
vismaye lokānāṃ tattvam ātmatattvaṃ ca na viveda salilāt kathaṃbhūtāt
yugāntety ādi yugāntaśvasanaḥ pralayavāyuḥ ||17||


 || 3.8.18 ||

 ka eṣa yo'sāv aham abjapṛṣṭha

etat kuto vābjam ananyad apsu |

asti hy adhastād iha kiñcanaitad

 adhiṣṭhitaṃ yatra satā nu bhāvyam ||

madhvaḥ :  pradhānavācakas tv ekaś cānanyaḥ kevalaṃ svayam iti brāhme |
satā brahmaṇā | sa brahmācintayat | kuto'nu padmaṃ brahmaṇaḥ syād iti  iti
maitrāyaṇaśrutiḥ ||18||

śrīdharaḥ : aviduṣas tasya vitarkam āha—yo'sāv aham abjapṛṣṭhe eṣa kaḥ ?
ananyad ekam evaitad abjaṃ kuto vā jātaṃ ? yatraitad adhiṣṭhitaṃ
tenādhastāt satā vartamānena nu niścitaṃ bhāvyam | sa ittham udvīkṣyety
uttareṇānvayaḥ | tathā ca śrutiḥ—so'paśyat puṣkaraparṇe tiṣṭhan
so'manyata asti caitad yasminn idam adhitiṣṭhati iti ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ka eṣa iti yugmakam ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ : aviduṣas tasya tarkam āha yo'sāv aham abjapṛṣṭhe eṣa kaḥ
kutaḥ kasmād vā utthitam etad abjam ananyad ekam eva | kiṃ ca, hi
niścitaṃ, iha adhastāt kiñcana vastu asti, yatra etat padmam adhiṣṭhitam |
ata eva satā sudhiyā mayā anubhāvyaṃ tad anubhavitum arhaḥ san, sudhīḥ
kovido budha  ity amaraḥ | sa ittham udvīkṣyety uttareṇānvayaḥ | tathā ca
śrutiḥ—so'paśyat puṣkaraparṇe tiṣṭhan so'manyata asti caitad yasminn idam
adhitiṣṭhati iti ||18||


 || 3.8.19 ||

  sa ittham udvīkṣya tadabjanāla

 nāḍībhir antarjalam āviveśa |

  nārvāggatas tatkharanālanāla

 nābhiṃ vicinvaṃs tad avindatājaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tasya ca bahirmukhapravṛttyā mahatāpi kālena tad aprāptim
āha—sa iti dvābhyām | tasyābjasaya yan nālaṃ tasya nāḍībhir antaś chidraiḥ
| tasya svaranālasya padmasya yan nālaṃ tasya nābhim adhiṣṭhānaṃ
vicinvann arvāggato'pi tat tadā nāvindata ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavadicchāṃ vinā sābhimānapuruṣaprayatno
vaiphalyāyaiva syād iti pradarśayann āha—sa iti nālībhir nāḍīcchidraiḥ
tasya kharanālasya padmasya yan nālaṃ tasya nābhim adhiṣṭhānaṃ
śrīnārāyaṇanābhipadmam arvāggato'pi tannikaṭagato'pi na avindan na
prāpa | bhaktyā vinā tatprāpter durghaṭatvād iti bhāvaḥ ||19||


 || 3.8.20 ||

 tamasy apāre vidurātmasargaṃ

 vicinvato'bhūt sumahāṃs triṇemiḥ |

 yo dehabhājāṃ bhayam īrayāṇaḥ

parikṣiṇoty āyur ajasya hetiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : he vidura, ātmasargaṃ svakāraṇam | triṇemiḥ kālaḥ | ajasya
viṣṇor hetiḥ sudarśanarūpaṃ śastram | dehabhājāṃ narāṇāṃ bhayam
utpādayann iti saṃvatsaraśatam ity uktaṃ bhavati ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ātmasvargaṃ svakāraṇaṃ trinemiḥ kālaḥ | yaḥ kālaḥ
dehabhājaṃ narāṇāṃ bhayaṃ mṛtyusannidhim īrayan kathayan āyuḥ
parikṣiṇotīti saṃvatsaraśatātmaka ity arthaḥ | ajasya viṣṇor hetiḥ
sudarśanaśastrāṃśasvarūpaḥ ||20||


 || 3.8.21 ||

 tato nivṛtto'pratilabdhakāmaḥ

 svadhiṣṇyam āsādya punaḥ sa devaḥ |

śanair jitaśvāsanivṛttacitto

nyaṣīdad ārūḍhasamādhiyogaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : antarmukhatayā tu bhagavantaṃ dṛṣṭavān ity āha dvābhyām |
tato'nveṣaṇān nivṛttaḥ | na pratilabdhaḥ kāmo manoratho yena |
svadhiṣṇyaṃ padmam | jitena śvāsena nivṛttaṃ saṃyataṃ cittaṃ yasya, ata
evārūḍha āśritaḥ samādhiyogo yena tathābhūtaḥ san nyaṣīdad upaviveśa
||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ārūḍhasamādhiyoga iti yat kim api sarvakāraṇaṃ vastu
syāt, tanmayy āvirbhavatv ity āśāpūrvikā sāmānyākāreṇaiva
tadananyavṛttitā samādhiyogo'tra jñeyaḥ, viśeṣākārājñānāt ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : tyaktasvābhimānasya tasya tadicchayā taddhyānena
tatprāptim āha—tata anveṣaṇāt | svadhiṣṇyaṃ padmaṃ nivṛttacittaḥ
saṃyatamanāḥ nyaṣīdat upaviveśa | samādhir bhagavaddhyānotthaṃ
cittaikāgryam ||21||


 || 3.8.22 ||

  kālena so'jaḥ puruṣāyuṣābhi

pravṛttayogena virūḍhabodhaḥ |

svayaṃ tad antarhṛdaye'vabhātam

apaśyatāpaśyata yan na pūrvam ||

śrīdharaḥ : puruṣāyuṣā saṃvatsaraśatena kālenābhipravṛttaḥ suniṣpanno
yogas tena virūḍha utpanno bodho yasya | yat pūrvaṃ vicinvann api nāpaśyat
tat svayam evāntarhṛdaye 'vabhātam apaśyat ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : puruṣāyuṣā varṣaśateneti śrīmaitreyo
vartamānakaliyugāpekṣayā prāheti jñeyam | vastutas tūttaragranthe
bhūyastvaṃ tapa ātiṣṭhety ādi śrībhagavadvākyānantaraṃ daśamādhyāye
viriñco'pi tathā cakre divyaṃ varṣaśataṃ tapa [bhā.pu. 3.10.4] ity uktyā
etad eva jñeyam | yat tu dvitīye divyaṃ sahasrābdaṃ [bhā.pu. 2.9.8]
ityādyuktaṃ tad brāhmakalpagataṃ jñeyam ||22||

viśvanāthaḥ : puruṣāyuṣā saṃvatsaraśatātmakakāleneti maitreyo
vartamānakaliyugāpekṣayā prāheti jñeyam | abhipravṛttayogena
pākadaśāprāptabhagavaddhyānena | dhyāne sma no darśitaṃ ta upāsakānām
ity upariṣṭād ukteḥ | yat svāspadakamalādhiṣṭhānaṃ pūrvaṃ vicinvann api
nāpaśyat | tat svayam evāntarhṛdaye'vabhātam apaśyat ||22||


 || 3.8.23 ||

  mṛṇālagaurāyataśeṣabhoga

paryaṅka ekaṃ puruṣaṃ śayānam |

 phaṇātapatrāyutamūrdharatna

 dyubhir hatadhvāntayugāntatoye ||

śrīdharaḥ : yad apaśyat tad varṇayati—mṛṇāleti navabhiḥ | navasv apy
apaśyad ity asyaivānuṣaṅgaḥ | mṛṇālavad gauraś cāsāv āyataś ca yaḥ śeṣas
tasya bhogo dehaḥ sa eva paryaṅkas tasmin | kutra sthite ? paryaṅke
phaṇātapatrair āyutāḥ sarvato yuktā ye mūrdhānas teṣāṃ ratnāni
kirīṭasthāni teṣāṃ dyubhiḥ prabhābhir hatadhvānte yugāntatoye ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tad eva vastu varṇayati navabhiḥ | phaṇā eva ātapatrāyutāni
teṣu mūrdharatnānāṃ śirasthamaṇīnāṃ dyubhiḥ kāntibhir hatadhvānte
pralayajale ||23||


 || 3.8.24 ||

prekṣāṃ kṣipantaṃ haritopalādreḥ

sandhyābhranīver ururukmamūrdhnaḥ |

 ratnodadhārauṣadhisaumanasya

vanasrajo veṇubhujāṅghripāṅghreḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kathaṃbhūtaṃ puruṣaṃ ? haritopalādrer
marakataśilāmayaparvatasya prekṣāṃ śobhāṃ kṣipantaṃ svalāvaṇyātiśayena
tiraskurvantam | sandhyābhraṃ nīvīparidhānaṃ yasya tasya śobhāṃ
pītāmbareṇa kṣipantam | ururukmamūrdhno'nekasvarṇaśikharasya tasya
svakirīṭaiḥ | ratnāni ca udadhārāś ca oṣadhayaś ca saumanasyāni ca,
puṣpasamūhāḥ sumanasa eva vā teṣāṃ vanasrajo vanamālā yasya, veṇava eva
bhūjā yasya, aṅghripā evāṅghrayo yasya sa cāsau sa ca tasya | ayam
arthaḥ, yadi tasmin mālā iva sthitā ratnādayo bhavanti, veṇavaś ca bhūjā
iva, vṛkṣāś ca pādā iva tarhi tasya śobhāṃ
svīyaratnamuktātulasīpuṣpadāmabhir bhujair aṅghribhiś ca kṣipantam
iti ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : haritopalādrer marakataśilāmayaparvatasya prekṣām
utprekṣāṃ kṣipantaṃ kim ayaṃ marakatamaṇimayaḥ parvata iti vā utprekṣā
tām api svalāvaṇyātiśayena tiraskurvantaṃ nirupamam ity arthaḥ |
kathaṃbhūtasya? | sandhyābhrāṇi nīvīva nitambe yasya tasyotprekṣāṃ
svīyapītāmbareṇa kṣipantam ity arthaḥ | ururukmāṇi kirīṭānīva mūrdhasu
śikhareṣu yasya tasyeti svīyakirītaiḥ | ratnānām upadhārāṇām oṣadhīnāṃ
saumanasyānāṃ puṣpasamūhānāṃ vanasrajo vanamālā yasyeti
svīyaratnamālā muktāmālā tulasīmālā puṣpamālābhiḥ, vanasrakśabdena
mālāmātrokteḥ | yad vā, ratnādibhir vanasrag yasyety ubhayatraikaiva
vanamālā vyākhyeyā | patrapuṣpamayīmālā vanamālā padāvadhīti
vanamālālakṣaṇe ratnamuktāder apy upalakṣaṇaṃ jñeyam | uparisthā veṇavo
bhujā iva | adhasthā aṅghripā aṅghraya iva yasya tasyeti
svīyabhujapādaiḥ ||24||


 || 3.8.25 ||

  āyāmato vistarataḥ svamāna

 dehena lokatrayasaṅgraheṇa |

  vicitradivyābharaṇāṃśukānāṃ

kṛtaśriyāpāśritaveṣadeham ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, āyāmato dairghyeṇa vistarataś ca svamānadehena
mīyate'neneti mānam upamā śobhanaś cāsāv amāno nirupamo dehas tena | yad
vā, suṣṭhu amāno'paricchinnas tena | yad vā, tābhyāṃ svānurūpapramāṇena,
ata eva lokatrayaṃ saṅgṛhyate yasmiṃs tathā | vicitrāṇi nānāvidhāni
divyāny apūrvāṇi cābharaṇāny aṃśukāni ca teṣāṃ kṛtā āsamantāc chrīḥ śobhā
yena, tena dehena viśiṣṭam | evaṃ svata evātiramyatve'py apāśritaveṣaḥ
svīkṛtālaṅkāro deho yasya tam apaśyat | yad vā, kena prekṣāṃ kṣipantam ity
apekṣāyām evaṃbhūtena deheneti saṃbandhaḥ ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, āyāmato dairghyeṇa vistaraton vistāreṇa ca svamānaḥ
svānurūpapramāṇo yo dehasthena viśiṣṭaṃ śleṣeṇa suṣṭhu amāno'paricchinnas
tena aparicchedam eva spaṣṭayati lokatrayasaṅgraheṇa trailokyavyāpinā
vicitrāṇi divyāny alaukikāni ābharaṇāny aṃśukāni ca teṣām api kṛtā śrīḥ
śobhā yena tena | tathā apāśitaveśadā īhā icchā yasya tam | yadaiva yaṃ
yaṃ veṣam icchati tadaiva satyasaṅkalpatvāt taṃ prāpnotīty arthaḥ ||25||


 || 3.8.26 ||

  puṃsāṃ svakāmāya viviktamārgair

 abhyarcatāṃ kāmadughāṅghripadmam |

pradarśayantaṃ kṛpayā nakhendu

  mayūkhabhinnāṅgulicārupatram ||

madhvaḥ : bhinnam anyebhyo vilakṣaṇam ||26||

śrīdharaḥ : svābhilaṣitaphalāya viviktaiḥ śuddhair vedoktair mārgair
abhyarcatāṃ puṃsāṃ kāmadugham aṅghripadmaṃ pradarśayantaṃ, kiñcid
unnamayya samarpayantam | nakhā eva indava;h, teṣāṃ mayūkhā raśmayaḥ, tair
bhinnāḥ sambhinnā aṅgulaya eva | cārūṇi patrāṇi yasya tat ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : svakāmāya svābhilaṣitaphalāya | yad vā, svo bhagavān eva
kāmas tasmai bhagavantam eva prāptum ity arthaḥ | svasya bhagavataḥ kāmāya
sevābhir bhagavantaṃ sukhayitum iti vā | viviktair
jñānakarmādyamiśratvena śuddhair mārgair vaidharāgādibhir
dāsyasakhyādibhāvamārgair vā kāmadughaṃ sevopayogimanorathapūrakam
aṅghripadmaṃ shasrapādapadmānāṃ madhya eva ekaṃ kiñcid unnamayya
pradarśayantam | tatra pādapadmam ityuttaraśloke mukhenety
ekavacanaliṅgena bhaṅgyātraiva prastāve puṃsām ityādiślokatrayyā
śrīkṛṣṇāvatāradarśanam eva brahmaṇe darśitam, tad uhovāca—brāhmaṇo'sāv
anavarataṃ me dhyātaḥ stutaḥ parārdhānte so'budhyata gopaveśo me purastād
āvirbabhūva  [goṭā.u. 1.26] iti gopālatāpinīśruter
brahmasaṃhitākathādṛṣṭeś ceti | tasyaiva madanagopālasvarūpasya
tribhaṅgamūrter vyatyastapādasya dakṣiṇacaraṇapadmonnamanadṛṣṭer iti
kecid āhuḥ | nakhendumayūkhair eva bhinnāḥ sambhinnā aṅgulaya eva cārūṇi
patrāṇi yasya tad iti | padmasyāsya candraraśmivikasitatvād adbhutatvam
uktam ||26||


 || 3.8.27 ||

  mukhena lokārtiharasmitena

parisphuratkuṇḍalamaṇḍitena |

  śoṇāyitenādharabimbabhāsā

 pratyarhayantaṃ sunasena subhrvā ||

śrīdharaḥ : lokārtiharaṃ smitaṃ yasmiṃs tena | parisphuradbhyāṃ
kuṇḍalābhyāṃ maṇḍitena | adharabimbadīptyā | śoṇavadācaritena
śobhananāsāyuktena subhrvā śobhanayā bhruvā ca pratyarhayantaṃ pūjakān
prati pūjayantaṃ saṃmānayantam ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : pratyarhayantaṃ pūjakāṃs tān pratipūjayantaṃ bhogāpavargādes
tair bhaktair asvīkārāt tenaiva tatsevāṛṇaṃ pariśodhayantam ivety arthaḥ
| ārtiduḥkhamātraṃ taddarśanotkaṇṭhyapīḍā vā subhrvā śobhanayā bhruvā
ekayā ramayaiva rahasyabhāvaprakāśikayeti pratyarhaṇiyā api
bhaktaviśeṣā eva sūcitaḥ ||27||


 || 3.8.28 ||

kadambakiñjalkapiśaṅgavāsasā

svalaṅkṛtaṃ mekhalayā nitambe |

  hāreṇa cānantadhanena vatsa

 śrīvatsavakṣaḥsthalavallabhena ||

śrīdharaḥ : kadambakiñjalkavatpiśaṅgaṃ yad vāsas tena mekhalayā ca
nitambe svalaṅkṛtam | he vatsa ! śrīvatsayuktaṃ yad vakṣaḥsthalaṃ,
tasya vallabhena vakṣasy anarghyeṇa hāreṇa svalaṅkṛtam ity arthaḥ ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vatsa ! he vidura ! śrīvatsayuktaṃ yad vakṣaḥsthalaṃ tasya
vallabhena hāreṇa ||28||


 || 3.8.29 ||

 parārdhyakeyūramaṇipraveka

  paryastadordaṇḍasahasraśākham |

  avyaktamūlaṃ bhuvanāṅghripendram

  ahīndrabhogair adhivītavalśam ||

madhvaḥ :  tasmād avyaktam utpannaṃ triguṇaṃ dvijasattamā  iti
mokṣadharme ||29||

śrīdharaḥ : mahācandanavṛkṣarūpakeṇa nirūpayituṃ taṃ viśinaṣṭi |
parārdhyāni śreṣṭhāni keyūrāṇy aṅgadāni maṇipravekāś ca maṇyuttamās taiḥ
paryastā vyāptā dordaṇḍā eva sahasram anantāḥ śākhā yasya |
candanavṛkṣo'pi keyūrāditulyaiḥ phalapuṣpādibhir vyāptaśākho bhavati |
avyaktaṃ pradhānaṃ mūlam adhobhāgo yasya | yad vā, avyaktaṃ brahma mūlaṃ
yasya, brahmābhivyaktirūpatvāt | vṛkṣasyāpi mūlaṃ na vyaktam |
bhūvanātmakam aṅghripendram | ahīndrasyānantasya bhogaiḥ phaṇair
dehāvayavair vādhivītāḥ saṃveṣṭitāḥ spṛṣṭā valśāḥ skandhā yasya |
vanaspate śatavalśo viroha [ṛg.ve. 3.8.4] iti śruteḥ | so'pi sarpair
veṣṭito bhavati ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : avyaktamūlam iti | na vyajyate śāstravidbhir na
kathyate mūlaṃ yasya taṃ sarvamūlatvena mūlāntararahitam ity arthaḥ |
avyaktaḥ svayaṃ bhagavāṃs tanmūlam iti vā bhūvanarūpāṇām aṅghripāṇām
indram īśvaram ||29||

viśvanāthaḥ : svayaśaḥsaurabhasuvāsitasarvaviśvatvāt
mahācandanavṛkṣarūpakeṇa nirūpayituṃ taṃ viśinaṣṭi | paryastā
viśvavyāpino dordaṇḍā eva sahasram anantāḥ śākhyā yasya tam | avyaktaṃ
vyañjanayāpi kair api noktaṃ mūlam anāditvāt yasya tam | yad uktaṃ—sa ātmā
svāśrayāśrayaḥ iti | vṛkṣapakṣe spaṣṭam | bhuvanāni caturdaśa aṅghriṇā
ekenaiva pāti rakṣati sa cāsāv indra aiśvaryavāṃś cety
ekapādavibhūtipatim ity arthaḥ | pakṣe, bhuvaneṣu madhye ye aṅghripās
teṣām indram ahīndrasyānantasya bhogaiḥ phaṇaiḥ dehāvayavair vā adhivītāḥ
spṛṣṭā valśāḥ skandhā yasya taṃ, śatavalśo viroha [ṛg.ve. 3.8.4] iti
śruteḥ | pakṣe, bahusarpaveṣṭitaskandhaśākhādikam ||29||


 || 3.8.30 ||

 carācarauko bhagavanmahīdhram

ahīndrabandhuṃ salilopagūḍham |

 kirīṭasāhasrahiraṇyaśṛṅgam

āvirbhavat kaustubharatnagarbham ||

śrīdharaḥ : prekṣāṃ kṣipantam ity atraiva parvatarūpakeṇa nirūpitam api
viśeṣaṇāntaraiḥ punar nirūpayati | bhagavān eva mahīdhrastam |
carācarāṇām okaḥ sthānam | so'pi tathā | ahīndrasya bandhum | so'py
ahīndrāṇāṃ bandhuḥ | salilenopagūḍham āvṛtam | parvato'pi mainākādis tathā
| kirīṭasāhasram eva hiraṇyaśṛṅgāṇi yasya | so'pi mervādis tathā | yathā
parvatasya garbhe kvacid ratnam āvirbhavati tathā āvirbhavat spaṣṭaṃ
dṛśyamānaṃ kaustubharatnaṃ garbhe mūrtimadhye yasya tam ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : candanavṛkṣarūpakeṇa nirūpya svasya āśrayo'pi svam eveti
darśayituṃ candanaparvatarūpakeṇāpi nirūpayati | bhagavān eva mahīdhro
malayagiris taṃ carācarāṇām oka āspadam ahīndro'nanto'hīndrāḥ sarpādhipāś
ca | salilena garbhodena kṣīrodena ca āliṅgitaṃ kirīṭasāhasram eva
hiraṇyavarṇāni śṛṅgāṇi yasya taṃ malayasya svarṇavarṇaśṛṅgatvāt
kaustubharatnaṃ garbhe mūrtimadhye yasya taṃ malayasya parvatatvena
ratnakhanimattvāt ||30||


 || 3.8.31 ||

nivītam āmnāyamadhuvrataśriyā

 svakīrtimayyā vanamālayā harim |

  sūryenduvāyvagnyagamaṃ tridhāmabhiḥ

 parikramatprādhanikair durāsadam ||

madhvaḥ : sūryenduvāyvagnyādibhis tridhāmno viṣṇor agacchadbhiḥ
prādhānikaiḥ |

muktavāyvādibhir viṣṇuṃ vṛtaṃ brahmā dadarśa |

tadanyabhāvato nānyad atas tat sraṣṭum aicchata || iti brahmāṇḍe ||31||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, vanamālayā nivītaṃ kaṇṭhalambinyā vyāptam | āmnāyā
vedā eva madhuvratāḥ, taiḥ śrīr yasyās tayā harim iti parvatādirūpam
apaśyat, harir asāv iti jñātavān ity arthaḥ | sūryādibhir agamam agamyam |
svavyāpārair ākalayitum aśakyam ity arthaḥ | kiṃ ca, triṣv api lokeṣu
dhāma sphūrtir yeṣāṃ taiḥ | rakṣaṇārthaṃ parikramadbhiḥ parito dhāvadbhiḥ
prādhanikaiḥ pradhanaṃ saṅgrāmas tatprayojanaiḥ sudarśanādibhir
hetubhūtair durāsadaṃ duṣprāpam ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : nivītaṃ yuktaṃ harim iti parvatādirūpaṃ paśyan harir asāv
iti jñātavān ity arthaḥ | sūryādibhir agamaṃ svavyāpārair ākalayitum
aśakyam ity arthaḥ | tridhāmabhiḥ saccidānandasvarūpaiḥ rakṣaṇārthaṃ
parikrāmadbhiḥ parito dhāvadbhiḥ prādhanikaiḥ pradhanaṃ saṅgrāmas tena
dīvyadbhiḥ sudarśanādibhir jayavijayādipārṣadair vā hetubhūtair
durāsadam anyair duṣprāpam ||31||


 || 3.8.32 ||

  tarhy eva tannābhisaraḥsarojam

  ātmānam ambhaḥ śvasanaṃ viyac ca |

  dadarśa devo jagato vidhātā

  nātaḥ paraṃ lokavisargadṛṣṭiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : yadi avaṃ harim apaśyat tarhy eva tadaiva lokavisargadṛṣṭi
saṃs tasya nābhisarasi sarojaṃ śvasanaṃ pralayavāyuṃ viyad ākāśaṃ ca
dadarśa ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tarhīti | ataḥ paraṃ sṛṣṭyupakaraṇam ||32||

viśvanāthaḥ : tarhy eva tannābhisarasi sarojaṃ saroje cātmānam ātmanaś
caturdikṣu antaḥ śvasanaṃ viyac ceti bhūtatrikaṃ dadarśa | nātaḥ paraṃ
pṛthivyādi | lokānāṃ vividhe sarge dṛṣṭiś cikīrṣā yasya saḥ ||32||


 || 3.8.33 ||

 sa karmabījaṃ rajasoparaktaḥ

  prajāḥ sisṛkṣann iyad eva dṛṣṭvā |

  astaud visargābhimukhas tam īḍyam

  avyaktavartmany abhiveśitātmā ||

śrīdharaḥ : karmabījaṃ lokasṛṣṭeḥ kāraṇam | rajasā uparakto
rajoguṇayuktaḥ | ataḥ prajāḥ sraṣṭum icchann iyad eva
nābhisarojādipañcakam eva | visarge'py abhimukhodattacittaḥ
avyaktavartmani bhagavati niveśitacittaḥ ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sa iti | rajasā yuktaḥ san prajāḥ sraṣṭum aicchat |
iyat nābhisarojādipañcakam eva lokasṛṣṭeḥ kāraṇaṃ dṛṣṭvā visarge
dattacitto'pi avyaktivartmani bhagavati niveśitacittaḥ sann astaud ity
arthaḥ ||33||

viśvanāthaḥ : karmabījaṃ lokasṛṣṭeḥ kāraṇam | iyad eva sarojādipañcakam
eva visargābhimukhaḥ visargaṃ katham ahaṃ kuryāṃ ? iti bhāvayan prabhum
evāhaṃ śaraṇaṃ yāmīti visargābhiniveśaṃ parityajya avyaktavartmani
śrībhagavati abhiniveśita ātmā mano yasya saḥ ||33||


iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

 tṛtīyaskandhe aṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe

 viduramaitreyasaṃvāde bhagavaddarśanam

  aṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.8 ||

 (3.9)

atha navamo'dhyāyaḥ

pādmodbhave brahmastavaḥ

 || 3.9.1 ||

 brahmovāca—

  jñāto'si me'dya sucirān nanu dehabhājāṃ

  na jñāyate bhagavato gatir ity avadyam |

  nānyat tvad asti bhagavann api tan na śuddhaṃ

  māyāguṇavyatikarād yad urur vibhāsi ||

madhvaḥ : svato nāsti tadadhīnavidyamānam apy aśuddham | yac ca
svanānātvaṃ tad api sthānabhedād asad eva bhāti |

eko'pi sthānanānātvān nāneva harir īyate |

sarvāntaryāmiṇas tasya na bhedo vidyate kvacit || iti brahmavaivarte
||1||

śrīdharaḥ :

 navame tapasā tuṣṭaṃ dṛṣṭvā nārāyaṇaṃ tv ajaḥ |

  astaud ekārṇave sīdan lokasargacikīrṣayā ||

bhagavajjñānenātmanaḥ kṛtārthatām āviṣkurvann ajñāṃś ca śocann
āha—jñāto'sīti | sucirād bahukālopāsanenādya me mayā jñāto'si | nanv aho
dehabhājām etad avadyaṃ doṣaḥ | kiṃ tat ? yad bhagavatas tava gatis
tattvaṃ na jñāyata iti | yatas tvam eva jñātuṃ yogyaḥ satyatvān nānyad
asatyatvād ity āha | tvat tvatto'nyan nāsti | yad apy astīti pratibhāti
tad api śuddhaṃ satyaṃ na bhavati | katham asataḥ pratītaḥ ? tatrāha—yad
yato māyāguṇakṣobhāt tvam evorur bahurūpo vibhāsi ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : jñāto'sīti | ajñāne kā hāniḥ ? tatrāha—deheti | gatiḥ
svarūpatacchaktyādirūpā sthitiḥ | nanu tādṛśamadgater anyac ca
pratīyate ? tatrāha—tādṛśāt tvat tvatto'nyat tattvaṃ nāstīti | yad vā,
asti, tad api na śuddhaṃ, kintu tvam eva śuddhaṃ tattvam ity arthaḥ |
tatrobhayatrāpi hetuḥ—māyeti | anantavaibhavamayyā antaraṅgayā śaktyā
svataḥ śuddha eva tvaṃ jagadrūpeṇa yad urur vibhāsi, tat khalu
bahiraṅgāyā māyākhyāyāḥ pradhānarūpāyāḥ svīyadravyaśakter guṇānāṃ
vyatikarāt pariṇāmād eva bhāsīti, na tatra śuddhatvam iti bhāvaḥ ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

 garbhodaśāyinaṃ svāntaryāminaṃ navame vidhiḥ |

  stutvā tasya kṛpāvṛṣṭyā sāmarthyaṃ prāpa sṛṣṭaye ||

bhagavatkṛpālabdhaṃ tadīyasākṣātkāraikakāraṇaṃ bhagavajjñānam eva
bhaved iti pradarśayan āha—jñāto'sīti | me mayā adya tvaṃ jñāto'si sucirāt
bahukālaṃ tvadīyadhyānaṃ kurvatāpīty arthaḥ | īdṛśasaundaryasya tava
mayā kadāpy adhyānāt dhyānadaśāyāṃ bhagavantam ahaṃ jñātvaiva dhyeyāmīti
| hanta hanta vṛthaiva jñānābhimānaḥ kṛtaḥ | tathā dhyātarūpa eva prabhur
me darśanaṃ dadātv ity āśaṃsāpi vṛthaiva kṛteti dhvaniḥ, yata
īdṛśasaundaryasya leśo'pi mahāmarakatanīlotpalanavanīradādiṣu nāstīti
tathārūpatayā tvaṃ dhyāto'pīdṛśarūpatayā pratyakṣo'bhūr iti tava kṛpāyā
māhātmyam anirvācyam ity anudhvaniḥ |

svayaṃ tanmādhuryāsvādanam anubhūya tadananubhavino'parān śocati |
dehabhājāṃ prāṇinām ity evāvadyaṃ doṣaḥ | kiṃ tat ? bhagavatas tava gatis
tattvaṃ na jñāyate, īdṛśasaundaryamādhuryādikaṃ nānubhūyate dehabhājām
iti dehadhāraṇasya tvadbhajanam eva phalaṃ, yasmād evaitādṛśaṃ svarūpam
anubhavituṃ śakyata iti bhāvaḥ |

nanu vicitre jagaty anyad api kim īdṛśam atimadhuram anubhavanīyaṃ vastu
nāsti, yato'syājñāne dehinām avadyaṃ bravīṣīti ? tatrāha—tvatto'nyan nāsti
yat kila jñānārtham upādeyam ity arthaḥ | bhagavann iti bhagavattvā tv
anyatra nāsty eveti bhagaśabdavācyanikhilāprākṛtasaundaryakīrtyādīni
vinā naiva netrakarṇādibhogyaṃ vastv astīti bhāvaḥ |

nanu sarvendriyabhogyaṃ svargasukham evāsti ? tatrāha—api tan na śuddham
iti | tad api naśvaratvādibhir anityaṃ pariṇāmavirasaṃ parimitam
atinikṛṣṭam api na śuddham apavitraṃ kāmikākasaṅghāsvādyaṃ, na tu
niṣkiñcanahaṃsapariṣaddṛśyam apīty arthaḥ |

kiṃ ca, tac cāpi tvanmāyāśaktikāryatvān na tvatto'nyad ity
āha—māyāguṇānāṃ vyatikarāt pariṇāmāt uruḥ
svargapārameṣṭhyasārvabhaumādirūpaḥ ||1||


 || 3.9.2 ||

  rūpaṃ yad etad avabodharasodayena

  śaśvannivṛttatamasaḥ sadanugrahāya |

  ādau gṛhītam avatāraśataikabījaṃ

 yannābhipadmabhavanād aham āvirāsam ||

madhvaḥ : yan nābhipadmabhavanād aham avirāsāṃ, yac cedaṃ
bhagavatsvarūpam ānandmātraṃ paśyāmi, yac cāśrito'smi, ataḥ paraṃ nāsti
| ato na jñāyata iti avadyam ity uttamāpekṣayā | anādigṛhītam eva gṛhyate
|

yad divyaṃ hare rūpaṃ kṣīrasāgaramadhyagam |

jñānānandaikamātraṃ ca na tataḥ paramaṃ kvacit |

anādinityād avyaktāt tasmāj jajñe caturmukhaḥ || ity adhyātme |

bhūtendriyāṇām ātmakam | yac cāpnotīty ādeḥ ||23||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu tvam api samyaṅ na jānāsi, yat tvayā dṛṣṭaṃ rūpam etad
api guṇātmakam eva | nirguṇaṃ brahmaiva tu satyam | tatrāha—rūpam iti
dvābhyām | avabodharasodayena cicchaktyāvirbhāvena śaśvat sadā nivṛttaṃ
tamo yasmāt tasya tava yad etad rūpaṃ, tvayaiva svātantryeṇa satām
upāsakānām anugrahāya gṛhītam āviṣkṛtam, avatāraśatasya
śuddhasattvātmakasya yad ekaṃ bījaṃ mūlam | tatpradarśanārthaṃ
guṇāvatārabījatvaṃ darśayati—yannābhīti ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : rūpam iti yugmakam | ādau guṇāvatārādīnām agrataḥ |
gṛhītam upāttaṃ satām ābhimukhyenānītaṃ prakaṭitam ity arthaḥ, aviśvaṃ
[bhā.pu. 3.9.3] iti vakṣyamāṇāt sṛjyatve viśvāntarbhāvāpātāt,
avabodharasodayena nityanivṛttasarvaprakṛtiguṇasya jīvavat
tadgrahaṇāyogāt | kvāhaṃ tamomahadahaṃ [bhā.pu. 10.14.11] ity ādiṣv iva
tamo hy atra prakṛtiḥ, avabodhasya sarvataś chedakatvāt |
tatrāvatāraśataikabījatve svānubhavena digdarśanam āha—yan nābhīti |
sṛṣṭeḥ prathamatvād ātmanas tathoktiḥ ||2|| [bhagavatsandarbha 53]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv idam api madīyaṃ rūpam adyatanam eva | adyatanatve
cānityam evātra adya jñāto'sīti tvaduktir eva pramāṇam iti parihāsam
āśaṅkyāha—rūpam iti | avabodharasaḥ svarūpabhūtā cicchaktis tadudayena
hetunā | śaśvat sanātanam eva nivṛttaṃ tamo māyā yasmāt tasya tava | atra
śaśvad ity ukter gṛhītam āviṣkṛtam iti svāmicaraṇāḥ | satām
ābhimukhyenānītam iti sandarbhaḥ | gṛhītā māyayā guṇā itivad abhede'pi
bhedabuddhyety eke, avabodharasena kartrā gṛhītam ity apare ||2||


 || 3.9.3 ||

  nātaḥ paraṃ parama yad bhavataḥ svarūpam

  ānandamātram avikalpam aviddhavarcaḥ |

paśyāmi viśvasṛjam ekam aviśvam ātman

bhūtendriyātmakam  adas ta upāśrito'smi ||

śrīdharaḥ : he parama, aviddhavarco'nāvṛtaprakāśam | ato'vikalpaṃ
nirbhedam | ata evānandamātram | evaṃbhūtaṃ yad bhavataḥ svarūpaṃ, tad
ato rūpāt paraṃ bhinnaṃ na paśyāmi, kintv idam eva tat | ataḥ kāraṇāt te
tava adaḥ idaṃ rūpam āśrito'smi | yogyatvād apīty āha—ekam upāsyeṣu
mukhyam, yato viśvasṛjaṃ viśvaṃ sṛjatīti viśvasṛjam, ata evāviśvaṃ
viśvasmād anyat | kiṃ ca, bhūtendriyātmakaṃ bhūtānām indriyāṇāṃ cātmānaṃ
kāraṇam ity arthaḥ ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yat khalv ataḥ paraṃ bhavataḥ svarūpaṃ
pūrṇabhagavadādirūpaṃ, tat tu na paśyāmi, kintv ado rūpam upāśrito'smi
| tatsvarūpaṃ viśinaṣṭi—ānandamātra ānando brahma [tai.u. 3.6.1] ity
uktaṃ brahma ca mātrā nirviśeṣacidrūpo'ṃśo yasya | na vidyate vividhaḥ
kalpaḥ sṛṣṭyādikalpanā yatra | bhagavadādirūpasya
mahāvaikuṇṭhasthitasya sṛṣṭyādikarmaṇy udāsīnatvāt, puruṣasyaiva tatra
pravṛttatvāt | tad uktaṃ—kālavṛttyā tu māyāyāṃ [bhā.pu. 3.5.26] ityādi,
viṣṇos tu trīṇi rūpāṇi ityādi ca | aviddhaṃ māyayā na bhinnaṃ varcas
tejaḥ śaktir yasya tādṛśam | ado rūpaṃ viśinaṣṭi—viśvasṛjam ityādinā |
bhūtānām indriyāṇāṃ cātmā pradhānākhyaṃ svarūpaṃ yatra, yad āśrityaiva
viśvakāraṇaṃ pradhānam api pravartata ity arthaḥ ||3||
[bhagavatsandarbha 53]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu nirviśeṣaṃ brahmaiva sarvādimaṃ kecid vyācakṣate, na tu
saviśeṣam iti | tatrāha—nāta iti | he parama ! yad bhavataḥ svarūpam
avikalpaṃ nirviśeṣam ānandamātraṃ brahma, tad adorūpāt paraṃ na paśyāmi,
kintv idam eva tan, na tu tad evedam ity arthaḥ | he aviddhavarcaḥ !
aviddhaṃ kāladeśādyaparicchinnaṃ varcas tejo yasyeti sarvavyāpakaṃ
tatteja eva tad brahmeti bhāvaḥ | yad uktaṃ harivaṃśe arjunaṃ prati
bhagavatā—

tat paraṃ paramaṃ brahma sarvaṃ vibhajate jagat ||

mamaiva tad ghanaṃ tejo jñātum arhasi bhārata || [ha.vaṃ. 2.114.12] iti |

nanūbhayor aikye'pi tvaṃ kutra rajyasīti ? tatrāha—aviśvaṃ viśvasmād anyaṃ
cinmayam ity arthaḥ | ahaṃ tu viśvam eva, yato bhūtendriyātmabhir
dehendriyamanobhiḥ kaṃ sukhaṃ yat tenaiva mado garvo yasyeti svasya
prākṛtatvam uktam ||3||


 || 3.9.4 ||

tad vā idaṃ bhuvanamaṅgala maṅgalāya

dhyāne sma no darśitaṃ ta upāsakānām |

  tasmai namo bhagavate'nuvidhema tubhyaṃ

yo'nādṛto narakabhāgbhir asatprasaṅgaiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanv evam api sopādhikam etad arvācīnam evety āśaṅkyāha—tad
vai tad evedam | he bhuvanamaṅgala ! yatas te tvayā no'smākam upāsakānāṃ
maṅgalāya dhyāne darśitam | na hy avyaktavartmābhiniveśitacittānām
asmākaṃ sopādhikadarśanaṃ yuktam iti bhāvaḥ | atas tubhyaṃ
namo'nuvidhemānuvṛttyā karavāma | tarhi kim iti kecin māṃ nādriyante ?
tatrāha—yo'nādṛta iti | asatprasaṅgair nirīśvarakutarkaniṣṭhaiḥ ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanu tarhy ado rūpaṃ prakṛtiguṇaviśiṣṭaṃ ? nety
āha—tad vā idam iti | tad evedam ity arthaḥ | bahumūrtyekamūrtikaṃ
[bhā.pu. 10.40.7] ity atrākrūroktanyāyena bhinnatvenāvirbhūtatve'pi
tasmād abhinnatvāt pradhānenāśritatve'pi, dhāmnā svena sadā
nirastakuhakaṃ [bhā.pu. 1.1.1] iti nyāyena tadanāsaktatvāt, tarhi kathaṃ
bhavatā dṛśyate ? tatrāha—dhyāna iti | asmākaṃ dhyānalakṣaṇāyāṃ bhaktāv
eva svātantryeṇa darśitatvāt | tarhy etadrūpaviśeṣadarśane kiṃ kāraṇaṃ
? tatrāha—upāsakānām | sṛṣṭikāmanayā tādṛśopāsanākartèṇāṃ svasya
sakāmatve'pi tādṛśatadupakārānusandhānena pratyupakārāsāmarthyāt
kevalaṃ namati tasmā iti | tad evaṃ sveṣāṃ sakāmatve'pi kṛpākaratvaṃ
tasya darśayitvā tadbahirmukhān nindati—ya iti | asanto'tra
tattadajñānakalpitam atikutarkeṇa manvānā ucyante ||4||
[bhagavatsandarbha 53]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu nirviśeṣasvarūpaṃ kim iti nāśrayasi ?
tatrāha—tatprasiddham idaṃ saviśeṣaṃ svarūpaṃ vai niścitaṃ
caturdaśabhuvanasthajanānāṃ sarveṣām api yāni maṅgalāni
dharmārthakāmamokṣāḥ, teṣām api maṅgalāya kalyāṇārtham etadrūpopāsane
saty eva dharmādayaḥ kuśalinaḥ sārthakā bhavanti, anyathā vyarthā
bhavantīty arthaḥ | nirviśeṣasvarūpas tv evaṃ na bhavatīti bhāvaḥ | tathā
no'smākam api dhyāne idam eva darśitaṃ, na tu tad iti, tataḥ
kṛpālutvādhikyam api | tasmāt tasmai saviśeṣasvarūpāya
cinmayaguṇasamudrāya tubhyaṃ nama eva kevalaṃ vidhema karavāma |
paricaryāṃ punaḥ kām ahaṃ kartuṃ śaknomīti bhāvaḥ |

nanv idaṃ rūpaṃ na saccidānandamayaṃ, kintu māyāmayam iti bruvāṇāḥ
kecin māṃ vastuto nādriyante ? tatrāha—yo'nādṛta iti | narakabhāgbhir iti
te naraka eva nipatiṣyantīty arthaḥ | asan  mithyaivedaṃ sarvam iti
prasaṅgavadbhir asādhusaṅgibhir iti vā ||4||


 || 3.9.5 ||

ye tu tvadīyacaraṇāmbujakośagandhaṃ

jighranti karṇavivaraiḥ śrutivātanītam |

bhaktyā gṛhītacaraṇaḥ parayā ca teṣāṃ

 nāpaiṣi nātha hṛdayāmburuhāt svapuṃsām ||

madhvaḥ : hṛdi vyaktaṃ tu yad rūpaṃ harer gandhaḥ sa ucyate |

uttamānāṃ tu pādena sarvaṃ rūpaṃ tu bhaṇyate |

gandhagandhavator yasmān na bhedaḥ kvacaneṣyate || iti brahmatarke ||5||

śrīdharaḥ : ādareṇa tu tvāṃ bhajantaḥ kṛtārthā ity āha—ye tv iti | śrutir
vedaḥ, sa eva vātaḥ, tena nītaṃ prāpitam | nāpaiṣi nāpayāsi | ye
tvatkathāśravaṇam atyādareṇa kurvanti, teṣāṃ hṛdi nityaṃ prakāśase ity
arthaḥ ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad eva sthāpayan—ye tu śuddhabhaktāḥ, teṣāṃ
tvaccaraṇāravindam eva puruṣārthaḥ syāt, yatas tvam api tāṃs tathā
manyase | ity āha—ye tv iti | tuśabdenātraiva paramasammatatvaṃ
sthāpitam | nāpaiṣi nāpagantum icchasīty arthaḥ | atra paramasādhanaṃ
ca—tvadīyety ādineti ||5||

viśvanāthaḥ : śāstreṣu nirviśeṣasvarūpopāsakā jñānina ucyante,
saviśeṣasvarūpopāsakās tu bhaktāḥ | teṣām ubhayeṣāṃ madhye bhaktā eva
kṛtārthāḥ priyāś cety āha dvābhyāṃ—ye tv iti | śrutir vedaḥ
śravaṇabhaktir vā vātaḥ, tena nītaṃ prāpitaṃ | tataś ca te
caraṇāmbujasaurabhyalobhino bhṛṅgā iva caraṇāmbujam eva
paramapuruṣārthatvena gṛhṇantīty āha—bhaktyā parayā premalakṣaṇayā
nāpaiṣīti, te yathā tava caraṇāmbuja eva lobhinas tan na tyajanti, tathā
tvam api teṣāṃ premamādhuryavati hṛdayāmbuja eva lobhī  tan na tyajasīti
parasparavaśīkāraḥ sūcitaḥ ||5||


 || 3.9.6 ||

  tāvad bhayaṃ draviṇadehasuhṛnnimittaṃ

 śokaḥ spṛhā paribhavo vipulaś ca lobhaḥ |

tāvan mametyasadavagraha ārtimūlaṃ

  yāvan na te'ṅghrim abhayaṃ pravṛṇīta lokaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tataḥ kiṃ ? ata āha—tāvad iti | draviṇādau vidyamāne bhayaṃ,
gate śokaḥ, punaś ca spṛhā, tataḥ paribhavaḥ, tathāpi vipulo lobhas tṛṣṇā,
punaḥ kathañcit prāpte mametyasadāgrahaḥ | ārtimūlaṃ bhayaśokādeḥ
kāraṇam | na pravṛṇīta nāśrayet | tvatpādāśrayaṇamātreṇa
bhayādinivṛttiḥ, kiṃ punas tvatprakāśe satīti bhāvaḥ ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nanu draviṇādinimitte bhayādau sati katham
etādṛśamanmādhuryāsaktiḥ syāt ? tatrāha—tāvad iti | na pravṛṇīta
śaraṇamātratvena nāśrayeta ||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu te'pi strīputradraviṇādimantaś cet saṃsāriṇa eveti
tatra nahi nahīti svarasanād aṃśam āha—tāvad iti |
draviṇādyāsaktihetukaṃ bhayaṃ saṃsāra ity arthaḥ | tasyaiva prapañcaṃ
śoka ity ādi tāvad eva, yāvat tavāṅghriṃ prabhutvādibhāvena na pravṛṇīta
| prakarṣeṇa varaṇe sati tvayy āsaktyā draviṇādyāsaktir nivartata iti
bhāvaḥ | yadi ca draviṇādāv āsakto'pi kaścid bhakto bhavet, tadāpi naiva
cintety āha—mamety asadāgrahas tāvad evārtimūlaṃ saṃsārakāraṇaṃ yāvad
iti | tavāṅghreḥ sevyatvena varaṇamātra eva draviṇāsaktyāder
utkhātadaṃṣṭroragadaṃśasyeva nārtimūlatvam ity agre ca vakṣyate—tāvad
rāgādayaḥ stenā ity atra yāvat kṛṣṇa na te janā [bhā.pu. 10.14.36] iti |
tāvacchabdasya dvipāṭhabalād vyākhyātam | evaṃ ca, "ye tu tvadīya" ity
anena ratimantaḥ, "tāvad bhayam" ity ardhenānarthanivṛttimantaḥ, "tāvan
mama" ity ardhenānivṛttānarthās trividhā api bhaktā na saṃsāriṇa ity uktam
||6 ||


 || 3.9.7 ||

  daivena te hatadhiyo bhavataḥ prasaṅgāt

sarvāśubhopaśamanād vimukhendriyā ye |

 kurvanti kāmasukhaleśalavāya dīnā

  lobhābhibhūtamanaso'kuśalāni śaśvat ||

śrīdharaḥ : ye niṣkāmā api santas tvāṃ nādriyante, te narakabhāja ity
uktaṃ | ye tu tvatkathāśravaṇādivimukhāḥ santaḥ kāmyakarmaparās
te'timandā ity āha—daivena te hatadhiyo naṣṭamatayaḥ | prasaṅgāc
chravaṇakīrtanādirūpāt sarvaduḥkhanivartakād vimukhānīndriyāṇi yeṣām |
akuśalāny akṣemakarāṇi ||7||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 10.466) : vaimukhyadoṣaṃ likhati—daiveneti dvābhyām
| prasaṅgāt śravaṇakīrtanādirūpāt kathāyā vā, sarvāṇy aśubhāny
amaṅgalāni duḥkhāni vā upaśamayatīti tathā tasmāt | vimukhāni aśraddhayā
nivṛttānīndriyāṇi yeṣāṃ te | vimukhendriyatvaṃ tatphalaṃ taddhetuṃ vā
abhivyañjayati—kurvantīti | akuśalāny akṣemakarāṇi karmāṇi ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  nanv evaṃ cet sarva eva sudhiyo bhūtvā maccaraṇam
āśrayiṣyante | tarhi ke saṃsāriṇo bhaviṣyanti ? tatrāha—daivena
tvadaparādhotthaduradṛṣṭena akuśalāni kāmyāni niṣiddhāni ca karmāṇi
||7||


 || 3.9.8 ||

 kṣuttṛṭtridhātubhir imā muhur ardyamānāḥ

śītoṣṇavātavaraṣair itaretarāc ca |

 kāmāgninācyutaruṣā ca sudurbhareṇa

sampaśyato mana urukrama sīdate me ||

śrīdharaḥ : akuśalatvam eva darśayati | kṣuc ca tṛṭ ca tridhātavaś ca
vātapittaśleṣmāṇaḥ, taiḥ | imāḥ prajāḥ sudurbhareṇa duḥsahena
kāmāgninācyutayā ruṣā'vicchinnakrodhena ca pīḍyamānāḥ sampaśyato me manaḥ
sīdati ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ye cānye paśvāditulyāḥ svīyahitāhitaṃ kim api na jānanti,
tāṃs tu śocāmy eva | ity āha—kṣuc ca tṛṭ ca tridhātavo
vātapittaśleṣmāṇaḥ, tair imāḥ prajā itaretarāc ca svaputrakalatrādiṣv
api parasparato'rdyamānāḥ kāmāgninā acyutayā anavacchinnayā ruṣā |
sudurbhareṇeti dvayor eva viśeṣaṇam | ardyamānāḥ prajāḥ paśyato mama manaḥ
sīdati | hanta hanta kathaṃ āsāṃ nistāro bhavitety avasīdati ||8||


 || 3.9.9 ||

 yāvat pṛthaktvam idam ātmana indriyārtha

māyābalaṃ bhagavato jana īśa paśyet |

tāvan na saṃsṛtir asau pratisaṅkrameta

vyarthāpi duḥkhanivahaṃ vahatī kriyārthā ||

madhvaḥ : māyābalaṃ bhagavadicchābalam | jñeyatvaṃ durgaṭasyāpi
ghaṭanādhikaśaktitā |

abheda īśvareṇāpi sṛṣṭyādāv antaraṅgatā |

ucyate yasyāḥ sā māyā harer icchātha vā balam ||

bhagavattantratā yasyās tadbhāryātvaṃ surūpatā |

ucyeta māyā sā tu śrīr doṣayuktā jaḍā smṛtā ||

pariṇāminī yasyās tu doṣāś cetanatā tathā |

śaivalīnām asau māyā jagadbandhātmikā sadā || iti brahmatarke |

dhyāye maṃsye tathā paśye śṛṇomīti vibhaktatā |

jīvasthā tu harer icchā balād indriyabhuktayaḥ || iti ṣāḍguṇye |

indriyāṇāṃ bhogārtham | vyarthāpi yajñādikriyārthā ||9 ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanv evaṃbhūtāyāḥ saṃsṛter aparamārthatvāt kimarthaṃ viṣādaḥ
kriyate ? tatrāha—yāvad iti | ātmana idaṃ pṛthaktvaṃ dehādibhāvam |
bhagavatas tavendriyārtharūpā yā māyā tayā balam ādhikyaṃ yasya tat | na
pratisaṅkrameta noparameta | duḥkhasamūhaṃ prāpayantī | kriyāṇām arthaḥ
phalaṃ yasyām | "pṛthaktvam idam" iti pāṭhe idaṃ dehādi tvad iti tvattaḥ
pṛthak paśyed yāvat, tāvad vyarthāpi noparameta ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tac ca tvattaḥ svātantryābhimānenaiva jīvānāṃ syād ity
abhipretyāha—yāvad iti | bhagavataḥ sakāśāt ātmanaḥ pṛthaktvaṃ svātantryaṃ
yāvat paśyet ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv evambhūtāyāḥ saṃsṛter avastubhūtatvād anayā katham
avasīdasi ? iti tatrāha—yāvad iti | yāvad ātmano jīvasya idaṃ pṛthaktvaṃ
dehādibhāvaṃ paśyet anubhavet | bhagavata indriyārtharūpāyā māyāyā balaṃ
yatra tat tāvat saṃsṛtir vyarthāpy avastubhūtāpi na pratisaṅkrameta
noparameta | duḥkhanivahaṃ prāpayanti yataḥ kriyāṇāṃ karmaṇām arthaḥ
phalaṃ yataḥ sā ||9||


 || 3.9.10 ||

 ahny āpṛtārtakaraṇā niśi niḥśayānā

 nānāmanorathadhiyā kṣaṇabhagnanidrāḥ |

  daivāhatārtharacanā ṛṣayo'pi deva

 yuṣmatprasaṅgavimukhā iha saṃsaranti ||

madhvaḥ:  arthair adhyāhṛtāni karaṇāni yeṣām |  ajñānaṃ tu niśā proktā
divājñānam udīryate iti skānde ||10||

śrīdharaḥ : bhavatv evam avivekināṃ, vivekinas tu muktā eveti kiṃ teṣāṃ
bhaktyā kṛtyaṃ ? ata āha—ahni āpṛtāni vyāpṛtāni ca tāny ārtāni kliṣṭāni
karaṇānīndriyāṇi yeṣāṃ rātrau viṣayasukhalavo'pi nāsti, yato niśi
niḥśayānāḥ svapnadarśanena ca kṣaṇe bhagnanidrā daivenāhatāḥ sarvataḥ
pratihatā artharacanā arthodyamā yeṣām ||10||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 10.304) : vivekino'py abhaktāś cet sadā
saṃsāraduḥkhādyanubhavanty evety āha—ahnīti | divase āpṛtāni ca tāni
artāni ca kliṣṭāni karaṇāni indriyāṇi yeṣām | rātrāv api sukhalavo nāsti,
yato niḥśayānāḥ svapnadarśanena ca kṣaṇe kṣaṇe bhagnanidrāḥ, daivena
āhatāḥ sarvataḥ pratihatāḥ artharacanāḥ arthārthodyamā yeṣām ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ata eva tattanmārgasiddhamunīnām apy anādara ity
āha—ahny āpṛtārtakaraṇā ity ādi | svabhāvāt yuṣmadbhajanavimukhāḥ
saṃsāriṇo bhavanti | kiṃ bahunā tattanmārgasiddhā munayo'pi
yuṣmatprasaṅgavimukhāś ced iha jagati tadvad eva saṃsaranti | athavā
munayo'pi tvadvimukhāś cet tarhi saṃsaranty eva | kathaṃbhūtāḥ santaḥ
saṃsaranti ? tatrāha—ahny āpṛtety ādi | āruhya kṛcchreṇa paraṃ padaṃ
[bhā.pu. 10.2.32] ity ādeḥ | ata uktaṃ śrīyamena—

dharmaṃ tu sākṣād bhagavatpraṇītaṃ

na vai vidur ṛṣayo nāpi devāḥ |

na siddhamukhyā asurā manuṣyāḥ

kuto nu vidyādharacāraṇādayaḥ ||

svayambhūr nāradaḥ śambhuḥ kumāraḥ kapilo manuḥ |

prahlādo janako bhīṣmo balir vaiyāsakir vayam ||

dvādaśaite vijānīmo dharmaṃ bhāgavataṃ bhaṭāḥ |

guhyaṃ viśuddhaṃ durbodhaṃ yaṃ jñātvāmṛtam aśnute ||

etāvān eva loke'smin puṃsāṃ dharmaḥ paraḥ smṛtaḥ |

bhaktiyogo bhagavati tannāmagrahaṇādibhiḥ ||  [bhā.pu. 6.1.1922] ity
ādi |

ete dharmapravartakā vijānīma eva , na tu svasmṛtyādiṣu prāyeṇopadiśāma
ity arthaḥ | yato guhyam aprakāśyam | durbodham anyais tathā grahītum
aśakyaṃ ca | guhyatve hetuḥ—yaṃ jñātvāmṛtam aśnute [bhā.pu. 6.3.21] iti |
ata eva vakṣyate ca—prāyeṇa veda tad idaṃ na mahājano'yaṃ [bhā.pu. 6.3.25]
ity ādi | atra mahājano dvādaśebhyas tadanugṛhītasampradāyibhyaś cānyo
mahāguṇayukto'pīty arthaḥ | tasmāt sādhūktam—ahny apṛtārta ityādi |
atra viśeṣo śrībhaktisandarbhe dṛśyaḥ ||10|| [bhaktisandarbhaḥ 113]

viśvanāthaḥ : na cājñānakalpitāyāḥ saṃsṛter jñānenaivoparāma iti vācyaṃ,
yato jñānino'pi bhaktirahitāḥ saṃsarantīty āha—ahnyeti
yuṣmatprasaṅgavimukhā ṛṣayo jñānino'pi evaṃbhūtāḥ santaḥ saṃsarantīty
anvayaḥ | munaya iti ca pāṭhaḥ | kathaṃbhūtāḥ ahni āpṛtāni
nānāvyāpārayuktāni ārtāni ca karaṇānīndriyāṇi yeṣāṃ tathābhūtā daivena
āhatā artharacanā bhogyavastupratipādanāni yeṣāṃ te | evaṃ ca daivena 
te  [bhā.pu. 3.9.7] ity anena karmiṇaḥ,  kṣuttṛḍ  [bhā.pu. 3.9.8]
ityādinā mūḍhāḥ,  ahny āpṛtā  [bhā.pu. 3.9.10] ity anena jñānina iti
trividhāḥ saṃsāriṇa uktāḥ ||10||


 || 3.9.11 ||

  tvaṃ bhaktiyogaparibhāvitahṛtsaroja

 āsse śrutekṣitapatho nanu nātha puṃsām |

yadyaddhiyā ta urugāya vibhāvayanti

 tattadvapuḥ praṇayase sadanugrahāya ||

madhvaḥ : tattadvapus teṣāṃ praṇayase | yādṛśo bhāvitas tv īśas tādṛśo
jīva ābhavet iti tantrasāre | taṃ yathā yathopāsate tad eva bhavatīti ca
||11||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evam abhaktānāṃ saṃsāram anivṛttim uktvā, bhaktānāṃ
tannivṛttim āha—tvam iti | bhaktiyogena śodhite hṛtsaroje āsse tiṣṭhasi
| śrutena śravaṇenekṣitaḥ panthā yasya | kiṃ ca, śravaṇaṃ vināpi
tvadbhaktā manasā yad yat tava vapūr rūpaṃ svecchayā dhyāyanti, tat tat
praṇayase prakaṭayasi | satāṃ bhaktānām anugrahāya ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhaktānāṃ tu tvaṃ vaśa evety aparaṃ kiṃ vaktavyaṃ ? ity
āha—tvam iti | bhaktiyogo'tra premā | paribhāvitatvaṃ yogyatām
āpāditatvam | śrutaṃ
bhagavatpratipādakavedavaidikaśāstravicāraśravaṇam | tarhi
madrūpaviśeṣāvirbhāve kiṃ kāraṇaṃ ? tatrāha—yad yad iti | dhiyā
śrutenaiva labdhena buddhiviśeṣeṇa | te pūrvoktāḥ śrutekṣitatatpathaḥ
pumāṃso yad yad vibhāvayanti, tat tad vapuḥ praṇayase prakarṣeṇa
tatsamīpe nayasi prakaṭayasīty arthaḥ |

nanu, īśvaro'haṃ katham evaṃ teṣāṃ vaśaḥ syāṃ ? tatrāha—sadanugrahāya |
satsu teṣv anugraha eva tava vaśatve kāraṇam, nānyad iti bhāvaḥ | nanu,
śrutamātreṇa mama kathaṃ bahūnāṃ rūpāṇāṃ jñānaṃ syāt ? tadabhāve ca
katham ekataratanniṣṭhā syāt ? tatrāha—he urugāyeti | vedena tvam
urudhaiva gīyasa iti svasvamatyanusāreṇa sā syād iti bhāvaḥ ||11||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhaktās tu jñānaṃ vināpi saṃsāraṃ nistarantīti kiṃ
vaktavyam, yato bhaktyā tvām apy adhīnīkurvantīty āha—bhaktiyogena pari
sarvatobhāvena bhāvite vāsite bhāvitaṃ vāsita triṣv ity amaraḥ | yad vā,
he bhaktiyogaparibhāvita ! bhaktiyogenaiva pari sarvatobhāvena
bhāvitaḥ prakaṭīkṛto bhavater nyastān niṣṭhayā bhaktiyoga eva
tvatprakaṭībhavanasya prayojakaḥ syād ity arthaḥ | ata eva teṣāṃ
hṛtsaroje āsse upaviśya tiṣṭhasi, na tato niḥsarasi nāpaiṣi nātha
[bhā.pu. 3.9.5] iti pūrvokteḥ | ādau gurumukhāt śrutaḥ, paścād īkṣitaḥ
sākṣātkṛtaś ca panthā yasya saḥ | yena pathā tvaṃ hṛtsarojam āyāto'si
taṃ panthānaṃ sādhanabhaktiprakāraṃ, ata eva suṣṭhu paricinvantīti
dhvaniḥ | ato yasya tvatprāptīcchā vartate, sa tata eva panthānaṃ
paricinotv ity anudhvaniḥ |

kiṃ ca, śravaṇaṃ vināpi tvadbhaktā manasā yad yad vapuḥ rūpaṃ svecchayā
dhyāyanti, tat tat praṇayase prakaṭayasi iti  svāmicaraṇāḥ | yad vā, te
sādhakabhaktāḥ svasvabhāvānurūpaṃ yadyaddhiyā bhāvayanti, tat tad eva
vapus teṣāṃ siddhadehaṃ praṇayase prakarṣeṇa tān prāpayasi | aho te
svabhaktapāravaśyam iti bhāvaḥ ||11||


 || 3.9.12 ||

  nātiprasīdati tathopacitopacārair

 ārādhitaḥ suragaṇair hṛdi baddhakāmaiḥ |

yat sarvabhūtadayayāsadalabhyayaiko

  nānājaneṣv avahitaḥ suhṛd antarātmā ||

madhvaḥ : sarvabhūtadayayāsuragaṇair hṛdy ārādhitas tvaṃ baddhakāmair
janair upacitopacārair nātiprasīdasi |

ārādhito yo brahmādyair bhaktijñānadayādibhiḥ |

kiṃ tasya kāmukajanakṛtayā paricaryayā || iti satyasaṃhitāyām ||12||

śrīdharaḥ : bhaktānāṃ ca niṣkāmānāṃ tvam atisulabho netareṣām ity āha,
neti | upacitair ūrjitair upacāraiḥ puṣpopahārādibhiḥ | yad yathā asatām
abhaktānām alabhyayā sarvabhūtadayayā | prasāde hetuḥ, eka ityādi
||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nātīti | bhavān iti śeṣaḥ | tataś ca yad yathā
sarvabhūtadayayā sādhāraṇair api janair ārādhito bhavān atiprasīdati |
kutaḥ ? tatrāha—eka eva bhavān nānājaneṣu suhṛc cāntarātmā ca sāvadhānaś
ceti | suragaṇaiḥ kathaṃbhūtaḥaḥ ? hṛdi baddhakāmatvāt tatra tatra
spardhāsūyāyuktair ity arthaḥ | tasmād bhavatprītyarthaṃ
sarvabhūtadayāmayy eva bhaktiḥ kartavyeti bhāvaḥ ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : teṣv api niṣkāmabhaktānām evātiśreṣṭhaṃ na tu sakāṃānām
ity āha nātiprasīdati bhavān iti śeṣaḥ | sakāmānāṃ svārthaparatvād eva
sarvabhūteṣu dayāyā abhāvam evātiprasādābhāve hetuṃ vyañjayan niṣkāmānāṃ
tu parārthaparatvāt sarvabhūtadayā sāhajikīty atiprasādo'pi sāhajika
ity āha yad yathā sarvabhūtadayayā atiprasīdati | asatām alabhyayā
dayayā atiprasāde hetuḥ eka eva bhavān nānājaneṣv avahitaḥ kṛtāvadhānaḥ |
yataḥ, suhṛt haitaiṣī |

nanv evaṃ ced aham eva svayaṃ kṛpayā tān kathaṃ noddharāmi ? tatrāha
antarātmā tvaṃ svabhakta evaitat yaśodānārthaṃ jagaduddhāriṇīṃ
svakṛpāśaktiṃ teṣu nidhāya sarvatrāntaryāmisvarūpeṇa svayam audāsyam
evāvalambase ity arthaḥ | evaṃ ca suhṛdantarātmeti padābhyāṃ krameṇa
nairghṛṇyavaiṣamyadoṣau parameśvarasya parāhatau bhaktavātsalyaṃ ca
dyotitam | na caivaṃ sarvamuktiprasaṅgaḥ iti vācyaṃ sarvabhūtadayayety
atra chatriṇo gacchantītivat sarvaśabdasya
prācuryamātrārthaparatvenābhidhānāt bhagavadbhaktakṛpāyā api prāyaḥ
khalv asārvatrikatvadarśanāt |

yad vā, bhaktena sarvabhūteṣv eva dayā kāryaiva tad api na sarvamuktir
draṣṭavyā | nahi sarvatraivoptāny api bījāny uṣarakṣārādibhūmiṣv api
prarohantīti nāradādīnām api dakṣādiṣu kṛpāyāḥ phalavattvādṛṣṭeḥ ||12||


 || 3.9.13 ||

 puṃsām ato vividhakarmabhir adhvarādyair

 dānena cogratapasā paricaryayā ca |

  ārādhanaṃ bhagavatas tava satkriyārtho

 dharmo'rpitaḥ karhicid mriyate na yatra ||

śrīdharaḥ : yataḥ sakāmānāṃ bhavān nātiprasīdaty ataḥ kāmaprāptiḥ
kriyāṇām uttamaṃ phalaṃ na bhavati, kintu tvatprīṇanam eva |
kāmasaṃyogas tv avāntaraphalena prarocanārtham ity āha, puṃsām iti |
bhagavatas tavārādhanam eva saṃś cāsau kriyārthaś ca śreṣṭhaṃ kriyāphalam
| śreṣṭhatve hetuḥ, yatra tvayy arpito dharmo na kadācid dhriyate na
naśyati, kāmārthas tu dharmaḥ kāmaṃ dattvā naśyatīty arthaḥ ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : āstāṃ tāvat pūjādau niṣkāmatvaṃ vividhakarmādāv api
tad evottamam ity āha—puṃsām iti | ārādhanaṃ prīṇanam | na mriyate sadā
tvatprītiṃ dadad eva tiṣṭhatīty arthaḥ ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhaktau yato niṣkāmāḥ śreṣṭhāḥ, ataḥ kevalabhaktyaśaktyāv
api pradhānībhūtā laukikavaidikakarmārpaṇarūpāpi bhaktir niṣkāmaiva
kāryety āha—puṃsām iti | vividhakarmabhir laukikaiḥ adhvarādyair
vaidikaiś ca tvadarpitair ārādhanaṃ yat karoṣi yad aśnāsi  [gītā 9.27]
bhagavatā śikṣitam ity arthaḥ | atra laukikavaidikanikhilakarmārpaṇaṃ
guṇībhūtāyāṃ vaidikasyaiva, na tu laukikasya kevalāyāṃ laukikasya tathā
śravaṇakīrtanādeś ca arpitasyaiva kāraṇam iti bhedo draṣṭavyaḥ |
satkriyārthas tad eva satkarmāṇāṃ phalaṃ kutaḥ ? yatra tvayy arpito
dharmaḥ karhicid api na mriyate, na naśyati, kintv ārādhanarūpeṇa
pariṇamati | kāmārthas tu dharmaḥ kāmaṃ dattvā naśyatīty arthaḥ ||13||


 || 3.9.14 ||

śaśvat svarūpamahasaiva nipītabheda

  mohāya bodhadhiṣaṇāya namaḥ parasmai |

  viśvodbhavasthitilayeṣu nimittalīlā

 rāsāya te nama idaṃ cakṛmeśvarāya ||

madhvaḥ : īśasyāpūrṇatājñānaṃ viṣṇor anyasya ceśatā bhedas tasyāvatāreṣu
jīvasyeśatvam eva ca |

tathā jīvatvam īśasya jaḍābhedas tayor api |

bhedamoha iti proktaḥ sa sadā na harau kvacit |

anyeṣāṃ tatprasādena śanair yāti satām api || iti skāndhe ||14||

śrīdharaḥ : atas tvām eva vayaṃ natā ity āha—śaśvat sarvadā
svarūpacaitanyenaiva nirastabhedabhramāya | punaś ca bodha eva dhiṣaṇā
vidyāśaktir yasya | yad vā, dhiṣaṇam āśrayaḥ | ata eva parasmai | atra
hetuḥ—viśvodbhavādinimittaṃ yā māyā tasyā līlā vilāsas tayā rāsaḥ krīḍā
yasya | te tubhyam idaṃ namo namanaṃ cakṛma kṛtavanto vayam ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : śaśvad iti | svarūpamahasā svarūpaśaktyā
tadvailakṣaṇyenaiva nipīto dūrīkṛto jīvādibhiḥ saha tava bhede mohas taiḥ
saha bhedo na sambhavatīti bhramo yena tvayā tasmai | tad vailakṣaṇyena
tebhyo bhinnatayā niścitāyety arthaḥ | ata eva bodhadhiṣaṇāya, na tu
jīvavat kadācid abodhenāpi yuktāyety arthaḥ ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : evam upāsanāṃ dvividhāṃ bhaktānāṃ nirūpya pūrvoktalakṣaṇaṃ
jñānibhaktayor upāsyaṃ svarūpadvayaṃ praṇamati sarvadā
svarūpacaitanyenaiva agastyenaiva nipīto bhedo mohasamudro yatas tasmai
bodhasya svarūpānubhavasya hetur dhiṣaṇā buddhir yatas tasmai
nirviśeṣasvarūpāya namaś cakṛma karavāma, tathā viśvodbhavādinimittaṃ yā
māyā tasminn api līlayā avalokanarūpayā rāsaḥ sambhogo yasya tasmai
saviśeṣasvarūpāya | yad vā, he nimittakāraṇarūpalīlayā rāso
gopījanasaṅgato lāsyaviśeṣo yasya tasmai | parārdhānte so'budhyata
gopaveśo me purastād āvirbabhūveti śruteḥ | kāmadughāṅghripadmaṃ
pradarśayantam iti pūrvokteś ca saviśeṣasvarūpeṣv api madhye
śrīkṛṣṇasvarūpasyaiva paramaparipūrṇatvāt paramāśrayatvaṃ jñāpitam
||14||


 || 3.9.15 ||

  yasyāvatāraguṇakarmaviḍambanāni

 nāmāni ye'suvigame vivaśā gṛṇanti |

te'naikajanmaśamalaṃ sahasaiva hitvā

 saṃyānty apāvṛtāmṛtaṃ tam ajaṃ prapadye ||

madhvaḥ : bhaktivivaśāḥ |

ye bhaktivivaśā viṣṇor nāmamātraikajalpakāḥ |

te'pi muktiṃ vrajanty āśu kim uta dhyāyinaḥ sadā || iti vyomasaṃhitāyām
||15||

śrīdharaḥ : nāmagrahaṇamātrataḥ kaivalyapradatvenaiśvaryaṃ vyañjayan
namaskaroti, yasyeti | avatārādīnāṃ viḍambanam anukaraṇam asti yeṣu |
tatrāvatāraviḍambanāni devakīnandana ityādīni | guṇaviḍambanāni
sarvajño bhaktavatsala ityādīni | karmaviḍambanāni govardhanoddharaṇaḥ
kaṃsārātir ityādīni | asuvigame'pi vivaśā api gṛṇanty uccārayanti
kevalam | śamalaṃ pāpam | apāvṛtaṃ nirastāvaraṇam | ṛtaṃ brahma
prāpnuvanti ||15||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 11.426) : avatārādīnāṃ viḍambanam anukaraṇam
avalambanaṃ vāsti yeṣu | tatrāvatāraviḍambanāni devakīnandana ityādīni
| guṇaviḍambanāni sarvajño bhaktavatsala ityādīni | karmaviḍambanāni
govardhanoddharaṇaḥ kaṃsaniṣūdana ityādīni | asuvigame'pi vivaśā api
gṛṇanty uccārayanti kevalam | śamalaṃ pāpam | apāvṛtaṃ nirastāvaraṇam |
ṛtaṃ brahma | sahasā sadya eva prāpnuvanti | jīvanmuktā bhavantīty arthaḥ
||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yasyāvatāreti | asuvigame'pīti |
tadānīntanatanmātratvam aśuddhavarṇatvaṃ ca vyañjitam | vivaśā iti |
tadicchāṃ vinā kenacit kārāṇāntareṇāpīty arthaḥ | vaśaḥ kāntāv ity amaraḥ
| tādṛśaśaktitve hetum āha—avatāreti | avatārādisadṛśāni
tattattulyaśaktīnīty arthaḥ | tatrāvatāraviḍambanāni nṛsiṃhety ādīni
guṇaviḍambanāni bhaktavatsalety ādīni | karmaviḍambanāni
govardhanadharetyādīni | ṛtaṃ saccidānandarūpaṃ śrībhagavantam eva |
ātmatāttvaviśuddhyarthaṃ yad āha bhagavān ṛtam | brahmaṇe darśayan
rūpam ity ukteḥ ||15||

viśvanāthaḥ : uktalakṣaṇopāsyopāsanājñānagandham api vinā
nāmābhāsamātrata eva paśutulyebhyo'pi janebhyaḥ svapadadāyitvena
paramakṛpaiśvaryam ācakṣāṇaḥ saviśeṣasvarūpa eva svaprapattiṃ
vijñāpayati yasyeti | avatārādisadṛśāni tattulya śaktīnīti sandarbhaḥ |
yad vā, avatārādīnāṃ viḍambanaṃ naṭādiṣv anukaraṇam api yais tāni | yad
vā, avatārādiviḍambanāni svabhrātṛputrādijīvaviśeṣavācakatvād
avatārādyananurūpāṇīty arthaḥ | tatra kṛṣṇo'yaṃ rāmo'yaṃ nārāyaṇo'yam ity
ādīny avatāraviḍambanāni dayālur dīnabandhur dāmodara ity ādīni
karmaviḍambanāni nāmāni ye janā ajāmilādaya iva prāṇavigame vivaśā api
gṛṇanti kevalam uccārayanti | śamalaṃ pāpam apāvṛtaṃ nirastāvaraṇam ṛtaṃ
saccidānandasvarūpaṃ bhagavantam ātmatāttvaviśuddhyarthaṃ yad āha
bhagavān ṛtam | brahmaṇe darśayan rūpam ity atra tathaiva vyākhyānāt
||15||


 || 3.9.16 ||

 yo vā ahaṃ ca giriśaś ca vibhuḥ svayaṃ ca

 sthityudbhavapralayahetava ātmamūlam |

  bhittvā tripād vavṛdha eka uruprarohas

  tasmai namo bhagavate bhuvanadrumāya ||

madhvaḥ : brahmādibhāvo viṣṇos tu tanniyāmakatā bhavet |

matsyāditāvatsvabhāvo nānyathā kvacid iṣyate || iti vāmane |

anantāsanavaikuṇṭhakṣīrābdhistho haris tripāt || iti ca ||16||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra guṇāvatārakarmāṇi darśayan praṇamati—yo vai ekas
tripāt trayo brahmādayaḥ pādāḥ skandhā yasya | pratyekaṃ ca uravaḥ
prarohāḥ śākhopaśākhā marīcyādimanvādirūpā yasya tathābhūtaḥ san
vavṛdhe, tasmai bhuvanākārāya drumāya namaḥ | kiṃ kṛtvā vavṛdhe ? ātmā
svayam eva mūlam adhiṣṭhānaṃ yasya, tatpradhānaṃ bhittvā
guṇatrayarūpeṇa vibhajya | tripāt tvam evāha | ahaṃ brahmā, giriśaś ca,
svayaṃ vibhur viṣṇuś ceti sthityudbhavapralayahetavo ye vayam | tripād
bhūtvā yo vavṛdhe ity arthaḥ ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ : na kevalam aham eka eva prapadye, api tu mahadādīnāṃ
sarveṣām eva tvatta udbhūtatvāt tvatprapattir ucitaivety abhivyañjayan
namasyati | yo vai ekaḥ tripāt trayo brahmādayaḥ pādāḥ skandhā yasya ūravo
marīcyādimanvādayaḥ prarohāh śākhopaśākhā yasya tathābhūtaḥ san
vavṛdhe | kiṃ kṛtvā ? ātmamūlam ātmakāraṇakaṃ pradhānaṃ bhittvā
guṇatrayarūpeṇa vibhajya tripāttvam evāhaham ity ādayaḥ
sthityādihetava iti yathāsambhavanirdeśaḥ | atra vibhur viṣṇuḥ svayaṃ
ceti viṣṇau svayaṃpadaprayogāt brahmagiriśayor iva viṣṇor nāsti
guṇanibandhanaḥ svato bheda iti jñāpitam | yad vā, ya eva ahamādayaḥ ya
eva ātmanaḥ svasyāpi mūlaṃ kāraṇam | tathā ya eva bhittvā svaśaktikṛtaṃ
bhedaṃ prāpya tripāt prathamaṃ trilokarūpaḥ, tata ūruprarohaḥ
caturdaśalokarūpaḥ, tasmai bhuvanākārāya drumāya nama iti viśvarūpatvam
uktam ||16||


 || 3.9.17 ||

loko vikarmanirataḥ kuśale pramattaḥ

karmaṇy ayaṃ tvadudite bhavadarcane sve |

 yas tāvad asya balavān iha jīvitāśāṃ

sadyaś chinatty animiṣāya namo'stu tasmai ||

madhvaḥ : nityajñānadṛśā nityaṃ lavakālam apīśvaraḥ |

paśyet tātkālikaṃ caiva tasmād animiṣo hariḥ |

kālasyānimiṣatvaṃ ca lavāder nityavīkṣaṇāt || iti tantrasāre ||17||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃ guṇāvatārakarmaviḍambanam uktvā tasyaiva tat kālākhyaṃ
rūpaṃ tat karma ca darśayan praṇamati—loka iti dvābhyām | vikarmanirato
viruddhakarmaniṣṭhaḥ kuśale hite sve ātmīye tvadudite tvayaiva
sākṣādukte bhavadarcanarūpe karmaṇi | uktaṃ hi gītāsu,

yat karoṣi yad aśnāsi yaj juhoṣi dadāsi yat |

yat tapasyasi kaunteya tat kuruṣva madarpaṇam || [gītā 9.27]  iti |

tasmin pramatto'dattacitto yāvad vartate tāvad asya lokasya | animiṣāya
kālāya ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : vikarma bhagavadbahirmukhaṃ karma | arcanaṃ
pañcarātrādyuktaṃ pañcarātrasya kṛtsnasya vaktā tu bhagavān svayaṃ
[ma.bhā. 12.337.62] iti mokṣadharmāt ||17||

viśvanāthaḥ : viśvarūpatvam uktam atha viśvanimiṣaṃ tu kālarūpatvena
praṇamati loko manuṣyādiḥ kuśale karmaṇi pramattaḥ akṛtāvadhānaḥ | kuśalaṃ
karmaiva kiṃ ? tatrāha—bhavadarcane |

nanu svadharmeṇa tam abhyarcyety ukteḥ jñānino jñānayajñena yajanti
jñānavigraham ity ukteś ca karmajñānayogābhyām api bhagavadarcanam eva
syād iti kecid vyācakṣate, tatrāha—tvadudite tvayaiva madarcanam idam
eveti sākṣādukteḥ | ye vai bhagavatā proktā upāyā ātmalabdhaye  [bhā.pu.
11.2.34]  ity ekādaśāt | pañcarātrasya kṛtsnasya vaktā tu bhagavān svayaṃ
[ma.bhā. 12.337.62] iti mokṣadharmāc ca sve svīye svakartavya ity arthaḥ
| tad evaṃ tvadbhaktalokebhyo'nyeṣv eva kālasyādhikāra iti dyotitam |
asya abhaktlokasya jīvitasyāpy āśāṃ kim uta bhogādivāñchām ity arthaḥ |
animiṣāya kālāya ||17||


 || 3.9.18 ||

yasmād bibhemy aham api dviparārdhadhiṣṇyam

  adhyāsitaḥ sakalalokanamaskṛtaṃ yat |

  tepe tapo bahusavo'varurutsamānas

tasmai namo bhagavate'dhimakhāya tubhyam ||

śrīdharaḥ : āstāṃ tāval lokasya kathā, yasmāt kālākhyāt tvatto yad
dviparārdhāvasthāyi dhiṣṇyaṃ sthānaṃ, tadārūḍho'pi bibhemi, bhītaś ca
saṃs tvām evāvarurutsamānaḥ prāptum icchaṃs tapas taptavān | kathaṃbhūtaḥ
? bahusavo bahavaḥ savā yāgāḥ saṃvatsarā vā yasya | bahūn yāgān kṛtvāpi
bahūn saṃvatsarān vā tapas taptavān ity arthaḥ | adhimakhāya
makhādhiṣṭhātre ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : uktasya kālabalavattvasya sīmām āha—yasmāt kālāt ahaṃ
brahmā dviparārdhāvasthāyi dhiṣṇyaṃ sthānaṃ satyalokam adhyāsito'pi
bibhemi tathā avarurutsamānaḥ avaroddhuṃ kālaṃ vaśīkartum icchan
bahusavaḥ bahavaḥ savā yajñā yasya tathābhūtaḥ san tapaś cāhaṃ tepe |
tad api bibhemīty arthaḥ |

nanu kālavaśīkārārthaṃ bahuyajñapravṛttau tava kadā kā  yuktir āsīt ?
tatrāha—adhimakhāya makhānām adhiṣṭhātre tubhyaṃ namaḥ | makhānām
adhiṣṭhātus tava makhair eva yajanena kālo me vaśībhavatv iti buddhyety
arthaḥ | pratyuta kālenaivāhaṃ vaśīkṛtaḥ sampraty api bibhemi, atas tava
śuddhabhaktiṃ vinā  kālo na jeyo bhavatīty adya jñātatattvo'taḥ paraṃ
śuddhām eva bhaktiṃ karavāṇīti dhvaniḥ ||18||


 || 3.9.19 ||

tiryaṅmanuṣyavibudhādiṣu jīvayoniṣv

  ātmecchayātmakṛtasetuparīpsayā yaḥ |

reme nirastaviṣayo'py avaruddhadehas

tasmai namo bhagavate puruṣottamāya ||

madhvaḥ : anirastaratir nityaratiḥ ||19||

śrīdharaḥ : idānīṃ tattatkālabhāvilīlāvatārakarmāṇi darśayann
āha—tiryagādiṣu jīvayoniṣu svecchayā svīkṛtamūrtiḥ san,
svakṛtadharmamaryādāpālanecchayā reme | vastutaḥ svānandānubhavenaiva
nirastaviṣayasukho'pi yo'pi eva puruṣottamaḥ
tattadupādhidharmāsaṃsparśāt | tad uktaṃ gītāsu—

yasmāt kṣaram atīto'ham akṣarād api cottamāh |

ato'smi loke vede ca prathitaḥ puruṣottamaḥ || [gītā 15.18] iti ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : nirastā viṣayā jīvagocarā arthāḥ prākṛtā yasmāt |
ātmecchayā bhaktapipālayiṣayā avaruddhadehaḥ prakaṭitamūrtiḥ ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ jagadrūpatvena tanniyantṛkālarūpatvena ca
praṇamyedānīṃ paramopāsyasaccidānandasvarūpatvena praṇamati |
tiryagādiṣu svecchayaiva avatīrṇa iti śeṣaḥ | svakṛtasetuparīpsayā
reme ātmārāmatvāt tyaktaviṣayasukho'pi—

patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ yo me bhaktyā prayacchati |

tad ahaṃ bhaktyupahṛtam aśnāmi prayatātmanaḥ || [gītā 9.26] iti |

svakṛtamaryādāpālanāya
svabhaktopanītasrakcandanagandhapuṣpaśayyādyupabhogyeṣv eva reme,
nāham ātmānam āśāse madbhaktaiḥ sādhubhir vinā  [bhā.pu. 9.4.64] ity
ātmārāmatve'py apūrṇakāma iveti bhāvaḥ | sragādīnāṃ prākṛtaviṣayatve'pi
bhagavadarthaviniyuktatve sati tatkṣaṇa evāprākṛtatvaṃ syād ity ekādaśe
vyaktībhaviṣyati [bhā.pu. 11.25.2729] | avaruddhadehaḥ bhāgurimate
avety akāralope vibhutvād anāvṛtadehaḥ saccidānandaśarīra evety
arthaḥ |

yad vā, ātmakṛtasetoḥ svabhaktavaśyatvarūpamaryādāyāḥ pari
sarvatobhāvenepsayā prāptīcchayā śrīyaśodayā dāmnevānyair api bhaktaiḥ
praṇayarasanayā avaruddhadehaḥ | ataḥ sarvotkarṣāt
mahatsraṣṭādyaryāmipuruṣebhyo'py uttamāyeti kṛṣṇāvatāra eva tātparyam |
yad uktaṃ—

yasmāt kṣaram atīto'ham akṣarād api cottamāh |

ato'smi loke vede ca prathitaḥ puruṣottamaḥ || [gītā 15.18] iti ||19||


 || 3.9.20 ||

yo'vidyayānupahato'pi daśārdhavṛttyā

  nidrām uvāha jaṭharīkṛtalokayātraḥ |

  antarjale'hikaśipusparśānukūlāṃ

 bhīmormimālini janasya sukhaṃ vivṛṇvan ||

śrīdharaḥ : idānīṃ dṛśyamānām eka mūrtiṃ praṇamati—yo'vidyayeti dvābhyām |
daśārdhāḥ pañca vṛttayo yasyās tayāvidyayā nidrāhetubhūtayānabhibhūto'pi
yoganidrām uvāha | tasmai te nama ity uttareṇānvayaḥ | jaṭharīkṛtā udare
pravilāpitā lokayātrā lokasthitir yena | ahir eva kaśipuḥ śayyā | tasyāḥ
sparśo'nukūlo yasyās tāṃ nidrām | bhīmānāṃ ūrmīṇāṃ mālā vidyante yasminn
antarjale nidrāṇasyāvivekino janasya nidrāsukham īdṛg iti vivṛṇvan
pradarśayan, upahasann ity arthaḥ | ata evāntarjalādiviśeṣaṇāni | yad
vā, pūrvakalpe śrāntasya janasya viśrāmasukhaṃ vivṛṇvan sphārayan | tadā
tu paropakārāya svayaṃ duḥsaham api duḥkhaṃ soḍhavyam iti dyotanārthaṃ
viśeṣaṇāni ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tasyāvatāriṇaḥ puruṣottamasyaiva dṛṣṭāṃ līlām
anumodate—ya iti | janasya yan nidrāsukhaṃ, tad eva līlayā svasmin
prakaṭayan tatrānyadurgamāspadatvaṃ sukhasparśaśayyatvaṃ ca
tatsaukaryahetum āha—antarjala ity ādinā ||20||

viśvanāthaḥ : idānīṃ dṛśyamānaṃ nijopāsyāṃ mūrtiṃ praṇamati dvābhyām |
daśārdhāḥ pañcavṛttayo yasyās tayā avidyayā nidrāhetubhūtayā
anabhibhūto'pi nidrām uvāha tasmād iyaṃ te svarūpaśaktimayy eva nidreti
bhāvaḥ | jaṭharīkṛtā udare pravilāpitā lokayātrā lokaparamparā yasya saḥ
| ahir eva kaśipuḥ śayyā tasya sparśo'nukūlo yasyās tām | bhīmormimālini
pralayasamudre janasya prākṛtalokasyāpi |
jalamadhyasthakomalaśayyāśāyinaḥ sukhaṃ bhavatīti vivṛṇvan lokaval
līla eva tvaṃ bhavasīti bhāvaḥ | yad vā, pralayakāle'pi
janamātrabhayade samudre'pi sarpaśayyāyām api sukhena tvg nidrāsīti
sarvakālasarvadeśasarvasaṅganirbhayas tvam eva nānya iti bhāvaḥ |
sukhaṃ vivṛṇvann iti kāladeśasaṅgato bhayayukto'pi nidrālur hi janaḥ
sukham eva nidrātīti ||20||


 || 3.9.21 ||

  yannābhipadmabhavanād aham āsam īḍya

 lokatrayopakaraṇo yadanugraheṇa |

  tasmai namas ta udarasthabhavāya yoga

 nidrāvasānavikasannalinekṣaṇāya ||

śrīdharaḥ : kiṃ ca, yasya nābhipadmam eva bhavanaṃ tasmāt | lokatrayam
upakaraṇaṃ yasya | yad vā, lokatrayasya sṛṣṭyādidvāreṇopakarotīti tathā
tādṛśo'haṃ yadanugraheṇāsam, udare sthito bhavaḥ saṃsāraprapañco yasya |
yoganidrāvasāne kiñcid vikasannalinavad īkṣaṇaṃ yasya ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : āsam abhūvaṃ lokatrayam eva upakaraṇam ājñākāri yasya saḥ
| yad vā, sṛṣṭyādidvārā lokatrayasyopakārī | udare sthito bhavaḥ
saṃsāra.prapañco yasya tasmai | yoganidrāvasāne samprati rātryanta iva
vikasannalinam iva īkṣaṇaṃ yasya tasmai | tena he matprabho
kṛpāpārāvāra jāgṛhi jāgṛhi kiṃkaro'haṃ maṅgalārātrikaṃ karavāṇīti bhāvaḥ
||21||


 || 3.9.22 ||

so'yaṃ samastajagatāṃ suhṛd eka ātmā

  sattvena yan mṛḍayate bhagavān bhagena |

tenaiva me dṛśam anuspṛśatād yathāhaṃ

srakṣyāmi pūrvavad idaṃ praṇatapriyo'sau ||

madhvaḥ : svasāmarthyāṃ svakarmāṇi ramayā saha keśavaḥ |

kurute svayam evaiṣā kānicit puruṣottamaḥ || iti nāradīye |

ātmaśabdasya mukhārtho viṣṇur ekaḥ sanātanaḥ |

sandehadehamanaso buddhijīvāḥ svayaṃ tathā ||

brahmāpy amukhyāḥ kramaśa utkarṣo hy ātmatā bhavet || iti
prakāśasaṃhitāyām ||22||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃ stutvā prārthayate—so'yam iti caturbhiḥ | yady ena
sattvena jñānena bhagenaiśvaryeṇa ca mṛḍayate sukhayati viśvam | dṛśaṃ
prajñām anuspṛśatād yojayatu, yathāhaṃ sraṣṭuṃ kṣamo bhaviṣyāmi | yataḥ
praṇatapriyo'sāv ahaṃ ca praṇato na cānyaḥ prārthanīyo'sti | yato
bhagavān | sa eva samastajagatāṃ suhṛd yato'sāv eko'nusyūta ātmāntaryāmī
||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ stutvā prārthayate so'yam iti caturbhiḥ |
samastajagatāṃ prākṛtāprākṛtānāṃ suhṛt pālakaḥ ātmā nirupādhipremāspadam
| evaṃbhūtasyānyasyābhāvād ekaḥ | yad yasmāt sattvena guṇena
pālanalakṣaṇena samastajagaty eva prākṛtāni mṛḍayate sukhayati | bhagena
svīyaṣaḍaiśvaryeṇa aprākṛtān bhaktajanān api mṛḍayate | tasmāt tenaiva
sattvena kiñcinmātreṇa bhagena ca me mama dṛśaṃ prajñāṃ prākṛtīṃ
bhaktimattvād aṃśenāprākṛtīṃ ca anuspṛśatu pālayatu, yathāhaṃ srakṣyāmi
prākṛtān marīcyādīn sraṣṭum aprākṛtān nāradādīṃś cāvirbhāvayituṃ jñāsyāmi
yato'sau prabhuḥ praṇatimātre kṛte'pi priyaḥ ||22||


 || 3.9.23 ||

 eṣa prapannavarado ramayātmaśaktyā

yad yat kariṣyati gṛhītaguṇāvatāraḥ |

  tasmin svavikramam idaṃ sṛjato'pi ceto

 yuñjīta karmaśamalaṃ ca yathā vijahyām ||

śrīdharaḥ : ātmaśaktyā ramayā saha yad yat karma kariṣyati | svavikramaṃ
svasya viṣṇor eva vikramaḥ prabhāvo yasmin, tad idaṃ viśvaṃ tadājñayā
sṛjato'pi me cetaḥ sa eva yuñjīta pravartayatu | karmāsaktiṃ tatkṛtaṃ
śamalaṃ ca vaiṣamyādipāpaṃ yathā vijahyāṃ tyakṣyāmi ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : eṣa iti | ramayeti ramākhyayā svarūpaśaktyā, na tu
māyāśaktyā hetunā gṛhītaguṇāvatāraḥ, gṛhītā guṇā bhaktavātsalyādayo
yeṣu, tādṛśā avatārā yasya saḥ | svavikramam iti | tvadvikramamayatvam
eva viśvaṃ syāt tatas tvacchaktyaiva mayā tat kartuṃ śakyam | tatas tathā
tatprārthanaṃ ca mama yuktam eveti bhāvaḥ ||23||

viśvanāthaḥ :  punaś ca rajoguṇamayyā sṛṣṭer bibhyat svīyabhakter
abhyudayaṃ prārthayate | eṣa bhavān prapannāya mahyam etadvarado'stv
ity arthaḥ | ramayā svarūpabhūtayā, na tu māyayety arthaḥ | ato ity
amaraḥaguṇā avatārā yasya saḥ | tasmin dharoddharaṇādau karmaṇi mama ceto
yuñjīta pravartayatu | mama kathaṃbhūtasya svavikramaṃ svasya
svaprabhor vikramaḥ prabhāvo yasmin tad idaṃ viśvaṃ sṛjato'pi tena sṛṣṭau
mama ceto nāsajjatu, kintu tallīlākathāyām evety arthaḥ | karmaśamalaṃ
sṛṣṭyutthaṃ vaiṣamyādipāpaṃ tyakṣyāmi ||23||


 || 3.9.24 ||

  nābhihradād iha sato'mbhasi yasya puṃso

  vijñānaśaktir aham āsam anantaśakteḥ |

rūpaṃ vicitram idam asya vivṛṇvato me

  mā rīriṣīṣṭa nigamasya girāṃ visargaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : ambhasi sato yasya nābhihradād ihāsam | vijñāne śaktir yasya
mahattattvātmakasya cittasya tadabhimānī, asya rūpam idaṃ vistārayato me
nigamasyāvayavabhūtānāṃ girāṃ visarga uccāraṇaṃ mā rīriṣīṣṭa | halāntaṃ
brahmavarcasam iti nyāyena mā lupyatām ity arthaḥ ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : idaṃ mahāpātakātmakaparyantaṃ sṛjato mama
vedoccāraṇarūpaṃ brahmatejo mā lupyatām | yathā sādhāraṇabrāhmaṇānāṃ
helayā brahmateja ity arthaḥ | mā rīriṣīṣṭeti riṣ hiṃsāyām ity asya
yaḍlugantaliḍi karmakartari rūpaṃ chaṇdasam ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ :  kiṃ ca, bhagavaṃs tavaiśvaryasindhoḥ kaṇamātre'py asmin
mama yat praveśas taṃ khalui vedābhyāsaprasādād eva | yad uktaṃ vedaś
cakṣus taveśvareti samprati tu
sṛṣṭyarthakavividhavyāpāravattenānadhyavasāyāt tasya vedasya vismṛtir
me sambhaviṣyati sā mā bhūd iti prārthayate nābhīti yasyāmbhasi sataḥ
puṃsas tava nābhihradād aham āsaṃ vijñānaśaktiḥ vijñānamayapuruṣaḥ
samaṣṭijīvarūpaḥ buddhitattvādhiṣṭhātā vā asya parameśvarasya rūpam
idaṃ viśvaṃ vistārayato mama nigamasya avayavabhūtānāṃ girāṃ visargaḥ
ṛgādibhedaprapañcaḥ mā rīriṣīṣṭa mātiśayena lupyatāṃ māyayā vismṛto
bhavatv ity arthaḥ | kiṣ hiṃsāyām ity asya yaṅlugantaliṅi karmakartari
rūpaṃ chāndasam ||24||


 || 3.9.25 ||

  so'sāv adabhrakaruṇo bhagavān vivṛddha

  premasmitena nayanāmburuhaṃ vijṛmbhan |

 utthāya viśvavijayāya ca no viṣādaṃ

  mādhvyā girāpanayatāt puruṣaḥ purāṇaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : vivṛddhapremṇā smitena vijṛmbhayan | viśvasya
vijayāyodbhavāya | cakārād asmad anugrahāya cotthāya ||25||

sanātanaḥ : adabhrakaruṇaḥ mahādayāluḥ | ataḥ vivṛddhapremṇā yat smitaṃ
tena, vijṛmbhan vijṛmbhayan unmīlayan, viśvasya vijayāya udbhavāya | yad
vā, nijabhaktipracāraṇena viśvavaśīkaraṇāya | yad vā, jaganmahotsavāya
| caśabdād viśeṣato'nugrahāya ceti | no'smākaṃ bhaktānāṃ viṣādaṃ pralayāt
ciravāgamṛtapānābhāvato vā śokaduḥkhaṃ mādhvyā madhurayā girā
apanayatāt | ślokaś cāyaṃ śiṣṭācārānusāreṇātra likhitaḥ | kintv anye'pi
yatheṣṭaṃ paṭhanīyāḥ || [haribhaktivilāsa 16.328]

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam |

viśvanāthaḥ :  kiṃ ca, prabhoḥ kṛpākaṭākṣakṛpānideśābhyām eva dāsasya
niḥsaṃśaya ānando bhaved iti tāv eva prārthayate so'sāv iti | vijṛmbhan
vijṛmbhayan no'smākaṃ viśvasmin sarvatraiva vijayāya sṛṣṭyādiṣu
parābhavābhāvāya cakārāt pūrvoktavāñchitasiddhaye ca | mādvhyā
mādhuryamayyā viśvaṃ sṛjeti nideśamayyā girā ||25||


 || 3.9.26 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

svasambhavaṃ niśāmyaivaṃ tapovidyāsamādhibhiḥ |

 yāvan manovacaḥ stutvā virarāma sa khinnavat ||

śrīdharaḥ : svasya saṃbhavo yasmāt tam | tapaḥ śārīram, vidyā upāsanā,
samādhir aikāgryam, tair niśāmya dṛṣṭvā yathāśakti stutvā śrāntavad
virarāma ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  svasya sambhavo yasmāt taṃ tapaḥ śārīraṃ vidyā,
ācāryacaittyavapuṣā svagatiṃ vyanakti  [bhā.pu. 11.29.6] iti rītyā
ākasmikasphūrtiprāptatanmantropāsanā | samādhiś cittaikāgryeṇa dhyānaṃ
tair niśāmya dṛṣṭvā yathāśakti stutvā kṛpākaṭākṣasyānupalambhāt khinna
iva virarāma ||26||


  || 3.9.2728 ||

  athābhipretam anvīkṣya brahmaṇo madhusūdanaḥ |

  viṣaṇṇacetasaṃ tena kalpavyatikarāmbhasā ||

  lokasaṃsthānavijñāna ātmanaḥ parikhidyataḥ |

tam āhāgādhayā vācā kaśmalaṃ śamayann iva ||

śrīdharaḥ : ātmano lokasaṃsthānavijñāne parikhidyato brahmaṇo'bhipretam
ālakṣya tam āheti dvayor anvayaḥ | tena pralayodakena viṣaṇṇacetasam
||27|| kaśmalaṃ moham | iveti samastamohāśamanaṃ darśayati ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kalpavyatikarāmbhasā pralayakālamilitāgantukajalena
hetunā viṣaṇṇacetasaḥ, tathā ātmanaḥ svasya lokānāṃ devatiryagādīnāṃ
saṃsthānaṃ samucitasvabhāvatayā nirmāṇasthāpanādiparipāṭī tadvijñāne
khidyato brahmaṇo'bhipretam anvīkṣya jñātvā tam āhety anvayaḥ | kaśmalaṃ
mohaṃ śamayann iveti ||28||


 || 3.9.29 ||

śrībhagavān uvāca—

 mā vedagarbha gās tandrīṃ sarga udyamam āvaha |

 tan mayāpāditaṃ hy agre yan māṃ prārthayate bhavān ||

madhvaḥ : prārthanam api matpreraṇam eva ||29||

śrīdharaḥ : he vedagarbha ! tandrīṃ viṣādakṛtam ālasyaṃ mā gāḥ | tenaiva
me dṛśam anuspṛśatād ity ādi yat prārthayate, tadagre pūrvam eva
saṃpāditam ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : samastamohopaśamanaṃ darśayati | tandrīm ajñānaṃ mā gāḥ |
vedagarbheti na hi sarvavedavijñasyājñānam ucitam iti bhāvaḥ | nanu
svasya sṛṣṭisāmarthye saṃśayāno'smi | tatrāha—sarga iti | udyamo niṣphalo
bhāvīty api mā śaṅkiṣṭhā ity āha—tanmayeti tenaiva me dṛśam anuspṛśatād
iti yan māṃ prārthayate ||29||


 || 3.9.30 ||

  bhūyas tvaṃ tapa ātiṣṭha vidyāṃ caiva madāśrayām |

 tābhyām antarhṛdi brahman lokān drakṣyasy apāvṛtān ||

madhvaḥ :  tapa ālocanaṃ proktaṃ vidyā niṣṭhā prakīrtitā  iti ca ||30||

śrīdharaḥ : tarhi katham ahaṃ na jānāmīty ata āha, bhūya iti ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhūya iti | tapaḥ prāṇāyāmādi ||30||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv idānīm udyamena kiṃ bhaviṣyati me mayā sṛjyās te
bhūrādayo lokā eva na dṛśyante ity ata āha—bhūya iti tapaś cittaikāgryaṃ
vidyāṃ mantropāsanām antarhṛdi hṛdaya eva bahiḥsthitām api lokān
bhūrādīn tatrasthān manuṣyādīṃś ca apāvṛtān jalāvaraṇaśūnyān drakṣyasi |
tataś ca mayaiva yathāsthitatayā darśayiṣyamāṇāṃs tān svahṛdaya eva
dṛṣṭvā ādarśadarśī lekhaka iva sukhenaiva bahiḥ srakṣyasīti ||30||


 || 3.9.31 ||

  tata ātmani loke ca bhaktiyuktaḥ samāhitaḥ |

 draṣṭāsi māṃ tataṃ brahman mayi lokāṃs tvam ātmanaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  dehe dehe haris tasmin lokāḥ sarve pratiṣṭhitāḥ |

aṅguṣṭhamātre'pi pare paraśaktir yato vibhuḥ || iti ca |

ātmani sthite mayi ||31||

śrīdharaḥ : bhaktiyuktaḥ samāhitaś ca sann ātmani svasmin loke ca māṃ
tataṃ vyāpya sthitaṃ draṣṭāsi drakṣyasi | ātmano jīvāṃś ca ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : sṛṣṭyāveśavaśatve'pi tvām ahaṃ na vismareyam iti yat
prārthitaṃ, tatrāha—tataḥ sṛṣṭisamaye'pi bhaktiyuktaḥ samāhitaś ca san
ātmani svamanasi bahir loke ca māṃ draṣṭāsi | tathā mayi lokān bhūrādīn
ātmano jīvāṃś ca mṛdbhakṣaṇalīlāyāṃ yaśodeva draṣṭāsi | yad vā, tataḥ
kṛṣṇāvatāre vatsavatsapālādyārair vyāpakaṃ māṃ mayi lokān brahmāṇḍāni
ātmanaś caturbhujamūrtīḥ | yad vā, ātmanaḥ svāni bahūn parameṣṭhinaḥ
drakṣyasi ||31||


 || 3.9.32 ||

 yadā tu sarvabhūteṣu dāruṣv agnim iva sthitam |

praticakṣīta māṃ loko jahyāt tarhy eva kaśmalam ||

śrīdharaḥ : sarvatra maddarśane moho nivartata ity āha, yadā tv iti |
praticakṣīta paśyet ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : karmaśamalaṃ ca yathā vijayām iti yat prārthitaṃ tat khalv
etādṛśyāṃ daśāyāṃ sambhaved ity āha—yadā tv iti praticakṣīti paśyet |
kaśmalaṃ moham ||32||


 || 3.9.33 ||

  yadā rahitam ātmānaṃ bhūtendriyaguṇāśayaiḥ |

 svarūpeṇa mayopetaṃ paśyan svārājyam ṛcchati ||

madhvaḥ : svarūpeṇa mayopetaṃ hṛdisthaṃ jīvarūpaṃ hi parameśvarasahitaṃ
bhavati |

tyaktvā dehādyātmabhāvaṃ jīvarūpe hṛdi sthite |

dṛṣṭvātmabhāvaṃ taṃ cāpi haripādābjasaṃsthitam ||

yad āpaśyaty āparokṣyāt tadā muktiṃ vrajaty asau || iti dattātreyayoge
||33||

śrīdharaḥ : tadā ca mithyājñānanivṛttau mucyata ity āha, yadeti |
bhūtādibhir virahitam ātmānaṃ jīvaṃ śuddhatvaṃ padārthaṃ svarūpeṇa
svasyātmabhūtena mayā tat padārthenopetam ekībhūtaṃ paśyan bhavati tadā
svārājyaṃ mokṣaṃ prāpnoti ||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yadeti | bhūtādibhir virahitam ātmānaṃ jīvaṃ svarūpeṇa
tasya jīvaśakter āśrayabhūtena śaktimatā mayā upetaṃ yuktaṃ svarājyaṃ
sārṣṭyādikam ||33||

viśvanāthaḥ : kasyāṃ daśāyāṃ tvāṃ prāpnuyād ity apekṣāyām āha—yadā ātmānaṃ
svaṃ bhūtādibhī rahitaṃ svarūpeṇaiva, na tu svīyajīvātmatvaṃ parityajyety
arthaḥ | mayā sevyena parameśvareṇa saha upa samīpa eva itaṃ sevārthaṃ
prāptaṃ paśyan bhavati, tadā svena svīyena prabhunā saha rājata iti svarāṭ
dāsas tasya bhāvaḥ karma vā dāsyam ṛcchati prāpnoti | kecit punar
nirviśeṣasaviśeṣasvarūpayor dvayor eva stutau prakrāntatvāt
tadupāsakānāṃ jñānināṃ bhaktānāṃ ca tantreṇaiva caramadaśāvyañjakatayā
padyam idaṃ vyācakṣate | tathā hi, jñānī ātmānaṃ śuddhatvaṃ
padārthasvarūpeṇa mayā tatpadārthena upetam ekībhūtaṃ paśyan yadā
bhavati, tadā svārājyaṃ mokṣaṃ prāpnoti | tathā bhaktaḥ
śāntādipañcavidho'pi svarūpeṇa śāntaś cidrūpatvena dāso dāsyarūpatvena
sakhā sakhyenaiva pitrādir vātsalyena priyā premṇaiva upetaṃ yuktam
ātmānaṃ svaṃ tathā mayāpi pañcavidhabhāvaviṣayeṇa saha
sākṣātparabrahmaṇā prabhunā sakhyā putrādinā kāntena ca upetam iti
yathāyatham evārthaḥ | svārājyaṃ svena citghanākāreṇa svīyena prabhunā
sakhyā putrādinā kāntena ca saha rājata iti tasya bhāvas tattvam ṛcchati
prāpnoti ||33||


 || 3.9.34 ||

  nānākarmavitānena prajā bahvīḥ sisṛkṣataḥ |

nātmāvasīdaty asmiṃs te varṣīyān madanugrahaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : yato varṣīyān vṛddhataraḥ | atyadhiko'stīty arthaḥ ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ jñānabhaktirasatattvam upadiśya tvayi
mamānugraho na kevalam adyatana eva, api tu sārvakālika evety āha—nāneti,
varṣīyān jyāyān ||34||


 || 3.9.35 ||

ṛṣim ādyaṃ na badhnāti pāpīyāṃs tvāṃ rajoguṇaḥ |

yan mano mayi nirbaddhaṃ prajāḥ saṃsṛjato'pi te ||

śrīdharaḥ : anugraham evāha, ṛṣim iti caturbhiḥ | yat yatas te mano mayi
nirbaddham ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ṛṣim iti | dvitīyaskandhe pūrvam evam uktam—

etan mataṃ samātiṣṭha parameṇa samādhinā |

bhavān kalpavikalpeṣu na vimuhyati karhicit || [bhā.pu. 2.9.36] iti |

ato na bhāratī me'ṅga mṛṣopalakṣyate [bhā.pu. 2.6.34] ityādikam api
svayam uktam | yas tu tasyānyāveśaḥ kvacit śrūyate, sa khalu na sthiraḥ
syād iti tadābhāsa eva jñeyaḥ | astu daśamaskandhe'sya mohaḥ śrūyate, sa
tu na rajasā, kintu bhagavadaiśvaryaviśeṣadarśanena
tadviśeṣadarśanecchayā ca | ambhojanmajanir [bhā.pu. 10.13.15] ityādes
tatraiva śravaṇāt | evam ekādaśe ca haṃsarūpeṇa sanakādiṣu jñānakathanāt
svamahimaprakāśanāya brahmajñānavaraṇaṃ jñeyam ||35||

viśvanāthaḥ : tvaṃ rajoguṇān mā bhaiṣīr ity āha—ṛṣim iti |
daśamaskandhe'sya vikṣepo na rajasā, kintu
mañjumahimadarśanasaubhāgyādṛṣṭavaśād eveti tatraiva vyākhyāste ||35||


 || 3.9.36 ||

jñāto'haṃ bhavatā tv adya durvijñeyo'pi dehinām |

 yan māṃ tvaṃ manyase'yuktaṃ bhūtendriyaguṇātmabhiḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  bhūtendriyamanobuddhitriguṇādiṣu sarvaśaḥ |

yuktaṃ niyāmakatayā paśyan jānāti keśavam || iti ca ||36||

śrīdharaḥ : yad yasmād bhūtair indriyair guṇaiḥ sattvādibhir
ātmanā'haṅkāreṇa cāyuktaṃ manyase ||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  jñāto'ham iti yad uktaṃ, tat tu jñāto'si [bhā.pu.
3.9.1] ityādibrahmoktapadyapañcakānusāreṇa jñeyam ||37||

viśvanāthaḥ : yad yasmāt māṃ sākāram api bhūtādibhir ayuktaṃ rūpaṃ yad
etad avabodharasodayenety ādi bruvāṇas tvaṃ manyase tasmān mayāyam ākāro
na bhūtāni pṛthivyādīni nāpīndriyāṇi taijasāni nāpi guṇamāyā nāpy ātmā
jīvaḥ, kintu sākṣād brahmaiva tvaṃ jānāsīty arthaḥ | tena madrūpasya
saccidānandatvamāyātvayor mananam eva majjñānājñānayor liṅgam iti
bhagavadabhiprāyo'vagrāhyaḥ ||36||


 || 3.9.37 ||

 tubhyaṃ madvicikitsāyām ātmā me darśito'bahiḥ |

nālena salile mūlaṃ puṣkarasya vicinvataḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tubhyaṃ tava nālena mārgeṇa puṣkarasya mūlam adhiṣṭhānaṃ
salile vicinvato mayi vicikitsāyāṃ bhavitavyam asyāśrayeṇa, na ca dṛśyate
tato'sti nāstīti sandehe saty ātmā svarūpaṃ me mayā abahir antarhṛdi
darśitaḥ ||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yato madrūpasya madicchayaivātarkyayā dṛśyatvaṃ, na tu
vastuto netrādīndriyagrāhyatvam ity atra tvam eva pramāṇam ity
āha—tubhyaṃ tvāṃ kṛtārthīkartum ātmā śrīvigraho me mayā
abahirantarhṛdi | yad vā, bahir api darśitaḥ—gopaveśo me purastād
āvirbabhūva  iti śruteḥ | ātmadarśanasya deyatvāt kriyāgrahaṇam api
kartavyam iti sampradāne caturthī vā | kadā ? puṣkarasya mūlaṃ vicinvatas
tava mayi viṣaye vicikitsāyām asyādhiṣṭhānam asti nāsti veti sandehe
satīty arthaḥ | atra tapasaḥ samādheś cānullekhāt tāv api maddarśanasya
vastuto na hetuḥ, kintu madicchaiveti rahasyaṃ siddhāntam api brahmāṇaṃ
jñāpayāmāseti jñeyam ||37||


 || 3.9.38 ||

 yac cakarthāṅga matstotraṃ matkathābhyudayāṅkitam |

 yad vā tapasi te niṣṭhā sa eṣa madanugrahaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : aṅga he brahman ! cakartha kṛtavān asi | matkathaivābhyudayas
tenāṅkitam | sa eṣa bandhābhāvo mayi manonirbandho majjñānaṃ madrūpasya
hṛdi darśanaṃ matstutis taponiṣṭhā ceti yady eṣa sarvo'pi madanugrahaḥ
||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yac ceti | tiryaṅmanuṣyatve'py evaṃrūpaṃ
matkathāmātram abhyudayaḥ, tatrāpi tadaṅkitaṃ stotram iti vaiśiṣṭyam |
sa eṣa iti | tad etat sarvaṃ madanugraharūpam ity arthaḥ ||38||

viśvanāthaḥ : atas tava matstavādayo'pi matkartṛkānugraheṇaivābhuvann
ity āha—yac cakartha akaroḥ tat sarvaṃ sa prasiddha eṣa pratyakṣo
madanugraha iti etasyaiva kāryaṃ tat tat pratīhīty arthaḥ ||38||


 || 3.9.39 ||

 prīto'ham astu bhadraṃ te lokānāṃ vijayecchayā |

 yad astauṣīr guṇamayaṃ nirguṇaṃ mānuvarṇayan ||

madhvaḥ :  sārvajñyādiguṇair yuktaṃ sattvādiguṇavarjitam |

yo jānāti hariṃ tasya prīto bhavati keśavaḥ || iti vyomasaṃhitāyām ||39||

śrīdharaḥ : guṇamayatvena pratīyamānam api nirguṇam evānuvarṇayan ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : prīto'ham iti | kecit prākṛtaguṇayuktatvena stuvanti
| kecit tu tadrahitatvena | guṇamayam aprākṛtānantaguṇaviśiṣṭaṃ tvaṃ
tu tadrahitaṃ prākṛtaguṇapracuraṃ ca pratipādya mām astauṣīr ity arthaḥ
||39||

viśvanāthaḥ : kiṃ ca, matkṛpotthayaiva bhaktyā punar ham atīva prīṇāmīty
adbhutāṃ matparipāṭīṃ paśyety āha—prīta iti | lokānāṃ vijayecchayā
matsṛjyamānā lokā jayayuktā bhavantv itīcchayā guṇamayaṃ
kalyāṇasamudraṃ sākāraṃ māṃ nirguṇaṃ prākṛtasattvādiguṇarahitam
anuvarṇayan yad astauṣīḥ | prīto'ham atas teṣāṃ bhadram astu | ye tu
guṇamayaṃ māṃ śrīnārāyaṇg sattvādiguṇavattvenaiva stuvanti, na tu
nirguṇatvena, teṣu na prīto'smīti na teṣāṃ bhadram astv iti bhāvaḥ ||39||


 || 3.9.40 ||

ya etena pumān nityaṃ stutvā stotreṇa māṃ bhajet |

  tasyāśu samprasīdeyaṃ sarvakāmavareśvaraḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  adhikārikadevānāṃ svādhikārādhikām itā |

bhavati prītaye viṣṇor bhaktyādyair api yat sadā || iti ca ||40||

śrīdharaḥ : tava prīta iti kiṃ vaktavyam ity āha—ya iti ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tvayi prīta iti kiṃ vaktavyam ity āha—ya iti ||40||


 || 3.9.41 ||

  pūrtena tapasā yajñair dānair yogasamādhinā |

rāddhaṃ niḥśreyasaṃ puṃsāṃ matprītis tattvavinmatam ||

madhvaḥ :  niḥśreyasaṃ rājyam | mokṣe'pi rañjanīyā matprītir eva |
muktasyāpi hareḥ prītiḥ sarvato'py anurajyate  iti vāmane ||41||

śrīdharaḥ : na ca matprīter apy adhikaṃ kiñcid astīty āha | pūrtādibhiḥ
rāddhaṃ siddhaṃ yan niḥśreyasaṃ phalaṃ tan matprītir eveti tattvavidāṃ
matam ||41||

sanātanaḥ (ha.bha.vi. 11.47) : na ca matprīter adhikaṃ kiñcid astīty
āha—pūrteneti | pūrtādibhī rāddhaṃ siddhaṃ yan niḥśreyasaṃ phalam |
matprītir eveti tattvavidāṃ matam ||41||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ bhaktaviṣayakasvaprītiṃ stutvā
svaviṣayikām api bhaktaprītiṃ stauti—pūrteneti | pūrtādīnā paramparayā
sākṣād vā yā mayi prītiḥ saiva rāddhaṃ suvicārasiddhaṃ niḥśreyasaṃ phalam
| yatas tad eva tattvavinmatam iti ||41||

viśvanāthaḥ :  na ca matprīter abhyadhikaṃ kiñcid astīty āha—pūrtādibhiḥ
rāddhaṃ sādhitaṃ yan niḥśreyasaṃ phalaṃ tat tattvavidāṃ mataṃ matprītir
eva | matprītiṃ vinā rāddhaṃ niḥśreyasam aniḥśreyasam evety atas
tattvavido matprītyartham eva pūrtādikaṃ kurvantīti te māṃ prīṇantam
eva kartum icchanti, na tu māṃ svaprīter viṣayaṃ cikīrṣanty atas tayā
sāttvikyā bhaktyā tān pratyahaṃ prītas tebhyo mokṣaṃ dadāmīti bhāvaḥ
||41||


 || 3.9.42 ||

aham ātmātmanāṃ dhātaḥ preṣṭhaḥ san preyasām api |

 ato mayi ratiṃ kuryād dehādir yatkṛte priyaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  sarvato'pi priyo hy ātmā tasyāpi priyatāṃ hariḥ |

āpādayati yat tasmāt svātmano'pi priyo hariḥ || iti brahmavaivarte ||42||

śrīdharaḥ : atra hetum āha—aham iti | ātmanām ahaṅkāropādhīnāṃ jīvānām
ātmā | ataḥ preyasām atipriyāṇām api madhye preṣṭhaḥ priyatamaḥ san
niravadyaḥ | yatkṛte yadartham ||42||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tathaiva sādhayati—aham ātmeti | ātmanāṃ śuddhajīvānām
api, ato nirupādhiniravadhipriyatamasya prasādarūpā prītir eva
prārthanīyeti bhāvaḥ ||42||

viśvanāthaḥ : nirguṇabhaktimatāṃ tu prīter ahaṃ viṣaya iti vyañjayan
sarveṣām api jīvānāṃ vastutaḥ prīter aham eva viṣayībhavituṃ yogya ity
ataḥ svasmin prītiṃ vidhatte—aham iti | ātmanāṃ jīvānām aham ātmā
paramātma yatkṛte dehādiḥ priya iti kalatraputrādiṣu prītir
dehasambandhena dehe prītir jīvātmasambandhena jīvātmani prītiḥ
paramātmasambandheneti paramātmay eva prītiḥ svābhāvikī jīvātmādiṣv
aupacārikīti teṣu krameṇa priyatvahrāsaḥ |

nanu tarhi mayi ratiṃ kuryād ity asya vākyasya kathaṃ vidhitvaṃ rateḥ
prāptatvād eva | yad uktaṃ vidhiratyantam aprāptau iti ? ucyate—māyāyāṃ
khalv adhikāro jīvātmaparyanta eva, na tu tato'pi paratra paramātmanīti
māyābandhapatitānāṃ manuṣyādīnāṃ māyikeṣv eva vastuṣv anubhavaḥ
pravartate, jīvasyāpy āropitaṃ māyikatvaṃ vartata iti | tathāpi
paramātmani tu svābhāvikyāḥ prīter vartamānatve'py anubhavābhāvād
ajñātasvabahuvittasya vaṇijo dāridryam iva tatra prītyabhāva iti
prītiṃ vidhatte śāstram iti |

kiṃ ca, vastutaḥ preṣṭho'pi paramātma jñānibhiḥ sākṣādanubhūto'pi ratyā
vinā premāspadaṃ na bhavaty ato bhaktānām eva sarvadeśakālavartī san
preṣṭho bhavati, na tu jñānināṃ, yathā śītādyārtihare
cakṣuḥprakāśasukhaprade'pi sūrye sākṣādanubhūte'pi ke'pi yat
nānurajyanti tatra mamatvābhāva eva hetuḥ | sūryaś ca tatsukhaprado'pi
teṣūdāsta eva | evaṃ jñānijanāḥ khalv ajñānatamo'ntari
svānubhavasukhaprade'pi brahmaṇi mamatvābhāvān nānurajyanti | brahmāpi
svg nirviśeṣam evānubhāvayaṃs teṣūdāsta eva | yadā ca sūryabhakto janaś
cakṣuṣmān andho vā bhaktyā santoṣitaṃ sūryam ihaiva karacaraṇādimantaṃ,
sahāśvarathasārathyādikaṃ paśyati taṃ svapremavaśaṃ ca karoti, tathaiva
mukto baddho vā jīvo bhaktyaiva paramātmanaṃ saviśeṣam anubhavaṃs
tatrānurajyati, taṃ ca svapremavaśaṃ karotīty ataḥ paramātmanaḥ sarvataḥ
preṣṭhatvaṃ bhaktānāṃ kevalayā pradhānībhūtayā vā bhaktyaiva | na tu
jñānināṃ guṇībhūtayā bhaktyeti | ata uktaṃ svayaṃ paramātmaiva, ato mayi
ratiṃ kuryād  iti vivecanīyam | yad vā, rateḥ uktayukter eva hetor mayi
ratiṃ kuryāt | yasyā rateḥ kṛte dehādāv aprītim ato'pi vivekino
dehādipriyo bhavati, dehendriyādibhir eva paricaryākīrtanādir
bhaktisiddhir iti naiva te mokṣākāṅkṣiṇaḥ syur iti bhāvaḥ ||42||


 || 3.9.43 ||

 sarvavedamayenedam ātmanātmātmayoninā |

prajāḥ sṛja yathāpūrvaṃ yāś ca mayy anuśerate ||

śrīdharaḥ : atas tvaṃ kṛtārtha eva tathāpi matpriyārthaṃ sṛṣṭiṃ kurv ity
āha, sarveti | ātmā tvam idaṃ trailokyaṃ yā mayy anuśerate tāḥ prajāś ca
sṛja | kena ātmanaivānyanirapekṣeṇa | tatra jñāpakāpekṣābhavam āha,
sarvavedamayeneti | ātmā ahaṃ yoniḥ kāraṇaṃ yasyeti
jñānakriyāśaktyatiśayaṃ sūcayati | yathāpūrvam iti tavāt rābhyāso'py
astīty uktam | mayy anuśerata iti sthitānām abhivyaktimātram eva
kartavyam ity anāyāsatvam uktam ||43||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : mā rīriṣīṣṭa nigamasyeti—yat prārthitaṃ,
tatrāha—sarvavedamayeneti | veds tvayā na vismartavya iti bhāvaḥ | idam
ātmanā anenaiva dehena prajāḥ sṛja ātmanām ātmā aham eva yoniḥ kāraṇaṃ
yasyeti tena | yathāpūrvadinasṛṣṭiṃ smārayati—mayy anuśerata iti |
sthitānām abhivyaktimātraṃ kartavyam ity anāyāsatvam uktaṃ, cakārād
bhaktiṃ ca kuru ||43||


 || 3.9.44 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

 tasmā evaṃ jagatsraṣṭre pradhānapuruṣeśvaraḥ |

 vyajyedaṃ svena rūpeṇa kañjanābhas tirodadhe ||

śrīdharaḥ : idaṃ sṛjyaṃ vyajya prakāśya padmanābhaḥ śrīnārāyaṇarūpeṇa
tirodadhe'śyo'bhavat ||44||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svena kañjanābhākāreṇaiva rūpeṇedaṃ vyajya tirodadhe
||44||

viśvanāthaḥ : idaṃ sṛjyaṃ jagat vyajya prakāśya svena śrīnārāyaṇarūpeṇa
| atra brāhmye kalpe aham evāsam evāgre ity ādi catuḥślokībhāgavatam iva
pādme kalpe yadā tu sarvalokeṣv iti yadā rahitam iti pūrteneti aham ātmā
ātmanām iti catuḥślokībhāgavat idaṃ bhagavān upadideśeti kecid āhuḥ
||44||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīye navamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe viduramaitreyasaṃvāde

 pādmodbhave brahmastavo nāma

  navamo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.9 ||

 (3.10)

daśamo'dhyāyaḥ

 tattvādyutpattikramaḥ

 || 3.10.1 ||

vidura uvāca—

antarhite bhagavati brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ |

prajāḥ sasarja katidhā daihikīr mānasīr vibhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

  daśame kālasaṃpraśna prāptiṃ vaktuṃ tad udbhavaḥ |

 prākṛtādivibhāgena sargas tu daśadhocyate ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :

 kālasya lakṣaṇaṃ sāmānyato daśama ucyate |

sargo daśavidhaś cātaḥ prākṛtādivibhedavān ||1||


 || 3.10.2 ||

  ye ca me bhagavan pṛṣṭās tvayy arthā bahuvittama |

  tān vadasvānupūrvyeṇa chindhi naḥ sarvasaṃśayān ||

śrīdharaḥ : me mayā | vadasva vada | bhāsayasveti vā ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vadasva tvaṃ sarvathā jānāsīty ato vadety arthaḥ ||2||


 || 3.10.3 ||

 sūta uvāca—

 evaṃ sañcoditas tena kṣattrā kauṣāravir muniḥ |

prītaḥ pratyāha tān praśnān hṛdisthān atha bhārgava ||

śrīdharaḥ : sañcoditaḥ prārthitaḥ | hṛdisthān evāha, na tu te praśnās
tena vismṛtā ity arthaḥ ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sūta uvāceti evam ity ādikā saṅgatiḥ | svayam eva
sūtena kriyate, na śrīśukakṛtānūdyata iti bodhayati | maitreya uvācety
ādikaṃ tu śrīśukavākyānukaraṇam | śuka uvāceti bhaṛateti ca pāṭhau na
bahusammatau ||3||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhārgavety ādinā jñāne sāmarthyaṃ dyotitam | hṛdisthān iti
na te praśān tena vismṛtā ity arthaḥ ||3||


 || 3.10.4 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

viriñco'pi tathā cakre divyaṃ varṣaśataṃ tapaḥ |

  ātmany ātmānam āveśya yathāha bhagavān ajaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : ātmani parameśvare mana āveśya ||4||

śrīdharaḥ : ātmani śrīnārāyaṇe ātmānaṃ mana āveśya ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ātmani śrīnārāyaṇe ātmānaṃ manaḥ ||4||


|| 3.10.56 ||

 tad vilokyābjasambhūto vāyunā yadadhiṣṭhitaḥ |

  padmam ambhaś ca tatkāla kṛtavīryeṇa kampitam ||

  tapasā hy edhamānena vidyayā cātmasaṃsthayā |

 vivṛddhavijñānabalo nyapād vāyuṃ sahāmbhasā ||

śrīdharaḥ : abjasaṃbhūto brahmā yad adhiṣṭhāya sthitaḥ, kartari ktaḥ |
tat padmam ambhaś ca vilokya | kathaṃbhūtaṃ padmam ambhaś ca ? tena
pralayakālena kṛtaṃ vīryaṃ yasya tena vāyunā kampitaṃ, nyapād ity
uttareṇānvayaḥ ||5|| vivṛddhaṃ vijñānaṃ balaṃ ca yasya | nyapāt sarvaṃ
pītavān ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad iti yugmakam ||5|| nyapād iti yāvat pralaye
vardhate sma tāvad iti bhāvaḥ ||6||

viśvanāthaḥ : abjasaṃbhūto brahmā yat padmam adhiṣṭhita iti kartari ktaḥ
| tad eva padmam ambhaś ca vāyunā kampitaṃ vīkṣya nyapād ity
uttareṇānvayaḥ | vāyunā kathambhūtena ? tatkālena pralayasamayena kṛtaṃ
vīryaṃ yasya tena nyapāt nāśayāmāsety arthaḥ | pralayakāle yāvatpramāṇam
ambho vāyuś cāvardhata tāvatpramāṇam eveti jñeyam ||5||


 || 3.10.7 ||

tad vilokya viyadvyāpi puṣkaraṃ yadadhiṣṭhitam |

 anena lokān prāglīnān kalpitāsmīty acintayat ||

śrīdharaḥ : puṣkaraṃ padmam | prāglīnān trīl lokān kalpitāsmi srakṣyāmi
||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tataś ca puṣkaraṃ padmaṃ viyadvyāpi satyalokaparyantam
ucchritaṃ kalpitāsmi srakṣyāmi ||7||


 || 3.10.8 ||

  padmakośaṃ tadāviśya bhagavatkarmacoditaḥ |

 ekaṃ vyabhāṅkṣīd urudhā tridhā bhāvyaṃ dvisaptadhā ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavatā svayaṃ karaṇīye karmaṇi codito niyuktaḥ saṃs tadā
padmakośaṃ praviśya tam ekam eva tridhā lokarūpeṇa vyabhāṅkṣīd vibabhāja
| ekena kamalamukulena kathaṃ lokatrayasṛṣṭir ity asaṃbhāvanāṃ
vārayituṃ tasya viśālatām āha—dvisaptadhā caturdaśalokarūpeṇa | urudhā
tato'pi bahuprakāreṇa | bhāvyaṃ bhāvayituṃ yogyam | ato na tena
trilokīkaraṇaṃ citram ity arthaḥ ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tataś ca āviśya praviśya bhagavatā karmaṇi jagatsarge
niyuktaḥ | tam ekam eva tridhā lokatrayarūpeṇa vyabhāṅkṣīt vibabhāja |
ekena kamalakoṣeṇa  kathaṃ lokatrayasṛṣṭir ity asambhāvanāṃ vārayituṃ
tasya viśālatām āha—dvisaptadhā caturdaśalokarūpeṇa, urudhā tato'pi
bahuprakāreṇa,  bhāvyaṃ  bhāvayituṃ yogyam | ato na tena trilokīkaraṇaṃ
citram iti svāmicaraṇāḥ | prathamaṃ sa nālena kamalakoṣeṇa tridhā, tataś
caturdaśadhā, tataḥ sūryacandrādilokabhedena urudhā vyabhāṅkṣīt |
kīdṛśaṃ ? bhāvyaṃ dhyeyaṃ vairājopāsakair ity anye ||8||


 || 3.10.9 ||

  etāvāñ jīvalokasya saṃsthābhedaḥ samāhṛtaḥ |

  dharmasya hy animittasya vipākaḥ parameṣṭhy asau ||

madhvaḥ: animittasya brahmārpaṇabuddhyā kṛtasya | a iti brahmeti śruteḥ
||9||

śrīdharaḥ : trilokīrūpeṇaiva vibhāge hetum āha—etāvāṃs trilokīrūpo
jīvalokasya jīvānāṃ bhogasthānasya praty ahaṃ sṛjyasya saṃsthābhedo
racanāviśeṣa uktaḥ | nanu parameṣṭhino'pi jīvatvāviśeṣād brahmalokasyāpi
kim iti praty ahaṃ sṛṣṭir na bhavati tatrāha—hi yasmād nimittasya
niṣkāmasya dharmasya vipākaḥ phalarūpo'sau | upalakṣaṇam etat
satyalokasya mahaḥ prabhṛtilokānāṃ tad vāsināṃ ca | trailokyasya
kāmyakarmaphalatvāt pratikalpam utpattivināśau bhavataḥ | mahaḥ
prabhṛtīnām upāsanāsamucitaniṣkāmadharmaphalatvād
dviparārdhaparyantaṃ na nāśaḥ | tatrasthānāṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ prāyeṇa
muktir iti bhāvaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : etāvān dvisaptadhā paryantaḥ śrībrahmā tu sarvato
viśiṣṭatvāt tatsraṣṭety āha—dharmasyeti | animittasya svabhāvenaiva
kriyamāṇasya, na tu gṛhasthavat tattatsaṅkalpenapīty arthaḥ | vipākaḥ
parākāṣṭhāprāptapariṇāmaḥ | asāv iti | brahmāntaraṃ vyavacchinatti,
brahmaṇo'pi bhayaṃ matta [bhā.pu. 11.10.30] ityādyukteḥ ||9||

viśvanāthaḥ : jīvalokasya vyaṣṭivirāṭsamūhasya saṃsthābhedaḥ
pratibimbocitasthānaracanāviśeṣa uktaḥ | nanu katham etāvatāṃ jīvānām
ekenaiva brahmaṇā saṃsthānirmāṇaṃ ? ity ata āha—hi yasmād asau
animittasya niṣkāmasya dharmasya tapovidyādeḥ vipākaḥ paripākamūrtir eva
tapobalena kim aśakyam iti bhāvaḥ ||9||


|| 3.10.10 ||

vidura uvāca—

 yathāttha bahurūpasya harer adbhutakarmaṇaḥ |

 kālākhyaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ brahman yathā varṇaya naḥ prabho ||

madhvaḥ :  lakṣaṇaṃ lakṣyam ātmā ca svarūpam iti kathyate  ity abhidhānam
||10||

śrīdharaḥ : kālabhedena lokasṛṣṭibhedaṃ śrutvā tam eva kālaṃ jijñāsuḥ
pṛcchati | yat kālākhyaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ svarūpam āttha abravīḥ | kathaṃ kālaḥ
kalpate ? kiṃ vā tasya sūkṣmaṃ sthūlaṃ ca rūpaṃ ? iti yathāvad varṇayety
arthaḥ ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  kālākhyayāsaditakarmatantra iti guṇena kālānugateneti
kālena so'jaḥ puruṣāyuṣeti tatkālakṛtavīryeṇety ādibhiḥ
pralayasṛṣṭyādikaṃ puruṣaprayatnādikaṃ ca kālenaiva siddhyatīti
vismṛtaḥ kālaṃ pṛcchati, yat kālākhyaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ svarūpam āttha abravīḥ,
tad yathāvad eva varṇaya ||10||


|| 3.10.11 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

guṇavyatikarākāro nirviśeṣo'pratiṣṭhitaḥ |

puruṣas tadupādānam ātmānaṃ līlayāsṛjat ||

madhvaḥ : guṇavyatikaram ākaroti tad dṛṣṭvā apratiṣṭhito'nyatra | sa
bhagavaḥ kasmin pratiṣṭhita iti svamahimni  iti śrutiḥ | tad upādānaṃ
guṇavyatikaropādānakartāraṃ, sṛṣṭyādyarthatvena tasya puruṣasya
brahmāviṣṇumaheśvarā iti trīṇi rūpāṇy ātmanā sṛṣṭāni ||11||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra sāmānyataḥ kālasya svarūpam atrocyate, uttarādhyāye tu
viśeṣataḥ | guṇānāṃ vyatikaro mahadādipariṇāmas tenaivākriyate yaḥ, sa
kāla iti śeṣaḥ | vakṣyate caikādaśe—guṇavyatikaraḥ kālaḥ svabhāvaḥ sūtram
eva ca [bhā.pu. 11.22.13] iti | svatas tu nirviśeṣaḥ | apratiṣṭhitaḥ kvāpy
aparyavasitaḥ, ādyantaśūnya ity arthaḥ | etad eva darśayitum īśvaraḥ
sṛṣṭyādi tena nimittabhūtena karotīty āha—puruṣa iti | upādīyate
nimittatayā svīkriyate ity upādānam | sa kāla upādānaṃ nimittaṃ yasmin,
tam ātmānam eva viśvarūpeṇāsṛjat | svavyatirekeṇa sṛjyasyābhāvāt | etac
ca vastukathanamātram | kālena nimittena cāsṛjad ity etāvad eva
vivakṣitam ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : guṇānāṃ vyatikarāt mahadādipariṇāmād eva ākāraḥ
svarūpajñānaṃ yasya saḥ | svatas tu nirviśeṣaḥ apratiṣṭhitaḥ kvāpy
aparyavasitaḥ ādyantaśūnya ity arthaḥ | yena nimittabhūtena
sṛṣṭyādikaṃ bhavati, sa kāla ity āha—puruṣa iti | upādīyate nimittatayā
svīkriyate ity upādānam | sa kāla eva upādānaṃ nimittakāraṇaṃ yasmin, tam
ātmānam ātmaśaktikāryatvād ātmaśabdavācyaṃ viśvam asṛjat ||11||


|| 3.10.12 ||

 viśvaṃ vai brahmatanmātraṃ saṃsthitaṃ viṣṇumāyayā |

  īśvareṇa paricchinnaṃ kālenāvyaktamūrtinā ||

madhvaḥ : brahma nirmātṛkam | māyayā sāmarthyena | tatra yat
saṃhatrīśvarākhyg rūpg tat kālākhyam | kal chedena iti dhātoḥ | atha trayī
vāva prakṛtiḥ sattvaṃ rajas tama iti tāṃ nārāyaṇaṃ paryapaśyad
ananyapratiṣṭhitaḥ tvaṃ vā etam āhuḥ puruṣa iti pūrṇo hy eṣa bhavati
satre dhāva bhūvaiṣāṃ guṇānām upādānāya viṣṇur vāva sattvasya rajaso
brahmeśāno nāma tamasaḥ sa āviveśa | brahmā  brahmāṇaṃ nāma caturmukhaḥ |
īśa īśānaṃ nāma pañcamukhaṃ yo vā īśa īśānam āviveśa | taṃ vā enaṃ kāla
ity ācakṣate kāla ity ācakṣate  iti saukarāyaṇaśrutiḥ ||12||

śrīdharaḥ : svavyatiriktasṛjyābhāvaṃ darśayan kālasya sṛṣṭinimittatāṃ
darśayati—viśvam iti | viṣṇumāyayā saṃsthitaṃ saṃhṛtaṃ brahmatanmātraṃ
sad viśvam | īśvareṇa kartrā kālena nimittena paricchinnaṃ pṛthak
prakāśitam | avyaktā mūrtiḥ svarūpaṃ yasyeti svato nirviśeṣatā darśitā
||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kālam ācaṣṭe—yat tu lakṣaṇaṃ jñāpakaṃ guṇavyatikareṇa
kriyārūpaṃ tatpariṇāmādi paurvyāparyānusandhānenākriyate ākārabhedair
lakṣyate yaḥ, sa kāla ity arthaḥ | viṣṇor īśvarasya māyayā
sṛṣṭyādiśaktyā saha līnaṃ brahmaṇi viṣṇāv eva tādātmyopapannaṃ sat,
īśvareṇa tatprabhāvarūpeṇa kālena paricchinnaṃ pṛthak kṛtam ity arthaḥ
||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : yo viśvaṃ paricchinatti, sa kāla ity āha—viśvam iti | viṣṇor
māyayā śaktyā samyak sthitam idaṃ viśvaṃ brahmatanmātraṃ kāraṇaṃ yasya
tat īśvareṇa īśvaraprabhāvarūpeṇa kālena paricchinnam etāvad iti
paricchedaviṣayīkṛtam avyaktā mūrtir yasya iti svato nirviśeṣatā darśitā
||12||


|| 3.10.13 ||

 yathedānīṃ tathāgre ca paścād apy etad īdṛśam |

madhvaḥ :  sṛṣṭiś ca pralayaś caiva saṃsāro muktir eva ca |

devarṣiprabhṛtayo lokā lokā bhūrādayas tathā ||

anādyanantakālīnāḥ sarvadaikaprakārakāḥ |

jagatpravāhaḥ satyo'yaṃ naiva mithyā kathañcana ||

ye tv etad anyathā brūyuḥ sarvahantāra eva te |

devair brahmādibhiḥ śaptā ṛṣībhir mānuṣādibhiḥ ||

setihāsais tathā vedaiḥ sarve yānty avaraṃ tamaḥ |

sarvabrahmatvavettāro jīvabrahmatasyavedinaḥ ||

anyasāmyavido viṣṇor viṣṇudveṣṭāra eva ca |

sarve yānti tamo ghoraṃ na caiṣām utthitiḥ kvacit || iti skānde ||13||

śrīdharaḥ : apratiṣṭhitatvaṃ darśayituṃ
tatkāryaviśvapravāhasyāpratiṣṭhām āha—yathedānīm asti tathāgre pūrvam
apy āsīt paścād api bhaviṣyati ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yathety ardhakam | īdṛśaṃ pūrvoktaprakāreṇa
pralayādyātmakaṃ sarga iti prākṛto vaikṛtas tv iti | tatra kecit prākṛtā
īśvarasṛṣṭāḥ, kecic ca vaikṛtā brahmasṛṣṭā ity arthaḥ | ubhayātmakas tu
vakṣyate ||13||

viśvanāthaḥ : nanv ādyantayor asattvāsad eva viśvam ity ato'satyasya
viśvasya kiṃ paricchinatvād yukteti cen, maivaṃ vācyam ity āha—yatheti |
agre pūrvamahāpralayasyādāv api etad viśvam āsīd eva, paścād
uttarapralayānte'pi bhaviṣyaty evety ape'sya na mithyābhūtatvaṃ, kintu
naśvaratvam eveti bhāvaḥ ||13||


|| 3.10.14 ||

sargo navavidhas tasya prākṛto vaikṛtas tu yaḥ |

  kāladravyaguṇair asya trividhaḥ pratisaṅkramaḥ ||

madhvaḥ: tāmasasya padārthasya sattvaṃ hi layakāraṇam |

sāttvikasya tamaś caiva tayor api rajaḥ kvacit ||

guṇato'yaṃ layaṃ prokto dravyatas tu virodhinā |

kālataḥ kālasaṅkhyāko layaḥ sarvasya vastunaḥ || iti brahmatarke ||14||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃ sāmānyataḥ kālaṃ nirūpya viśeṣato nirūpayiṣyaṃs tan
nimittasya sargasya pūrvoktān eva bhedān anuvadati—sarga iti | yas tu
prākṛto vaikṛtaś ca sa daśamaḥ | tan nimittam eva trividhaṃ pralayam
āha—kālenaiva kevalena nityaḥ pralayaḥ | dravyeṇa saṃkarṣaṇāgnyādinā
naimittikaḥ | guṇaiḥ svasvakāryaṃ grasadbhiḥ prākṛtikaḥ ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ādyas tv ity atra yatreti pūrveṇāpi sambadhyate | yatra
mahataḥ sarge ātmano jīvasya guṇavaiṣamyaṃ bhavatīti yadyapi
padmakalpe'smin pūrvasiddhatvān mahadādīnāṃ sargo nāsti, tathāpi
taduddeśaḥ sūkṣmasūkṣmakramabodhārtha eva ||14||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ sāmānyataḥ kālaṃ nirūpyottarādhyāye viśeṣato
nirūpayiṣyan tannimittaṃ sargaṃ vistareṇoktaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ ca
sukhabodhārthaṃ saṅkṣepato daśavidhatvena saṅkalayati sarga iti | yas tu
prākṛto vaikṛtaś ca sa daśama iti śeṣaḥ | tannimittam eva trividhaṃ
pralayam āha—kālenaiva kevalena nityaḥ pralayaḥ dravyeṇa
saṃkarṣaṇāgnyādinā naimittikaḥ guṇaiḥ svasvakāryaṃ grasadbhiḥ
prākṛtikaḥ ||14||


|| 3.10.15 ||

 ādyas tu mahataḥ sargo guṇavaiṣamyam ātmanaḥ |

dvitīyas tv ahamo yatra dravyajñānakriyodayaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  tamaso rajas tu dviguṇaṃ rajasaḥ sattvam eva ca |

parimāṇataḥ evaṃ syus trayaḥ prakṛtijā guṇāḥ ||

tatra sattvaṃ kevalaṃ syāt rajasy api śatādhikam |

sattvaṃ rajaḥśatāṃśaṃ tu tamas tatra prakīrtitam ||

tamasy api tathā sattvaṃ tamasas tu daśottaram |

taddaśāṃśena tu rajo mūlajg yat rajas tu tat ||

vilaye daśāṃśataḥ sattva ekāṃśena tamasy api |

miśritaṃ bhavati hy etāṃ sāmyāvasthāṃ vidur budhāḥ ||

yadā tu tat rajaḥ sarvaṃ tamasā saha saṅgatam |

tadā tv āhur mahattattvaṃ taccaturbhāgasambhavam ||

tatra tribhāgo rajasa eko'ṃśatamasas tathā |

tad āhur brahmaṇo rūpaṃ guṇavaiṣamyanāmakam ||

tad eva kevalaṃ sattva itarāpekṣayā bhavet |

śrīr mūlasattvaṃ vijñeyā bhūrmūlaraja ucyate ||

mūlaṃ tamas tathā durgā mahālakṣmī strīmūlikā |

guṇebhyo guṇamūlāc ca yo'tītaḥ sa janārdanaḥ ||

yat rajo mūlarajasi mūle tamasi yat rajaḥ |

tamaś ca mūle tamasi mahattattvaṃ tadātmakam ||

daśāṃśās tatra sattvaṃ syād ekāṃśo raja eva tu |

taddaśāṃśaṃ tamo jñeyam ahaṅkāras tadātmakaḥ ||

sa rudras tāmaso jñeyo viriñcāpekṣayaiva tu |

itarāpekṣayā sattvaṃ sattvādyās tadvad asya ca ||

tat tamo'ṃśāt sāttvikāṃśā manāadyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |

rajaso'ṃśas tv indriyāṇi tamaso'ṃśaś ca khādayaḥ || iti tattvaviveke
||15||

śrīdharaḥ : tān eva sargān prapañcayati—ādya ityādinā
yāvadadhyāyasamāpti | mahato lakṣaṇam ātmano hareḥ sakāśād guṇānāṃ
vaiṣamyam iti | ahamo'haṅkārasya | tasya lakṣaṇam—yatreti | dravyādayo
vakṣyamāṇās trayaḥ sargāḥ tan mātro bhūtasargaḥ, bhūtasūkṣmasarga ity
arthaḥ | dravyaśaktimān mahābhūtotpādakaḥ ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tān eva sargān vivṛṇoti—ādya ity ādinā yāvadadhyāyasamāpti
| mahato lakṣaṇam ātmanaḥ parameśvarāt sakāśād guṇānāṃ vaiṣamyaṃ prathamaḥ
| ahamo'haṅkārasya, tasya lakṣaṇam—yatreti | dravyāṇi bhūtāni jñānāni
jñānendriyāṇi devatā manaś ca kriyāḥ karmendriyāṇi teṣām udayaḥ yataḥ saḥ
||15||


|| 3.10.16 ||

  bhūtasargas tṛtīyas tu tanmātro dravyaśaktimān |

  caturtha aindriyaḥ sargo yas tu jñānakriyātmakaḥ ||

madhvaḥ: bhūtāni dravyaśaktīni bhūteṣu dravaṇaṃ yataḥ |

tathā tanmātraśaktīni śabdādyātmakatā yataḥ ||

kriyaśaktīni vāgādyānīndriyāṇīty ādi tu |

jñānaśaktīni manasā devāś ca jñānaśaktayaḥ ||

eteṣāṃ mūlabhūtatvād ahaṅkāras triśaktimān |

mānuṣāpekṣayā devā sāttvikāḥ parikīrtitāḥ ||

tatrāpi sāttvikāḥ proktā tāttvikāyās tu devatāḥ |

tatrāpi sāttviko rudras tatrāpi tu caturmukhaḥ ||

avikārī brahmarudrau dehabhedādisambhavau |

vikāravanta indrādyās tasmād vaikārikā matāḥ ||

ta evendriyarūpeṇa yatas tv ativikāriṇaḥ |

jñānamātraguṇodriktās tasmāt taijasanāmakāḥ ||

avikāritvayogyatvaṃ nivṛttaṃ hīndriyeṣu tu |

vaikāritvanāmāpi tatas teṣāṃ na vidyate ||

yathā viprakule mūrkho mūrkha ity abhidhīyate |

vidyāyogyatvataḥ śūdro na mūrkho mūrkha eva san ||

tāmasāni hi bhūtāni kiñcid vyavahitatvataḥ |

jñānasya suṣṭhujñatve'pi pūrṇajñāno hariḥ svayam || iti ca ||16||

śrīdharaḥ : jñānakarmendriyātmakaś caturthaḥ | pañcamo vaikārikaḥ
indriyādhiṣṭhātāro devā manaś ca ||16||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tanmātraḥ teṣāṃ bhūtānāṃ mātrā sūkṣmāvasthā yasmin saḥ
| yas tv iti | tuśabdaḥ pādapūraṇe | tuhicasmahevaipādapūraṇe ity
amaraḥ ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : bhūtasargaḥ tanmātraḥ tanmātrātmako dravyeṣu mahābhūteṣu
śaktimān tatprakāśanasāmarthyaś cety arthaḥ | jñānakarmendriyāṇām ātmā
svarūpaṃ yataḥ ||16||


|| 3.10.17 ||

 vaikāriko devasargaḥ pañcamo yanmayaṃ manaḥ |

ṣaṣṭhas tu tamasaḥ sargo yas tv abuddhikṛtaḥ prabhoḥ ||

madhvaḥ : abuddhipūrvam iva tu brahmaṇo haribuddhitaḥ |

avidyā pañcaparvaiṣā prādurbhūtā mahātmanaḥ ||

tāmasānāṃ tu bhūtānāṃ sahasraṃ sattvabhāginām |

śatāṃśarajasām ekatamasāṃ sarvavedinām |

kevalas tamaso yo'ṃśaḥ sāvidyā pañcaparvikā ||

jñātārtiduṣṭās taddehād daityarakṣaḥpiśācakāḥ |

yat rajobhautikaṃ tena mānuṣāṇāṃ sadā janiḥ ||

tamogūḍhena rajasā tv itarasthāsnucāriṇām |

bhautikena tu sattvena gūḍhaṃ brahmaṇa āṇḍajam ||

rūpaṃ tatrāpi tu tamaḥ śatāṃśena prakīrtitam |

tajjo rudras tatas tvem indrādīnāṃ punar janiḥ ||

gūhitaṃ bhūtarajasā tat sattvaṃ mānuṣā yadā |

devā evaṃ guṇās tv ete sarvaṃ vyāpya vyavasthitāḥ || 17||

śrīdharaḥ : ṣaṣṭhas tu tamasaḥ pañcaparvāvidyāyāḥ | abuddhir jīvānām
āvaraṇaṃ vikṣepaś ca tāṃ karotīty abuddhikṛttasya | me mattaḥ śṛṇu ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vaikārikāḥ sāttvikāhaṅkārasambandhī | devānām
indriyādhiṣṭhātèṇāṃ sargaḥ yan mayaṃ manaḥ manaso'pi sargaḥ tṛtīya ity
arthaḥ | ete pañcasargāḥ prādhānikā uktāḥ | āvidyakaṃ sargam āha—ṣaṣṭhas
tv iti | tu bhinnopakrame | tamaso'jñānasya sargaḥ, ṣaṣṭhaḥ prabhoḥ
parameśvarasya śaktir abuddhir jīvamohinī yā avidyānāmnī tayā kṛtaḥ |
ayam arthaḥ—pradhānam avidyā vidyeti māyāyās tisro vṛttayaḥ | tatra
pradhānena mahadādipṛthivyantāni tattvāni satyāny eva sṛṣṭāni yair eva
samaṣṭivyaṣṭirūpāḥ jīvasya sthūÿās tayā sūkṣmāś copādhayo'bhavan
dvitīyayā avidyayā tu jīvaṃ mohayantyā jīvasambandham
avidyāsmitārāgadveṣābhiniveśātmakaṃ tamaḥ pañcavidham ajñānam asatyam
eva sṛṣṭam | evaṃ satyamithyātmakaṃ jagad idaṃ pradhānāvidyābhyāṃ sṛṣṭam
| tṛtīyayā vidyayā tu pañcavidhājñānanivartakaṃ jñānaṃ sṛṣṭam | tac
cāgre vivṛtya vyākhyāsyate ||17||


|| 3.10.18 ||

  ṣaḍ ime prākṛtāḥ sargā vaikṛtān api me śṛṇu |

  rajobhājo bhagavato līleyaṃ harimedhasaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  guṇātītaṃ ca yad rūpaṃ brahmādīnāṃ sukhātmakam |

cidrūpaṃ tac ca sattvasyaivotkarṣo yatra vidyate ||

tac cotkṛṣṭaṃ tamo yatra hīnaṃ tatra svabhāvataḥ |

upagūhane tu naivāsti viśeṣo nityacinmaye ||

prakṛter guṇarūpāyā mūlikāyāś ca na kvacit |

viśeṣaḥ parame tattve vāsudeve kutaḥ punaḥ ||

avyaktādyāḥ pṛthivyantāḥ sarvāḥ prakṛtayaḥ smṛtāḥ |

tadupādānakaḥ sargaḥ prākṛtaḥ paripaṭhyate ||

aṇḍaṃ tu vikṛtaṃ jñeyaṃ tajjo vaikṛta ucyate |

pañcaparvātvavidyā tu bhūtebhyo hariṇā purā ||

uddhṛtya brahmaṇi kṣiptā sā punas tena niḥsṛtā |

tatsraṣṭṛtvajñāpanāya tasmāt sā prākṛtā matā ||

ete guṇā hareḥ samayak svātantryaviṣayāḥ sadā |

svatantrāḥ prakṛteś cāpi brahmaṇo'nyeṣu tu kramāt |

deveṣv eva tad anyeṣu paratantrā hi te matāḥ || iti ca ||18||

śrīdharaḥ : anudvegena śrotavyatām āha—yad viṣayā medhā saṃsāraṃ harati,
tasya harer līlā | yad vā, iyam iti tamāadisargarūpā | rajobhāja iti
brahmarūpasyety arthaḥ | asmin pakṣe abuddhikṛta iti prathamāntam |
anavadhānakṛta ity arthaḥ | musvam iva prathamaṃ kṛto mukhyasargaḥ |
tasthuṣāṃ sthāvarāṇām ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : rajobhājaḥ sannidhau na svayaṃ tadupakārakasya
brahmarūpeṇa tu tadupādhikasyety arthaḥ | ṭīkāyāṃ tamāadīti |
ādipadena mukhyasargaprabhṛtitvaṃ grāhyam | anavadhānakṛta iti harer
eva dhyānasvātantryāt, brahmaṇas tu tadvyabhicārād ity arthaḥ ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ : prakṛter māyāśakteḥ sakāśāj jāttā iti prākṛtā ime ṣaṭ |
vikṛtiḥ samaṣṭivirāḍ brahmā tasmāj jātān vakṣyamāṇān api me mattaḥ
vaikṛtān ity etad vivṛṇoti—rajobhājo brahmarūpasya harir medhāyāṃ yasya
tasya ||18||


|| 3.10.19 ||

 saptamo mukhyasargas tu ṣaḍvidhas tasthuṣāṃ ca yaḥ |

 vanaspatyoṣadhilatātvaksārā vīrudho drumāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : ṣaḍvidhatvam evāha—ye pūṣpaṃ vinā phalanti te vanaspatayaḥ |
oṣadhayaḥ phalapākāntāḥ | latā ārohaṇāpekṣāḥ | tvaksārā veṇvādayaḥ |
latā eva kāṭhinyenārohaṇānapekṣā vīrudhaḥ | ye puṣpaiḥ phalanti te drumāḥ
||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : saptama iti sārdhakam ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : sthāvarajaṅgamātmakasya jagataḥ sthāvarāṇāṃ prāthamyāt
mukhe prathame bhavo mukhyaḥ yas tasthūṣāṃ sthāvarāṇām | puṣpaṃ vinā
phalayanto vanaspatayaḥ | oṣadhayaḥ phalapākāntāḥ | latā ārohaṇāpekṣāḥ |
tvaksārā veṇvādayaḥ | latā eva kāṭhinyenārohaṇāpekṣā vīrudhaḥ | puṣpair
eva phalanto drumāḥ ||19||


|| 3.10.20 ||

 utsrotasas tamaḥprāyā antaḥsparśā viśeṣiṇaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : sthāsnubhir niyamān mukhyāsthiter gatir avāpyate |

prāyaḥ paropakartṛtvāt te mukhyasrotasaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

nādho nordhvaṃ tiraścāṃ tu punas tatraiva yaj janiḥ |

yajñopayogaṃ ca satām upakāraṃ vināpi ca ||

tiryaksrotasa ity eva procyante jñānibhis tataḥ |

prāyo'dhogamanaṃ yasmāt prayatnena vinā bhavet ||

arvāksrotasa ity eva mānuṣāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |

niyamād ūrdhvagantāro devāmokṣaikabhāginaḥ ||

ūrdhvasrotasa ity eva tasmāt te parikīrtitāḥ || iti brāhme |

tiraścāṃ sthāvarāṇāṃ ca buddhipūrvapravartanām |

asurāṇāṃ rakṣasāṃ vā piśācānāṃ tathaiva ca ||

arvāksrotas tvam uddiṣṭaṃ niyamād asurādinām |

mukhyasrotasa ity asya artha utsrotasa iti |

ūrdhva ity eva yas tūccatama evābhidhīyate ||

ūrdhvasrotasa etasmād devā eva na tatpare |

ucchabdauccamātre'pi tasmāt sthāsnuṣu bhaṇyate || iti ca |

tiraścīnā sthāvarāś ca antaḥsparśā itīritāḥ |

yatpratyakṣānumānābhyāṃ hṛjjajñānaṃ hi śāstrataḥ || iti pādme ||20||

śrīdharaḥ : teṣāṃ sādhāraṇaṃ lakṣaṇam āha—ūrdhvaṃ srotaḥ āhārasañcāro
yeṣām | tamaḥprāyā avyaktacaitanyāḥ | antaḥsparśāḥ sparśam eva jānanti
nānyat | tad apy antar eva na bahiḥ |
viśeṣiṇo'vyavasthitapariṇāmādyanekabhedavantaḥ ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : teṣāṃ sādhāraṇaṃ lakṣaṇam āha—ūrdhvaṃ srota āhārasañcāro
yeṣāṃ te | tamaḥprāyā avyaktacaitanyāḥ antaḥsparśā antaś cheda eva
vyathānubhavinaḥ | viśeṣiṇaḥ avyavasthitapariṇāmādyanekabhedavantaḥ
||20||


|| 3.10.21 ||

tiraścām aṣṭamaḥ sargaḥ so'ṣṭāviṃśadvidho mataḥ |

  avido bhūritamaso ghrāṇajñā hṛdy avedinaḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  yad aprayatnād dhṛdayaṅgamaṃ tad eva jānanti no
śāstrayuktibhyām ity arthaḥ |

aṣṭāviṃśadviśeṣeṇa yajñeṣūpakṛto yataḥ |

tiraścāṃ tāvad etasmād gaṇyate candravedibhiḥ ||21||

śrīdharaḥ : tiryak srotasāṃ sargam āha—tiraścām iti | sa
cāṣṭāviṃśatibhedaḥ | tiraścāṃ lakṣaṇam | avidaḥ śvastanādijñānaśūnyāḥ
| bhūritamasaḥ āhārādijñānamātraniṣṭhāḥ | ghrāṇenaiveṣṭam arthaṃ
jānanti | hṛdi avedino dīrghānusandhān aśūnyāḥ | tathā ca
śrutiḥ—athetareṣāṃ paśūnām aśanāpipāse evābhivijñānaṃ na vijñātaṃ vadanti,
na vijñātaṃ paśyanti, na viduḥ śvastanaṃ na lokālokau iti ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : gaur aja iti catuṣkam | ekaiko'yaṃ bahūnām
upalakṣaṇarūpo jñeyaḥ ||21||

viśvanāthaḥ : tiraśāḥ tiryaksrotasām | avidaḥ svastanādijñānaśūnyāḥ |
bhūritamasaḥ āhārādimātraniṣṭhāḥ | ghrānajñāḥ ghrāṇenaiveṣṭam arthaṃ
jānanti | hṛdi avedinaḥ dīrghānusandhānaśūnyāḥ alpaparāmarśāḥ | tathā ca
śrutiḥ—athetareṣāṃ paśūnām aśanāpipāse evābhivijñānaṃ na vijñātaṃ vadanti,
na vijñātaṃ paśyanti, na viduḥ śvastanaṃ na lokālokau iti | yad vā,
bhūritamaso bahuruṣaḥ ghrāṇenaiva jānanti hṛdyaṃ prati svapriyaṃ vastv
eva vindanti bhojanaśayanādyarthaṃ gṛhṇanti ||21||


  || 3.10.2225 ||

  gaur ajo mahiṣaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ sūkaro gavayo ruruḥ |

dviśaphāḥ paśavaś ceme avir uṣṭraś ca sattama ||

 kharo'śvo'śvataro gauraḥ śarabhaś camarī tathā |

  ete caikaśaphāḥ kṣattaḥ śṛṇu pañcanakhān paśūn ||

 śvā sṛgālo vṛko vyāghro mārjāraḥ śaśaśallakau |

 siṃhaḥ kapir gajaḥ kūrmo godhā ca makarādayaḥ ||

kaṅkagṛdhrabakaśyena bhāsabhallūkabarhiṇaḥ |

  haṃsasārasacakrāhva kākolūkādayaḥ khagāḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  gaur ajo mahiṣaḥ kṛṣṇaṃ śūkaro gavayo ruruḥ |

avyuṣṭrau ca kharāśvau ca tathaivāśvataroparaḥ ||

gauraś ca śarabhaś caiva camarī śvaśṛgālakau |

vṛko vyāghraś ca mārjāro hariś ca śaśaśalpakau ||

kapir gajaś ca godhādyā jalajāḥ pakṣiṇas tathā || iti brahmāṇḍe |

kūrmo jalajatvenāṣṭāviṃśas tv antarbhūto'pi pañcanakhatvapradarśanārthaṃ
pṛthaguktaḥ |

tattadākārasaṃyuktān sṛjyān sraṣṭāram eva ca |

yaḥ sadā saṃsmared yogī na sa bhūyo'bhijāyate ||

iti skāndavacanāt prasiddhānām api dviśaphādīnāṃ
smaraṇavidhānārthamuktiḥ ||

ucyate suprasiddhaṃ ca smaraṇārthaṃ ca kutracit |

aprasiddhajñāpanārthaṃ dvidhā śāstravacaḥ smṛtam || iti ṣāḍguṇye |

valguro nṛtyapakṣī ca salalukaś ca kathyate ity abhidhāne |

aṣṭāviṃśat pradhānās tu tiraścāṃ yās tu jātayaḥ |

yo yasya sadṛśas tv anyaḥ tantrāntargato bhavet ||

jalajāntargatāḥ sarpāḥ kīṭādyā yāś ca jātayaḥ |

teṣāṃ jalapradhānatvāc charīrasya tu sarvaśaḥ || iti satyasaṃhitāyām
||2225||

śrīdharaḥ : aṣṭāviṃśatibhedān evāha—gavādaya uṣṭrāntā dviśaphā
dvikhurā nava ||21||

svarādaya ekaśaphāḥ ṣat | aṣṭāviṃśatibhedān evāha—gavādaya uṣṭrāntā
dviśaphā dvikhurā nava |  śvādayo godhāntāḥ pañcanakhā dvādaśa | evam
ete bhūcarāḥ saptaviṃśatiḥ | makarādayo jalacarāḥ | kaṅkādayaś ca
svagā abhūcaratvenaikīkṛtya gṛhītāḥ | tad evam aṣṭāviṃśatibhedā
bhavanti | teṣu kṛṣṇarurugaurā mṛgaviśeṣāḥ | anyeṣām api tiryak
prāṇināṃ yathāyatham eteṣv evāntar bhāvaḥ ||2225||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  gavādaya uṣṭrāntā dviśaphā dvikhurā nava | avir meṣaḥ |
kharādayaś camaryas tāḥ, ekaśaphā ṣaṭ | śvādayo godhās tāḥ pañcanakhāḥ
dvādaśa | evam ete sthalacarāḥ saptaviṃśatiḥ | makarādayo jalacarāḥ |
kaṅkādayaḥ sthalacarāḥ | haṃsādayaḥ punarjalacarāḥ | kākādayaḥ punaḥ
sthalacarā iti | ete makarādaya ekavidhatvenaiva vyupadiṣṭāḥ | tad evam
aṣṭāviṃśatibhedā gavādayas teṣu rurukṛṣṇagaurā mṛgaviśeṣāḥ | anyeṣām
api tiryakprāṇināṃ yathāyatham eteṣv antarbhāvaḥ ||2225||


|| 3.10.26 ||

arvāksrotas tu navamaḥ kṣattar ekavidho nṛṇām |

rajo'dhikāḥ karmaparā duḥkhe ca sukhamāninaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : rajoniṣṭhā tamoniṣṭhā dvedhārvāksrotasaḥ smṛtāḥ |

asurādyās tamoniṣṭhā mānuṣās tu rajo'dhikāḥ || iti vyomasaṃhitāyām
||26||

śrīdharaḥ : adha āhārasañcāro yasya so'rvāksrotaḥ | hrasvatvam ārṣam |
nṛṇāṃ sargo nṛṇāṃ lakṣaṇam | rajo'dhikaṃ yeṣu te ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : arvāg adha āhārasañcāro yasya so'rvāksrotaḥ | hrasvatvam
ārṣam | nṛṇāṃ lakṣaṇam | raja ity ādi ||2326||


|| 3.10.27 ||

  vaikṛtās traya evaite devasargaś ca sattama |

  vaikārikas tu yaḥ proktaḥ kaumāras tūbhayātmakaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : duḥkhe ca sukhamānino surāḥ, sarvārthān viparītāṃś ca buddhiḥ
sāpārthatāmasīti vacanāt | sukhe sukhaikabhāvās tu devā naivaṃ tu dānavā
iti ṣāḍguṇye | 

kumārantīti kaumāro devānām antajodbhavaḥ |

vaikārikāṇāṃ jananāt prākṛto vaikṛtaś ca saḥ |

vaikārikeṣv evānyeṣām īṣadbhogitvahetutaḥ |

ubhayātmakatvenaiva procyante'ṣṭagaṇā api || iti ca |

devasargaś ceti cakārārtha ubhayātmakaḥ | vaikārikas tu devasargaḥ
prākṛtatvenoktaḥ ||27||

śrīdharaḥ : ete trayo vaikṛtā eva na kaumāravad ubhayātmakāḥ |
devasargaś ca vaikṛta ity anuṣaṅgaḥ | vaikārikas tu devasargaḥ prākṛteṣu pūrvam eva
proktaḥ | ayaṃ tu tato nyūnatvād vaikṛto devasargatvāt tad antarbhūtaś
ca | sanatkumārādīnāṃ sargas tu prākṛto vaikṛtaś ca devatvena
manuṣyatvena ca sṛjya ity arthaḥ ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yas tu vaikārikas tattvadevatārūpaḥ | sa tu proktaḥ
prākṛtatvān, na tu vaikṛto'tra procyate ity arthaḥ | kaumāras tu
ubhayātmaka iti teṣāṃ brahmaṇo manasy āvirbhūtamātratvāt tat
sṛjyāntaḥpātavivakṣayā ||27||

viśvanāthaḥ : ete trayo vaikṛtā eva | devasargaś ca vaikṛtaḥ | prākṛtaś
ca ka ity apekṣāyām āha—yas tu vaikārikaḥ vaikārikāhaṅkārabhavānāṃ
devānāṃ sargaḥ prākṛteṣu proktaḥ | punas teṣām eva brahmasṛṣṭatvād
vaikṛtaś ca „tathā kaumāraḥ sanatkumāraḥ sanatkumārādīnāṃ sargas tu
ubhayātmaka iti teṣāṃ bhagavaddhyānajanyatvena manasānyāṃs tato'sṛjad
ity agrimokter bhagavaddhyānajanyatvena bhagavajjanyatvena
brahmajanyatvāc ca prākṛto vaikṛtaś cety arthaḥ ||27||


  || 3.10.2829 ||

 devasargaś cāṣṭavidho vibudhāḥ pitaro'surāḥ |

gandharvāpsarasaḥ siddhā yakṣarakṣāṃsi cāraṇāḥ ||

 bhūtapretapiśācāś ca vidyādhrāḥ kinnarādayaḥ |

daśaite vidurākhyātāḥ sargās te viśvasṛkkṛtāḥ ||

madhvaḥ : proktā aṣṭavidhā devā vibudhā sarva eva tu |

pitèṇāṃ śatam evātra asurās triṃśad eva ca ||

gandharvāpsarasāṃ caiva dviśataṃ parikīrtitam |

saptatir yakṣarakṣaḥsu triṃśaccāraṇajātiṣu ||

śataṃ siddhās tathānyāsu saptatiḥ sarvajātiṣu |

ūrdhvasrotasa ete vai anye'rvāksrotaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

vaikārikeṣu deveṣu ete vai mukhyabhoginaḥ |

abhoginas tad anye tu devā ete tataḥ smṛtāḥ ||

sarvajñās te sahārādhyā bhaktās teṣv antar eva |

nṛtyagānādikartāro vāhanādi kṛtas tathā ||

siddhāsiddhetivaktāro cārāś caiṣāṃ kvacit kvacit |

sevākarā iti hy etair bhedair aṣṭavidhā matāḥ ||

anye ca ye tu sarvajñā vibudhās te prakīrtitāḥ |

tathānye karmabhis tais tair aṣṭabhedāntaraṃ gatāḥ || iti tattvaviveke |

yadi devādayo doṣāj jāyeran mānuṣādiṣu |

tathāpi devā vijñyeāsurādyās tu tathādhruvam || iti ca ||2829||

śrīdharaḥ : vaikṛtaś ca devasargo'ṣṭavidhaḥ | tatra vibudhādayas trayo
bhedāḥ | gandharvāpsarasa ekaḥ | yakṣarakṣāṃsy ekaḥ | bhūtapretapiśācā
ekaḥ | siddhacāraṇavidyādharā ekaḥ | kinnarādaya ekaḥ | ādiśabdāt
kiṃpuruṣāśvamukhādayaḥ | etad viṃśe'dhyāye spaṣṭaṃ bhaviṣyati ||2829||

kramasandarbhaḥ : devasarga iti sārdhakam ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : vaikṛtas tu devasargo'ṣṭabhedaḥ tatra vibudhādayas trayo
bhedāḥ gandharvāpsaras ekaḥ yakṣarakṣa;msy ekaḥ bhūtapretapiśācā ekaḥ
siddhacāraṇavidyādharā ekaḥ kinnarādayaḥ eka ity aṣṭau bhedāḥ |
ādiśabdāt kiṃpuruṣādayaḥ | viśvasṛk parameśvaro brahmā ca ||2829||


|| 3.10.30 ||

 ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi vaṃśān manvantarāṇi ca |

 evaṃ rajaḥplutaḥ sraṣṭā kalpādiṣv ātmabhūr hariḥ ||

  sṛjaty amoghasaṅkalpa ātmaivātmānam ātmanā ||

madhvaḥ :  guṇāpluto harir nityaṃ guṇānāṃ madhyago yataḥ |

anahaṃvedanāt tasya guṇāsaṃsparśa eva ca || iti ca |

sṛṣṭvā devādi dehān sa ātmānaṃ bahudhākarot |

tanniyantṛtayātmānaṃ prakṛtiṃ dehabhedataḥ || iti nāradīye |

kartā ca karaṇaṃ caiva karma caiva svayaṃ hariḥ |

ātmāno bahudḥā bhāve prakṛtes tu svatantratā || ity āgneye ||30||

śrīdharaḥ, kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : harir evātmabhūḥ sann ity anvayaḥ ||30||


 || 3.10.3132 ||

guṇavyatyaya etasmin māyāvitvād adhīśituḥ |

 na paurvāparyam icchanti sṛṣṭe nadyāṃ yathā bhrame ||

devāsurādayo nāmarūpābhyāṃ ye prakīrtitāḥ |

 asmin kalpe ta evāsan kṣattar manvantarāntare ||

śrīdharaḥ : nanu tarhi prathamaṃ sṛṣṭiḥ pralayo vā, tatrāha—guṇeti |
guṇavyatyaye sarge bhrāmyan bhramaṇaśīlo bhramir aviśeṣād bhrāmyad
bhramis tasya nadyāṃ bhramato yathā nādir nāntas tathā sṛṣṭisaṃhārayor
ity arthaḥ | saṃsārasyānāditvam ekarūpatvaṃ cāha—devāsurādaya iti | ta
eveti | tannāmānas tadrūpāś cety arthaḥ ||3132||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīye daśamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


 iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe viduramaitreyasaṃvāde

  tattvādyutpattikramo nāma

  daśamo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.10 ||

 (3.11)

  ekādaśo'dhyāyaḥ

  kālasvarūpakathanaṃ

 || 3.11.1 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

caramaḥ sadviśeṣāṇām aneko'saṃyutaḥ sadā |

 paramāṇuḥ sa vijñeyo nṛṇām aikyabhramo yataḥ ||

madhvaḥ : kālaparimāṇaṃ darśayituṃ dravyaparimāṇaṃ dṛṣṭāntatvena
darśayati |

manuṣyād eva loko'pi viśeṣeṇaiva darśane |

aṃśāṃśatvaviśeṣaṃ tu yasya draṣṭuṃ na śaknuyuḥ ||

caramo viśeṣa iti munayo śrūyur añjasā |

paramāṇuḥ sa vijñeyaḥ kaṇādādyā niraṃśinam ||

anantāṃśayutatve'pi yaṃ brūyur bhrāntidarśanāt |

tato'pi paramāṇutvaṃ tadaṃśānāṃ tu yadyapi |

anantatvād vivekārtham asyoktā paramāṇutā || iti tattvavivekaḥ |

anekāṃśair āsamantād ||1||

śrīdharaḥ :

 tata ekādaśe kālaḥ paramāṇvādilakṣaiḥ |

 yugamanvantarādibhyaḥ kalpam ānādi varṇyate ||

tad evaṃ sāmānyataḥ kālasyopalakṣaṇabhūtaṃ guṇavyatikaraṃ daśavidhaṃ
nirūpyedānīṃ tasyaiva viśeṣaṃ nirūpayituṃ tatparicchedyaṃ vastu lakṣayati
dvābhyām | sataḥ kāryasya viśeṣāṇām aṃśānāṃ yaś caramo'ntyo yasyāṃśo nāsti
| anekaḥ kāryāvasthām aprāptaḥ | asaṃyutaḥ samudāyāvasthāṃ cāprāptaḥ | ata
eva sadā kāryasamudāyāvasthayor apagame'py asti sa paramāṇur vijñeyaḥ |
kiṃ tatra pramāṇam ata āha—yato yebhyaḥ samuditebhyo nṛṇāṃ vyavahartèṇām
aikyabhramo'vayavibuddhiḥ | tathā ca pañcame'vayavinirākaraṇe vakṣyati,
yeṣāṃ samūhena kṛto viśeṣa iti | kāryānupapattyā kalpyata iti bhāvaḥ ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :

  ekādaśe punaḥ kālo viśeṣeṇāpi lakṣyate |

  māsavarṣayugādīnāṃ pramāṇaṃ jñāyate yataḥ ||

prathamam ātyantikaṃ sūkṣmakālaṃ svarūpato lakṣayitum aśaknuvaṃs tat
paricchedyaṃ vastu lakṣayati | sataḥ kāryasya pṛthivyāder viśeṣāṇām
aṃśānāṃ yaś caramaḥ, yasyāṃśo na sambhavati | nanu carama ity ekavacanāt
sa kim eka eva na, kintv anekaḥ | atra sūkṣmakālajñānārthaṃ teṣāṃ
bahutve'pi ekasyaivopayogitety ekavacanaprayogaḥ | nanu tarhi sa svair
milito'milito vā atropādīyata ity ata āha—asaṃyutaḥ paramāṇur vijñeya eva,
na tu dṛśyata ity arthaḥ | nanu tarhi tasya sattve kiṃ pramāṇaṃ
tatrāha—yataḥ yebhyaḥ samuditebhyaḥ nèṇām aikyam iti bhramo bhavati |
sūryaraśmiyukte gavākṣarandhre ye bhramanto'tisūkṣma eva kaṇa iti
buddhir bhavatīty arthaḥ | tasya ṣaṣṭho'ṃśa eva paramāṇuḥ sa tv adṛśya
evety arthaḥ | nèṇām ity uktyā trasareṇupramāṇadehānāṃ kīṭaviśeṣāṇāṃ
keṣāṃcit ko'pi dṛśya eveti vyajyate ||1||


 || 3.11.2 ||

  sata eva padārthasya svarūpāvasthitasya yat |

kaivalyaṃ paramamahān aviśeṣo nirantaraḥ ||

madhvaḥ : kālato deśato guṇataś ca paramamahattvam | sataḥ parabrahmaṇa
eva | sacchabdo'nyatrāpy upacārato bhavatīty ataḥ padārthasyeti |
satpadasya yo mukhyābhidheyas tasya |

mukhyābhidheyas tv arthaḥ syād vācyam anyac ca bhaṇyate |

amukhyeṣv arthaśabdas tu nīco parihito bhavet || iti brahmatarke |

yady eva samaḥ pluṣiṇety ādinānyatrasthitasya tatparimāṇatvam apy astīty
ataḥ svarūpāvasthitasyeti | jagadāvarakasvarūpasya tataḥ kiñcin
mahattvam itvam ity ataḥ kaivalyam iti | tatrāpi bahuvidhāni rūpāṇi tasya
santīti aviśeṣa iti | sarvagate prādeśamātram api vidyata ity ato
nirantara iti | parabrahmaṇo yaḥ kevalabhāvaḥ | aṇḍā'dyantaḥpraviṣṭaṃ
tadāvarakaṃ tasyaiva paramapuruṣādirūpāntaraṃ tad ekadeśaṃ prādeśaḥ
prādeśamātrādiviśeṣaṃ ca vinā yat sarvagataṃ rūpaṃ tad eva paramamahān
|

kālakoṭivihīnatvaṃ kālānantyaṃ vidur vadhāḥ |

deśakoṭivihīnatvaṃ deśānantyaṃ tathaiva ca ||

guṇānām aprameyatvaṃ vastvānantyaṃ vido viduḥ |

ānantyaṃ trividhaṃ nityaṃ harer nānyasya kasyacit ||

tasya sarvasvarūpeṣv apy ānantyaṃ tu trilakṣaṇam |

tathāpi deśatas tasya paricchedo'pi vidyate ||

paricchedas tathā vyāptir ekarūpe'pi yujyate |

tasyācintyādbhutaiśvaryād vyavahārārtham eva ca |

guṇataḥ kālataś caiva paricchedo na kutracit |

vyāptatvaṃ deśato'py asti sarvarūpeṣu yadyapi |

na ca bhedaḥ kvacit teṣām aṇumātro'pi .viśeṣ |

tathāpi .viśeṣe'ṇutvaṃ tasmād aiśvaryayogataḥ |

tasmād buddhyavatārārtham avyāptatvaṃ ca bhaṇyate ||

yat tasya vyāpakaṃ rūpaṃ paraṃ nārāyaṇābhidham |

śūnyaṃ brahmeti tat prāhur dvitīyaṃ sraṣṭṛ yat tataḥ ||

paramaḥ puruṣo nāma mitaṃ taddeśato vibhuḥ |

tṛtīyaṃ vāsudevākhyaṃ jagadāvarakaṃ mitam ||

deśato jagad āviṣṭaṃ turīyaṃ viṣṇunāmakam || iti brahmatarke |

sarvagatasyāpi brahmarūpasya kālādirūpayā prakṛtyā samavyāptāv api
dārṣṭāntikāntarbhāvāt tadanyasminn avasthānāc ca svarūpāvasthitasyety
uktam |

devyāṃ kālādirūpiṇyāṃ sthitaṃ brahmāpi sarvagam |

uttam'nanyagaṃ yasmād ātmavat sā harer vibhoḥ ||

mahadādigataṃ yat tu tadanyagatam uttam |  iti brāhme |

anjumitaḥ śāstralokānusāreṇa jñātaḥ | anumeti dvayaṃ prāhur yathā jñānaṃ
ca liṅgajam ity abhidhānam |

yāvantaṃ tad eva lokastho mānuṣas tv avadhārayet |

mahāprājño devajūkaḥ sa kālaḥ paramāṇukaḥ ||

sargādyair anavacchinnas tad anantara ity api |

tathaiva paramāṇvādiviśeṣātmāpi no bhavet ||

pūrvāparādibhedo na sa kālaḥ paramo mahān || iti brahmatarke |

svarūpāvasthitasya kaivalyam aviśeṣo nirantara ity etāni viśeṣaṇāni
krameṇa paramamahataḥ kālasyāpy atroktāni |

deśataḥ kālataś caiva vastutas tu tridhā hareḥ |

yathānantyaṃ na cānyasya prakṛter deśakālataḥ ||

tathā śabdasya kālasya deśānantyaṃ na kālataḥ |

kālaśabdātmik saiva tathāpi tu hareḥ sadā ||

nāsyāḥ sāmarthyaleśo'pi jñānānandaguṇeṣv api |

jñeyas tad avaro vāyuḥ śeṣavīndraharās tataḥ ||

avarās tata indrādyā guṇaiḥ sarvair na saṃśayaḥ || iti brahmavaivarte ||

aṇvādi kālasaṃsthānabhoktṛtvāt parameśvaraḥ |

aṇvādināmavācyo'sau kālaś cety abhidhīyate || iti ca |

sato brahmaṇaḥ aviśeṣaṃ svarūpaṃ yaḥ kālaḥ kālāntaryāmī, tad eva brahma
bhuṅkte | tad api brahma paramamahān, tasyāpi tridhā paricchedābhāvāt |

sarvaṃ sarvatra bhoktāpi viśeṣād ekabhoktṛvat |

sthito harir acintyātmā nijaiśvaryād ajo vibhuḥ || iti brahmatarke
||24||

śrīdharaḥ : sūkṣmam uktvā sthūlam āha—sata eveti | yasya caramo'ṃśaḥ
paramāṇus tasyaiva sataḥ kāryamātrasya svarūpāvasthitasya pariṇāmāntaram
aprāptasya yat kaivalyam aikyaṃ sa paramamahān | puṃstvaṃ tu
paramāṇupratiyogitvāt | nanu nānāviśeṣavān parasparaṃ bhinnaś ca sarvaḥ
padārthaḥ, katham aikyaṃ tasya ? tatrāha—aviśeṣo viśeṣavivakṣārahito
nirantaro bhedavivakṣārahitaś ca sarvo'pi prapañcaḥ paramamahān ity
arthaḥ ||2||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ātyantikaṃ sūkṣmam uktvā ātyantikaṃ sūkṣmam apy āha—yasya
caramo'mśáḥ paramāṇus tasyaiva sataḥ kāryamātrasya svarūpāvasthitasya
pralayapariṇāmaprāgbhūtasya yat kaivalyam aikyaṃ sa paramamahān
puṃstvaṃ tu paramāṇupratiyogitvāt | nanu nānāviśeṣavān parasparaṃ
bhinnaś ca sarvaḥ padārthaḥ, katham aikyaṃ tasya ? tatrāha—aviśeṣo
viśeṣavivakṣārahito nirantaro bhedavivakṣārahitaś ca sarvo'pi
prapañcaḥ paramamahān ity arthaḥ ||2||


 || 3.11.3 ||

  evaṃ kālo'py anumitaḥ saukṣmye sthaulye ca sattama |

saṃsthānabhuktyā bhagavān avyakto vyaktabhug vibhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : yathā sūkṣmaḥ sthūlaś cāyaṃ padārthaḥ—evaṃ kālo'py anumitaḥ |
cakārān madhyamāvasthā gṛhyate | saṃsthānaṃ paramāṇvādyavasthānasya
bhuktir vyāptis tayā bhagavān iti hareḥ śaktiḥ svato'vyakto bhuṅkte
vyāpnoti paricchinattīti tathā | vibhur utpattyādiṣu dakṣaḥ ||3||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yathā sūkṣmaḥ sthūlaś cāyaṃ padārthaḥ—evaṃ kālo'py anumito
jñātaḥ | kena prakāreṇa ? saṃsthānaṃ paramāṇuparamamahatoḥ svarūpaṃ
tasya bhuktyā vyāptyā bhagavacchaktitvād bhāgavat svato'vyakto vyaktaṃ
sarvaprapañcaṃ bhuṅkte vyāpnoti paricchinattīti tathā | vibhur ata eva
vyāpakaḥ, utpattyādiṣu dakṣo vā ||3||


 || 3.11.4 ||

 sa kālaḥ paramāṇur vai yo bhuṅkte paramāṇutām |

 sato'viśeṣabhug yas tu sa kālaḥ paramo mahān ||

śrīdharaḥ : etad eva prapañcayati—sa ityādinā | sataḥ prapañcasya
paramāṇutāṃ paramāṇvavasthāṃ yo bhuṅkte, sa kālaḥ paramāṇuḥ |
tasyaivāviśeṣaṃ sākalyaṃ yo bhuṅkte, sa paramamahān | ayam
arthaḥ—graharkṣatārācakrastha [bhā.pu. 3.11.13] ity ādinā yat
sūryaparyaṭanaṃ vakṣyate, tatra sūryo yāvatā paramāṇudeśam atikrāmati
tāvān kālaḥ paramāṇuḥ | yāvatā ca dvādaśarāśyātmakaṃ sarvaṃ
bhuvanakośam atikrāmati, sa paramamahān saṃvatsarātmakaḥ kālaḥ |
tasyaivāvṛttyā yugamanvantarādikrameṇa dviparārdhāntatvam iti | tathā
ca pañcame sūryagatyaiva kālādivibhāgaṃ vakṣyati ||4||

kramasandarbhaḥ : evaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.10.3] iti yad uktaṃ tad eva vivṛṇoti—sa
kāla iti | atra ṭīkāyāṃ paramāṇudeśam atikrāmati ity atra
madhyamavīthīmayajyotiścakragatyeti jñeyam | sarvaṃ bhuvanakoṣam
atikrāmati ity atra tu svagatyeti jñeyam | yo bhuṅkte paramāṇutām ity
atra ca sūryarūpeṇa paramāṇudeśātikrāmitām ity evārthaḥ | vakṣyate ca
tasya kālasya sūryeṇābhedaḥ—yaḥ sṛjyaśaktim urudhā [bhā.pu. 3.11.15] ity
anena | yad vā, paramāṇutāṃ tatpadārthavat paramasūkṣmāvasthatāṃ yo
bhuṅkte vyāpnoti sa kālaḥ paramāṇuḥ | sataḥ prapañcasyāviśeṣabhuk
sṛṣṭyādisaṃhāraparyantaṃ sarvam eva vyāpnoti yaḥ, sa kālaḥ paramamahān
dviparārdharūpa ity arthaḥ | tathā ca vakṣyate kālo'yaṃ paramāṇvādi
dviparārdhāntaḥ [bhā.pu. 3.11.38] iti ||4||

viśvanāthaḥ : sambhoktety asyārthaṃ vivṛṇoti—sataḥ kāryasya paramāṇutāṃ
paramāṇusvarūpaṃ yaḥ kālo bhuṅkte, sūryarūpeṇa atikrāmyati sa paramāṇuḥ
| graharkṣa [bhā.pu. 3.11.13] iti vakṣyamāṇavākyadṛṣṭyā yāvatā kālena
sūryaḥ paramāṇudeśam atikrāmati, tāvān kālaḥ paramāṇur ity arthaḥ | sa ca
tasyaiva aviśeṣaṃ sarvam eva prapañcaṃ bhuṅkte vatsarayugādyāvṛttyā
sūryarūpī yaḥ kālaḥ sa paramamahān sṛṣṭim ārabhya prapañcasya
saṃhāraparyantaṃ yāvān kālaḥ tāvān sarva eva paramamahān ity arthaḥ |
tatra paramāṇvaṇutrasareṇūnāṃ kāryāṃśānāṃ saṃjñapramāṇe tulye eva,
tathā paramamahataḥ kāryasya kālasya ca saṃjñeva tulyā tanmadhyasthānāṃ
saṃjñāpramāṇayor bhinnatvam iti jñeyam ||4||


 || 3.11.5 ||

aṇur dvau paramāṇū syāt trasareṇus trayaḥ smṛtaḥ |

 jālārkaraśmyavagataḥ kham evānupatann agāt ||

madhvaḥ : agāt dṛṣṭiviṣayaṃ prāpya jñāta ity arthaḥ, rāśibhedāt ||5||

śrīdharaḥ : idānīṃ hvyaṇukādilakṣaṇapūrvakaṃ madhyamakālāvasthāṃ
kathayati | dvau paramāṇū aṇuḥ syāt | trayo'ṇavas trasareṇuḥ | sa tu
pratyakṣa ity āha—jālārketi | gavākṣapraviṣṭeṣv arkaraśmiṣv avagataḥ |
ko'sau ? yo'tilaghutvena svam evānupatann agād gataḥ | pāṭhāntare svam
evānupatann avagataḥ, na tu gāṃ pṛthvīm ||5||

kramasandarbhaḥ : aṇur dvāv iti padyaṃ padārthakālayoḥ sāmānyavacanaṃ
dṛṣṭāntadārṣṭāntikabhāvanaikanāmatvena ca ||5||

viśvanāthaḥ : dvau paramāṇū aṇuḥ syāt | trayo'ṇavas trasareṇuḥ, sa tu
pratyakṣa ity āha—jālārketi | gavākṣapraviṣṭeṣv arkaraśmiṣu kham
evātilāghavena anupatann avagataś cakṣuṣā jñātaḥ, na tu gāṃ pṛthvīm | agād
iti pāṭhe tathābhūtaś calatīty arthaḥ | atrāṇuparamāṇvoḥ sattve kiṃ
jñāpakam iti cet trasareṇur eva | tathā hi avayavānāṃ sthaulyapracuratve
vinā avayavī kalpyā, na tu paramāṇavas teṣāṃ sthaulyābhāvāt sthaulyam
anekavastughaṭitatvam ity aṇoḥ sthaulyaṃ paramāṇuṃ vinā na sambhaved iti
paramāṇusiddhiḥ | trasareṇor dṛśyatvam avayavasthaulyaṃ vinā na
sambhaved ity aṇusiddhiḥ | tathā aṇoḥ sthaulyārthaṃ paramāṇor dvitvam eva
kalpyate, na tu tritvacatuṣṭvādikaṃ prathamopasthites tantratvād iti
nyāyāt | yathā kapiñjalān ālabhate prācuryārtham aṇor api tritvam eva
kalpyate tathā yukter iti ||5||


 || 3.11.6 ||

 trasareṇutrikaṃ bhuṅkte yaḥ kālaḥ sa truṭiḥ smṛtaḥ |

  śatabhāgas tu vedhaḥ syāt tais tribhis tu lavaḥ smṛtaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : śataṃ bhāgāḥ truṭirūpā yasmin sa vedhaḥ ||6||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : trasareṇutrikam iti | tirbhis trasareṇubhiḥ truṭiḥ | sūcyā
bhinne padmapātre truṭir ity abhidhīyate  iti sūryasiddhāntaḥ | yāvatā
kālena padmapuṣpapatraṃ bhidyate tāvān kālaḥ truṭir ity arthaḥ | śataṃ
bhāgāḥ truṭirūpā yasmin sa vedhaḥ truṭiśatena vedha ity arthaḥ | tais
tribhir lavaḥ ||6||


 || 3.11.7 ||

nimeṣas trilavo jñeya āmnātas te trayaḥ kṣaṇaḥ |

  kṣaṇān pañca viduḥ kāṣṭhāṃ laghu tā daśa pañca ca ||

śrīdharaḥ : te nimeṣās trayaḥ kṣaṇa ity āmnātaḥ | kāṣṭhāḥ pañcadaśa ekaṃ
laghu ||7||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : te nimeṣās trayaḥ kṣaṇa ity āmnātaḥ | kathitāḥ tāḥ kāṣṭhāḥ
pañcadaśa ekaṃ laghu bhavati ||7||


 || 3.11.8 ||

laghūni vai samāmnātā daśa pañca ca nāḍikā |

  te dve muhūrtaḥ praharaḥ ṣaḍ yāmaḥ sapta vā nṛṇām ||

madhvaḥ : ūnātirekāt sapta veti ||8||

śrīdharaḥ : nāḍikāḥ ṣaṭ sapta vā praharaḥ | sa eva yāmo dinasya rātreś ca
caturtho bhāgaḥ | hrāse ṣaṭ vṛddhau sapta | sandhyāṃśamuhūrtadvayaṃ
vineti jñātavyam | tatrāpy aniyamārtho vāśabdaḥ | pratyahaṃ tad bhedānāṃ
gaṇayitum aśakyatvāt ||8||

kramasandarbhaḥ : ṣaṭ sapta veti | vāśabdas tatra sarvam evāntaraṃ
samuccinoti ||8||

viśvanāthaḥ :  nāḍikā daṇḍaḥ te dve nāḍike | ṣaṭ sapta vā nāḍikāḥ praharaḥ
sa eva yāmo'pi | dinasya rātreś ca caturthabhāgaḥ | hrāse ṣaṭ
vṛddhipravṛttau sapta | sandhyādvayaghaṭikāṃ vineti jñeyam | tatrāpy
aniyame vāśabdaḥ | pratyahaṃ tadbhedānāṃ gaṇayitum aśakyatvāt ||8||


 || 3.11.9 ||

dvādaśārdhapalonmānaṃ caturbhiś caturaṅgulaiḥ |

svarṇamāṣaiḥ kṛtacchidraṃ yāvat prasthajalaplutam ||

madhvaḥ : kākaṇikācatuṣkaṃ tu viṃśāṃśety abhidhīyate |

kṛṣṇalety api taṃ brūyus taiś caturbhis tu māṣakam ||

caturaṅguladīrghe tu kṛte māsacatuṣṭayam |

yāvat syāt pariṇāhena tāvad dvāraṃ vidhīyate ||

prasthasya nāḍīpātrasya ṣaṭdalasya śubhe jale |

bhārādhikye nodakena kṣipraṃ pūrtir bhaviṣyati ||

atiśaitye kalaṅke ca māghenaiva tu pūraṇam |

tasmād vasantakāle tu prayāgasthodakena tu ||

nāḍīśuddhiparīkṣā syād anyathā na sambhavet || iti pādme |

nirmalena samoṣṇena nityasūryāṃśuvāriṇā |

pravāhagena kāryā syāt kaliśuddhiḥ sadaiva tu || iti brahmāṇḍe ||9||

śrīdharaḥ : nāḍikāyā unmānam āha—unmīyate'nenety unmānaṃ pātraṃ
ṣaṭpalatāmraviracitam | pañcaguñjo māṣas taiś caturbhiś
caturaṅgulāyāmaśalākārūpeṇa racitaiḥ kṛtamūlacchidraṃ tena chidreṇa
yāvat prasthaparimitaṃ jalaṃ praviśati tena ca plutaṃ nimagnaṃ bhavati
tāvān kālo nāḍikā | atra palacchidrayor ādhikye śīghraṃ nimajjed alpatve
ca vilambeneti palaśalākayor niyamaḥ ||9||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : nāḍīkāyā unmānam āha—unmīyate'nenety unmānaṃ
ṣaṭpalatāmraracitaṃ pātraṃ catuḥṣaṣṭyā māṣaiḥ palaṃ bhavati |
pañcaguñjā māṣaḥ taiś caturbhiś caturaṅgulāyāmaśalākārūpeṇa racitaiḥ
kṛtamūlacchidraṃ tena chidreṇayāvat prasthaparimitaṃ jalaṃ praviśati |
tena ca plutaṃ nimagnaṃ bhavati tāvān kālo nāḍikā atra palacchidrayor
ādhikye śīghraṃ nimajjet | alpatve ca vilambeneti palaśalākayor niyamas
tatrāpi rajatādiśalākayā chidrapuṣṭiḥ syād iti svarṇasyāpi niyamaḥ ||9||


|| 3.11.10 ||

  yāmāś catvāraś catvāro martyānām ahanī ubhe |

 pakṣaḥ pañcadaśāhāni śuklaḥ kṛṣṇaś ca mānada ||

madhvaḥ : yatrobhayoḥ saśabdaḥ syāt tatra dvivacane'py ubha ity
abhidhānam ||10||

śrīdharaḥ, viśvanāthaḥ : ahanī ahorātram ||10||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.


|| 3.11.11 ||

  tayoḥ samuccayo māsaḥ pitèṇāṃ tad aharniśam |

dvau tāv ṛtuḥ ṣaḍ ayanaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ cottaraṃ divi ||

śrīdharaḥ : ṣaṇmāsā ayanam | divīty asyottareṇānvayaḥ ||11||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : ṣaṇmāsā ayanam | divīty asyottareṇānvayaḥ ||11||


|| 3.11.12 ||

ayane cāhanī prāhur vatsaro dvādaśa smṛtaḥ |

  saṃvatsaraśataṃ nèṇāṃ paramāyur nirūpitam ||

śrīdharaḥ : divīti devānām ahorātre prāhūḥ | dvādaśa māsāḥ ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : graharkṣeti sūryagatimātrakathanaṃ, na tu
kālāvasānatātparyakaṃ saṃvatsarasya paramamahattvāyogāt ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : te ayane divi devānām ahanī ahorātrau dvādaśamāsā vatsaraḥ
||12||


|| 3.11.13 ||

graharkṣatārācakrasthaḥ paramāṇvādinā jagat |

saṃvatsarāvasānena paryety animiṣo vibhuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : anena krameṇāsau sūryo nityam āyuḥ kṣapayatīty āha—grahāś
candrādayaḥ, ṛkṣāṇy aśviny ādīni, tārā anyaṇi nakṣatrāṇi, tad upalakṣitaṃ
yat kālacakraṃ, tatra sthito'nimiṣaḥ kālātmā vibhur īśvaraḥ sūryo jagad
dvādaśarāśyātmakaṃ bhuvanakośaṃ paryeti paryaṭati ||13||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tac ca nṛṇām āyur udayāstamayābhyāṃ sūryo haratīty
āha—grahāś candrādayaḥ ṛkṣāṇy aśvinyādīni tārā anyāni nakṣatrāṇi teṣāṃ
cakre maṇḍale tiṣṭhatīti jyotiścakrastha ity arthaḥ | animiṣaḥ
kālasvarūpaḥ vibhur īśvarāṃśaḥ paryeti parikrāmati ||13||


|| 3.11.14 ||

saṃvatsaraḥ parivatsara iḍāvatsara eva ca |

 anuvatsaro vatsaraś ca viduraivaṃ prabhāṣyate ||

madhvaḥ : iḍāvatsaranāmāsau nakṣatradvādaśasthitaḥ |

tithīnāṃ dvādaśāvarte yo hariḥ so'nuvatsaraḥ ||

vatsaro yaḥ sthitas tv ahnāṃ ṣaṣṭyuttaraśatatraye |

gurvāvarte dvādaśāṃśe yaḥ sthaḥ sa parivatsaraḥ ||

sauradvādaśake māse yaḥ sthaḥ saṃvatsaro hariḥ |

evaṃ sa kālanāmāpi kālasthaḥ parameśvaraḥ || iti brahmatarke |

sarvadā darśanāt tasyānimiṣatvaṃ vidur budhāḥ |

satataṃ gamanād vāpi kālasthasya mahātmanaḥ || iti ca ||14||

śrīdharaḥ : saṃvatsarādibhedaś ca
saurabārhaspatyasāvanacāndranākṣatramāsabhedena draṣṭavyaḥ | kecit
punar evam āhuḥ | yadā śuklapakṣapratipadi saṅkrāntir bhavati
sauracāndramāsayor yugapad upakramo bhavati sa saṃvatsaraḥ | tataḥ
sauramānena varṣe ṣaṭ dināni vardhante cāndramānena varṣe ṣaṭ dināni
hrasantīti dvādaśadinavyavadhānād ubhayor agrapaścād bhāvo bhavati |
evaṃ vyavadhānatāratamyena pañcavarṣāṇi gacchanti | tanmadhye dvau
malamāsau bhavataḥ | punaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ saṃvatsaro bhavati ||14||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : graharkṣatārācakrastha ity uktam, ataḥ sūryagatyā
grahādīnāṃ gatyā varyasya nāmabhedān āha—saṃvatsara iti sauragatyā |
parivatsara iti bārhaspatyagatyā | anuvatsara iti cāndragatyā |
ṛkṣatārāṇāṃ svato gatyabhāvāt cakragatir eva gatir iti | tatrāpi
ṛkṣāṇāṃ saptaviṃśatidinamānair māsair dvādaśabhir vatsara iti | tārāṇāṃ
saṅkhyābhāvāt triṃśaddinapramāṇaiḥ sāvanair māsair idāvatsara iti jñeyam
||14||


|| 3.11.15 ||

yaḥ sṛjyaśaktim urudhocchvasayan svaśaktyā

 puṃso'bhramāya divi dhāvati bhūtabhedaḥ |

  kālākhyayā guṇamayaṃ kratubhir vitanvaṃs

  tasmai baliṃ harata vatsarapañcakāya ||

madhvaḥ : abhramāyābhūtabhedakaḥ kratubhiḥ svaprajñābhiḥ |

bhūtānāṃ jyaiṣṭhakaniṣṭhājñaptyai yajñādivṛttaye |

bodhayan sṛjyaśaktiṃ ca kālastho vartate hariḥ || iti tantraprakāśikāyām
||15||

śrīdharaḥ : evaṃbhūtaḥ kālātmā vityamapramattaiḥ pūjanīya ity āha—ya iti
| sṛjyaṃ kāryam aṅkurādi tadviṣayāṃ bījādīnāṃ śaktiṃ kālarūpayā
svaśaktyā bahudhocchvasayan kāryābhimukhīkurvan divy antarikṣe dhāvati |
ko'sau ? bhūtabhedo mahābhūtaviśeṣas tejomaṇḍalarūpī sūryaḥ | kim
arthaṃ dhāvati | puruṣasyābhramāya bhramo mohas tan nivṛttaye |
āyurādivyayena viṣayāsaktiṃ nivartayann ity arthaḥ | sakāmānāṃ tu
guṇamayaṃ svargādiphalaṃ kratubhir vistārayan | tasmai
saṃvatsarapañcakapravartakāya pūjāṃ kuruta ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kimartham idaṃ vatsarabhedakalpanam iti cet
tattadvarṣavihitadharmādisiddhyartham ity āha—ya iti | sṛjyānām
udbhijjādīnāṃ śaktim aṅkurādau sāmarthyaṃ svaśaktyā kālarūpayā urudhā
ucchvasayan prakāśayan divi antarīkṣe dhāvati ko'sau bhūtabhedaḥ
mahābhūtaviśeṣas tejomaṇḍalarūpī sūryaḥ kimarthaṃ dhavati puṃsaḥ
puruṣasya abhramāya diṅmāhādinivṛttaye sakāmānāṃ guṇamayaṃ
svargādiphalaṃ saṃvatsarādivihitakarmakālajñāpanayā kratubhir
anuṣṭheyaiḥ | tasmāt tasmai vatsarapañcakapravartakāya kalim
ardhyādipūjopahāraṃ datta | he dhārmikalokāḥ ! ||15||


|| 3.11.16 ||

vidura uvāca —

  pitṛdevamanuṣyāṇām āyuḥ param idaṃ smṛtam |

  pareṣāṃ gatim ācakṣva ye syuḥ kalpād bahir vidaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : idaṃ svasvamānena varṣaśataṃ gaṇitam āyur mānam | pratyahaṃ
kalpyate sṛjyate iti kalpas trailokyaṃ tasmād bāhyataḥ | vido jñāninaḥ |

kramasandarbhaḥ : pitrādīnām āyur idam iti | tad etad yathāsvaṃ
pūrvoktakālagaṇanātmakam ity arthaḥ | śataṃ tu nṛṇām eva | pūrvaṃ nṛṇāṃ
pitèṇāṃ devānāṃ ca kālasaṅkhyānam uktvā saṃvatsaraśataṃ nèṇāṃ paramāyur
nirūpitam iti nirdhāritatvāt | indrādīnāṃ manvantarasthāyinām
adhikaparimāṇaprāptiś ca pareṣāṃ brahmasanakādīnāṃ kalpād brahmadinād
bahir ye syuḥ jīvanti ||16||

viśvanāthaḥ : idaṃ svasvamānena varṣaśataṃ ye vido vidvāṃsaḥ kalpād
dainandinād bahiḥ paratrāpi tiṣṭhanti, teṣāṃ sanakādīnāṃ bhṛgvādīnāṃ ca
gatim āyuḥ ||16||


|| 3.11.17 ||

bhagavān veda kālasya gatiṃ bhagavato nanu |

 viśvaṃ vicakṣate dhīrā yogarāddhena cakṣuṣā ||

śrīdharaḥ : yogarāddhena yogasiddhena ||17||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : bhagavān bhavān yogarāddhena yogasiddhena ||17||


|| 3.11.18 ||

  maitreya uvāca —

 kṛtaṃ tretā dvāparaṃ ca kaliś ceti caturyugam |

  divyair dvādaśabhir varṣaiḥ sāvadhānaṃ nirūpitam ||

śrīdharaḥ : dvādaśabhir varṣasahasrair ity uttaraślokasāmarthyāj
jñātavyam | avadhīyate ity avadhānaṃ sandhyā cāṃśaś ca tatsahitam ||18||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kṛtam ity ādīnām ayam arthaḥ—manuṣyāṇāṃ
ṣaṣṭyadhikatriśataparimitair varṣaiḥ (360) devānāṃ varṣaṃ, tair
dvādaśabhiḥ sahasrais teṣāṃ caturyugam | tac ca manuṣyāṇāṃ
viṃśatisahasrādhikatricatvāriṃśallakṣagaṇitaṃ (432000)
varṣasaṅkhyākaṃ bhavati | tāvad eva satyādicaturyugam | yataḥ satyaṃ
(1728000) tretā (1296000) dvāparaḥ (864000) kaliḥ (432000) iti evaṃ
devānāṃ yugasahasradvayaṃ brahmaṇo'horātraḥ | tac ca manuṣyāṇāṃ
padmāṣṭakaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭikoṭyadhikaṃ (800000640000000) iti ||18||

viśvanāthaḥ : kalpabahirāyuṣo hi bhṛgvādayo brahmatulyāyuṣa eva
bhavantīti brahmaṇa āyur vaktuṃ yugādīnāṃ mānam āha—kṛtam iti | varṣair
varṣasahasraiḥ | avadhīyata ity avadhānaṃ sandhyāsandhyāṃśaś ca
tatsahitam ||18||


|| 3.11.19 ||

 catvāri trīṇi dve caikaṃ kṛtādiṣu yathākramam |

  saṅkhyātāni sahasrāṇi dviguṇāni śatāni ca ||

śrīdharaḥ : kṛtayuge catvāri sahasrāṇi sandhyāsandhyāṃśayoś
catvāricatvārīty aṣṭau śatāni ca | evaṃ tretādiṣv api yojyam ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : yathākramam iti | kṛtayuge catvāri sahasrāṇi |
sandhyāsandhyāṃśayoś catvāricatvārīty aṣṭau śatāni | evaṃ tretādiṣv api
yojyam ||19||


|| 3.11.20 ||

sandhyāsandhyāṃśayor antar yaḥ kālaḥ śatasaṅkhyayoḥ |

tam evāhur yugaṃ tajjñā yatra dharmo vidhīyate ||

śrīdharaḥ : yugasyādau sandhyā ante'ṃśaḥ sandhyāṃśaḥ | uktāni śatāni
saṅkhyā yayos tayor antareṇa madhye yugam | tasya viśeṣam āha—yatreti |
gavālambhādidharmaviśeṣo yatra vidhīyat ity arthaḥ | sādhāraṇadharmas
tu sandhyāṃśayor apy asty eva ||20||

kramasandarbhaḥ : sandhyāsandhyāṃśayor antar ity atra
sandhyāsandhyāṃśayor anta iti ||20||

viśvanāthaḥ :  yugasyādau sandhyā ante'ṃśaḥ sandhyāṃśaḥ | tayoḥ
kathambhūtayoḥ ? uktāni śatāni saṅkhyā yayos tayor antarmadhyavartī yaḥ
kālas taṃ yugam āhuḥ | yatra dharma iti
dhyānayajñaparicaryākīrtanātmako dharmaviśeṣaḥ | sādhāraṇadharmas tu
guṇabhūtaḥ | sandhyāṃśayor apy asty eva | kiṃ ca, yasya yugasya yo
dharmaḥ, sa eva tatsandhyāsandhyāṃśayor api pradhānībhūtaḥ iti jñeyam |
manuṣyāṇāṃ ṣaṣṭyadhikatriśatavarṣair devānām ekavarṣam | evaṃ
manuṣyāṇāṃ viṃśatisahasrādhikatricatvāriṃśallakṣavarṣaiś caturyugaṃ
śāstreṣu yugaśabdenocyate | tatrāṣṭāviṃśasahasrādhikasaptadaśalakṣair
varṣaiḥ satyaṃ, ṣaṇṇavatisahasrādhikadvādaśalakṣais tretā |
catuḥṣaṣṭhisahasrādhikāṣṭalakṣair dvāparaḥ |
dvātriṃśatsahasrādhikacaturlakṣaiḥ kaliḥ ||20||


|| 3.11.21 ||

  dharmaś catuṣpān manujān kṛte samanuvartate |

  sa evānyeṣv adharmeṇa vyeti pādena vardhatā ||

śrīdharaḥ : catuṣpāt saṃpūrṇaḥ | tretādiṣu pādena pādena vyeti hrasati |
pādena pādena vardhamānenādharmeṇa hetunā | etac ca svarūpakathanamātraṃ
vairāgyārthaṃ na tu dharmasaṅkocanārtham ||21||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : catuṣpāt pūrṇaḥ | manujānulakṣīkṛtya anyeṣu tretādiṣu
adharmeṇa pādena pādena vardhatā vardhamānena hetunā vyeti pādena pādena
hrasati ||21||


|| 3.11.22 ||

 trilokyā yugasāhasraṃ bahir ābrahmaṇo dinam |

  tāvaty eva niśā tāta yan nimīlati viśvasṛk ||

śrīdharaḥ : trilokyā bahir maharlokaprabhṛtibrahmalokam abhivyāpya
caturyugasahasram ekaṃ dinam | yad yasyāṃ viśvasṛk brahmā nimīlati
svapiti ||22||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ :  trilokyā bahir maharlokaprabhṛtibrahmalokam abhivyāpya
caturyugasahasram ekaṃ dinam | yad yasyāṃ viśvasṛg brahmā nimīlati,
tadaiva svapantaṃ garbhodaśāyinam anusvapiti | evaṃ yugasahasradvayaṃ
brahmaṇo'horātraḥ | tatra manuṣyāṇāṃ
catuḥṣaṣṭhikoṭyadhikāṣṭapadmavarṣāṇi bhavanti ||22||


|| 3.11.23 ||

 niśāvasāna ārabdho lokakalpo'nuvartate |

yāvad dinaṃ bhagavato manūn bhuñjaṃś caturdaśa ||

śrīdharaḥ : tatra dinasthitim āha—niśāvasāna ityādisārdhaiś caturbhiḥ |
caturdaśamanūn bhuñjan pālayan | vyāpnuvann ity arthaḥ ||23||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tatra dinasthitim āha—niśāvasāna ityādisārdhaiś caturbhiḥ
| caturdaśamanūn bhuñjan pālayan | vyāpnuvann ity arthaḥ ||23||


|| 3.11.24 ||

svaṃ svaṃ kālaṃ manur bhuṅkte sādhikāṃ hy ekasaptatim |

  manvantareṣu manavas tadvaṃśyā ṛṣayaḥ surāḥ |

 bhavanti caiva yugapat sureśāś cānu ye ca tān ||

madhvaḥ : dinastho bhagavān bhoktā |

yugaikasaptater ūrdhvaṃ sārdhāṣṭādaśalakṣakam |

vatsarāṇāṃ manor bhuktiḥ sahasraṃ caturuttaram |

śatānāṃ pralayaś caiva pañcottaram athāpi ca |

ādyeṣu ṣaṭsu prathame dvisāhasrāṃ prakīrtitam |

vatsarāṇāṃ manor antar evam indrādīnāṃ bhavet || iti mahāvārāhe ||24||

śrīdharaḥ : kiñcid adhikāṃ yugānām ekasaptatim | manuvaṃśyāḥ
pṛthvīpālakāḥ krameṇa bhavanti | saptarṣiprabhṛtayas tu yugapat
samakālam eva bhavanti | sureśā indrāḥ | tān anuvartante ye
gandharvādayas te'pi ||24||

kramasandarbhaḥ : svaṃ svam ity ardhakam ||24||

viśvanāthaḥ : manuḥ svāyambhuvādiḥ kiñcid adhikāṃ caturyugānām
ekasaptatiṃ kālaṃ vyāpya tatra devamānena dvipañcāśatsahasrādhikāny
aṣṭalakṣāṇi varṣāṇi bhavanti, manuṣyamānena tu tirṃśatkoṭyaḥ
saptaṣaṣṭalakṣāṇi viṃśatiḥ sahasrāṇīti | tathoktaṃ viṣṇupurāṇe—

triṃśatkoṭyas tu sampūrṇāḥ saṅkhyātāḥ saṅkhyayā dvija |

saptaṣaṣṭis tathānyāni niyutāni mahāmune |

viṃśatiś ca sahasrāṇi kālo'yam adhikaṃ vinā |

manvantarasya saṅkhyeyaṃ mānuṣair vatsarair dvija || iti |

manuvaṃśaḥ pṛthvīpālakaḥ krameṇa bhavati | saptarṣiprabhṛtayas tu
yugapat samakālam eva bhavanti | sureśā indrās tān anuvartante ye
gandharvādayas te'pi ||24||


|| 3.11.25 ||

eṣa dainandinaḥ sargo brāhmas trailokyavartanaḥ |

tiryaṅnṛpitṛdevānāṃ sambhavo yatra karmabhiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : trailokyaṃ vartayatīti tathā ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yugapad iti svasvamanvantara ity arthaḥ ||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : trailokye vartate iti sa trailokyasṛṣṭir ity arthaḥ ||25||


|| 3.11.26 ||

 manvantareṣu bhagavān bibhrat sattvaṃ svamūrtibhiḥ |

 manvādibhir idaṃ viśvam avaty uditapauruṣaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : svamūrtibhir manvantarāvatārair manvādibhir dvārabhūtair
āviṣkṛtapuruṣakāraḥ san viśvaṃ rakṣati ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : svamūrtibhir avatārair uditapauruṣa āviṣkṛtapuruṣākāraḥ
||26||


|| 3.11.27 ||

  tamomātrām upādāya pratisaṃruddhavikramaḥ |

 kālenānugatāśeṣa āste tūṣṇīṃ dinātyaye ||

śrīdharaḥ : rātrigatāṃ sthitim āha pañcabhiḥ | tamaso mātraṃ leśam |
pratisaṃruddhaḥ pratyāhṛto vikramo yena | anugatam anupraviṣṭam aśeṣaṃ
yasmin ||27||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : rātrigatāṃ sthitim āha—tamaso mātrāṃ
trailokyamātrasaṃhārārthaṃ leśaṃ kālāgnirudrarūpeṇa svīkṛtya saṃhāraṃ
pratisaṃruddho vahnyādibhir āvṛto vikramo bhūrādilokatrayaṃ yena saḥ |
vikramo bhūrbhuvaḥsvar iti pūrvokteḥ | tataś cānugatam anupraviṣṭam
aśeṣaṃ yasmin trailokyasthajīvavṛndaṃ yatra saḥ | tūṣṇīṃ
tyaktamāyikalīlāvinoda ity arthaḥ ||27||


|| 3.11.28 ||

 tam evānv api dhīyante lokā bhūrādayas trayaḥ |

  niśāyām anuvṛttāyāṃ nirmuktaśaśibhāskaram ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad eva spaṣṭayati—tam eveti | anv api dhīyanta iti
karmakartariprayogaḥ | tirohitā bhavantīty arthaḥ | kathaṃ ? nirmukto
rahitaḥ śaśī bhaṣkaraś ca yathā bhavati tathā ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : tad eva spaṣṭayati—tam eveti | anv api dhīyanta iti
karmakartariprayogaḥ | tirohitā bhavantīty arthaḥ | kathaṃ ? nirmukto
rahitaḥ śaśī bhaṣkaraś ca yathā bhavati tathā ||28||


|| 3.11.29 ||

 trilokyāṃ dahyamānāyāṃ śaktyā saṃkarṣaṇāgninā |

  yānty ūṣmaṇā maharlokāj janaṃ bhṛgvādayo'rditāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : bhagavacchaktirūpo yaḥ saṃkarṣaṇamukhāgnis tenoṣmaṇārditāḥ
santo janalokaṃ yānti ||29||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kena prakāreṇa ity apekṣāyām āha—trilokyām iti ||29||


|| 3.11.30 ||

  tāvat tribhuvanaṃ sadyaḥ kalpāntaidhitasindhavaḥ |

  plāvayanty utkaṭāṭopacaṇḍavāteritormayaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : kalpāntenaidhitāḥ sindhavaḥ samudrāḥ | utkaṭa āṭopaḥ ksobho
yeṣāṃ te ca te caṇḍavātair īritor mayaś ca ||30||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : sadya iti trilokyāṃ dagdhāyāṃ satyām avilambenety arthaḥ |
dāhas tu śatavarṣaparyanto jñeyaḥ | utkaṭa āṭopaḥ ksobho yeṣāṃ te ca, te
caṇḍavāteritataraṅgāś ceti te ||30||


|| 3.11.31 ||

  antaḥ sa tasmin salila āste'nantāsano hariḥ |

  yoganidrānimīlākṣaḥ stūyamāno janālayaiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : janaloka ālayo yeṣāṃ maharlokagatānām anyeṣāṃ ca taiḥ
||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : utkaṭāṭopaiś caṇḍavātair īritā ūrmayo yeṣāṃ te ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ : yogākhyā vimalādīnāṃ cicchaktivṛttīnāṃ pañcamī saiva
tadānīṃ nidrārūpā tayā muditanetraḥ | janālayair janalokanivāsibhir
munibhiḥ ||31||


|| 3.11.32 ||

 evaṃvidhair ahorātraiḥ kālagatyopalakṣitaiḥ |

apakṣitam ivāsyāpi paramāyur vayaḥśatam ||

madhvaḥ : asya brahmaṇaḥ, brahmaṇo dinam ity uktatvāt |

nāyur mānaṃ bhagavataḥ kasmin rūpo'pi vidyate |

anāditvād amadhyatvād anantatvāc ca so'vyayaḥ || iti harivaṃśaḥ ||32|| 

śrīdharaḥ : vairāgyārtham āha—evaṃvidhair ahorātrair varṣaśataṃ
sarveṣāṃ prāṇinām āyuṣaḥ param adhikam asya brahmaṇo yad āyus tad apy
apakṣitam iva kṣīṇam iveti lokoktiḥ | gataprāyam ity arthaḥ ||32||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : asya brahmaṇo'py āyur upalakṣitam apakṣīṇaṃ gataprāyam
eveti yasmād bibhemy ahaṃ [bhā.pu. 3.9.18] ity uktyā kālād bibhyatā
brahmaṇāpi viṣayabhogebhyo virajya nirantaram eva bhāgavat upāsyate
manuṣyāḥ kiyad āyuṣaḥ kena sāhasena viṣayam upabhuñjānās taṃ na bhajantīti
bhaktivairāgyayoḥ prayatna āvaśyaka iti kālanirūpaṇaprayojanam uktam
||32||


|| 3.11.33 ||

 yad ardham āyuṣas tasya parārdham abhidhīyate |

  pūrvaḥ parārdho'pakrānto hy aparo'dya pravartate ||

śrīdharaḥ : pūrvasya parārdhasyādāv iti tribhir vastukathanamātram
||33||

kramasandarbhaḥ : yad ardham iti adya asmin ||33||

viśvanāthaḥ : tadāyur dvidhā vibhaktam āha—yad iti ||33||


|| 3.11.34 ||

pūrvasyādau parārdhasya brāhmo nāma mahān abhūt |

  kalpo yatrābhavad brahmā śabdabrahmeti yaṃ viduḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : pādmatve hetuḥ, yad iti ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : pūrvasyeti prabhāsakhaṇḍoktaḥ śvetavarāhādibhiḥ
pitṛkalpās tais triṃśatkalpair eva śuklapratipadādyamāvasyāntāni
triṃśaddināni teṣām eva kalpānāṃ punaḥ punar āvṛttyā māsāḥ māsair
dvādaśabhir varṣaṃ pañcāśatā varṣair ekaṃ parārdham | tatra pūrvasya
prathamasya ādau brāhma iti śvetavārāha eva brahmajanmatithitvāt
brāhmaśabdenocyate | sā tithiś ca caitraśuklapratipad eva
jyotiḥśāstroktyā jñeyā ||34||


|| 3.11.35 ||

tasyaiva cānte kalpo'bhūd yaṃ pādmam abhicakṣate |

  yad dharer nābhisarasa āsīl lokasaroruham ||

śrīdharaḥ : ayaṃ tu dvitīyasyādau kathitaḥ ||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : kalpaḥ pitṛkalpaḥ yaṃ parārdhasyaivāntimaṃ pitṛkalpam eva
pādmaṃ vadanti, pādmatve hetuḥ—yad iti | tena sarveṣv eva kalpeṣu
lokātmakaṃ padmaṃ na bhavati, kintu kvāpi kvāpy evety arthaḥ ||35||


|| 3.11.36 ||

  ayaṃ tu kathitaḥ kalpo dvitīyasyāpi bhārata |

  vārāha iti vikhyāto yatrāsīc chūkaro hariḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tad evaṃ kālena nimittena sṛjyānām āyuḥ parimāṇam uktvā
kālaparicchedarahitaṃ tattvam āha—kālo'yam iti pañcabhiḥ | upacaryate
kevalaṃ na tv anenāpi krameṇāyur gaṇanaṃ tasyety āha—avyākṛtasya
kāryopādhiśūnyasya ata evānantasyānādeś ca jagadātmano jagatkāraṇasya
||36||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ brahmaṇo dinakalpanena garbhodaśāyino
dinakalpanā jñeyā | tasyāpi tadante yoganidrāsvīkārāt |
kāraṇārṇavaśāyinaḥ kālakalpana'ṃ tv evam ity āha—kālo'yam iti |
yasyaikaniśvasitakālam athāvalambya jīvanti lomabilajā
jagadaṇḍanāthāḥ iti brahmasaṃhitātaḥ ||36||

viśvanāthaḥ : ayaṃ tu samprati vartamānadvitīyasya parārdhasya
ekapañcāśattamavarṣasya prathamadivasa ity arthaḥ | atra pādmaṃ kalpam
atho śṛṇv ity upakrāntāyām udāplutaṃ viśvam ity ādipādmakalpakathāyām
ekārṇavodake ekasya padmasyaiva śravaṇāt tatraikasya brahmaṇa evodbhavād
vilokya tatrānyad apaśyamāna ity ādyukter mahākalpāyuṣāṃ sanakādīnāṃ ca
tatrānupalambhāt kecit prathamaparārdhānte maharjanastapaḥsatyānāṃ
dviparārdhāntaparyantasthāyinām anaṣṭānām api jalaplāvanaṃ tathā
tatratyānāṃ sarveṣām eva kalpāyuṣāṃ brahmasāhitenaiva śrīnārāyaṇe
praveśam ākhyāya prathamaparārdhasamāptau dvitīyaparārdhasyādimaṃ
śvetavārāham eva pādmam āhuḥ | dvādaśādhyāye ca sanakādimarīcyādīnāṃ
brāhmakalpa iva brahmata evāvirbhāvaś ca vakṣyate, na ca tatra
brāhmakalpakathaiveti vācyaṃ, pādmakalpakathāyāḥ prakrāntatvāt |
tasmāt tasyaiva cānta ity atra ante avasāne samāptāv ity artha iti | ayaṃ
tv iti tur evārthe ayam eva pādma eva vārāha iti khyātaḥ | tatra hetur
yatrāsīd iti dvitīyasyāpīty apikāreṇa prathamaparārdhasyādimo brāhmaḥ
kalpo'pi pādma ucyata iti vyācakṣate ||36||


|| 3.11.37 ||

  kālo'yaṃ dviparārdhākhyo nimeṣa upacaryate |

  avyākṛtasyānantasya hy anāder jagadātmanaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tat paricchede kālasyāsāmarthyād ity āha—kālo'yam īśvaraḥ
samartho'pi bhūmnaḥ paripūrṇasyeśituṃ naiva prabhuḥ samarthaḥ | yato
dhāmamānināṃ dehagehābhemāninām eveśvaraḥ ||37||

kramasandarbhaḥ : dhāmamānināṃ satyalokādyadhikāramāninām ||37||

viśvanāthaḥ : tad evaṃ sūkṣmaṃ sthūlaṃ kālam uktvedānīm ātyantikaṃ sthūlaṃ
paramamahāntaṃ kālam āha—dviparārdhasaṃjñaḥ kālasya
paryavasānāsambhave'py ātyantikasthūlatvena sa eva śāstre vyavahrīyate
so'pi jagadātmanaḥ parameśvarasya nimeṣaḥ | nanv evaṃ nimeṣādikrameṇa
tasyāpi kim āyur gaṇyate, tatra nahi nahīti sarasanād aṃśam āha—upacaryate
kvacin nimeṣa iti | yasyaikaniḥśvasitakālam athāvalambya jīvanti
lomabilajā jagadaṇḍanāthā iti brahmasaṃhitādau kvacin niśvāsa ity
upacāramātraṃ na tu vastuto nimeṣo'pīty arthaḥ | yato'vyākṛtasya
kālakṛtavikārarahitasya | tatra hetur anantasyānādeḥ
kālaparicchedātītasyety arthaḥ | yato jagadātmanaḥ
kālādisarvajagatkāraṇasya ||37||


|| 3.11.38 ||

 kālo'yaṃ paramāṇvādir dviparārdhānta īśvaraḥ |

naiveśituṃ prabhur bhūmna īśvaro dhāmamāninām ||

śrīdharaḥ : “bhūmna” ity uktaṃ tat prapañcayann āha—vikāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhir
yuktair aṣṭaprakṛtisaṃyutaiḥ sahitas tad ārabdha ity arthaḥ | ayam
āṇḍakośo yatra praviṣṭaḥ paramāṇuval lakṣyate ity uttareṇānvayaḥ |
kīdṛśaḥ | antaḥ pañcāśatkoṭiyojanavistṛtaḥ, bahiś ca viśeṣādibhiḥ
pṛthivyādibhiḥ saptabhir āvṛtaḥ ||38||

kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : vyañjitam evārthaṃ punaḥ spaṣṭayati—kālo'yam iti | bhūmnaḥ
parameśvarasya dhāmamānināṃ satyalokādyadhikāriṇām ||38||


|| 3.11.39 ||

  vikāraiḥ sahito yuktair viśeṣādibhir āvṛtaḥ |

  āṇḍakośo bahir ayaṃ pañcāśatkoṭivistṛtaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : daśendriyāṇi ca manobhūtāny aṇḍagatāni tu |

vikārā iti vijñeyā bhūtāhaṃ mahataḥ param ||

pṛthivīṃ viśeṣa ity āhuḥ śabdādīnāṃ bahutvataḥ |

sā sūkṣmatvād vṛṇoty aṇḍaṃ dviguṇā tu daśottarāḥ |

avādayaḥ prakṛtyantā aṣṭa prakṛtayaḥ smṛtāḥ || iti ca |

śarīrāṇāṃ bahutvena atītān āgatais tathā |

asyeva devakāyeṣu prati prati ca darśanāt |

viṣṇusāmarthyato'ṇḍānāṃ bahutvaṃ nānyathā bhavet || iti brahmatarke |

ekam aṇḍaṃ bahutvena pratyekaṃ romakūpagam |

brahmāpaśyat tathātmānaṃ hares teṣu pṛthak pṛthak || iti brahmāṇḍe |

bṛhadaṇḍam abhūd ekam iti ca bhārate ||39||

śrīdharaḥ : kīdṛśaiḥ | āṇḍakośapramāṇād daśaguṇam uttarottaro'dhiko
yeṣu taiḥ | na kevalam ayam eka eva api tv anye'pi lakṣyante ||39||

kramasandarbhaḥ : vikārair iti yugmakam | vikārā
ekādaśendriyapañcamahābhūtarūpāḥ prakṛtayaḥ
prakṛtimahadahaṅkārapañcatanmātrārūpāḥ mahadādyāḥ, prakṛtivikṛtayaḥ
sapteti nyāyena khasvakāryaṃ prati mahadādīnām api prakṛtitvamananāt
||39||

viśvanāthaḥ : jagadātman ity anena vyañjitaṃ sarvajagatparicchedakatvaṃ
tasyāha—vikāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhir yuktaiḥ aṣṭaprakṛtiyuktaiḥ sahitas
tadārabdha ity arthaḥ | ayam aṇḍakoṣo yatra praviṣṭaḥ paramāṇuval
lakṣyate ity uttareṇānvayaḥ | kīdṛśaḥ bahir viśeṣādibhiḥ pṛthavyādibhiḥ
saptabhir āvṛtaḥ ||39||


  || 3.11.4041 ||

  daśottarādhikair yatra praviṣṭaḥ paramāṇuvat |

  lakṣyate'ntargatāś cānye koṭiśo hy aṇḍarāśayaḥ ||

  tad āhur akṣaraṃ brahma sarvakāraṇakāraṇam |

viṣṇor dhāma paraṃ sākṣāt puruṣasya mahātmanaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : antargatā śarīrāṇi | dhāmagṛham aṇḍarāśayaḥ |

yamaḥ kālo mānuṣāṇāṃ tasya kālaḥ sudarśanaḥ |

tasyāpi rudras tatkālo brahmā durgāpi tasya tu ||

sā brahmapralaye devī vartate cakrarūpiṇī |

saṃharati sadā lokān saiva brahmādiṣu sthitā ||

tasyā niyāmako viṣṇuḥ paraḥ kālaḥ sa ucyate |

kālābhimāninī saiva prabhur na jagadīśituḥ |

tasyāḥ prabhuḥ sa eveśo viṣṇuḥ sarveśvareśvaraḥ || iti ca ||40||

śrīdharaḥ : sarveṣāṃ kāraṇānāṃ kāraṇam | dhāma svarūpam ||40||

kramasandarbhaḥ : anye ca lakṣyante iti jalādyāvaraṇaṃ tu
pūrvoktayuktyaivam eva sarveṣām avagantavyam ||40||

yadyapi pūrvoktarītyā mahāpuruṣo'pi kālādhīno na bhavaty eva | tathāpy
āvirbhāvatirobhāvalīlatvād akṣaraśabdavācyo na bhavati | kintu tasya
paramasvarūpaṃ svayaṃ bhagavān eva nityāvirbhāvatvāt tadvācya ity
āha—tad āhur iti | mahātmano viṣṇor mahāviṣṇvākhyasya sākṣād yat paraṃ
dhāma svataḥ siddhaṃ paramāṃśirūpatattvaṃ tad evākṣaraṃ nityāvirbhāvaṃ
brahma paripūrṇaṃ bhagavattvam āhuḥ | yataḥ sarvakāraṇasya pūruṣasyāpi
kāraṇam iti ||41||

viśvanāthaḥ : kīdṛśaiḥ ? aṇḍakoṣapramāṇād daśaguṇa uttarottaro'dhiko
yeṣu taiḥ | na kevalam ayam eka eva api tv anye'pi lakṣyante viṣṇoḥ
kāraṇārṇavaśāyino dhāma dehaḥ | gṛhadehatviṭprabhāvā dhāmanīty amaraḥ
||4041||

iti sārārthadarśinyāṃ harṣiṇyāṃ bhaktacetasām |

  tṛtīye daśamo'dhyāyaḥ saṅgataḥ saṅgataḥ satām ||*||


iti śrīmadbhāgavate mahāpurāṇe brahmasūtrabhāṣye pāramahaṃsyaṃ
saṃhitāyāṃ vaiyāsikyāṃ tṛtīyaskandhe viduramaitreyasaṃvāde

kālasvarūpakathanaṃ nāma

 ekādaśo'dhyāyaḥ |

  || 3.11 ||
oṃ śrīśrīrādhākṛṣṇābhyāṃ namaḥ

śrīmadbhāgavatamahāpurāṇam |

atha bhāgavatatṛtīyaskandhe dvitīyo vibhāgaḥ  ||

