 || 3.11.9 ||

dvādaśārdhapalonmānaṃ caturbhiś caturaṅgulaiḥ |

svarṇamāṣaiḥ kṛtacchidraṃ yāvat prasthajalaplutam ||

madhvaḥ : kākaṇikācatuṣkaṃ tu viṃśāṃśety abhidhīyate |

kṛṣṇalety api taṃ brūyus taiś caturbhis tu māṣakam ||

caturaṅguladīrghe tu kṛte māsacatuṣṭayam |

yāvat syāt pariṇāhena tāvad dvāraṃ vidhīyate ||

prasthasya nāḍīpātrasya ṣaṭdalasya śubhe jale |

bhārādhikye nodakena kṣipraṃ pūrtir bhaviṣyati ||

atiśaitye kalaṅke ca māghenaiva tu pūraṇam |

tasmād vasantakāle tu prayāgasthodakena tu ||

nāḍīśuddhiparīkṣā syād anyathā na sambhavet || iti pādme |

nirmalena samoṣṇena nityasūryāṃśuvāriṇā |

