brahmacaryaṃ sāvitram | vratāny ācarataḥ saṃvatsaraparyantaṃ bṛhad iti
caturvidhaṃ brahmacaryam | vārtā aniṣiddhakṛṣyādivṛttiḥ | sañcayo
yājanādivṛttiḥ | śālīnam ayācitavṛttiḥ | śiloñchanaṃ
patitakaṇiśakaṇavṛttiḥ | śiloñcha iti dvandvaikyaṃ ūkālo'c
hrasvadīrghapluta [pā. 1.2.27] itivat | gṛhe iti jīvikācāturvidhyāt
gārhasthyam api caturvidham ity arthaḥ ||42||

