 || 3.12.4647 ||^

 majjāyāḥ paṅktir utpannā bṛhatī prāṇato'bhavat |

 sparśas tasyābhavaj jīvaḥ svaro deha udāhṛtaḥ ||

ūṣmāṇam indriyāṇy āhur antaḥsthā balam ātmanaḥ |

 svarāḥ sapta vihāreṇa bhavanti sma prajāpateḥ ||

madhvaḥ :  sparśās tasyābhavajīvāt svarā dehāt prajajñire |

ūṣmāṇa indriyebhyaś ca antasthā balato vibhoḥ || iti ca |

yasmāt yaj jāyate cāṅgāt tat tad aṅgābhidhaṃ bhavet || iti ca ||4647||

śrīdharaḥ : mahākalpe brahmā śabdabrahmarūpo'bhavad ity uktaṃ tad eva
