 yatra cādyaḥ pumān āste bhagavān śabdagocaraḥ |

  sattvaṃ viṣṭabhya virajaṃ svānāṃ no mṛḍayan vṛṣaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  yatreti | śabdagocaro vedāntaikavedyaḥ | virajaṃ
sattvamūrtiṃ viṣṭabhya dhṛtvā | vṛṣo dharmamūrtiḥ | svānāṃ svān ||15||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  sattvaṃ guṇaṃ sānnidhyenopakṛtya vṛṣaḥ
sarvānandavarṣī ||15||

viśvanāthaḥ :  virajaṃ sattvaṃ śuddhasattvaṃ viṣṭabhya dhṛtvā yasya
