|| 3.15.26 ||

tad viśvagurvadhikṛtaṃ bhuvanaikavandyaṃ

 divyaṃ vicitravibudhāgryavimānaśociḥ |

āpuḥ parāṃ mudam apūrvam upetya yoga

 māyābalena munayas tad atho vikuṇṭham ||

śrīdharaḥ :  tat tadā tadapūrvaṃ vikuṇṭham atho anantaram upetya munayaḥ
parām utkṛṣṭāṃ mudam āpuḥ | apūrvatve hetavaḥ, viśvaguruṇā
hariṇā'dhikṛtam adhiṣṭhitam | bhuvanānām ekam eva vandyam | divyam
alaukikam | vicitrāṇi vibudhāgryāṇāṃ vimānāni teṣāṃ śocir dīptir yasmin |
yogamāyābaleneti aṣṭāṅgayogaprabhāveṇopetya | parameśvare tu
yogamāyeti cicchaktivalāsa iti draṣṭavyam ||26||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  yogamāyābalena bhagavacchaktiprabhāveṇaiva, na tu
svaśaktyā | manīṣitānubhāvo'yaṃ mama lokāvalokanam iti
śrībhagavatoktatvāt ||26||

viśvanâthaḥ : atha tatra sanakādīnāṃ gamanaṃ varṇayati—atho tad vikuṇṭhaṃ
yogamāyāyā bhagavadicchānuvartinyā bhagavacchakter balena, na tu
svabalena upetya, bhagavatkṛpayā parāṃ mudam apūrvaṃ yathā syāt tathā
āpuḥ | atra parām apūrvam iti padābhyāṃ tadīyabrahmānubhavamudo'pi
sakāśāt vaikuṇṭhīyamuda ādhikyaṃ darśitam | vikuṇṭhaṃ kīdṛśaṃ ? tenaiva
viśvaguruṇā hariṇā svayam adhikṛtam iti nātra tanmāyāśakter adhikāra
ity arthaḥ | kṛpayā svīyabhaktim upadeṣṭum eva munīn apy ānināyeti
viśvagurupadavyaṅgaṃ vastu | vicitrāṇi vibudhāgryāṇāṃ vimānāni teṣāṃ
śaucir yatra tat ||26||

