|| 3.15.28 ||

 mattadvirephavanamālikayā nivītau

vinyastayāsitacatuṣṭayabāhumadhye |

vaktraṃ bhruvā kuṭilayā sphuṭanirgamābhyāṃ

 raktekṣaṇena ca manāg rabhasaṃ dadhānau ||

madhvaḥ : vaktrasthayā bhruvā saha nirgatena ||28||

śrīdharaḥ :  tāv eva varṇayati | mattā dvirephā yasyāṃ tayā vanamālayā
nivītau kaṇṭhalaṃ vinyā alaṅkṛtau | asitā nīlāś catuṣṭaye catuḥsaṅkhyākā
bāhavas teṣāṃ madhye vinyas tayā | vaktraṃ ca manāgrabhasaṃ kiñcit
kṣubdhaṃ dadhānau | sphuṭāv utphullau nirgamau śvāsamārgau nāsāpuṭe
tābhyām ||28||

kramasandarbhaḥ :  manāg rabhasatve hetur dvārīti ||28||

viśvanāthaḥ : atha saptamyāṃ kakṣāyāṃ devau dvārapālau jayavijayāv
apaśyan gṛhītagadau tatrāpi vaktraṃ manāg rabhasaṃ kiñcit kopakṣubdhaṃ
ca dadhānau | kena lakṣaṇenety apekṣāyām āha—bhruvety ādi
sphuṭanirgamābhyām ity asya nāsāśvāsābhyām iti viśeṣyapadam adhyāhāryam
||28||

