|| 3.15.34 ||

 tad vām amuṣya paramasya vikuṇṭhabhartuḥ

  kartuṃ prakṛṣṭam iha dhīmahi mandadhībhyām |

lokān ito vrajatam antarabhāvadṛṣṭyā

  pāpīyasas traya ime ripavo'sya yatra ||

madhvaḥ : trayo ripavo dehatraye ||34||

śrīdharaḥ : tat tasmād amuṣya vaikuṇṭhanāthasya bhṛtyābhyāṃ yuvābhyāṃ
prakṛṣṭaṃ bhadram eva kartum ihāsminn aparādhe yad yuktaṃ tad dhīmahi
cintayema | tad evāhuḥ—antarasya bhedasya bhāvaḥ sattā taddarśanena ito
vaikuṇṭhalokād vrajatam | yatra yeṣu lokeṣv asya
pāpīyaso'ntarabhāvadraṣṭur ime kāmaḥ krodhas tathā lobhaḥ iti gītoktās
trayo ripavo bhavanti | ito vaikuṇṭhāt pāpīyaso lokān iti vā ||34||

kramasandarbhaḥ : pāpīyaso lokān janasamūhān vrajataṃ teṣu jāyetām |
yatra vrajane ime asmin nirdiṣṭā lokā daityarākṣasarājanyajanasamūhās
trayo'sya bhagavato'pi ripavaḥ ||34||

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ ninditvāpy aśāntatvāt punar atikrodhāt śapanti | tat
tasmād vāṃ yuvābhyāṃ mandadhībhyāṃ bhūtābhyām amuṣya vikuṇṭhabhartuḥ
prakṛṣṭaṃ prakarṣaṃ kartuṃ dhīmahi | atra bhedadarśanaṃ viśeṣato
brāhmaṇavāraṇaṃ ca brahmaṇyadevasyāpakarṣas tadabhāvam eva prakarṣas
taṃ kartuṃ tadanantaraṅgatvena vayam eva cintayemeti kṣaṇaṃ tūṣṇīṃ
sthitvā tad evāhuḥ—ito vaikuṇṭhād vrajatam | yatra lokeṣu pāpīyaso
yuṣmadvidhāparādhijanasya bhedabhāvadṛṣṭyā ime, kāmaḥ krodhas tathā
lobhaḥ iti gītoktās trayo ripavo bhavanti | atrāparokṣārthavācinā
idamśabdaprayogeneme sampraty asmād dehād bhūtāḥ krodhādaya iti
sarasvatyabhimato'rthaḥ ||34||

