|| 3.15.35 ||

teṣām itīritam ubhāv avadhārya ghoraṃ

taṃ brahmadaṇḍam anivāraṇam astrapūgaiḥ |

  sadyo harer anucarāv uru bibhyatas tat

 pādagrahāv apatatām atikātareṇa ||

śrīdharaḥ : iti teṣām īritaṃ bhāṣaṇaṃ ghoram avadhārya, taṃ ca
brahmadaṇḍaṃ brahmaśāpam avadhārya, taṃ cāstrasamūhair apy anivāryam
avadhārya | harer anucarāv atikātaryeṇa bhayena tat pādagrahaṇaṃ
kurvantau santau daṇḍavad apatatām | kathaṃ bhūtasya hareḥ ?
evaṃbhūtebho munibhyas tābhyām apy uru adhikaṃ bibhyato bhayaṃ bhāvayataḥ
||35||

kramasandarbhaḥ : taṃ ca brahmadaṇḍam avadhāryety anenānayos teṣu pūrvaṃ
brāhmaṇatvajñānaṃ nāsīd iti gamyate | brāhmaṇebhya uru bibhyataḥ ||35||

viśvanāthaḥ : aho aparāddham āvābhyāṃ yad brāhmaṇāḥ kopitā iti tayor
vaiklavyam āha—teṣām iti | hareḥ sakāśāt prathamaṃ bibhyataḥ bhītau, atus
ukāralopaś chāndasaḥ | tataś ca atikātaryeṇa teṣāṃ pādagrahaṇaṃ
kurvantau daṇḍavad apatatām ||35||

