|| 3.15.39 ||

  kṛtsnaprasādasumukhaṃ spṛhaṇīyadhāma

snehāvalokakalayā hṛdi saṃspṛśantam |

  śyāme pṛthāv urasi śobhitayā śriyā svaś

 cūḍāmaṇiṃ subhagayantam ivātmadhiṣṇyam ||

madhvaḥ: kaustubho brahmaṇo rūpaṃ prāṇaś cūḍāmaṇis tathā ||39||

śrīdharaḥ :  kṛtsnasya dvārapālamunivṛndasya prasāde sumukham |
spṛhaṇīyānāṃ guṇānāṃ dhāma sthānam | snehāvalokakalayā sapremakaṭākṣeṇa
hṛdi saṃspṛśantaṃ sukhayantam | trailokyavivakṣāpakṣe
satyalokaparyantaḥ svargas tasya cūḍāmaṇivat sthitaṃ svadhiṣṇyaṃ
vaikuṇṭhaṃ subhagayantaṃ śobhayantam |

kramasandarbhaḥ : kṛtsnaprasādeti | kṛtsnaḥ pūrṇo yo muniṣu prasādas
tena sumukhaṃ manoharavaktram | pārṣadayos tu prasādo na sphuṭaḥ | etau
dvau [bhā.pu. 3.16.2] ity ādi vakṣyamāṇavirodhāt | yad vā, kṛtsnasya
dvārapālamunivṛndasya prasāde sumukham iti | spṛhaṇīyānāṃ guṇānāṃ dhāma
sthānam iti ca tattadguṇānāṃ tādṛśatvaṃ darśitam | snehāvaloketi
vilāsasya | svaḥ sukhabhogasthānāni nityānantānandarūpatvāt teṣāṃ
cūḍāmaṇim | ātmadhiṣṇyaṃ svasvarūpasthānaṃ śrīvaikuṇṭham | tādṛśe'py
urasi śobhitayā rekhārūpayā śriyā kṛtvā subhagayantam iva, tatra
bhūṣaṇaviśeṣaṃ nidadhānam iva | iveti vākyālaṅkāre | anena
śrīvaikuṇṭhasya nityatvaṃ sarvotkṛṣṭatvaṃ ca | uktaṃ ca, tadviśvagurv
[bhā.pu. 3.15.26] ity ādau, āpuḥ parāṃ mudam ity ādi | vakṣyate ca—atha te
munayo dṛṣṭvā [bhā.pu. 3.16.27] ity ādi, vaiṣṇavīṃ śriyaṃ [bhā.pu.
3.16.28] ity antam ||39|| [bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ: svabhaktābhyām abhiśāpadāyiṣv asmāsu na jānīmahe bhagavān
antaḥ kupyati na veti saṃśayasindhunimagneṣu kṛtsna ābhyantaro bāhyaś ca
yaḥ prasādas tena sumukham | ata eva hanta hantāsmāsu pratyuta prasāda eva
pūrṇa upalabhyata ity antar ullasan munivṛndasya netrādīndriyaiḥ
spṛhaṇīyānāṃ saundaryasausvaryasaurabhyasaukumāryakāruṇyaudāryāṇāṃ
dhāma pūrṇāspadam | hā hantāvcayor brahmaśāpānaladagdhayor adhaḥpatator
īdṛgdarśanamādhurī punar na ghaṭiṣyata iti khedārṇavanimagnau rudantau
jayavijayau prati yaḥ snehāvalokas tasya kalayā kauśalena,
tatratyajanānāṃ sarveṣām eva hṛdi saṃspṛśantam aho bhaktavātsalyam iti
manolobhayantaṃ, śriyā vāmas tanordhvasvarṇarekhārūpeṇa sthitayā svaś
cūḍāmaṇiṃ satyalokāntānāṃ svargāṇāṃ cūḍāyāṃ maṇim iva svadhiṣṇyaṃ
vaikuṇṭhaṃ subhagayantaṃ dhanyaḥ sa vaikuṇṭho yatratyāḥ svarṇarekhāmayīṃ
lakṣmīṃ bhagavadvakṣasi vilokayantīty evaṃ saubhāgyavantaṃ kurvantaṃ,
evaṃ gare'pi vyākhyeyam | atra kṛpāmādhuryarūpamādhurye
tanmanonetrābhyām anubhūte jñeye ||39||

