|| 3.15.42 ||

 atropasṛṣṭam iti cotsmitam indirāyāḥ

svānāṃ dhiyā viracitaṃ bahusauṣṭhavāḍhyam |

mahyaṃ bhavasya bhavatāṃ ca bhajantam aṅgaṃ

nemur nirīkṣya na vitṛptadṛśo mudā kaiḥ ||

madhvaḥ : avidyamānakaraṇaṃ vidyamānasmṛtis tathā |

ubhayaṃ racanaṃ proktaṃ pūrvasiddheṣu tu smṛtiḥ || iti śabdanirṇaye
||42||

śrīdharaḥ :  kiṃ bahuna ? indirāyā utsmitam aham eva
sarvasaundaryanidhir ity ahaṅkaraṇam atra bhagavatsaundarye upasṛṣṭam
astaṃ gatam iti svānāṃ bhaktānāṃ dhiyā viracitam | bhṛtyaiḥ svamanasy
evaṃ vitarkitam ity arthaḥ | kutaḥ ? bahusauṣṭhavena saundaryeṇāḍhyaṃ
yuktam | kiṃ ca, mahyāṃ mama bhavasyeśvarasya bhavatāṃ ca kṛte'ṅgaṃ
bhajantaṃ mūrtiṃ prakaṭayan tam acakṣata | nirīkṣya ca kaiḥ śirobhir mudā
nemur namaś cakruḥ | na viśeṣeṇa tṛptā dṛśo netrāṇi yeṣāṃ te ||42||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evaṃ paricchadādīnām api tādṛśatvaṃ varṇayitvā
punas tasyaivātimanoharatvam āha—atropasṛṣṭam iti | indirāyā utsmitaṃ
garvaḥ | atra bhagavati upasṛṣṭam | asya paramasaundaryādiguṇaśālinaḥ
kāntasya nityena lābhena nityam evādhikam āvirbhāvitam iti tadīyānāṃ dhiyā
vitarkitam | atra hetuḥ—bahusauṣṭhavāḍhyam
anantasvarūparūpaguṇasampadbhir yuktam |

nanv evambhūtasya lakṣmyā api rahasyamahānidhirūpasya paramavastunaḥ
kathaṃ prakāśaḥ smabhavatīty ata āha—mahyam iti | bhavasya bhavatāṃ cāṅam
aṅgīkāraṃ bhajantam | asmadviṣayakam aṅgīkāraṃ bhajantaṃ
tattatkāryasampādanārtham āviśantam ity arthaḥ |

ullaṅghitatrividhasīmasamātiśāyi

sambhāvanaṃ tava parivraḍhimasvabhāvam |

māyābalena bhavatāpi niguhyamānaṃ

paśyanti kecid aniśaṃ tvadananyabhāvāḥ || [stotraratna, 13] itivat |

bhaktir evainaṃ nayati bhaktir evainaṃ darśayati ity ādi śruteś ca | yad
vā, tathābhūtaṃ tam acakṣateti | avitṛptadṛśo nirīkṣya mudā kair iti
paśyanta eva śirobhir nemur ity arthaḥ ||42|| [bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ :  kiṃ bahunā ? indirāyā utsmitam aham eva sarvasaundaryāṇāṃ
nidhir ity ahaṅkaraṇam atra bhagavatsaundarye upasṛṣṭam astaṃ gatam iti
svānāṃ bhaktānāṃ dhiyā viracitam | bhṛtyaiḥ svamanasy evaṃ vitarkitam iti
svāmicaraṇaḥ | paramasaundaryādiguṇaśālinaḥ kāntasya lābhena tasyā
utsmitaṃ garva upa ādhikyena sṛṣṭam āvirbhāvitam iti sandarbhaḥ |

yad vā, atra bhagavati upasṛṣṭaṃ brahmādibhir ārādhyayāpi
rūpaguṇamādhuryaiḥ sarvataḥ śreṣṭhayāpi mayā upasarjanībhūtam
apradhānībhūtam ity arthaḥ | iti hetunā cakārāt premṇā ca indirāyā
lakṣmyā utkṛṣṭaṃ smitaṃ dhanyāhaṃ yasyā īdṛśaḥ preyān ity ānandottha
ullāso yasmāt tathābhūtam aṅgaṃ bhajantaṃ samucitavastrālaṅkārādibhiḥ
śobhayantaṃ, na tu śambhum iva sundaram apy aṅgaṃ bhasmādibhir
virūpayantam ity arthaḥ | dṛśyate ca svāṅgapariṣkāe'pi
pūjādiśabdaprayogaḥ | yathā pādayor alpapūjeti sāmudrikādau |

tac ca paraḥ sahasrakiṅkaradvārair evety āha—svānāṃ svāṅgaparicārakāṇāṃ
dhiyā nityavividhavastrādiśṛṅgāravailakṣaṇyavidhāyinyā
sūkṣmabuddhyaiva bahusauṣṭhavāḍhyaṃ viracitam | aṅgaṃ punaḥ kīdṛśaṃ ?
bhavasya śambhor bhavatām asmadādīnāṃ ca mahyaṃ mahanīyaṃ
gandhapuṣpādibhir dhyānena deśāntare pūjanīyam eva, na tu teṣām iva
vaikuṇṭhe sākṣāt paricaraṇīyam ity arthaḥ | mahaḥ pūjāyām ity asya
curādyantasya rūpam | evaṃbhūtaṃ tam acakṣata | tato viśeṣatas taṃ
nirīkṣya ca atṛptanetrāḥ santaḥ kaiḥ śirobhiḥ nemuḥ ||42||

