|| 3.15.44 ||

 te vā amuṣya vadanāsitapadmakośam

  udvīkṣya sundaratarādharakundahāsam |

 labdhāśiṣaḥ punar avekṣya tadīyam aṅghri

  dvandvaṃ nakhāruṇamaṇiśrayaṇaṃ nidadhyuḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  harṣakāritaṃ saṃbhramam āha dvābhyām | te vai kilāmuṣya
vadanam evāsitapadmasya kośo'ntarbhāgas tam | asitapadmakośam ity
abhūtopamā | sundaratare aruṇe adharoṣṭhe kundavaddhāso yasmiṃs tam | ut
ūrdhvaṃ vīkṣya labdhamanorathāḥ santo nakhā evāruṇamaṇayas teṣāṃ
śrayaṇam āśrayabhūtam aṅghridvandvaṃ punar avekṣyādhodṛṣṭyā vīkṣya
punaḥ punar evaṃ nirīkṣya yugapat sarvāṅgalāvaṇyagrahaṇāśakteḥ paścān
nidadhyur dhyātavantaḥ ||44||

kramasandarbhaḥ : vadanāsitapadmakoṣaṃ vadanam evāsitapadmakoṣa
īṣadvikasitaṃ nīlāmbujaṃ taṃ, ut ūrdhvadṛṣṭyā vīkṣya punaś
cārvāgdṛṣṭyāṅghridvandvaṃ ca vīkṣya punaḥ punaḥ
śrīmukhādiśrīcaraṇaparyantam aṅgaṃ dṛṣṭvety arthaḥ | paścād
dhārṣṭyabuddhyā sambhramān nimīlite netre nidadhyuḥ | antar api tad eva
dadṛśur ity arthaḥ |

yad vā, bhaktyatiśayena paścād aṅghridvandvam eva dadṛśur ity arthaḥ |
yad vā, bhaktyatiśayena paścād aṅghridvandvam eva dadṛśur ity arthaḥ |
nirvarṇanaṃ tu nidhyānaṃ darśanālokanekṣaṇam ity amaraḥ | koṣo
vihīnabāhyadalapaṭalo'ntarbhāgaḥ ||44|| [bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ : evaṃ tulasīgandhena śodhitaprāṇānāṃ teṣām indriyāṇāṃ ca
prāṇādhīnatvāt prathamaṃ cakṣurbhyāṃ rūpamādhuryagrahaṇe
labdhādhikārāṇāṃ rūpamādhuryasya ca pratyaṅgagatavaividhyenānantyāt
yugapaj jighṛkṣāyām āvegasañcārikāritam ānandasammardavaivaśyam āha—te
vā iti | vai niścitaṃ vadanam evāsitapadmasya koṣaḥ,
bāhyarūkṣadalapaṭalahito'ntarbhāgas tam udvīkṣya utkṛṣṭamādhuryam
utkṛṣṭātaraṃ tad upari ca hāsaparihāsamādhuryam utkṛṣṭatamam iti bhāvaḥ
| labdhāśiṣa iti pitrā brahmaṇā bhrātrā nāradena ca bhaktyarthaṃ yā
āśiṣaḥ pūrvaṃ dattās tatphalalābhāt tā labdhā ity arthaḥ | aho
caraṇasaundaryaṃ kīdṛśam iti mukhamādhuryam īṣad eva gṛhītvā tatrātṛptā
eva te caraṇamādhurye dattekṣaṇā babhūvur ity āha—punar iti | nakhā
evāruṇamaṇayas teṣāṃ śrayaṇam āśrayabhūtam aṅghridvandvaṃ punar eva
adhaḥpradeśe īkṣitvā īṣad vīkṣya nidadhyuḥ, punar api mukhaṃ vīkṣya punaḥ
punar apy evaṃ dadṛśur ity arthaḥ | nirvarṇanaṃ tu nidhyānaṃ
darśanālokanekṣaṇam ity amaraḥ |

evaṃ śrīsvāmicaraṇās tu yugapat sarvāṅgalāvaṇyagrahaṇāśakteḥ paścāt
nidadhyur dhyātavanta ity āhuḥ | evam atra labdhāśiṣaḥ ity agre ca
pitrānuvarṇitarahā ity ābhyāṃ bhaktakṛpānugāminyā bhagavatkṛpayaivaiṣāṃ
bhakter utpattāv api bhagavatkṛpāyā bhūyastvād bhūmnā vyapadeśā
bhavantīti nyāyena bhagavatkṛpayaiva sanakādīnāṃ bhaktir bhaktyaiva teṣāṃ
tanmādhuryānubhava iti prasiddhiḥ ||44||

