|| 3.15.46 ||

 kumārā ūcuḥ—

  yo'ntarhito hṛdi gato'pi durātmanāṃ tvaṃ

 so'dyaiva no nayanamūlam ananta rāddhaḥ |

  yarhy eva karṇavivareṇa guhāṃ gato naḥ

  pitrānuvarṇitarahā bhavadudbhavena ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nityaṃ brahmarūpeṇa prakāśase, na tac citram | idānīṃ tu
paramamaṅgalaviśuddhasattvaśrīmūrtyā pratyakṣo'si | aho bhāgyam
asmākam ity āhuḥ | he ananta, yas tvaṃ hṛdgato'pi durātmanām antarhito
na sphurasi sa no'smākam antarhito na bhavasi | nayanamūlaṃ tv adyaiva
rāddhaḥ prāpto'si | antardhānābhāve hetuḥ, bhavataḥ sakāśād udbhavo yasya
tenāsmat pitrā yarhi yadaivānuvarṇitarahā upadiṣṭarahasyastadaiva naḥ
karṇamārgeṇa guhāṃ buddhiṃ gataḥ prāpto'sīti ||46||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha śrībhagavatas tādṛśatve tādṛśatvavyañjinīṃ nijāṃ
mūrtiṃ teṣām eva svahārdābhivyaktikareṇa stutivākyena pramāṇayati,
śrīkumārā ūcur iti | stutim āha—ya iti pañcabhiḥ | atra akṣarajuṣām api
[bhā.pu. 3.15.43] ity anusṛtya vyākhyāyate | 
nityaṃ brahmarūpeṇa prakāśase na tac citram | 
idānīṃ tu viśuddhasattvalakṣaṇena svarūpaśaktivṛttiviśeṣeṇa prakāśitayā ghanaprakāśaparatattvaikarūpayā mūrtyā pratyakṣo'si | 
aho bhāgyam asmākam ity āhuḥ—he ananta ! yas tvaṃ duṣṭātmanām antaryāmirūpeṇa
hṛdgato'py antarhito bhavasi, na sphurasīty arthaḥ, sa tvaṃ no'smākam
antarhito na bhavasi | tatra hetuḥ—yarhy eva bhavadudbhavenāsmākaṃ
pitrāsmabhyam anuvarṇitarahā
upadiṣṭacatuḥślokīproktapremabhaktyākhyarahasyaḥ proktas tarhy eva
karṇavivareṇa tadrūpatayā guhāṃ gato'sy antaḥ sphurasīti nayanamūlaṃ
tvayaiva rāddhaḥ prāpto'si | kṛpāvaiśiṣṭyena tarhy eva samyaṅ nayanaṃ
praviṣṭaḥ | tatrāvirbhūta ity arthaḥ | raha ity adanto'pi kvacit |
tanmātaro yad abhajan raharūḍhabhāvāḥ [bhā.pu. 10.55.40] ity ādiṣu
dṛśyate | nādyaivety atra “so'dyaiveti kva” iti tu na ṭīkāsammatam |
no'dyaiveti kvacit ||46||

viśvanāthaḥ : aho mahatkṛpāyā apāro mahimā yato bhagavatā
īdṛśasākṣātkārānandam anubhāvitāḥ sma ity aho bhāgyam asmākam ity āhuḥ—he
ananta ! apāramādhuryaiśvaryasindho ! yas tvaṃ hṛdgato'pi durātmanām
antarhita eva sa tvaṃ na kevalam adyaiva no'smākaṃ nayanamūlaṃ rāddhaḥ
prāpto'si, api tu pūrvam api |

nanu kadāham evaṃ dṛṣṭa āsaṃ ? tatra sarasam āhuḥ—yarhīti | na smarasi
bhavadudbhavena pitrā brahmaṇā anuvarṇitaṃ raho yasya sa tvaṃ yadaiva
no'smākaṃ karṇamārgeṇa guhāṃ gataḥ prāpto'si tadaiveti | ayam arthaḥ—bho
brahmānubhavino mattanayā brahmasākṣātkārād api bhagavatsākṣātkāraḥ
koṭīguṇitānandaḥ so'pi bhavatām astu, sa tu bhagavān
nīlotpaladalaśyāmalaḥ pīṇāyatacaturbāhuḥ
kaṭakakeyūrakuṇḍalādimaṇḍitaś candravadano vaikuṇṭhe virājamāno
bhaktyā labhyata iti bhagavadbhaktasyāsmatpituḥ kṛpāśīrvacanaṃ
yadaivāśrauṣma, tadaiva kāraṇe labdhe tatphalalabdher āvaśyakatvāt bhāvi
kilādyatanam api bhagavaddarśanaṃ tadbhaktakṛpātulyakālam eva jātaṃ
jānanto vayam āsmeti bhaṅgyā hanta bhagavan na tvaṃ svatantro'smān
kṛpayasi, kintu svabhaktādhīna eveti tadbhaktakṛpāyā māhātmyam
anirvacanīyam eveti ||46||

—o)0(o—

|| 3.15.47 ||

taṃ tvāṃ vidāma bhagavan param ātmatattvaṃ

 sattvena samprati ratiṃ racayantam eṣām |

 yat te'nutāpaviditair dṛḍhabhaktiyogair

  udgranthayo hṛdi vidur munayo virāgāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :  nanu pitropadiṣṭaṃ bhavatām anyādṛśam adṛśyam ātmatattvam
ahaṃ tv anya eva syāṃ dṛśyatvāt | naivam | asmat praty abhijñayā
bhedanirāsād ity āhuḥ, tam iti | he bhagavan, ātmatattvam eva paraṃ tvāṃ
vidāma vidmaḥ praty abhijānīmaḥ | nanu nirupādher ātmatattvasya katham
īdṛśam aiśvaryaṃ syād ata āhuḥ | sattvena viśuddhasattvamūrtyā | eṣāṃ
bhaktānām | samyak pratikṣaṇaṃ saṃprati ratiḥ prītis tāṃ racayantam |
ātmatattvam evāhuḥ | te'nutāpaḥ kṛpā tena viditair jñātair dṛḍhair
bhaktiyogaiḥ śravaṇādibhir munayo hṛdi yad viduḥ | kīdṛśāḥ | udgranthayo
nirahaṃ mānā ata eva vigatarāgāḥ |

kramasandarbhaḥ : tad evānubhavena paramatayā niścinvanti—taṃ tvām iti |
he bhagavan ! taṃ pitropadiṣṭarahasyaṃ tvāṃ paramaṃ bhagavallakṣaṇaṃ yad
ātmatattvaṃ brahmaṇo hi pratiṣṭhāhaṃ [gītā 14.27] iti
śrībhagavadgītānusāri, śubhāśrayaḥ sacitasya sarvagasya tathātmanaḥ
[vi.pu. 6.75] iti śrīviṣṇupurāṇādiprasiddhaṃ brahmaṇo'pi paramam, tad
eva vidāma pratyabhijānīmaḥ | kathaṃ ? tatrāhuḥ—sampraty adhunā
sattvenāsmāsv etadrūpāvirbhāvaitāvantaṃ kālaṃ na jñātavanto vayaṃ, adhunā
tu sākṣādanubhavena niścitavantaḥ sma ity arthaḥ | na kevalaṃ
pratyabhijñāmātram ity āhuḥ | eṣām asmākaṃ brahmānubhavinām api ratiṃ
racayantam anyathā ratir api tvayy asmākaṃ nodbhaved iti bhāvaḥ |

yad vā, eṣām asmākaṃ brahmānubhavinām api samprati sākṣātkārasamaye'smin
ratiṃ racayantam iti | asya paramatvam
ātmārāmāntarānubhavenābhivyañjayanti—taṃ tvām iti | yat ta iti
virāgāḥ—cittaṃ brahmasukhaspṛṣṭaṃ naivottiṣṭhata karhicit [bhā.pu.
7.15.35] iti tādṛśatvena prasiddhā apy udgranthayo nirahaṅkārā api munayo
yat paramātmatattvaṃ tava kṛpāviditaiḥ, mayi bhaktir astu te [bhā.pu.
4.30.32] iti pṛthvādāv iva tvatkṛpāmātralabdhaiḥ | ata eva dṛḍhaiḥ
sālokyasārṣṭi [bhā.pu. 3.29.13] ity ādinyāyena niścalair bhaktiyogair
vidur iti | yathoktaṃ—ātmārāmāś ca munayaḥ [bhā.pu. 1.7.10] ity ādinā
||48|| [bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ : tvatsākṣātkārasya kā kathā, tvatparokṣe'pi
tvatkathākīrtanānando'pi  brahmānandād adhika ity āhuḥ—ātyantikaṃ
mokṣākhyaṃ sāyujyam api te prasādaṃ tvatprasādatvena na gaṇayanti
nādriyante, kim u kim utānyat indrādipadam | te bhurva unnayair
ujjṛmbhitair arpitaṃ nihitaṃ bhayaṃ yasmin tat | ta eva ke ?
tatrāhuḥ—ye'ṅgeti | kathārasajñās ta eva kuśalā anye akuśalina ity arthaḥ
| kathāyāḥ  kīdṛśyāḥ kīrtanārhāṇi pāvanatvāt tīrtharūpāṇi yaśāṃsi yasyā |
bhavataḥ ity asya vā viśeṣaṇam ||48||

—o)0(o—

|| 3.15.48 ||

  nātyantikaṃ vigaṇayanty api te prasādaṃ

  kiṃ vānyad arpitabhayaṃ bhruva unnayais te |

ye'ṅga tvadaṅghriśaraṇā bhavataḥ kathāyāḥ

kīrtanyatīrthayaśasaḥ kuśalā rasajñāḥ ||

madhvaḥ:

ato'napekṣāṇām ānandodreko mokṣecchubhyaḥ |

teṣāṃ paripākataḥ pūrvaṃ brahmadṛṣṭyā muktiprāptiḥ |

mokṣaḥ kevalo bhakto muktāv api sukhī bhavet ||48||

śrīdharaḥ :  svayam api bhaktiṃ prārthayituṃ bhaktānāṃ sukhātiśayam āhuḥ |
ātyantikaṃ mokṣākhyam api tava prasādaṃ te na gaṇayanti nādriyante |
kintuṃ kim utānyad indrādipadam | te bhruva unnayair ujjṛmbhair arpitaṃ
nihitaṃ bhayaṃ yasmiṃs tat | te ke | aṅga he bhagavan, ye bhavataḥ kathāyā
rasajñāḥ | kathaṃbhūtasya | ramaṇīyatvena pāvanatvena ca kīrtanyaṃ
kīrtanārhaṃ tīrthaṃ pavitraṃ ca yaśo yasya |

kramasandarbhaḥ : atha pūrvam abhedamatayo'pi samprati
svarūpānandaśaktivilāsair vicitritamatayo bhūyo'pi bhedātmikāṃ bhaktim
eva prārthayituṃ bhaktānāṃ sukhātiśayam āhuḥ—nātyantikaṃ ti | ātyantikaṃ
mokṣalakṣaṇaṃ prasādam api, kim utānyad indrādipadam ||48||
[bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ : tvatsākṣātkārasya kā kathā, tvatparokṣe'pi
tvatkathākīrtanānando'pi brahmānandād adhika ity āhuḥ—ātyantikaṃ
mokṣākhyaṃ sāyujyam api te prasādaṃ tvatprasādatvena na gaṇayanti
nādriyante, kim u kim utānyat indrādipadam | te bhruva unnayair
ujjṛmbhitair arpitaṃ nihitaṃ bhayaṃ yasmin tat | ta eva ke
tatrāhuḥ—ye'ṅgeti | kathārasajñās ta eva kuśalā anye akuśalina ity arthaḥ
| kathāyāḥ kīdṛśyāḥ kīrtanārhāṇi pāvanatvāt tīrtharūpāṇi yaśāṃsi yasyāḥ |
bhavataḥ ity asya vā viśeṣaṇam ||48||

—o)0(o—

|| 3.15.49 ||

kāmaṃ bhavaḥ svavṛjinair nirayeṣu naḥ stāc

ceto'livad yadi nu te padayo rameta |

vācaś ca nas tulasivad yadi te'ṅghriśobhāḥ

  pūryeta te guṇagaṇair yadi karṇarandhraḥ ||

madhvaḥ:

yāvat paramabhaktais tu bhujyate duḥkham ulbaṇam |

tāvan muktau sukhodrekas tatra ced bhaktivardhanam ||49||

śrīdharaḥ :  idānīṃ svīyāparādhaṃ dyotayanto bhaktiṃ prārthayante, kāmam
iti | he bhagavannitaḥ pūrvam asmākaṃ vṛjinaṃ nābhavat | idānīṃ sarvāṇy
api jātāni | yatas tvadbhaktau śaptau | atas taiḥ svavṛjinair nirayeṣu
kāmaṃ no'smākaṃ bhavo janma stātsyāt | nu vitarke | yadi tu naś cetas te
padayo rameta alir yathā kaṇṭakair āvidhyamāno'pi puṣyeṣu ramate tadvad
vighnānavigaṇayya yadi rameta | aṅghribhyāṃ śobhā yāsām | yathā ca tulasī
guṇanair apekṣyeṇa tvadaṅghrisaṃbandhenaiva śobhate tathā yadi no vācaḥ
śobheran | yadi ca te guṇagaṇair āpūryeta | karṇarandhra ity alpasya
pūraṇam eva yācakarītyā prārthayante | ayaṃ tu gūḍho'bhiprāyaḥ |
karṇarandhrasyākāśatvād guṇagaṇānāṃ cāmūrtatvān na kadācit pūraṇam | ato
nityam eva śravaṇaṃ phaliṣyatīti |

kramasandarbhaḥ : kāmam iti | anena tadadhigama uttarapūrvārdhayor
aśleṣavināśau tadvyapadeśāt [veṣū. 4.1.13] iti
nyāyenāsambhavatadbhāvānāṃ brahmajñāninām api sveṣāṃ
bahunarakakārivṛjināpātakṣamāpaṇena tayor itthambhūtaguṇo hariḥ
[bhā.pu. 1.7.10]  itivat sarvādbhutamahattamatvaṃ sūcitam | aho ! nirayā
api bhaveyur eva, na tāvatāpi paryāptam | tebhyaś ca nāsmākam api bhayam |
atra tu mūlaṃ duṣphalaṃ bhagavatparāṅmukhībhāva eva, sa tv asmākaṃ mā
bhūd iti sakāku prārthayante | nu vitarke | yadi tu naś cetas te padayo
rameta, tatrāpy alivad eva kevalatanmādhuryāsvādāpekṣayā, na tu
brahmānubhavāpekṣayā, evaṃ vācaś cety ādi | atra bhaktāparādhasya
bhagavatā kṣamā tadicchāmātrakṛtatatkrodhajananāt teṣām
aparādhābhāsatveneti jñeyam | ślokadvaye'smin kaivalyān narake'pi
tvadbhaktimātraṃ kāmayamānānām asmākaṃ tadavirodhatvāt śreyān iti
svārasyalabdham ||49|| [bhagavatsandarbha 85]

viśvanāthaḥ : nanu madbhaktāḥ satyam īdṛśā eva mokṣaṃ na gaṇayanty eva |
sveṣāṃ samprati kā niṣṭhā vaḥ śuddhabhaktau muktau vā tāṃ spaṣṭaṃ brūtha
? vyañjanayālam ity ata āhuḥ—no'smākaṃ bhava eva stāt, na tu mokṣa ity
arthaḥ | tatrāpi svavṛjinaiḥ svāśubhakarmabhir nirayeṣu nārakīṣv api
yoniṣu | kas tatrādhiko lābho muktau vā kaḥ khalv alābhas tam āha—ceta iti
alir yathā kaṇṭakair ābiddhamāno'pi puṣpeṣu ramate, tadvat vighnān
avigaṇayya yadi rameteti premā vyañjitaḥ | yadīty anena nārakyām api yonau
bhaktau narakam api mokṣād uttamam ity āśīstātaṅā labhyate | aṅghribhām
eva śobhā yāsāṃ tā iti tulasī yathā svaśobhāyā abhāvād anyatra na
tiṣṭhati, aṅghryor eva śobhate, tathaivāsmākaṃ vāco'pi
tvadaṅghrirūpaguṇanāmavarṇana eva śobhantāṃ nānyatra | pūryeteti
tatrānyavārtā na praviśatv iti | yad vā, karṇarandhrasya ity alpasya
pūraṇam ato nityam eva śravaṇakīrtanasmaraṇānīty ānandatrayaṃ muktau
nāsty eva bhave tu sambhaved apīti nikṛṣṭo'pi bhava eva prārthito na
mokṣaḥ | evam eva nātha yonisahasreṣv iti, kīṭeṣu pakṣiṣu mṛgeṣv ity ādi
prārthanā niṣkāmabhaktānāṃ svabhāva eva | teṣām anusaṃhitaṃ bhajanānandam
anausaṃhitam api bhavakṣayaṃ ca kurute iti bhagavato'pi svabhāvaḥ
sarvatra draṣṭavyaḥ ||49||

