tatpracurāḥ, kintu svaprakāśatālakṣaṇaśuddhasattvaprakāśitā iti
prāktanam evoktaṃ vyaktam | ata eva teṣām upādhitvanirākṛtes
tattadanubhavānandavaicitrī ca sampadyate | tathaiva tam evam
evambhūtam acakṣateti tattadviṣayasaundaryavarṇanaṃ prastutopakāritvāt
