hariṇā sāntv itair viprair anutaptais tu ṣoḍaśe |

tayor asurabhāve'pi kṛto'nugraha īryate ||

iti gṛṇatāṃ teṣāṃ tadvākyaṃ pratinandyedaṃ jagāda etāv ity ekādaśabhiḥ
