kramasandarbhaḥ : evam ātmīyatvena tau bhartsayitvā brāhmaṇatvena tān
stauti yasyeti caturbhiḥ | kīrtiḥ pūrvoktaṃ yaśaḥ | yadyapi lokeśvarās
