|| 3.16.23 ||

śrībhagavān uvāca—

  etau tau pārṣadau mahyaṃ jayo vijaya eva ca |

  kadarthīkṛtya māṃ yad vo bahv akrāntām atikramam ||

 yas tv etayor dhṛto daṇḍo bhavadbhir mām anuvrataiḥ |

sa evānumato'smābhir munayo devahelanāt ||

śrīdharaḥ : yad yasmān māṃ kad arthīkṛtya tucchīkṛtya bahu yathā bhavati
