 || 3.16.6 ||

  yasyāmṛtāmalayaśaḥśravaṇāvagāhaḥ

 sadyaḥ punāti jagad āśvapacād vikuṇṭhaḥ |

so'haṃ bhavadbhya upalabdhasutīrthakīrtiś

  chindyāṃ svabāhum api vaḥ pratikūlavṛttim ||

madhvaḥ : anuktāś ca guṇā viṣṇor uktā doṣā na tasya tu |

ajñānād doṣavijñānaṃ guṇajñānam ayatiātmarthataḥ || iti paiṅgiśrutiḥ
