|| 3.16.12 ||

  tan me svabhartur avasāyam alakṣamāṇau

yuṣmadvyatikramagatiṃ pratipadya sadyaḥ |

bhūyo mamāntikam itāṃ tad anugraho me

  yat kalpatām acirato bhṛtayor vivāsaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : tat tasmān me'vasāyam abhiprāyam alakṣamāṇāv ajānantau
yuṣmadaparādhocitāṃ gatiṃ sadyaḥ prāpya matsamīpam itāṃ prāpnutām | tad
iti sa me'nugrahaḥ | tam evāha—yat bhṛtayor vivāso'cirataḥ śīghraṃ
kalpatāṃ sampadyatāṃ samāpyatām iti ||12||

kramasandarbhaḥ : bhagavatkṛpayā tāvad eva tau mamāntikam itām
āgacchatāṃ, kintu etayor bhṛtyayor vivāsaḥ śīghraṃ kalpayatāṃ bhavatv iti
| yat tan me mahyaṃ bhavatām anugraharūpam eva | daṇḍaṃ vinā tu mama
sukhaṃ na syād iti bhāvaḥ ||12||

viśvanāthaḥ : tat tasmād evaṃ svabhartur mama avasāyam abhiprāyam
alakṣamāṇau daivād apaśyantau yuṣmadaparādhocitāṃ gatiṃ sadyaḥ prāpya
matsamīpam itāṃ punaḥ prāpnutām itīyaṃ me prārthaneti bhāvaḥ |

nanu prabho brāhmaṇātikramiṇo madaparādhina eveti śrīmukhena svayam eva
brūṣe | tat kathaṃ punar api tayor evg snighyasīti tatra savaivaśyam
āha—tad anugraho me iti | yad yasmāt  tatra jayavijayayor mamānugraha
eva, na tu nigraha iti na hi svābhāviko dharmas tyaktuṃ śakyata iti bhāvaḥ
| tasmāt bhṛtayor bhṛtyayor vivāsaḥ viśiṣṭo mayā sahavāsaḥ acirād eva
kalpyatāṃ samartho bhavatu ||12||

