|| 3.16.19 ||

 taranti hy añjasā mṛtyuṃ nivṛttā yadanugrahāt |

  yoginaḥ sa bhavān kiṃ svid anugṛhyeta yat paraiḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : viparītaṃ cedam ity āhuḥ—tarantīti | yasyānugrahād eva nivṛttā
viraktā yoginaś ca santo mṛyuṃ taranti sa bhavān parair anugṛhyeteti kiṃ
svit | na kiñcid ity arthaḥ ||19||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tarantīti | yad anugṛhyeta tat kiṃ svit tat tu
tarkātītam ity arthaḥ ||19||

viśvanāthaḥ : teṣv api brāhmaṇeṣu madhye pravṛttiniṣṭhebhyo nivṛttāḥ
śreṣṭhāḥ | tebhyo'pi yoginaḥ, te'pi yadanugrahān mṛtyuṃ taranti, sa
bhavān yatparair anyair anugṛhyeta, tat kiṃ svid iti praśno
vismayādhikyena ||19||

