|| 3.16.25 ||

  yaṃ vānayor damam adhīśa bhavān vidhatte

 vṛttiṃ nu vā tad anumanmahi nirvyalīkam |

asmāsu vā ya ucito dhriyatāṃ sa daṇḍo

  ye'nāgasau vayam ayuṅkṣmahi kilbiṣeṇa ||

śrīdharaḥ : śāpāgrahaṃ parityajya vijñāpayanti | yaṃ vānyaṃ daṇḍaṃ
vidhāsyati bhavān, vṛttiṃ nv adhikajīvikāṃ vā tat sarvam anumanyāmahe |
ye vayaṃ niraparādhāv etau kilbiṣeṇa śāpenāyuṅkṣmahi yojitavantaḥ ||25||

kramasandarbhaḥ : atra śrībhagavataḥ kim api cikīrṣitam eva kāraṇaṃ
niścityāhuḥ | asmāsv iti ||25||

viśvanāthaḥ : vastutas tu duravagāhābhiprāyaṃ tvāṃ kāyamanovākyair
avanatā vayam idaṃ nivedayāma ity āhuḥ—yaṃ vā damaṃ daṇḍaṃ brahmaṇyatvāt
tathā bhaktavatsalatvād vṛttiṃ yām adhikāṃ jīvikāṃ vā bhavān vidhatte tat
sarvam anumanyāmahe, svacchandenaiva prabho tāṃ vidhehi |
asmaddatto'bhiśāpas tu rasātalaṃ gacchatv iti bhāvaḥ | punaś ca
sabhayāśrukampam āhuḥ—asmāsv iti | ye vayaṃ niraparādhāv etau kilbiṣeṇa
śāpenāyuṅkṣmahi yojitavantaḥ ||25||

