|| 3.16.31 ||

 mayi saṃrambhayogena nistīrya brahmahelanam |

  pratyeṣyataṃ nikāśaṃ me kālenālpīyasā punaḥ ||

madhvaḥ : antar bhaktā bahir vairā hiraṇyādyā harer matāḥ |

tatra bhaktyābhavan pūtā dveṣa āveśakān gatāḥ ||

brahmajā asurā ye tu viṣṇoḥ pārṣadatāṃ gatāḥ |

kalyādyāś ca harer dveṣam antaḥ kṛtvā tamo gatāḥ || iti ca |

tasmāt saṃrambho'lpaphalaḥ kathyata eva | bhaktiyoga eva
brahmahelananistārakaḥ ||31||

śrīdharaḥ : pratyeṣyataṃ pratyeṣyathaḥ | nikāśaṃ samīpam ||31||

kramasandarbhaḥ : tadaparādhābhāsaduḥkhaphalabhogābhāsānuvādena
maryādāṃ rakṣann āha—mayīti | saṃrambhasya yogena pratiphalenābhāsenety
arthaḥ ||31||

viśvanāthaḥ : na caikāṃśenāsurabhāve'pi cintā kāryā, yato'ham apy
avatāratrayeṇa yuvābhyāṃ saha vīrarasamayaṃ yuddhasukham
anubhaviṣyāmīty asurabhāve'pi matsevaiva bhavadbhyāṃ sampādayiṣyate |
tṛtīyena tu janmani sākṣād eva vāṃ svīkariṣye ity āha—mayīti saṃrambheṇa
krodhāveśena yogaḥ yuddheṣu mayi yaḥ saṃyogo dhyānaṃ vā tena pratyeṣyataṃ
pratyeṣyathaḥ | nikāśaṃ samīpam ||31||

