 || 3.17.1 ||

  maitreya uvāca—

 niśamyātmabhuvā gītaṃ kāraṇaṃ śaṅkayojjhitāḥ |

 tataḥ sarve nyavartanta tridivāya divaukasaḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ :

 tataḥ saptadaśe janma tayor lokabhayaṅkaram |

  hiraṇyākṣaprabhāvaś ca varṇyate digjaye'dbhutaḥ ||

kṣemaṃ vidhāsyatīti brahmavacanānantaraṃ śaṅkayā tyaktāḥ ||1||

kramasandarbhaḥ : kāraṇaṃ tasyopadravasyotpattau pratīkāre ca hetum |
śaṅkayā sandehena ||1||

viśvanāthaḥ :

tayor janmany ariṣṭāṇi spaṣṭaṃ saptadaśe'bhavan |

  upāhasac ca digjetā hiraṇyākṣaḥ pracetasam ||

śaṅkayā ujjhitā bhagavaty eva viśvāsena iti bhāvaḥ ||1||

