 tvayi saṃsthite gadayā śīrṇaśīrṣaṇy

 asmadbhujacyutayā ye ca tubhyam |

baliṃ haranty ṛṣayo ye ca devāḥ

svayaṃ sarve na bhaviṣyanty amūlāḥ ||

śrīdharaḥ : asmad bhujacyutayāpi gadayā aśīrṇaṃ śīrṣaṃ yasya tathābhūte
tvayi sukhaṃ sthite sati ye tubhyam adhunā baliṃ haranti navīnā bhaktāḥ,
ye ca pūrve bhaktā ṛṣayo devāś ca, te sarve svayam evodyamaṃ vinaivāmūlā
