kramasandarbhaḥ : na vyākhyātam.

viśvanāthaḥ : saṃsthite mṛte sati na bhaviṣyanti, pakṣe
asmadbhujacāturyāpi gadayā aśīrṇaṃ śīrṣaṃ yasya tasmin saṃsthite sati ye
tubhyam adhunā baliṃ haranti, navīnā bhaktā ye ca pūrve bhaktā ṛṣayo devāś
ca te sarve svayam eva udyamaṃ vinaiva amūlā na bhaviṣyanti kintu
dṛḍhamūlā eva bhaviṣyantīty arthaḥ ||5||

