svanayanagocare deśe vinyasya nidhāya tasyāṃ gavi svasattvaṃ svaśaktiṃ
nyadhāt, yathā jale sā na majjed ity arthaḥ | viśvasṛjām iti pāṭhe
prajāpatibhir vibudhaiś ca prasūnair vṛṣyamāṇair āpūryamāṇaḥ | paśyataḥ
