 parānuṣaktaṃ tapanīyopakalpaṃ

  mahāgadaṃ kāñcanacitradaṃśam |

  marmāṇy abhīkṣṇaṃ pratudantaṃ duruktaiḥ

  pracaṇḍamanyuḥ prahasaṃs taṃ babhāṣe ||

śrīdharaḥ : parā parāk pṛṣṭhato'nuṣaktaṃ lagnam | tapanīyopakalpaṃ
