kramasandarbhaḥ : satyam ityādi śrībhagavadvākyāni ca
kevalopādhidṛṣṭyā tāni copahāsaparāṇy api vāstavārtham api vahanti |
tatra vanagocaratvam ekāntavāsatvaṃ jñeyam | tathāpi kṛpayā
yuṣmadvidhān grāmyaviṣayāsaktaśreṣṭhān mṛgaye mṛgayāmahe mocayitum
anveṣayāmaḥ | nanv avinītān asmān kathaṃ kṛpayasi ? tathāha—na
